 its own result, and nothing depends on a host. */\\nexport const SELF_REPORTED = Object.freeze(['parallel', 'ghost']);\\n\\n/**\\n * Whether a game's round carries the seed in its address, so the client seeds\\n * Math.random and every copy starts the same: read from the game's own tag,\\n * parallel or ghost. A game still tagged race was built for an unseeded start\\n * (ids it makes from Math.random must differ between its copies), so it keeps one.\\n\",\"total_lines\":533}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-41d6b4f1-11fc-40a8-b8bc-a6e9e1a87a94-23","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,95,95,120,50,57,98,52,100,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,57,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,95,95,120,50,57,98,52,100,57,47,119,111,114,107,47,76,101,118,101,108,32,66,101,115,116,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,47,116,111,111,108,115,47,104,117,98,47,114,111,117,110,100,46,106,115,10,49,54,58,32,32,104,101,108,108,111,77,115,58,32,49,48,95,48,48,48,44,10,50,48,58,32,32,99,111,117,110,116,100,111,119,110,77,115,58,32,51,95,48,48,48,44,10,50,49,58,32,32,103,114,97,99,101,77,115,58,32,53,95,48,48,48,44,10,51,50,55,58,32,32,32,32,103,111,65,116,32,61,32,99,108,111,99,107,46,110,111,119,40,41,32,43,32,116,46,99,111,117,110,