{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_19","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The harness play time is only six seconds of random input after the countdown.\n\nWebGPU initialization may be slow with SwiftShader. The ready() call must finish within the load grace period. The plan connects to AIHub in ghost mode, boots the engine, and then runs either a session or standalone mode.\n\nbootEngine includes renderer.init() and RAPIER.init(). The first render is slow with software WebGPU. ready() should fire as soon as the engine is up, not after building a large scene. CPU geometry construction is fast. Rapier logs a deprecated init warning.\n\nRapier panics would be unhandled errors that the harness catches. Device lost errors might not throw at all. The client seeds Math.random before the script runs when aihub-seed is present, so the script must not replace it. rng.js uses AIHub.rng inside sessions and mulberry32 outside.\n\nThe client automatically seeds Math.random before the script runs, so no manual seeding is required. Ghost messages should be sent at a rate of ten per second.\n\nGhost sends are limited to twenty per second with a burst of forty. Progress messages use a separate channel and do not count toward that limit.\n\nThe progress label must stay under twenty-four characters. It displays the score during the intro.\n\nA single result message is sent at the end or when time-up occurs.\n\nAt session end, input, sending, and sound stop while the last frame remains visible.\n\nDuring sessions, pressing Options opens a volume overlay without pausing the game. Restart, quit, and dev mode options are unavailable.\n\nIf Create is held, Options presses are ignored.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4df48902-5a9f-4771-87c5-fa982a4b6af4-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/hub/round.js","offset":230,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4df48902-5a9f-4771-87c5-fa982a4b6af4-25","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"name:|color:|players:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/hub/harness.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2035,"output_tokens":1047,"cache_read_input_tokens":105216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"d32a64f6-5a48-4bf2-bb70-51c50d94556d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4df48902-5a9f-4771-87c5-fa982a4b6af4-24","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"230→  const later = (ms, fn) => {\\n    const handle = clock.setTimeout(() => {\\n      timers.delete(handle);\\n      fn();\\n    }, Math.max(0, ms));\\n    timers.add(handle);\\n    return handle;\\n  };\\n  const cancel = (handle) => {\\n    if (handle == null) return;\\n240→    clock.clearTimeout(handle);\\n    timers.delete(handle);\\n  };\\n\\n  /** The players still in the round. */\\n  const present = () => seats.filter((s) => !s.out);\\n  /** The copies still in the round: the players, and the server. */\\n  const presentCopies = () => copies.filter((s) => !s.out);\\n  const selfReported = () => SELF_REPORTED.includes(mode);\\n  const needsHost = () => !selfReported();\\n250→  const send = (seat, msg) => deliver(seat.key, { round, ...msg });\\n  const toPresent = (msg, except = null) => {\\n    for (const s of presentCopies()) if (s !== except && s.hello) send(s, msg);\\n  };\\n  const issue = (seat, problem) => {\\n    issues.push({ key: seat?.key ?? null, id: seat?.id ?? null, problem });\\n    status();\\n  };\\n\\n  function status() {\\n260→    onStatus({\\n      round,\\n      phase,\\n      mode,\\n      host: host.id,\\n      goAt,\\n      gate,\\n      released,\\n      players: seats.map((s) => ({\\n        id: s.id,\\n270→        key: s.key,\\n        slot: s.slot,\\n        name: s.name,\\n        color: s.color,\\n        hello: s.hello,\\n        ready: s.ready,\\n        out: s.out,\\n        result: s.result,\\n        client: s.caps?.client ?? null,\\n      })),\\n280→      server: server && { id: server.id, key: server.key, hello: server.hello, ready: server.ready, out: server.out, client: server.caps?.client ?? null },\\n      issues: issues.slice(),\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function welcome(seat) {\\n    send(seat, {\\n      type: 'welcome',\\n      me: seat.id,\\n      host: host.id,\\n290→      players: seats.map((s) => ({ id: s.id, name: s.name, color: s.color })),\\n      keys: copies.map((s) => s.key),\\n      mode,\\n      seed: seed >>> 0,\\n      limitMs,\\n      ...(gate ? { splash: true } : {}),\\n      ...(seat === server ? { server: true } : {}),\\n    });\\n    for (const s of seats) if (s.out) send(seat, { type: 'leave', id: s.id, reason: s.out });\\n  }\\n300→\\n  function markOut(seat, reason) {\\n    if (seat.out || phase === 'ended') return;\\n    seat.out = reason;\\n    cancel(seat.hidden);\\n    seat.hidden = null;\\n    toPresent({ type: 'leave', id: seat.id, reason });\\n    // A player who sat out is still at the hub: tell their game it is over for them.\\n    if (reason === 'not-ready' && seat.hello) send(seat, { type: 'end', reason: 'sat-out' });\\n  }\\n310→\\n  function settle() {\\n    if (phase === 'ended') return;\\n    const left = present();\\n    if (!left.length) return finishVoid('no-players');\\n    if (needsHost() && host.out) {\\n      return finishVoid(host.out === 'not-ready' ? 'host-not-ready' : 'host-left', phase === 'loading' ? 'void' : 'host-left');\\n    }\\n    if (phase === 'loading') {\\n      if (released && presentCopies().every((s) => s.ready)) begin();\",\"content_concise\":\"230→  const later = (ms, fn) => {\\n    const handle = clock.setTimeout(() => {\\n      timers.delete(handle);\\n      fn();\\n    }, Math.max(0, ms));\\n    timers.add(handle);\\n    return handle;\\n  };\\n  const cancel = (handle) => {\\n    if (handle == null) return;\\n240→    clock.clearTimeout(handle);\\n    timers.delete(handle);\\n  };\\n\\n  /** The players still in the round. */\\n  const present = () => seats.filter((s) => !s.out);\\n  /** The copies still in the round: the players, and the server. */\\n  const presentCopies = () => copies.filter((s) => !s.out);\\n  const selfReported = () => SELF_REPORTED.includes(mode);\\n  const needsHost = () => !selfReported();\\n250→  const send = (seat, msg) => deliver(seat.key, { round, ...msg });\\n  const toPresent = (msg, except = null) => {\\n    for (const s of presentCopies()) if (s !== except && s.hello) send(s, msg);\\n  };\\n  const issue = (seat, problem) => {\\n    issues.push({ key: seat?.key ?? null, id: seat?.id ?? null, problem });\\n    status();\\n  };\\n\\n  function status() {\\n260→    onStatus({\\n      round,\\n      phase,\\n      mode,\\n      host: host.id,\\n      goAt,\\n      gate,\\n      released,\\n      players: seats.map((s) => ({\\n        id: s.id,\\n270→        key: s.key,\\n        slot: s.slot,\\n        name: s.name,\\n        color: s.color,\\n        hello: s.hello,\\n        ready: s.ready,\\n        out: s.out,\\n        result: s.result,\\n        client: s.caps?.client ?? null,\\n      })),\\n280→      server: server && { id: server.id, key: server.key, hello: server.hello, ready: server.ready, out: server.out, client: server.caps?.client ?? null },\\n      issues: issues.slice(),\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function welcome(seat) {\\n    send(seat, {\\n      type: 'welcome',\\n      me: seat.id,\\n      host: host.id,\\n290→      players: seats.map((s) => ({ id: s.id, name: s.name, color: s.color })),\\n      keys: copies.map((s) => s.key),\\n      mode,\\n      seed: seed >>> 0,\\n      limitMs,\\n      ...(gate ? { splash: true } : {}),\\n      ...(seat === server ? { server: true } : {}),\\n    });\\n    for (const s of seats) if (s.out) send(seat, { type: 'leave', id: s.id, reason: s.out });\\n  }\\n300→\\n  function markOut(seat, reason) {\\n    if (seat.out || phase === 'ended') return;\\n    seat.out = reason;\\n    cancel(seat.hidden);\\n    seat.hidden = null;\\n    toPresent({ type: 'leave', id: seat.id, reason });\\n    // A player who sat out is still at the hub: tell their game it is over for them.\\n    if (reason === 'not-ready' && seat.hello) send(seat, { type: 'end', reason: 'sat-out' });\\n  }\\n310→\\n  function settle() {\\n    if (phase === 'ended') return;\\n    const left = present();\\n    if (!left.length) return finishVoid('no-players');\\n    if (needsHost() && host.out) {\\n      return finishVoid(host.out === 'not-ready' ? 'host-not-ready' : 'host-left', phase === 'loading' ? 'void' : 'host-left');\\n    }\\n    if (phase === 'loading') {\\n      if (released && presentCopies().every((s) => s.ready)) begin();\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/hub/round.js\",\"offset\":230,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"  const later = (ms, fn) => {\\n    const handle = clock.setTimeout(() => {\\n      timers.delete(handle);\\n      fn();\\n    }, Math.max(0, ms));\\n    timers.add(handle);\\n    return handle;\\n  };\\n  const cancel = (handle) => {\\n    if (handle == null) return;\\n    clock.clearTimeout(handle);\\n    timers.delete(handle);\\n  };\\n\\n  /** The players still in the round. */\\n  const present = () => seats.filter((s) => !s.out);\\n  /** The copies still in the round: the players, and the server. */\\n  const presentCopies = () => copies.filter((s) => !s.out);\\n  const selfReported = () => SELF_REPORTED.includes(mode);\\n  const needsHost = () => !selfReported();\\n  const send = (seat, msg) => deliver(seat.key, { round, ...msg });\\n  const toPresent = (msg, except = null) => {\\n    for (const s of presentCopies()) if (s !== except && s.hello) send(s, msg);\\n  };\\n  const issue = (seat, problem) => {\\n    issues.push({ key: seat?.key ?? null, id: seat?.id ?? null, problem });\\n    status();\\n  };\\n\\n  function status() {\\n    onStatus({\\n      round,\\n      phase,\\n      mode,\\n      host: host.id,\\n      goAt,\\n      gate,\\n      released,\\n      players: seats.map((s) => ({\\n        id: s.id,\\n        key: s.key,\\n        slot: s.slot,\\n        name: s.name,\\n        color: s.color,\\n        hello: s.hello,\\n        ready: s.ready,\\n        out: s.out,\\n        result: s.result,\\n        client: s.caps?.client ?? null,\\n      })),\\n      server: server && { id: server.id, key: server.key, hello: server.hello, ready: server.ready, out: server.out, client: server.caps?.client ?? null },\\n      issues: issues.slice(),\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function welcome(seat) {\\n    send(seat, {\\n      type: 'welcome',\\n      me: seat.id,\\n      host: host.id,\\n      players: seats.map((s) => ({ id: s.id, name: s.name, color: s.color })),\\n      keys: copies.map((s) => s.key),\\n      mode,\\n      seed: seed >>> 0,\\n      limitMs,\\n      ...(gate ? { splash: true } : {}),\\n      ...(seat === server ? { server: true } : {}),\\n    });\\n    for (const s of seats) if (s.out) send(seat, { type: 'leave', id: s.id, reason: s.out });\\n  }\\n\\n  function markOut(seat, reason) {\\n    if (seat.out || phase === 'ended') return;\\n    seat.out = reason;\\n    cancel(seat.hidden);\\n    seat.hidden = null;\\n    toPresent({ type: 'leave', id: seat.id, reason });\\n    // A player who sat out is still at the hub: tell their game it is over for them.\\n    if (reason === 'not-ready' && seat.hello) send(seat, { type: 'end', reason: 'sat-out' });\\n  }\\n\\n  function settle() {\\n    if (phase === 'ended') return;\\n    const left = present();\\n    if (!left.length) return finishVoid('no-players');\\n    if (needsHost() && host.out) {\\n      return finishVoid(host.out === 'not-ready' ? 'host-not-ready' : 'host-left', phase === 'loading' ? 'void' : 'host-left');\\n    }\\n    if (phase === 'loading') {\\n      if (released && presentCopies().every((s) => s.ready)) begin();\\n\",\"total_lines\":533}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4df48902-5a9f-4771-87c5-fa982a4b6af4-25","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,