{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_31","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rest remains perfectly upright.\n\nFull lean peaks at 23.4°. It has not settled at 18° by 3s. The angle is now 16.3° and still falling. I will run for 8 seconds to find the true settle point.\n\nThe 2 N·m gust fell at 1.05 s because it was applied continuously for 1.2 s instead of the planned 0.5 s. The 3.5 N·m flail test had the same flaw. Recovery works: the robot falls once, recovers, and settles near zero lean. Both loaded and rest tests used continuous torque, so they cannot be compared fairly. I will rerun with 0.5 s pulses and check full lean at 6 and 8 seconds.\n\nThe drift below 18° suggests a sign error or gravity mismatch in the feed-forward formula. The equilibrium torque should equal G·sin(tx), and the body torque must be negated.\n\nThe 23° overshoot matches the plan. The drift below 18° may be a slow oscillation that will eventually settle there. I will sample the full-lean trace at 0.5 s intervals to confirm.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7948900b-5397-472b-a5b2-ce5ad12153a6-53","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/spike-balance.mjs","old_string":"function run({ seconds, wishX = 0, wishZ = 0, nx = 0, nz = 0, mass = 0, massY = 1.2, flailWhen = null }) {\n  const world = makeWorld(8);\n  addGround(world);\n  const doll = createDollBody(world, 0, 0, 0);\n  if (mass > 0) {\n    world.createCollider(\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.ball(0.08).setMass(mass).setTranslation(0, massY, 0).setCollisionGroups(0),\n      doll.body,\n    );\n  }\n  const state = freshBalance();\n  let peak = 0;\n  let fellAt = null;\n  const leans = [];\n  const steps = Math.round(seconds / DT);\n  for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) {\n    const t = i * DT;\n    state.wishX = wishX;\n    state.wishZ = wishZ;\n    if (flailWhen && flailWhen(state, t) && state.flailCool <= 0 && state.flailLeft <= 0) {\n      state.flailLeft = 0.35;\n      state.flailCool = 2;\n    }\n    if (state.flailLeft > 0) state.flailLeft = Math.max(0, state.flailLeft - DT);\n    if (state.flailCool > 0) state.flailCool = Math.max(0, state.flailCool - DT);\n    if (!state.fallen) balanceStep(doll.body, state, DT, tune, nx, nz);\n    world.step();\n    const lean = readLean(doll.body);\n    peak = Math.max(peak, lean.tilt);\n    leans.push(lean.leanX);\n    if (!state.fallen && checkFall(doll.body, state, tune)) fellAt = t;\n    if (state.fallen) break;\n  }\n  const end = readLean(doll.body);\n  freeWorld(world);\n  return { peak: peak / DEG, end: end.leanX / DEG, tilt: end.tilt / DEG, fellAt, falls: state.falls, last: leans.slice(-10).map((v) => v / DEG) };\n}","new_string":"function run({ seconds, wishX = 0, wishZ = 0, nx = 0, nz = 0, gustFor = 0.5, gustAt = 0.2, mass = 0, massY = 1.2, flailWhen = null, sample = 0.5 }) {\n  const world = makeWorld(8);\n  addGround(world);\n  const doll = createDollBody(world, 0, 0, 0);\n  if (mass > 0) {\n    world.createCollider(\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.ball(0.08).setMass(mass).setTranslation(0, massY, 0).setCollisionGroups(0),\n      doll.body,\n    );\n  }\n  const state = freshBalance();\n  let peak = 0;\n  let fellAt = null;\n  const samples = [];\n  const steps = Math.round(seconds / DT);\n  for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) {\n    const t = i * DT;\n    state.wishX = wishX;\n    state.wishZ = wishZ;\n    const gustOn = nx !== 0 && t >= gustAt && t < gustAt + gustFor;\n    if (flailWhen && flailWhen(state, t) && state.flailCool <= 0 && state.flailLeft <= 0) {\n      state.flailLeft = 0.35;\n      state.flailCool = 2;\n    }\n    if (state.flailLeft > 0) state.flailLeft = Math.max(0, state.flailLeft - DT);\n    if (state.flailCool > 0) state.flailCool = Math.max(0, state.flailCool - DT);\n    if (!state.fallen) balanceStep(doll.body, state, DT, tune, gustOn ? nx : 0, gustOn ? nz : 0);\n    world.step();\n    const lean = readLean(doll.body);\n    peak = Math.max(peak, Math.abs(lean.leanX));\n    if (i % Math.round(sample / DT) === 0) samples.push(Number((lean.leanX / DEG).toFixed(2)));\n    if (!state.fallen && checkFall(doll.body, state, tune)) fellAt = Number(t.toFixed(3));\n    if (state.fallen) break;\n  }\n  const end = readLean(doll.body);\n  freeWorld(world);\n  return { peak: Number((peak / DEG).toFixed(2)), end: Number((end.leanX / DEG).toFixed(2)), fellAt, falls: state.falls, samples };\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7948900b-5397-472b-a5b2-ce5ad12153a6-54","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/spike-balance.mjs","old_string":"const rest = run({ seconds: 2 });\nconst full = run({ seconds: 3, wishX: 1 });\nconst gust2 = run({ seconds: 1.2, nx: 2 });\nconst gust3 = run({ seconds: 1.2, nx: 3 });\nconst gust35 = run({ seconds: 1.5, nx: 3.5 });\nconst loaded = run({ seconds: 1.2, nx: 2, mass: 0.25, massY: 1.1 });\nconst early = run({ seconds: 1.5, nx: 3.5, flailWhen: (_s, t) => t < 0.02 });\nconst timed = run({ seconds: 1.5, nx: 3.5, flailWhen: (s) => !s.fallen && Math.abs(s.leanX) > 30 * DEG });","new_string":"const rest = run({ seconds: 2, nx: 0, gustFor: 0 });\nconst full = run({ seconds: 6, wishX: 1, sample: 0.5 });\nconst gust2 = run({ seconds: 2, nx: 2 });\nconst gust25 = run({ seconds: 2, nx: 2.5 });\nconst gust3 = run({ seconds: 2, nx: 3 });\nconst gust35 = run({ seconds: 2, nx: 3.5 });\nconst loaded = run({ seconds: 2, nx: 2, mass: 0.2, massY: 1.15 });\nconst early = run({ seconds: 2.5, nx: 3.5, flailWhen: (_s, t) => t >= 0.2 && t < 0.22 });\nconst timed = run({ seconds: 2.5, nx: 3.5, flailWhen: (s, t) => t > 0.25 && !s.fallen && Math.abs(s.leanX) > 28 * DEG });\nconst brace = run({ seconds: 2, nx: 3, wishX: -0.6 });"}}],"stop_reason":"to