{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_34","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The physics aligns closely with the plan.\n\nFull stick overshoot and settle values match the plan exactly. Gust 2 and 2.5 peaks align precisely with the target. Gusts 3 and 3.5 fall as expected. The timed flail at 3.5 still falls despite the plan suggesting it should save the gust.\n\nThe flail likely saved the gust itself. The aircraft peaked around 41° during the gust and held near 40° afterward. It crossed 45° at 2.4s, after the gust ended.\n\nThe flail triggered at 28°, which was too early. The boost lasted only 0.35 seconds and expired before the peak at 41°. The aircraft had already crossed the point of no return near 39°, so it could not recover from 40°. Triggering at 32° would have kept the boost active through the peak.\n\nI will test the flail trigger at 32° instead of 28°. The boost should then last through the peak and help recovery.\n\nThe loaded mass test confirmed that extra weight makes tipping easier. I will now check a smaller mass of 0.05 kg.\n\nThe 0.08 kg loaded test will be clearer than 0.2 kg for showing the mass effect. The 60% brace against a 3 N·m gust peaked at 24°, close to the plan's 19° target. The lean direction and brace sign need checking.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6583dcbe-29e1-40be-aaf5-2de5fc231a5b-57","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node --input-type=module << 'EOF'\nimport { initRapier, makeWorld, addGround, createDollBody, freeWorld, RAPIER } from './src/physics/world.js';\nimport { freshBalance, balanceStep, checkFall, readLean, DEG, pressFlail } from './src/physics/balancer.js';\nawait initRapier();\nconst DT = 1/120;\nconst tune = { maxLean: 18, margin: 0.45, zeta: 0.4, ankleMax: 4.6, reflex: 10, flailBoost: 1.9, fallAngle: 45, recoverTime: 2.2, swayScale: 1, disturbScale: 1 };\nfunction trial(label, opts) {\n  const world = makeWorld(8); addGround(world);\n  const doll = createDollBody(world, 0, 0, 0);\n  if (opts.mass) world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.ball(0.06).setMass(opts.mass).setTranslation(0, opts.massY||1.2, 0).setCollisionGroups(0), doll.body);\n  const state = freshBalance();\n  let peak = 0, fell = null, flailed = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < Math.round((opts.seconds||2.5)/DT); i++) {\n    const t = i*DT;\n    state.wishX = opts.wish || 0;\n    const gust = t >= (opts.at??0.5) && t < (opts.at??0.5) + 0.5;\n    if (!flailed && opts.flailAtLean && Math.abs(state.leanX) >= opts.flailAtLean*DEG && gust) {\n      flailed = pressFlail(state, 2);\n    }\n    if (state.flailLeft>0) state.flailLeft = Math.max(0, state.flailLeft-DT);\n    if (state.flailCool>0) state.flailCool = Math.max(0, state.flailCool-DT);\n    if (!state.fallen) balanceStep(doll.body, state, DT, tune, gust ? opts.nx : 0, 0);\n    world.step();\n    const lean = readLean(doll.body);\n    peak = Math.max(peak, Math.abs(lean.leanX));\n    if (!state.fallen && checkFall(doll.body, state, tune)) fell = t;\n    if (state.fallen) break;\n  }\n  freeWorld(world);\n  console.log(label, { peak: +(peak/DEG).toFixed(1), fell: fell && +fell.toFixed(2), flailed });\n}\ntrial('flail32', { nx: 3.5, flailAtLean: 32, at: 0.4 });\ntrial('flail30', { nx: 3.5, flailAtLean: 30, at: 0.4 });\ntrial('flail34', { nx: 3.5, flailAtLean: 34, at: 0.4 });\ntrial('flail early', { nx: 3.5, flailAtLean: 5, at: 0.4 });\ntrial('mass 0.05 gust2', { nx: 2, mass: 0.05, massY: 1.3, at: 0.3 });\ntrial('mass 0 gust2', { nx: 2, at: 0.3 });\ntrial('brace 0.5s before', { nx: 3, wish: -0.6, at: 0.8, seconds: 3 });\ntrial('second flail blocked', { nx: 2, at: 0.3 });\nEOF","description":"Tune flail timing and load response"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1011,"output_tokens":1879,"cache_read_input_tokens":165504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"2364a825-3689-4add-8d43-2c70dfb41ac9"}
