,109,44,10,32,32,110,97,110,58,32,27,91,51,51,109,102,97,108,115,101,27,91,51,57,109,10,125,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\nusing deprecated parameters for the initialization function; pass a single object instead\\n(node:4071149) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n{\\n  bankAt: 7,\\n  seed: 1,\\n  ms: 296,\\n  maxHat: 7,\\n  form: 94.8076923076923,\\n  raw: 49.300000000000004,\\n  medal: 'exemplary',\\n  stats: '35 banked · 0 spills',\\n  banked: 35,\\n  falls: 0,\\n  nan: false\\n}\\n{\\n  bankAt: 7,\\n  seed: 2,\\n  ms: 268,\\n  maxHat: 7,\\n  form: 96.34615384615387,\\n  raw: 50.10000000000001,\\n  medal: 'exemplary',\\n  stats: '35 banked · 0 spills',\\n  banked: 35,\\n  falls: 0,\\n  nan: false\\n}\\n{\\n  bankAt: 999,\\n  seed: 1,\\n  ms: 243,\\n  maxHat: 11,\\n  form: 0.9615384615384616,\\n  raw: 0.5,\\n  medal: 'attended',\\n  stats: '0 banked · 2 spills',\\n  banked: 0,\\n  falls: 2,\\n  nan: false\\n}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\\\" && node --input-type=module << 'EOF'\\nimport { initRapier } from './src/physics/world.js';\\nimport { createInput } from './src/input/input.js';\\nimport { makePad, writeWish, writeButton, clearPad, skillOf } from './src/input/bot.js';\\nimport { FruitHat } from './src/events/fruitHat.js';\\nimport { resetRng } from './src/core/rng.js';\\n\\nawait initRapier();\\nconst DT = 1/120;\\nasync function play(bankAt, seed) {\\n  resetRng(seed);\\n  const ev = new FruitHat({ tier: 1, seed });\\n  ev.build();\\n  const input = createInput();\\n  const pad = makePad();\\n  input.setPadSource(() => [pad]);\\n  input.setDevice('pad');\\n  const skill = skillOf('sharp');\\n  let maxHat = 0;\\n  const t0 = Date.now();\\n  while (!ev.done) {\\n    const cmd = ev.botInput(0, skill, bankAt);\\n    clearPad(pad);\\n    writeWish(pad, cmd.stickX, cmd.stickY > 0 ? -cmd.stickY : -cmd.stickY);\\n    // stickY from bot is positive-down. Screen-up is -stickY.\\n    writeWish(pad, cmd.stickX, -cmd.stickY);\\n    writeButton(pad, 0, !!cmd.hop);\\n    input.poll(DT, 'balance');\\n    ev.fixed(DT, [input.snapshot(0)]);\\n    maxHat = Math.max(maxHat, ev.hats[0].length);\\n  }\\n  const r = ev.result(0);\\n  console.log({ bankAt, seed, ms: Date.now()-t0, maxHat, ...r, nan: ev.nan });\\n  ev.dispose();\\n}\\nawait play(7, 1);\\nawait play(7, 2);\\nawait play(999, 1);\\nEOF\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Play Fruit Hat with the sharp bot through real input\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/terminal/call-35fbb37a-6ac5-436b-8eb7-44cbbb58fc22-74.log\",\"total_bytes\":1173}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"8b85d7e4-0ea4-4b0d-b80c-7f80dc9860fd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_43","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fruit hat performed well. At 7:35 it banked cleanly with zero falls, scoring about 50 raw against a par of 52.\n\nThe 60-second simulation finished in 270 milliseconds. The catch radius is slightly generous, yielding a raw score of 49–50 against the planned par of 52. Tightening it would make the game less trivial.\n\nThe sharp banking form is about 95. The never-bank falls match the plan exactly at two. The raw score of 49 sits close enough to the planned 47.8 that no further catch adjustments are needed.\n\nThe full test suite will finish in seconds. I am now writing the remaining event modules, data files, director, renderer, audio, UI, main entry point, build script, and tests.\n\nPoses will be the first event module. Each pose holds for eight seconds with a shrinking ring and increasing sway and tremor. A three-second glide moves the stick from center to the spot. Score ticks during both hold and glide. The parked test locks the wish to the exact ring center in world space. The sharp test delays correction using feedback.\n\nPose spots are defined in disc space: the heron at (-0.35, 0), the pine at (0, 0.4), and the chair at (0, -0.35). The wish position converts to world space by setting X to the spot x and Z to the negated spot y at yaw zero. A quick test will verify that parked form stays below 85 while sharp form exceeds it. Sway ramps during the hold phase, and an optional breath multiplier tracks sync during the grow phase.\n\nThe pose table now includes five more spots: keeper, flamingo, goodbye, umbrella, and regret. Tiers will contain three, four, and five poses respectively. I will write poses first, then batch the remaining events in shorter but complete versions to save time. Room service glasses may be tuned if time allows.\n\nRoom service will use five glasses with brace. A shared `applyCommand` helper in bot.js will write pad commands for wish, hop, flail, breathe, and directional input.\n\nThe bot command helper now accepts analog directional values. Events will return x, y, hop, flail, breathe, left, right, and leftValue, rightValue. Fruit hat is being updated to match this convention by returning x and y with y pointing up.\n\nThe fruit hat return now uses the computed screen wish x and y. The unused `void reach` variable is being removed, and the radius function is being simplified to return the landing radius for tier 1 or the stored parameter otherwise.\n\nPoses scoring constants are now defined per tier. Tier 1 holds for eight seconds with a shrinking ring and ramping sway and tremor. Tiers 2 and 3 scale up to ten and twelve seconds with tighter rings and stronger oscillation. The maximum lean is set to fourteen degrees.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-213bfb64-1f5d-4722-8b71-15672cb1c0f0-75","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/physics/balancer.js","old_string":"    maxLean: values.maxLean,","new_string":"    maxLean: extra.maxLean ?? values.maxLean,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-213bfb64-1f5d-4722-8b71-15672cb1c0f0-76","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/base.js","old_string":"    return tuneFrom(live, {\n      margin: (extra.margin ?? live.margin) * this.marginMul,","new_string":"    return tuneFrom(live, {\n      maxLean: extra.maxLean,\n      margin: (extra.margin ?? live.margin) * this.marginMul,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-213bfb64-1f5d-4722-8b71-15672cb1c0f0-77","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/s