{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5394bf8d-3c80-4607-be3e-a323d980d12d-83","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"75→\\n  radius() { return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('landingRadius') : this.params.radius; }\\n  every() { return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('fruitInterval') : this.params.every; }\\n  massOf(kind) { return kind.mass || (this.tier === 1 ? getTune('fruitMass') : this.params.mass); }\\n\\n80→  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const reach = Math.sin(getTune('maxLean') * DEG) * 1.5;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen && this.bankCool[i] <= 0) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      } else if (!state.fallen) {\\n        state.wishX = 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"75→\\n  radius() { return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('landingRadius') : this.params.radius; }\\n  every() { return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('fruitInterval') : this.params.every; }\\n  massOf(kind) { return kind.mass || (this.tier === 1 ? getTune('fruitMass') : this.params.mass); }\\n\\n80→  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const reach = Math.sin(getTune('maxLean') * DEG) * 1.5;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen && this.bankCool[i] <= 0) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      } else if (!state.fallen) {\\n        state.wishX = 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/fruitHat.js\",\"offset\":75,\"limit\":15,\"raw_output\":\"\\n  radius() { return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('landingRadius') : this.params.radius; }\\n  every() { return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('fruitInterval') : this.params.every; }\\n  massOf(kind) { return kind.mass || (this.tier === 1 ? getTune('fruitMass') : this.params.mass); }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const reach = Math.sin(getTune('maxLean') * DEG) * 1.5;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen && this.bankCool[i] <= 0) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      } else if (!state.fallen) {\\n        state.wishX = 0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":254}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"4ead5bdc-197c-454c-8eea-51c33ef393fa"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_46","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Removing the unused reach line. Then writing the remaining event files.\n\nConsidering a shared `runEvent` test helper. The remaining event files will be written separately for cleaner navigation.\n\nDrafting poses.js with ring positioning, world wish mapping, and correction logic. Will write the remaining events in batches of two or three. Also planning earned and maxEarn tracking, plus a 4-second breath cycle that accumulates sync when held across the grow-shrink transition.\n\nBreath sync above 0.7 at cycle end triggers a 0.6 sway multiplier and 1.25 scoring bonus. Sharp bot gains this bonus; parked bot does not, so its score stays below 85. The acceptance criteria will not require an exact 75-point score for the parked stick. Setting poses maxLean to 14. Ring shrink applies only during hold; glide radius remains 0.30. Still deciding whether sway ramps throughout the pose or only during the hold phase.\n\nSettled on ramping sway from 0.08 to 0.22 during the hold phase. The pose clock uses a 3-second entry followed by a hold where ring radius and sway interpolate toward their target values. Scoring will be restricted to the hold portion so the parked-on-target score lands near 75.\n\nRevised the scoring window to include the glide phase as well as the hold. The correcting bot will track dot history for feedback.\n\nThe event will store dot history per lane for the correcting bot. `botInput` records each frame's cob position and retrieves it after the configured delay to compute the corrected wish. The driver must also pass a parked flag.\n\nThe `botInput` signature will accept a `{ parked: true }` flag. The screen cob helper maps leanX and leanZ to normalized screen coordinates. The input system converts screen stick input to world coordinates using yaw, so the bot can write screen wishes directly.\n\nThe event will read the input snapshot's wish directly, so it does not need to know whether the value is in screen or world coordinates. A shared `test/drive.mjs` test runner is being drafted to run events with bots for the suite.\n\nThe test runner creates a pad and input source, then steps the event forward at 120 Hz. Each frame it calls `botInput` with the skill and flags, writes the returned wish and buttons back to the pad, and advances the simulation until the event finishes.\n\nThe test runner now writes left and right analog stick values to the pad before polling input and advancing the simulation. It returns the event result, NaN count, body count, and disposes the world after each run. The Fruit hat botInput signature is `(i, skill, bankAt = 7)`.\n\nUpdating the fruit hat `botInput` to accept either a numeric bank threshold or an options object with `bankAt`, defaulting to 7. The plate event will read `input.plateA` and `plateD` as half-turns plus stick angular velocity, but the pad path covers it for bot testing while key presses remain for manual verification.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa409a2c-016e-4e9b-bb3f-f43d5cbb2989-84","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/fruitHat.js","old_string":"  fixed(dt, inputs) {\n    const reach = Math.sin(getTune('maxLean') * DEG) * 1.5;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {","new_string":"  fixed(dt, inputs) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa409a2c-016e-4e9b-bb3f-f43d5cbb2989-85","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/fruitHat.js","old_string":"  botInput(i, skill, bankAt = 7) {","new_string":"  botInput(i, skill, opt = 7) {\n    const bankAt = typeof opt === 'number' ? opt : (opt?.bankAt ?? 7);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa409a2c-016e-4e9b-bb3f-f43d5cbb2989-86","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/poses.js","new_string":"export const POSES = [\n  { id: 'heron', name: 'The Contented Heron', x: -0.35, y: 0 },\n  { id: 'pine', name: 'The Apologetic Pine', x: 0, y: 0.4 },\n  { id: 'chair', name: 'Half-Folded Deck Chair', x: 0, y: -0.35 },\n  { id: 'keeper', name: 'The Lighthouse Keeper', x: 0.4, y: 0 },\n  { id: 'flamingo', name: 'Startled Flamingo', x: 0.35, y: 0.2 },\n  { id: 'goodbye', name: 'The Long Goodbye', x: -0.2, y: 0.45 },\n  { id: 'umbrella', name: \"Someone Else's Umbrella\", x: 0.45, y: -0.1 },\n  { id: 'regret', name: 'The Quiet Regret', x: -0.4, y: -0.2 },\n];\n","old_string":""}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa409a2c-016e-4e9b-bb3f-f43d5cbb2989-87","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/poses.js","new_string":"import { Standing } from './base.js';\nimport { POSES } from '../data/poses.js';\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\n\nconst TIERS = {\n  1: { n: 3, hold: 8, ring0: 0.3, ring1: 0.16, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\n  2: { n: 4, hold: 10, ring0: 0.3, ring1: 0.13, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.1, tremor1: 0.3 },\n  3: { n: 5, hold: 12, ring0: 0.3, ring1: 0.1, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.15, tremor1: 0.4 },\n};\n\nconst GLIDE = 3;\nconst MAX_LEAN = 14;\n\nexport class Poses extends Standing {\n  static id = 'poses';\n  static title = 'Poses';\n  static discipline = 'Stillness';\n  static instructor = 'stillwater';\n  static couch = true;\n  static session = true;\n  static can = 'Follow the ring with your weight. Breathe in while the breath ring grows.';\n  static cant = 'You can fall. Flail costs a little form, and it will not hold the pose for you.';\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe'];\n  static tiers = {\n    1: { blurb: 'Three poses. The ring shrinks slowly.' },\n    2: { blurb: 'Four poses. The ring gets small.' },\n    3: { blurb: 'Five poses. Breath is how you stay.' },\n  };\n\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\n    super(opts);\n    this.params = TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1];\n    this.list = POSES.slice(0, this.params.n);\n    this.earned = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.possible = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\n    this.breathSync = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.breathSeen = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.flailPenalty = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.poseMax = MAX_LEAN;\n  }\n\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\n\n  poseClock() {\n    const len = GLIDE + this.params.hold;\n    const total = len * this.list.length;\n    const t = Math.min(this.t, total - 1e-4);\n    const index = Math.max(0, Math.min(this.list.length - 1, Math.floor(t / len)));\n    const local = t - index * len;\n    const pose = this.list[index];\n    const gliding = local < GLIDE;\n    const u = gliding ? local / GLIDE : (local - GLIDE) / this.params.hold;\n    const ring = gliding\n      ? { x: pose.x * u, y: pose.y * u }\n      : { x: pose.x, y: pose.y };\n    const radius = gliding ? this.params.ring0 : this.params.ring0 + (this.params.ring1 - this.params.ring0) * u;\n    const sway = gliding ? this.params.sway0 : this.params.sway0 + (this.params.sway1 - this.params.sway0) * u;\n    const tremor = gliding ? this.params.tremor0 : this.params.tremor0 + (this.params.tremor1 - this.params.tremor0) * u;\n    return { index, local, gliding, ring, radius: Math.max(0.08, radius * (getTune('ringEnd') / 0.16)), sway, tremor, pose, total };\n  }\n\n  breathPhase() {\n    const cycle = 8;\n    const p = (this.t % cycle) / cycle;\n    return { grow: p < 0.5, p };\n  }\n\n  screenCob(i) {\n    const m = this.poseMax * DEG;\n    return { x: this.states[i].leanX / m, y: -this.states[i].leanZ / m };\n  }\n\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\n    const clock = this.poseClock();\n    const breath = this.breathPhase();\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\n      const state = this.states[i];\n      if (!state.fallen) {\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\n      }\n      if (input.flail && this.tryFlail(i)) this.flailPenalty[i] += 4;\n      const synced = breath.grow ? !!input.breathe : !input.breathe;\n      this.breathSeen[i] += dt;\n      if (synced) this.breathSync[i] += dt;\n    }\n    const bonus = this.lanes.map((_, i) => (this.breathSeen[i] > 4 && this.breathSync[i] / this.breathSeen[i] >= 0.7) ? 0.6 : 1);\n    this.stepCores(dt, { maxLean: this.poseMax, margin: 0.45 }, (i) => {\n      const s = this.sway(i, clock.sway * bonus[i], clock.tremor * bonus[i]);\n      return s;\n    });\n    if (this.t <= clock.total + dt) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n        if (this.states[i].fallen) continue;\n        const cob = this.screenCob(i);\n        const dist = Math.hypot(cob.x - clock.ring.x, cob.y - clock.ring.y);\n        const inside = dist <= clock.radius;\n        const worth = 0.3 / Math.max(0.08, clock.radius);\n        const gain = bonus[i] < 1 ? 1.25 : 1;\n        this.possible[i] += worth;\n        if (inside) this.earned[i] += worth * gain;\n      }\n    }\n    if (this.t >= clock.total) this.done = true;\n  }\n\n  result(i = 0) {\n    const share = this.possible[i] > 0 ? this.earned[i] / this.possible[i] : 0;\n    const form = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, share * 100 - this.flailPenalty[i]));\n    return {\n      form, raw: this.earned[i],\n      medal: medalOf(form),\n      stats: `${this.list.length} poses · ${this.states[i].falls} floor exercises`,\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\n    };\n  }\n\n  botInput(i, skill, opt = {}) {\n    const clock = this.poseClock();\n    const cob = this.screenCob(i);\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\n    const goal = clock.ring;\n    let wish;\n    if (opt.parked) wish = { x: goal.x, y: goal.y };\n    else wish = correctWish(skill, goal, past, this.t, false, this.ph + i);\n    const breath = this.breathPhase();\n    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, breathe: breath.grow, flail: false, hop: false };\n  }\n}\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":459,"output_tokens":4443,"cache_read_input_tokens":201216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"ac6e1860-2a19-4599-b715-202325beaf0d"}
