{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d1158cb4-3295-4088-a3eb-a2a7ec1a0e1d-56","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"50→  let x = goal.x + g * (goal.x - dot.x) + n;\\n  let y = goal.y + g * (goal.y - dot.y) + n2;\\n  const h = Math.hypot(x, y);\\n  if (h > 1) { x /= h; y /= h; }\\n  return { x, y };\\n}\\n\\n/** A short history so the bot reacts to where the dot was `delay` seconds ago. */\\nexport function remember(history, t, dot, keep = 1.2) {\\n  history.push({ t, x: dot.x, y: dot.y });\\n60→  const cut = t - keep;\\n  while (history.length && history[0].t < cut) history.shift();\\n}\\n\\n/** Deterministic timing error. Sharp stays inside a perfect window; clumsy often does not. */\\nexport function timingOffset(skill, index) {\\n  const sign = index % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1;\\n  const scale = index % 5 === 0 ? 1.25 : 0.8;\\n  return sign * (skill?.timingSd ?? 0.05) * scale;\\n}\\n70→\\nexport function recall(history, t) {\\n  if (!history.length) return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  let best = history[0];\\n  for (const sample of history) {\\n    if (sample.t <= t) best = sample;\\n    else break;\\n  }\\n  return best;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"50→  let x = goal.x + g * (goal.x - dot.x) + n;\\n  let y = goal.y + g * (goal.y - dot.y) + n2;\\n  const h = Math.hypot(x, y);\\n  if (h > 1) { x /= h; y /= h; }\\n  return { x, y };\\n}\\n\\n/** A short history so the bot reacts to where the dot was `delay` seconds ago. */\\nexport function remember(history, t, dot, keep = 1.2) {\\n  history.push({ t, x: dot.x, y: dot.y });\\n60→  const cut = t - keep;\\n  while (history.length && history[0].t < cut) history.shift();\\n}\\n\\n/** Deterministic timing error. Sharp stays inside a perfect window; clumsy often does not. */\\nexport function timingOffset(skill, index) {\\n  const sign = index % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1;\\n  const scale = index % 5 === 0 ? 1.25 : 0.8;\\n  return sign * (skill?.timingSd ?? 0.05) * scale;\\n}\\n70→\\nexport function recall(history, t) {\\n  if (!history.length) return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  let best = history[0];\\n  for (const sample of history) {\\n    if (sample.t <= t) best = sample;\\n    else break;\\n  }\\n  return best;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/input/bot.js\",\"offset\":50,\"raw_output\":\"  let x = goal.x + g * (goal.x - dot.x) + n;\\n  let y = goal.y + g * (goal.y - dot.y) + n2;\\n  const h = Math.hypot(x, y);\\n  if (h > 1) { x /= h; y /= h; }\\n  return { x, y };\\n}\\n\\n/** A short history so the bot reacts to where the dot was `delay` seconds ago. */\\nexport function remember(history, t, dot, keep = 1.2) {\\n  history.push({ t, x: dot.x, y: dot.y });\\n  const cut = t - keep;\\n  while (history.length && history[0].t < cut) history.shift();\\n}\\n\\n/** Deterministic timing error. Sharp stays inside a perfect window; clumsy often does not. */\\nexport function timingOffset(skill, index) {\\n  const sign = index % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1;\\n  const scale = index % 5 === 0 ? 1.25 : 0.8;\\n  return sign * (skill?.timingSd ?? 0.05) * scale;\\n}\\n\\nexport function recall(history, t) {\\n  if (!history.length) return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  let best = history[0];\\n  for (const sample of history) {\\n    if (sample.t <= t) best = sample;\\n    else break;\\n  }\\n  return best;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":79}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"02b23e57-119a-41fb-b08f-f02979e7c8d0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_66","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"bot.js is fine. Charts have a bug: `bars('.', 4)` pads to eight dots.\n\nPattern lengths are correct. Now writing a shared lean helper in `src/events/lean.js` with `screenOf` and `clamp`.\n\nNow writing the main event files. Confirmed `notesOf` correctly identifies directional cells. Will import `formOf` and `medalOf` for cairn and other events. Still water duration is 60 seconds and it is excluded from session tracking.\n\nSneeze events use fixed times with small random offsets so seeds differ but the bot can read warnings from event state. The implementation tracks `sneezes`, `nextSneeze`, `warnLeft`, and `shoveLeft`. When a sneeze triggers, the bot gets a 1.2 second warning. If it flails during that warning, it is stilled; otherwise it is shoved forward by 2.2.\n\nBot flails during the warning window but not at its start, so a flail can stifle the sneeze. A zone is defined as a screen radius of 0.15 with maxLean 18. Calm accumulates when inside the zone and decays outside it. Form equals 100 times the mean of share and calm. Sharp should stay near 100 while Sway stays between 0.07 and 0.18; if Sway pushes out of the zone, the bot gain or corrected-wish check may need adjustment.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a52101-52b7-4b36-936b-9d0fe58e9804-57","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/lean.js","old_string":"","new_string":"import { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\n\nexport function screenOf(state, maxDeg) {\n  const m = Math.max(1e-4, maxDeg) * DEG;\n  return { x: state.leanX / m, y: -state.leanZ / m };\n}\n\nexport function clamp(n, a, b) {\n  return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, n));\n}\n\nexport function lerp(a, b, u) {\n  return a + (b - a) * clamp(u, 0, 1);\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a52101-52b7-4b36-936b-9d0fe58e9804-58","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/cairn.js","old_string":"","new_string":"import { Standing } from './base.js';\nimport { RAPIER, propGroups, dollGroups, bodyPoint } from '../physics/world.js';\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { rng } from '../core/rng.js';\nimport { medalOf, formOf } from '../game/score.js';\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\n\nconst SIZES = [[0.26, 0.09], [0.24, 0.085], [0.22, 0.08], [0.2, 0.078], [0.18, 0.074], [0.165, 0.07], [0.15, 0.066], [0.14, 0.062], [0.125, 0.058], [0.11, 0.054]];\nconst WIDE = [[0.28, 0.09], [0.27, 0.085], [0.26, 0.08], [0.25, 0.078], [0.24, 0.074], [0.23, 0.07], [0.22, 0.066], [0.21, 0.062], [0.2, 0.058], [0.19, 0.054]];\n\nconst TIERS = {\n  1: { n: 6, every: 5.5, hold: 8, sway0: 0.1, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.05, tremor1: 0.15, offset: 0.015, par: 640 },\n  2: { n: 8, every: 5, hold: 10, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.4, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2, offset: 0.02, par: 780 },\n  3: { n: 10, every: 4.5, hold: 10, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.4, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2, offset: 0.02, par: 860, wide: true },\n};\n\nexport class Cairn extends Standing {\n  static id = 'cairn';\n  static title = 'The Cairn';\n  static discipline = 'Stillness';\n  static instructor = 'stillwater';\n  static couch = true;\n  static session = true;\n  static can = 'Keep the slab level while stones are lowered onto it. Breathe with the ring.';\n  static cant = 'You can drop a stone. A flail will not put it back, and it costs a little form.';\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe'];\n  static tiers = {\n    1: { blurb: 'Six stones. The stack teaches you.' },\n    2: { blurb: 'Eight stones. Breath is how the tall ones stay.' },\n    3: { blurb: 'Ten wider stones. The quarry is showing off.' },\n  };\n\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\n    super(opts);\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\n    this.sizes = (this.params.wide ? WIDE : SIZES).slice(0, this.params.n);\n    this.stones = [];\n    this.nextAt = 1.2;\n    this.spawned = 0;\n    this.up = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.stead = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.samples = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\n    this.breathSync = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.breathSeen = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.flailPenalty = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\n    this.label = opts.label ?? 'cairn';\n  }\n\n  build() {\n    this.buildWorld(10, 16);\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      this.world.createCollider(\n        RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.275, 0.015, 0.275)\n          .setMass(0.05).setFriction(1).setTranslation(0, 0.95, 0)\n          .setCollisionGroups(dollGroups(i)),\n        this.dolls[i].body,\n      );\n    }\n  }\n\n  duration() {\n    return this.nextAt + (this.params.n - 1) * this.every() + this.params.hold;\n  }\n\n  every() {\n    return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('stoneInterval') : this.params.every;\n  }\n\n  massOf() {\n    return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('stoneMass') : 0.02;\n  }\n\n  breathPhase() {\n    const p = (this.t % 8) / 8;\n    return p < 0.5;\n  }\n\n  topY(i) {\n    let y = bodyPoint(this.dolls[i].body, { x: 0, y: 0.965, z: 0 }).y;\n    for (const stone of this.stones) {\n      if (stone.lane !== i) continue;\n      const p = stone.body.translation();\n      y = Math.max(y, p.y + stone.hh);\n    }\n    return y;\n  }\n\n  dropStone(i) {\n    const [r, hh] = this.sizes[this.spawned];\n    const origin = this.dolls[i].body.translation();\n    const off = this.params.offset;\n    const x = origin.x + (rng(this.label) * 2 - 1) * off;\n    const z = origin.z + (rng(this.label) * 2 - 1) * off;\n    const y = this.topY(i) + 0.012 + hh;\n    const body = this.world.createRigidBody(\n      RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(x, y, z).setCanSleep(false)\n        .setLinearDamping(0.1).setAngularDamping(0.6),\n    );\n    this.world.createCollider(\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(r * 0.8, hh, r * 0.8)\n        .setMass(this.massOf()).setFriction(0.95).setRestitution(0)\n        .setCollisionGroups(propGroups(i)),\n      body,\n    );\n    this.stones.push({ body, hh, lane: i, r });\n  }\n\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\n    const total = 1.2 + this.params.n * this.every() + this.params.hold;\n    const grow = this.breathPhase();\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\n      const state = this.states[i];\n      if (!state.fallen) {\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\n      }\n      if (input.flail && this.tryFlail(i)) this.flailPenalty[i] += 3;\n      this.breathSeen[i] += dt;\n      const synced = grow ? !!input.breathe : !input.breathe;\n      if (synced) this.breathSync[i] += dt;\n    }\n    if (this.spawned < this.params.n && this.t >= this.nextAt) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n        if (!this.states[i].fallen) this.dropStone(i);\n      }\n      this.spawned += 1;\n      this.nextAt += this.every();\n    }\n    const u = clamp(this.t / Math.max(1, total - this.params.hold), 0, 1);\n    const sway = lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u);\n    const tremor = lerp(this.params.tremor0, this.params.tremor1, u);\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6 }, (i) => {\n      const bonus = this.breathSeen[i] > 4 && this.breathSync[i] / this.breathSeen[i] >= 0.7 ? 0.6 : 1;\n      return this.sway(i, sway * bonus, tremor * bonus);\n    });\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      if (this.states[i].fallen) continue;\n      const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\n      this.samples[i] += 1;\n      this.stead[i] += clamp(1 - Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y), 0, 1);\n    }\n    if (this.t >= total) {\n      this.finishCount();\n      this.done = true;\n    }\n  }\n\n  finishCount() {\n    if (this.counted) return;\n    this.counted = true;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      const home = this.dolls[i].body.translation();\n      let up = 0;\n      for (const stone of this.stones) {\n        if (stone.lane !== i) continue;\n        const p = stone.body.translation();\n        if (p.y > 0.9 && Math.hypot(p.x - home.x, p.z - home.z) < 0.42) up += 1;\n      }\n      this.up[i] = up;\n    }\n  }\n\n  result(i = 0) {\n    this.finishCount();\n    const steady = this.samples[i] ? this.stead[i] / this.samples[i] : 0;\n    const raw = this.up[i] * 100 + this.up[i] * 8 * steady - this.flailPenalty[i];\n    const form = formOf(Math.max(0, raw), this.params.par);\n    return {\n      form, raw, medal: medalOf(form),\n      stats: `${this.up[i]} stones still up`,\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\n      stones: this.up[i],\n    };\n  }\n\n  botInput(i, skill, opt = {}) {\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\n    const loadedSkill = { ...skill, gain: skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7 };\n    const wish = opt.parked\n      ? { x: 0, y: 0 }\n      : correctWish(loadedSkill, { x: 0, y: 0 }, past, this.t, false, this.ph + i);\n    const grow = this.breathPhase();\n    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, breathe: opt.breath === false ? false : grow, flail: false, hop: false };\n  }\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a52101-52b7-4b36-936b-9d0fe58e9804-59","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/stillWater.js","old_string":"","new_string":"import { Standing } from './base.js';\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\nimport { mean } from '../game/score.js';\n\nconst TIERS = {\n  1: { zone: 0.15, sway0: 0.07, sway1: 0.18, sneezes: 2, par: 100 },\n  2: { zone: 0.12, sway0: 0.1, sway1: 0.22, sneezes: 3, par: 100 },\n  3: { zone: 0.1, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.26, sneezes: 4, par: 100 },\n};\n\nexport class StillWater extends Standing {\n  static id = 'stillWater';\n  static title = 'Still Water';\n  static discipline = 'Stillness';\n  static instructor = 'stillwater';\n  static couch = false;\n  static session = false;\n  static can = 'Sit in the calm. When a sneeze is coming, flail to stifle it.';\n  static cant = 'You cannot chase the creatures. Leaving the calm sends them off.';\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe'];\n  static tiers = {\n    1: { blurb: 'A wide calm, and two sneezes.' },\n    2: { blurb: 'The calm shrinks. Three sneezes.' },\n    3: { blurb: 'A small calm, and four sneezes.' },\n  };\n\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\n    super(opts);\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\n    this.duration = opts.session ? 50 : 60;\n    this.calm = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.inTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.warn = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.shove = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.stifled = this.lanes.map(() => false);\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\n    this.arrivals = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    const span = this.duration - 8;\n    this.times = Array.from({ length: this.params.sneezes }, (_, n) => 8 + (span * (n + 0.5)) / this.params.sneezes);\n    this.fired = 0;\n  }\n\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 18); }\n\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\n    if (this.fired < this.times.length && this.t >= this.times[this.fired]) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n        this.warn[i] = 1.2;\n        this.stifled[i] = false;\n      }\n      this.fired += 1;\n    }\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\n      const state = this.states[i];\n      if (!state.fallen) {\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\n      }\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0 && input.flail && this.tryFlail(i)) this.stifled[i] = true;\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0) {\n        this.warn[i] = Math.max(0, this.warn[i] - dt);\n        if (this.warn[i] === 0 && !this.stifled[i]) this.shove[i] = 0.3;\n      }\n    }\n    const u = clamp(this.t / this.duration, 0, 1);\n    const sway = lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u);\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.45 }, (i) => {\n      const s = this.sway(i, sway, 0.05);\n      if (this.shove[i] > 0) {\n        this.shove[i] = Math.max(0, this.shove[i] - dt);\n        s.nx += 2.2;\n      }\n      return s;\n    });\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      if (this.states[i].fallen) {\n        this.calm[i] = Math.max(0, this.calm[i] - dt / 8);\n        continue;\n      }\n      const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\n      const inside = Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= this.params.zone;\n      if (inside) this.inTime[i] += dt;\n      this.calm[i] = clamp(this.calm[i] + dt * (inside ? 1 / 30 : -1 / 8), 0, 1);\n      const gates = [0.2, 0.4, 0.6, 0.8, 1];\n      this.arrivals[i] = gates.filter((g) => this.calm[i] >= g - 1e-6).length;\n    }\n    if (this.t >= this.duration) this.done = true;\n  }\n\n  result(i = 0) {\n    const share = this.inTime[i] / this.duration;\n    const form = clamp(mean([share, this.calm[i]]) * 100, 0, 100);\n    return {\n      form, raw: form, medal: medalOf(form),\n      stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% calm time · ${this.arrivals[i]} visitors`,\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\n      calm: this.calm[i],\n    };\n  }\n\n  botInput(i, skill) {\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\n    const wish = correctWish(skill, { x: 0, y: 0 }, past, this.t, false, this.ph);\n    const flail = this.warn[i] > 0.2 && this.warn[i] < 1.05 && !this.stifled[i];\n    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, flail, breathe: false, hop: false };\n  }\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a52101-52b7-4b36-936b-9d0fe58e9804-60","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/logReps.js","old_string":"","new_string":"import { Standing } from './base.js';\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\nimport { difficultyOf, DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\n\nconst TIERS = {\n  1: { reps: 6, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.04, tremor1: 0.12 },\n  2: { reps: 9, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.06, tremor1: 0.16 },\n  3: { reps: 12, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\n};\n\nexport class LogReps extends Standing {\n  static id = 'logReps';\n  static title = 'Log Reps';\n  static discipline = 'Strength';\n  static instructor = 'bolster';\n  static couch = true;\n  static session = true;\n  static can = 'Follow the ribbon with both feet and keep the dot near the middle.';\n  static cant = 'The log is not a balance board. Lean it past the notch and Coach has to catch it.';\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\n  static tiers = {\n    1: { blurb: 'Six reps, then Coach lies about the last one.' },\n    2: { blurb: 'Nine reps. The band is stricter.' },\n    3: { blurb: 'Twelve reps. The band is strict.' },\n  };\n\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\n    super(opts);\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\n    this.offset = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.repScore = this.lanes.map(() => []);\n    this.bandTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.zoneTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.repClock = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.repIndex = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.lost = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\n    this.dropped = this.lanes.map(() => false);\n  }\n\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\n\n  tempo() {\n    const diff = difficultyOf(this.difficulty).rhythm;\n    return getTune('repTempo') * diff;\n  }\n\n  cycle() { return 5 / this.tempo(); }\n\n  ribbon(t) {\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\n    const u = (t % cycle) / cycle;\n    const down = 2 / 5;\n    const pause = 0.5 / 5;\n    if (u < down) return u / down;\n    if (u < down + pause) return 1;\n    if (u < down + pause + down) return 1 - (u - down - pause) / down;\n    return 0;\n  }\n\n  totalReps() { return this.params.reps + 2; }\n\n  halfWidth(rep) {\n    const base = lerp(0.16, 0.1, rep / this.params.reps);\n    return Math.max(0.06, base - 0.02 * (this.tier - 1));\n  }\n\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\n      const state = this.states[i];\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\n      }\n      const depth = ((input.feetL || 0) + (input.feetR || 0)) / 2;\n      const target = this.ribbon(this.t);\n      const rep = Math.min(this.totalReps() - 1, Math.floor(this.t / cycle));\n      const band = this.halfWidth(rep);\n      const cob = screenOf(state, 18);\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\n        if (Math.abs(depth - target) <= band) this.bandTime[i] += dt;\n        if (Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= 0.3) this.zoneTime[i] += dt;\n        this.repClock[i] += dt;\n      }\n      const deg = Math.abs(state.leanX) / DEG;\n      if (deg > 6) this.offset[i] += Math.sign(state.leanX || 1) * 0.05 * (deg - 6) * dt;\n      else this.offset[i] *= Math.exp(-dt * 0.8);\n      if (Math.abs(this.offset[i]) >= 0.5 && !this.dropped[i]) {\n        this.dropped[i] = true;\n        this.lost[i] += 1;\n        this.offset[i] = 0;\n        this.dropBack = (this.dropBack || 0) + 1;\n      }\n      if (this.dropped[i]) {\n        this.dropT = (this.dropT || 0) + dt;\n        if (this.dropT > 0.6) {\n          this.dropped[i] = false;\n          this.dropT = 0;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    const u = clamp(this.t / (this.totalReps() * cycle), 0, 1);\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6 }, (i) => {\n      const s = this.sway(i, lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u), lerp(this.params.tremor0, this.params.tremor1, u));\n      s.nx += 0.06 * 9.81 * this.offset[i];\n      return s;\n    });\n    const repNow = Math.floor(this.t / cycle);\n    if (repNow !== this.lastRep && this.t > 0) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\n        const clock = Math.max(1e-4, this.repClock[i]);\n        const bandShare = clamp(this.bandTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\n        const zoneShare = clamp(this.zoneTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\n        let score = bandShare * (0.5 + 0.5 * zoneShare);\n        if (this.lastRep >= this.params.reps) score *= 2;\n        if (this.lost[i]) score = 0;\n        this.repScore[i].push(score);\n        this.bandTime[i] = 0;\n        this.zoneTime[i] = 0;\n        this.repClock[i] = 0;\n        this.lost[i] = 0;\n      }\n      this.lastRep = repNow;\n    }\n    if (this.lastRep == null) this.lastRep = 0;\n    if (this.t >= this.totalReps() * cycle) this.done = true;\n  }\n\n  result(i = 0) {\n    const list = this.repScore[i];\n    const raw = list.length ? list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length : 0;\n    const form = clamp(raw * 100, 0, 100);\n    return {\n      form, raw, medal: medalOf(form),\n      stats: `${list.length} reps · the log stayed a number`,\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\n    };\n  }\n\n  botInput(i, skill) {\n    const late = skill?.delay ?? 0.16;\n    const depth = this.ribbon(Math.max(0, this.t - late));\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\n    const fix = (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7) * (0 - cob.x);\n    return {\n      x: clamp(fix, -0.4, 0.4),\n      y: clamp(-cob.y * (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7), -0.4, 0.4),\n      feetL: depth,\n      feetR: depth,\n      flail: false,\n      hop: false,\n      breathe: false,\n    };\n  }\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":514,"output_tokens":7441,"cache_read_input_tokens":149760,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"a7cef2c2-408a-45d9-a87f-28eb3cc9cc6a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-92a52101-52b7-4b36-936b-9d0fe58e9804-57","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"import { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\n\\nexport function screenOf(state, maxDeg) {\\n  const m = Math.max(1e-4, maxDeg) * DEG;\\n  return { x: state.leanX / m, y: -state.leanZ / m };\\n}\\n\\nexport function clamp(n, a, b) {\\n  return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, n));\\n}\\n\\nexport function lerp(a, b, u) {\\n  return a + (b - a) * clamp(u, 0, 1);\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/lean.js has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/lean.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/lean.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"import { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\n\\nexport function screenOf(state, maxDeg) {\\n  const m = Math.max(1e-4, maxDeg) * DEG;\\n  return { x: state.leanX / m, y: -state.leanZ / m };\\n}\\n\\nexport function clamp(n, a, b) {\\n  return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, n));\\n}\\n\\nexport function lerp(a, b, u) {\\n  return a + (b - a) * clamp(u, 0, 1);\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-92a52101-52b7-4b36-936b-9d0fe58e9804-58","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { RAPIER, propGroups, dollGroups, bodyPoint } from '../physics/world.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { rng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { medalOf, formOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst SIZES = [[0.26, 0.09], [0.24, 0.085], [0.22, 0.08], [0.2, 0.078], [0.18, 0.074], [0.165, 0.07], [0.15, 0.066], [0.14, 0.062], [0.125, 0.058], [0.11, 0.054]];\\nconst WIDE = [[0.28, 0.09], [0.27, 0.085], [0.26, 0.08], [0.25, 0.078], [0.24, 0.074], [0.23, 0.07], [0.22, 0.066], [0.21, 0.062], [0.2, 0.058], [0.19, 0.054]];\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { n: 6, every: 5.5, hold: 8, sway0: 0.1, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.05, tremor1: 0.15, offset: 0.015, par: 640 },\\n  2: { n: 8, every: 5, hold: 10, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.4, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2, offset: 0.02, par: 780 },\\n  3: { n: 10, every: 4.5, hold: 10, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.4, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2, offset: 0.02, par: 860, wide: true },\\n};\\n\\nexport class Cairn extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'cairn';\\n  static title = 'The Cairn';\\n  static discipline = 'Stillness';\\n  static instructor = 'stillwater';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n  static can = 'Keep the slab level while stones are lowered onto it. Breathe with the ring.';\\n  static cant = 'You can drop a stone. A flail will not put it back, and it costs a little form.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Six stones. The stack teaches you.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Eight stones. Breath is how the tall ones stay.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Ten wider stones. The quarry is showing off.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.sizes = (this.params.wide ? WIDE : SIZES).slice(0, this.params.n);\\n    this.stones = [];\\n    this.nextAt = 1.2;\\n    this.spawned = 0;\\n    this.up = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.stead = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.samples = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.breathSync = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.breathSeen = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.flailPenalty = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n    this.label = opts.label ?? 'cairn';\\n  }\\n\\n  build() {\\n    this.buildWorld(10, 16);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      this.world.createCollider(\\n        RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.275, 0.015, 0.275)\\n          .setMass(0.05).setFriction(1).setTranslation(0, 0.95, 0)\\n          .setCollisionGroups(dollGroups(i)),\\n        this.dolls[i].body,\\n      );\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  duration() {\\n    return this.nextAt + (this.params.n - 1) * this.every() + this.params.hold;\\n  }\\n\\n  every() {\\n    return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('stoneInterval') : this.params.every;\\n  }\\n\\n  massOf() {\\n    return this.tier === 1 ? getTune('stoneMass') : 0.02;\\n  }\\n\\n  breathPhase() {\\n    const p = (this.t % 8) / 8;\\n    return p < 0.5;\\n  }\\n\\n  topY(i) {\\n    let y = bodyPoint(this.dolls[i].body, { x: 0, y: 0.965, z: 0 }).y;\\n    for (const stone of this.stones) {\\n      if (stone.lane !== i) continue;\\n      const p = stone.body.translation();\\n      y = Math.max(y, p.y + stone.hh);\\n    }\\n    return y;\\n  }\\n\\n  dropStone(i) {\\n    const [r, hh] = this.sizes[this.spawned];\\n    const origin = this.dolls[i].body.translation();\\n    const off = this.params.offset;\\n    const x = origin.x + (rng(this.label) * 2 - 1) * off;\\n    const z = origin.z + (rng(this.label) * 2 - 1) * off;\\n    const y = this.topY(i) + 0.012 + hh;\\n    const body = this.world.createRigidBody(\\n      RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(x, y, z).setCanSleep(false)\\n        .setLinearDamping(0.1).setAngularDamping(0.6),\\n    );\\n    this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(r * 0.8, hh, r * 0.8)\\n        .setMass(this.massOf()).setFriction(0.95).setRestitution(0)\\n        .setCollisionGroups(propGroups(i)),\\n      body,\\n    );\\n    this.stones.push({ body, hh, lane: i, r });\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const total = 1.2 + this.params.n * this.every() + this.params.hold;\\n    const grow = this.breathPhase();\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      }\\n      if (input.flail && this.tryFlail(i)) this.flailPenalty[i] += 3;\\n      this.breathSeen[i] += dt;\\n      const synced = grow ? !!input.breathe : !input.breathe;\\n      if (synced) this.breathSync[i] += dt;\\n    }\\n    if (this.spawned < this.params.n && this.t >= this.nextAt) {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n        if (!this.states[i].fallen) this.dropStone(i);\\n      }\\n      this.spawned += 1;\\n      this.nextAt += this.every();\\n    }\\n    const u = clamp(this.t / Math.max(1, total - this.params.hold), 0, 1);\\n    const sway = lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u);\\n    const tremor = lerp(this.params.tremor0, this.params.tremor1, u);\\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6 }, (i) => {\\n      const bonus = this.breathSeen[i] > 4 && this.breathSync[i] / this.breathSeen[i] >= 0.7 ? 0.6 : 1;\\n      return this.sway(i, sway * bonus, tremor * bonus);\\n    });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.states[i].fallen) continue;\\n      const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n      this.samples[i] += 1;\\n      this.stead[i] += clamp(1 - Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n    if (this.t >= total) {\\n      this.finishCount();\\n      this.done = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  finishCount() {\\n    if (this.counted) return;\\n    this.counted = true;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const home = this.dolls[i].body.translation();\\n      let up = 0;\\n      for (const stone of this.stones) {\\n        if (stone.lane !== i) continue;\\n        const p = stone.body.translation();\\n        if (p.y > 0.9 && Math.hypot(p.x - home.x, p.z - home.z) < 0.42) up += 1;\\n      }\\n      this.up[i] = up;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    this.finishCount();\\n    const steady = this.samples[i] ? this.stead[i] / this.samples[i] : 0;\\n    const raw = this.up[i] * 100 + this.up[i] * 8 * steady - this.flailPenalty[i];\\n    const form = formOf(Math.max(0, raw), this.params.par);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${this.up[i]} stones still up`,\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n      stones: this.up[i],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill, opt = {}) {\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\\n    const loadedSkill = { ...skill, gain: skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7 };\\n    const wish = opt.parked\\n      ? { x: 0, y: 0 }\\n      : correctWish(loadedSkill, { x: 0, y: 0 }, past, this.t, false, this.ph + i);\\n    const grow = this.breathPhase();\\n    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, breathe: opt.breath === false ? false : grow, flail: false, hop: false };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/cairn.js has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/cairn.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20