{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b1bd137c-0d56-4965-a624-86be12f9054f-92","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"        const p = glass.translation();\\n        const localX = p.x - home.x;\\n        const localZ = p.z - home.z;\\n        if (p.y < 0.45) glass.setEnabled(false);\",\"new_string\":\"        const p = glass.translation();\\n        if (p.y < 0.45 || Math.hypot(p.x - home.x, p.z - home.z) > 1.4) glass.setEnabled(false);\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/roomService.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/roomService.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/roomService.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"        const p = glass.translation();\\n        const localX = p.x - home.x;\\n        const localZ = p.z - home.z;\\n        if (p.y < 0.45) glass.setEnabled(false);\",\"old_line\":153,\"new_string\":\"        const p = glass.translation();\\n        if (p.y < 0.45 || Math.hypot(p.x - home.x, p.z - home.z) > 1.4) glass.setEnabled(false);\",\"new_line\":153,\"context_before\":\"      let held = 0;\\n      for (const glass of this.glasses[i]) {\\n        if (!glass.isEnabled()) continue;\\n\",\"context_after\":\"        else held += 1;\\n      }\\n      this.held[i] = held;\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"16284f0d-f899-479f-9e05-22f1e2a68dd6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_77","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Plates and island fixes are next. Then I'll rerun room debug and a couple events.\n\nIsland cadence accumulates phase in botInput. Plates commit to band and use explicit raft skills. Sharp error still modulates rate slowly.\n\nCadence variation is 3%, safely inside the 15% limit. Clumsy at 16% will fall outside that range. The plates bot selects alive plates matching its band wish, then picks the lowest-energy one.\n\nPlates switch bands only after a 1.2-second delay if the lowest-energy plate is below 0.4 energy and the current band is stale. Clumsy reaction is 0.5, so speed errors push plates out of band and kill them faster. Sharp speed error is 0.3.\n\nSharp speed error is 0.045, keeping it in band. Clumsy speed error is 1.19, pushing mid-4.25 out of the 3.5–5 range. Hoop tau 0.5 and the reaction delay let sharp hold a dead band while clumsy switches too late. The raft skill fallback is now ['average', 'clumsy', 'average'] for local lanes. I will add a debug for plates omega sign flips if energy stays low. Room retest follows the physics change. If glasses still fall, I will attach them as colliders.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5ea0f7e-1fc8-477a-bbf2-c6f10873a5e7-93","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/islandLoop.js","old_string":"    const err = skill?.name === 'clumsy' || (skill?.speedErr ?? 0) > 1 ? 0.16 : (skill?.speedErr ?? 0) > 0.5 ? 0.08 : 0.03;\n    const rate = 2.5 * (1 + err * Math.sin(this.t * 0.7));\n    const period = 1 / Math.max(0.5, rate);\n    const half = Math.floor(this.t / period) % 2 === 0;\n    const on = (this.t % period) < period * 0.42;","new_string":"    const err = (skill?.speedErr ?? 0) > 1 ? 0.16 : (skill?.speedErr ?? 0) > 0.5 ? 0.08 : 0.02;\n    const rate = 2.5 * (1 + err * Math.sin(this.t * 0.35 + this.ph));\n    this.jog = (this.jog || 0) + rate / 120;\n    const n = Math.floor(this.jog);\n    const on = this.jog - n < 0.45;\n    const half = n % 2 === 0;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5ea0f7e-1fc8-477a-bbf2-c6f10873a5e7-94","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/plates.js","old_string":"    let lowest = this.plates[i].filter((p) => p.alive)[0] || this.plates[i][0];\n    for (const plate of this.plates[i]) {\n      if (plate.alive && plate.energy < lowest.energy) lowest = plate;\n    }\n    const want = lowest?.band || 'L';\n    if (want !== this.bandWish[i] && this.t - this.bandAt[i] > (skill?.reaction ?? 0.12)) {\n      this.bandWish[i] = want;\n      this.bandAt[i] = this.t;\n    }\n    const band = BANDS[this.bandWish[i]];\n    const err = (skill?.speedErr ?? 0.3) * Math.sin(this.t * 1.7 + this.ph);\n    const clumsy = (skill?.speedErr ?? 0) > 1;\n    const wander = clumsy ? err * 1.1 : err * 0.25;","new_string":"    const alive = this.plates[i].filter((plate) => plate.alive);\n    const lowest = alive.slice().sort((a, b) => a.energy - b.energy)[0] || this.plates[i][0];\n    const here = alive.filter((plate) => plate.band === this.bandWish[i]);\n    const hereMin = here.length ? Math.min(...here.map((plate) => plate.energy)) : 0;\n    const reaction = Math.max(0.9, skill?.reaction ?? 0.12);\n    const urgent = lowest && lowest.energy < 0.35 && lowest.band !== this.bandWish[i];\n    if ((urgent || hereMin > 0.9) && lowest && this.t - this.bandAt[i] > reaction) {\n      this.bandWish[i] = lowest.band;\n      this.bandAt[i] = this.t;\n    }\n    const band = BANDS[this.bandWish[i]];\n    const clumsy = (skill?.speedErr ?? 0) > 1;\n    const wander = (skill?.speedErr ?? 0.3) * (clumsy ? 0.9 : 0.12) * Math.sin(this.t * 1.7 + this.ph);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5ea0f7e-1fc8-477a-bbf2-c6f10873a5e7-95","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/raft.js","old_string":"      skill: lane.kind === 'local' ? (opts.skill || 'sharp') : (lane.skill || ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'][i % 3]),","new_string":"      skill: lane.kind === 'local' ? (opts.skill || 'sharp') : (['average', 'clumsy', 'average'][i - 1] || 'average'),"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":391,"output_tokens":1914,"cache_read_input_tokens":199168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"25fc88ea-41f4-4f48-972a-f2e540360635"}
