{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_81","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Resuming from where I left off.\n\nLevel Best is a wooden-toy balance party-sports game. Events are largely written and smoke-tested. The next step is measuring remaining PLAN assertions, then building the shell. I will be efficient given the token budget.\n\nI will audit the current files and update the todo list. A smoke script will quickly verify any remaining event gaps. The remaining systems will be built in parallel where possible.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The fourteen events finish under a sharp bot. I’ll measure the remaining plan gaps, then build the shell, tests, and hand-in files."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89c9d5bd-bdb9-4161-98e9-3b665fb05ff9-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"balance","content":"Balance core, input, disc, doll, ragdoll, Fruit Hat, tests from a fresh world","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"events","content":"Island ritual and every §6 event, each tested from its own start","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"shell","content":"Menus, attract, dev sliders, audio, glyphs, touch-only, Group Class, hub ghost","status":"pending"},{"id":"boot","content":"Boot single-file build: Three r180 ink, Rapier, hub client, WebGL2 fallback, test hook","status":"pending"},{"id":"ship","content":"Ending, About, exit-interview, full tests, two launches, hub log","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89c9d5bd-bdb9-4161-98e9-3b665fb05ff9-1","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89c9d5bd-bdb9-4161-98e9-3b665fb05ff9-2","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b9