{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_88","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a large implementation. I will write code in large files.\n\nI'll read spike-balance.mjs to reuse its test logic for the balance kernel tests. I'm structuring the tests carefully so they pass.\n\nThe dialogue generator will be a node script or shell script writing src/data/dialogue.js. The game shell goes into large files. Tests must match the plan. Then build and run.\n\nThe director flow test needs a fresh save. It must walk through title, profile, tutorial, and all days with stubbed pad and bot in every class.\n\nThe full director flow test must cover ending, credits, maintenance day, and free play. It needs stamps, marbles rising, tilt falling to zero, and music detuning to zero. Reload mid-day should resume correctly. Attract mode requires ten advances from the title, visiting at least four events, a key exit, and a ten-second wall-clock wait. Pause, resume, restart, and Dev Mode opening only from pause are also required. A five-day physics run in Node.js takes roughly seven hundred seconds.\n\nThe balance kernel tests will run in roughly two minutes. Browser tests need about two minutes too, since WebGPU initialization is slow. The hub harness covers four scenarios.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7cb4ce0e-6f8d-40ee-ac11-0e07877f5f9a-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"checks|pass|progress|ghost|ready|time-up|host-leave","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/hub","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7cb4ce0e-6f8d-40ee-ac11-0e07877f5f9a-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/plates.js","offset":120,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id"