{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_98","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The local variable `placeholder` in ExtrudeGeometry will be mangled by minification.\n\nComments will be stripped during minification, so TODO markers disappear. The built HTML will be verified with grep afterward. Now writing the code files.\n\nDesigning the game director API for deterministic, fast flow testing. The `createGame` function will accept configurable options and return methods to control timing, bot behavior, screen navigation, settings, input, and raw save/load.\n\nBoot waits for the engine in render mode. Tests skip to title immediately.\n\nTitle shows a \"Press X\" prompt. Coarse input without fine controls routes to a touch screen. Attract mode continues during this check.\n\nConfirming title without profiles goes to who. Otherwise it goes to menu.\n\nThe who screen has previous name, next name, paint, hat, and start choices.\n\nThe who screen is trimmed to four choices: name, paint, hat, and begin. Left and right change the name on the focused row. Confirming begin creates a profile and advances to tutorial.\n\nTutorial shows one card explaining lean, hop, and flail. It also states that typing names is not possible. Confirming advances to morning.\n\nMorning displays one speech line and uses it to advance. Then it presents a question with yes or no choices. Either answer triggers a reply line before check-in.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d2d3e1db-ff69-4627-8678-8b2b4bc520a1-50","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"buildWorld|this\\.start\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events","glob":"*.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1186,"output_tokens":1345,"cache_read_input_tokens":119168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"17d418e8-c6db-4cb5-a78c-c27f5330fbd9"}
