{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_108","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The log reps bot uses continuous ribbon depth for feetL and feetR instead of edges.\n\nClumsy's 0.38s delay may still score above 70 because the ribbon depth acts as a direct trigger. The plan requires Log Reps to keep clumsy below 70 without hurting sharp. Sharp uses 0.16s delay and a 0.16–0.10 band, while clumsy uses 0.38s on a 2s move that drops over 2s. The band half-width must be tightened for clumsy.\n\nClumsy's 0.38s delay produces a depth error of 0.19, which sits outside the 0.16 band and should keep its score low. Sharp's 0.16s error stays inside at roughly 0.08. I will write the gap script, generate files, and run the test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c895cda4-f36b-4ec4-868d-56aa6699e21f-65","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"static can|static cant|static title|static verbs|static instructor","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4433,"output_tokens":497,"cache_read_input_tokens":141568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"7c640294-988e-4e26-bd1c-c5c18877406d"}
