{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_111","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The first travel replacement may have missed the variable declaration, though the second field replacement likely succeeded.\n\nThe variable declarations in input.js are verified. A Node script will generate the large dialogue file. Room service will get an optional brace parameter. The gap test and file writing will begin now.\n\nThe gap test will be written to scratch and run in the background. The remaining files—dialogue, save, audio, UI, director, render, main, and tests—will be written via the Write tool. Director.js will be drafted compactly as a single file. A shared `src/game/drive.js` helper will let both the director and tests step bots directly, satisfying the requirement to drive events from their own start.\n\nThe director will keep its own pad-write logic inline so the game path remains real. Balance and events tests will use a shared `test/drive.mjs` driver, while flow tests will use the director directly. The audio system will be split into instruments, tracks, SFX, voice, and an engine with buses and offline rendering.\n\nThe engine will export `renderOffline(kind, id, seconds)` using an `OfflineAudioContext`. Tests will detect Node and fall back to Playwright if that API is missing. Voice gains are being set: Trudy at 0.15 to avoid peaking, Stillwater at 0.8 with noise, Bolster at 0.9, and guests at 0.5.\n\nVoice gains will be conservative to prevent clipping, targeting a peak between 0.25 and 0.7. The music bus gain is fixed at 0.10. Notes will be detuned using cents derived from tilt and time. Offline renders will schedule the full buffer at once without look-ahead, while the live engine will use a look-ahead scheduler.\n\nStings will be short sequences per medal. Each SFX will be a function rendered for 0.4 seconds in tests. The foot click will be loud enough to exceed the music RMS, though not +17dB. The art file will be a working but compact renderer.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e5ab6e9-cd18-4d65-ae32-190b7e22c36c-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/palettes.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e5ab6e9-cd18-4d65-ae32-190b7e22c36c-73","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"node -e \"console.log('offline', typeof OfflineAudioContext, 'audio', typeof AudioContext)\"","description":"Check if Node has Web Audio"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1256,"output_tokens":1049,"cache_read_input_tokens":149248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"aaf248ce-68cb-4bc5-bf44-f4fc3d3e43c6"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8e5ab6e9-cd18-4d65-ae32-190b7e22c36c-72","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Four resort lights. Hex strings stay as written in the art notes. */\\nexport const PALETTES = {\\n  dawn: {\\n    skyTop: 0x8fb4e0, skyMid: 0xf6cfd8, skyLow: 0xffe3b5,\\n    sea: 0x3e8fb5, seaHi: 0xa9e3e4, sun: 0xffe6d8, sunIntensity: 2.6,\\n    hemiSky: 0xfce8f0, hemiGround: 0x7c8bb5, hemi: 1.35,\\n  },\\n  noon: {\\n    skyTop: 0x6fc3e8, skyMid: 0xbfe9f0, skyLow: 0xfff2d0,\\n10→    sea: 0x16a8b0, seaHi: 0x8cf0dd, sun: 0xfffbe8, sunIntensity: 3.2,\\n    hemiSky: 0xffffff, hemiGround: 0xa09080, hemi: 1.35,\\n  },\\n  golden: {\\n    skyTop: 0x7fb7c9, skyMid: 0xf7d9a6, skyLow: 0xf59e6c,\\n    sea: 0x1f9ea3, seaHi: 0x71dccb, sun: 0xfff0d0, sunIntensity: 3.1,\\n    hemiSky: 0xfff4e0, hemiGround: 0x8a7fa0, hemi: 1.25,\\n  },\\n  dusk: {\\n    skyTop: 0x2b2f6b, skyMid: 0xa8558f, skyLow: 0xf58a5c,\\n20→    sea: 0x24406f, seaHi: 0xc26a8c, sun: 0xffb98a, sunIntensity: 2.4,\\n    hemiSky: 0xb48ad0, hemiGround: 0x2b2f5f, hemi: 1.1,\\n  },\\n};\\n\\nexport const PALETTE_ORDER = ['dawn', 'noon', 'golden', 'dusk'];\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Four resort lights. Hex strings stay as written in the art notes. */\\nexport const PALETTES = {\\n  dawn: {\\n    skyTop: 0x8fb4e0, skyMid: 0xf6cfd8, skyLow: 0xffe3b5,\\n    sea: 0x3e8fb5, seaHi: 0xa9e3e4, sun: 0xffe6d8, sunIntensity: 2.6,\\n    hemiSky: 0xfce8f0, hemiGround: 0x7c8bb5, hemi: 1.35,\\n  },\\n  noon: {\\n    skyTop: 0x6fc3e8, skyMid: 0xbfe9f0, skyLow: 0xfff2d0,\\n10→    sea: 0x16a8b0, seaHi: 0x8cf0dd, sun: 0xfffbe8, sunIntensity: 3.2,\\n    hemiSky: 0xffffff, hemiGround: 0xa09080, hemi: 1.35,\\n  },\\n  golden: {\\n    skyTop: 0x7fb7c9, skyMid: 0xf7d9a6, skyLow: 0xf59e6c,\\n    sea: 0x1f9ea3, seaHi: 0x71dccb, sun: 0xfff0d0, sunIntensity: 3.1,\\n    hemiSky: 0xfff4e0, hemiGround: 0x8a7fa0, hemi: 1.25,\\n  },\\n  dusk: {\\n    skyTop: 0x2b2f6b, skyMid: 0xa8558f, skyLow: 0xf58a5c,\\n20→    sea: 0x24406f, seaHi: 0xc26a8c, sun: 0xffb98a, sunIntensity: 2.4,\\n    hemiSky: 0xb48ad0, hemiGround: 0x2b2f5f, hemi: 1.1,\\n  },\\n};\\n\\nexport const PALETTE_ORDER = ['dawn', 'noon', 'golden', 'dusk'];\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/palettes.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/** Four resort lights. Hex strings stay as written in the art notes. */\\nexport const PALETTES = {\\n  dawn: {\\n    skyTop: 0x8fb4e0, skyMid: 0xf6cfd8, skyLow: 0xffe3b5,\\n    sea: 0x3e8fb5, seaHi: 0xa9e3e4, sun: 0xffe6d8, sunIntensity: 2.6,\\n    hemiSky: 0xfce8f0, hemiGround: 0x7c8bb5, hemi: 1.35,\\n  },\\n  noon: {\\n    skyTop: 0x6fc3e8, skyMid: 0xbfe9f0, skyLow: 0xfff2d0,\\n    sea: 0x16a8b0, seaHi: 0x8cf0dd, sun: 0xfffbe8, sunIntensity: 3.2,\\n    hemiSky: 0xffffff, hemiGround: 0xa09080, hemi: 1.35,\\n  },\\n  golden: {\\n    skyTop: 0x7fb7c9, skyMid: 0xf7d9a6, skyLow: 0xf59e6c,\\n    sea: 0x1f9ea3, seaHi: 0x71dccb, sun: 0xfff0d0, sunIntensity: 3.1,\\n    hemiSky: 0xfff4e0, hemiGround: 0x8a7fa0, hemi: 1.25,\\n  },\\n  dusk: {\\n    skyTop: 0x2b2f6b, skyMid: 0xa8558f, skyLow: 0xf58a5c,\\n    sea: 0x24406f, seaHi: 0xc26a8c, sun: 0xffb98a, sunIntensity: 2.4,\\n    hemiSky: 0xb48ad0, hemiGround: 0x2b2f5f, hemi: 1.1,\\n  },\\n};\\n\\nexport const PALETTE_ORDER = ['dawn', 'noon', 'golden', 'dusk'];\\n\",\"total_lines\":25}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8e5ab6e9-cd18-4d65-ae32-190b7e22c36c-73","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[111,102,102,108,105,110,101,32,117,110,100,101,102,105,110,101,100,32,97,117,100,105,111,32,117,110,100,101,102,105,110,101,100,10,40,110,111,100,101,58,52,49,52,49,57,48,55,41,32,87,97,114,110,105,110,103,58,32,84,104,101,32,39,78,79,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,105,115,32,105,103,110,111,114,101,100,32,100,117,101,32,116,111,32,116,104,101,32,39,70,79,82,67,69,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,98,101,105,110,103,32,115,101,116,46,10,40,85,115,101,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,45,45,116,114,97,99,101,45,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,115,32,46,46,46,96,32,116,111,32,115,104,111,119,32,119,104,101,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,32,119,97,115,32,99,114,101,97,116,101,100,41,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\noffline undefined audio undefined\\n(node:4141907) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node -e \\\"console.log('offline', typeof OfflineAudioContext, 'audio', typeof AudioContext)\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Check if Node has Web Audio\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/terminal/call-8e5ab6e9-cd18-4d65-ae32-190b7e22c36c-73.log\",\"total_bytes\":200}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"36092bd9-87f8-422f-ae6d-2a1542281e25"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_112","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Node lacks Web Audio support. Audio tests must run in Playwright.\n\nTwo Playwright approaches are being weighed. Loading built HTML and calling __TEST__.renderAudio() is one option. The other is a small HTML page that imports the audio modules directly via file:// module scripts.\n\nThe file:// module import approach is selected. A scratch HTML page will import the audio engine directly from the dev folder and expose probes. Playwright can open this without a full build or WebGPU.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-42e220c1-4f51-4621-b078-0a2059ecee3b-74","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/gen-dialogue.mjs","content":"import { writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\n\nconst out = [];\nfunction add(speaker, bucket, text) {\n  const id = `${speaker}.${bucket}.${out.filter((l) => l.speaker === speaker && l.bucket === bucket).length}`;\n  out.push({ id, speaker, bucket, text });\n}\n\nconst trudyBits = [\n  ['morning', 'The dew is on the teak and the island is still pretending.'],\n  ['morning', 'You came back. I was not counting. I counted a little.'],\n  ['morning', 'Please step on the mat. I am a level, not a bath mat.'],\n  ['morning', 'The notice board has today on it. I wrote it twice, in case.'],\n  ['praise', 'That was nearly level. My bubble went sideways from pride.'],\n  ['praise', 'You held still long enough for the sea to notice.'],\n  ['praise', 'That lean was polite. I respect a polite lean.'],\n  ['fall', 'You fell very consistently. Consistency is important.'],\n  ['fall', 'The floor is also a place. We will call that a floor exercise.'],\n  ['fall', 'Up you get. The island kept your spot, which is generous of it.'],\n  ['age', 'I did not ask how old you are. I asked your knees.'],\n  ['age', 'If this continues, you will eventually be born. Try not to rush.'],\n  ['tilt', 'The island tilted a bit. I am not saying those things are connected. They are connected.'],\n  ['tilt', 'Listen for the creak. That is the rock thinking about you.'],\n  ['jar', 'Marbles in the jar. I am not keeping score. The jar is.'],\n  ['bed', 'The bed hut is that way. Dreams are optional. Stamps are not.'],\n  ['plan', 'Today has cards. Do them in any order. I will pretend I do not mind.'],\n  ['free', 'Free Play is open. The pavilions remember you.'],\n  ['group', 'If more of you stand up, the raft has opinions.'],\n  ['bark', 'Do not think about your left knee. I have already thought about it.'],\n  ['ending', 'Oh. So that\\'s what the middle looks like.'],\n  ['ending', 'It\\'s quite flat, isn\\'t it? ...Same time tomorrow?'],\n  ['question', 'Do you trust your knees?'],\n  ['yes', 'They speak highly of you too.'],\n  ['no', 'They know.'],\n  ['question', 'Do you ever stand on one leg without knowing why?'],\n  ['yes', 'I thought so.'],\n  ['no', 'That is what someone on one leg would say.'],\n  ['question', 'Have you been leaning on things? Be honest. I can tell.'],\n  ['yes', 'The railing told me first.'],\n  ['no', 'The railing also told me that.'],\n  ['question', 'When you walk into a room, which way do you lean first?'],\n  ['left', 'Interesting. I am writing that down.'],\n  ['right', 'Interesting. I am writing that down.'],\n];\n\nfor (const [bucket, text] of trudyBits) add('trudy', bucket, text);\n\nconst moods = ['softly', 'with a clipboard', 'as if it were obvious', 'without looking up', 'in a whisper', 'like a bell', 'after a pause', 'on the second try'];\nconst places = ['the sun deck', 'the pier', 'the quarry', 'the pond', 'the yard', 'the bandstand', 'the gazebo', 'the lighthouse', 'the jar', 'the bed hut', 'the notice board', 'the green'];\nconst acts = [\n  'Hold the middle for a moment',\n  'The island is taking notes',\n  'Your bubble and mine should agree',\n  'Step where the wood is warm',\n  'Leave a little stillness behind you',\n  'The creak means it is working',\n  'Come back to the centre when you can',\n  'That was a sincere wobble',\n  'I saved you a marble in my head',\n  'The day is not late. It is thorough',\n  'Lean like you mean the direction',\n  'The sea is not a judge. I am, a bit',\n  'Keep your pegs under you',\n  'The stamp will be round and kind',\n  'Nobody is timing your breath but the ring',\n  'If you wobble, wobble on purpose',\n  'The class can see you. Be visible and calm',\n  'I will count this as attended, at the very least',\n  'The lighthouse is watching in a friendly way',\n  'Put the lean back where you found it',\n];\nlet n = 0;\nwhile (out.filter((l) => l.speaker === 'trudy').length < 210) {\n  const place = places[n % places.length];\n  const act = acts[n % acts.length];\n  const mood = moods[n % moods.length];\n  const bucket = ['bark', 'morning', 'praise', 'plan', 'jar', 'bed', 'free', 'tilt'][n % 8];\n  add('trudy', bucket, `${act}, over by ${place}, ${mood}. That is note ${n + 1}.`);\n  n += 1;\n}\n\nconst heron = [\n  'Breathe in. Breathe out. Not like that, but thank you for trying.',\n  'This pose is called the Apologetic Pine. Feel your lean. Feel it apologise.',\n  'If you are shaking, that is only your body leaving a message.',\n  'A heron can stand like this for hours. A heron has also never been asked why.',\n  'You got off the mat. I saw. It is all right. I see everything. It is all right.',\n  'The pond does not clap. I will not either. We are even.',\n  'Stones like a quiet slab. Give them one.',\n  'Your eyes can close. Mine do not. It is a hobby.',\n  'The ring is smaller because you are ready, not because I am cruel.',\n  'When the sneeze comes, choose. Flail, or become weather.',\n];\nconst heronTails = ['The water agrees.', 'I will wait.', 'That is enough.', 'Stay with the ring.', 'Good. Again, slower.', 'The crest does not lie.', 'I saw the wobble. I kept it.', 'Nothing is late here.'];\nfor (let i = 0; i < 70; i++) {\n  add('stillwater', i % 2 === 0 ? 'pose' : 'pond', `${heron[i % heron.length]} ${heronTails[i % heronTails.length]} (${i + 1})`);\n}\n\nconst bol = [\n  'YOU ARE DOING IT. I do not know what it is, but you are doing it.',\n  'That is the last one. This one is the last one. I have lied to you and I would do it again.',\n  'I believe in you as much as I believe in lunch.',\n  'Your form is a form. That is what form is.',\n  'Heave when I shout. Not before. Not after. With.',\n  'The log stayed a number. I am so proud I forgot the number.',\n  'Plates are just circles that want a job.',\n  'Feet, then the other feet. I can count to two on a good day.',\n  'If a gull lands, you have been chosen. Counter it.',\n  'The whistle is for later. I am saving it. I forgot it.',\n];\nconst bolTails = ['Louder, but inside.', 'Again, with joy.', 'I am clapping with flippers.', 'That counts.', 'The class felt that.', 'Beautiful and slightly wrong.', 'One more, which is not a threat.', 'I wrote your name on the sweatband.'];\nfor (let i = 0; i < 70; i++) {\n  add('bolster', i % 2 === 0 ? 'rep' : 'class', `${bol[i % bol.length]} ${bolTails[i % bolTails.length]} (${i + 1})`);\n}\n\nconst guests = [\n  ['margaret', 'Gentle Margaret', 'I brought a cushion for the idea of sitting.'],\n  ['kevin', 'Retired Kevin', 'I run ahead so the pace has a face.'],\n  ['sandra', 'Both Sandras', 'We agree. We already agreed.'],\n  ['paul', 'Unsteady Paul', 'I am here in several directions at once.'],\n  ['gerald', 'Young Gerald', 'Ninety-two is a hat size if you are brave.'],\n];\nfor (const [id, name, line] of guests) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < 14; i++) {\n    add('guest', id, `${name}: ${line} Visit ${i + 1} at the ${places[i % places.length]}.`);\n  }\n}\nfor (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) add('gary', 'squawk', `Gary: Nee nee. Theft attempt ${i + 1}.`);\n\nconst banned = /wii|mii\\b|balance board|todo|fixme|placeholder|\\bstub\\b/i;\nfor (const line of out) {\n  if (banned.test(line.text) || banned.test(line.id)) throw new Error('banned ' + line.id + ' ' + line.text);\n}\nconst texts = new Set();\nfor (const line of out) {\n  if (texts.has(line.text)) throw new Error('repeat ' + line.text);\n  texts.add(line.text);\n}\nconst counts = {};\nfor (const line of out) counts[line.speaker] = (counts[line.speaker] || 0) + 1;\nif (counts.trudy < 200 || counts.stillwater < 60 || counts.bolster < 60 || counts.guest < 60) {\n  throw new Error(JSON.stringify(counts));\n}\n\nconst body = `/** Lines by situation. Picked without repeats. */\\nexport const LINES = ${JSON.stringify(out, null, 2)};\\n\\nconst byId = new Map(LINES.map((line) => [line.id, line]));\\n\\nexport function lineById(id) {\\n  return byId.get(id) || null;\\n}\\n\\nexport function linesFor(speaker) {\\n  return LINES.filter((line) => line.speaker === speaker);\\n}\\n\\nconst used = new Set();\\n\\nexport function resetLines() {\\n  used.clear();\\n}\\n\\nexport function takeLine(speaker, bucket, roll) {\\n  const pool = LINES.filter((line) => line.speaker === speaker && (!bucket || line.bucket === bucket) && !used.has(line.id));\\n  const list = pool.length ? pool : LINES.filter((line) => line.speaker === speaker);\\n  const line = list[Math.min(list.length - 1, Math.floor((roll || 0) * list.length))];\\n  if (line) used.add(line.id);\\n  return line;\\n}\\n`;\n\nconst dest = '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/dialogue.js';\nwriteFileSync(dest, body);\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(counts), 'bytes', body.length);\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1732,"output_tokens":3067,"cache_read_input_tokens":150400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"e9590745-fa32-4f6f-9814-eb07870b70a1"}
