your left knee. I have already thought about it.'],\\n  ['ending', 'Oh. So that\\\\'s what the middle looks like.'],\\n  ['ending', 'It\\\\'s quite flat, isn\\\\'t it? ...Same time tomorrow?'],\\n  ['question', 'Do you trust your knees?'],\\n  ['yes', 'They speak highly of you too.'],\\n  ['no', 'They know.'],\\n  ['question', 'Do you ever stand on one leg without knowing why?'],\\n  ['yes', 'I thought so.'],\\n  ['no', 'That is what someone on one leg would say.'],\\n  ['question', 'Have you been leaning on things? Be honest. I can tell.'],\\n  ['yes', 'The railing told me first.'],\\n  ['no', 'The railing also told me that.'],\\n  ['question', 'When you walk into a room, which way do you lean first?'],\\n  ['left', 'Interesting. I am writing that down.'],\\n  ['right', 'Interesting. I am writing that down.'],\\n];\\n\\nfor (const [bucket, text] of trudyBits) add('trudy', bucket, text);\\n\\nconst moods = ['softly', 'with a clipboard', 'as if it were obvious', 'without looking up', 'in a whisper', 'like a bell', 'after a pause', 'on the second try'];\\nconst places = ['the sun deck', 'the pier', 'the quarry', 'the pond', 'the yard', 'the bandstand', 'the gazebo', 'the lighthouse', 'the jar', 'the bed hut', 'the notice board', 'the green'];\\nconst acts = [\\n  'Hold the middle for a moment',\\n  'The island is taking notes',\\n  'Your bubble and mine should agree',\\n  'Step where the wood is warm',\\n  'Leave a little stillness behind you',\\n  'The creak means it is working',\\n  'Come back to the centre when you can',\\n  'That was a sincere wobble',\\n  'I saved you a marble in my head',\\n  'The day is not late. It is thorough',\\n  'Lean like you mean the direction',\\n  'The sea is not a judge. I am, a bit',\\n  'Keep your pegs under you',\\n  'The stamp will be round and kind',\\n  'Nobody is timing your breath but the ring',\\n  'If you wobble, wobble on purpose',\\n  'The class can see you. Be visible and calm',\\n  'I will count this as attended, at the very least',\\n  'The lighthouse is watching in a friendly way',\\n  'Put the lean back where you found it',\\n];\\nlet n = 0;\\nwhile (out.filter((l) => l.speaker === 'trudy').length < 210) {\\n  const place = places[n % places.length];\\n  const act = acts[n % acts.length];\\n  const mood = moods[n % moods.length];\\n  const bucket = ['bark', 'morning', 'praise', 'plan', 'jar', 'bed', 'free', 'tilt'][n % 8];\\n  add('trudy', bucket, `${act}, over by ${place}, ${mood}. That is note ${n + 1}.`);\\n  n += 1;\\n}\\n\\nconst heron = [\\n  'Breathe in. Breathe out. Not like that, but thank you for trying.',\\n  'This pose is called the Apologetic Pine. Feel your lean. Feel it apologise.',\\n  'If you are shaking, that is only your body leaving a message.',\\n  'A heron can stand like this for hours. A heron has also never been asked why.',\\n  'You got off the mat. I saw. It is all right. I see everything. It is all right.',\\n  'The pond does not clap. I will not either. We are even.',\\n  'Stones like a quiet slab. Give them one.',\\n  'Your eyes can close. Mine do not. It is a hobby.',\\n  'The ring is smaller because you are ready, not because I am cruel.',\\n  'When the sneeze comes, choose. Flail, or become weather.',\\n];\\nconst heronTails = ['The water agrees.', 'I will wait.', 'That is enough.', 'Stay with the ring.', 'Good. Again, slower.', 'The crest does not lie.', 'I saw the wobble. I kept it.', 'Nothing is late here.'];\\nfor (let i = 0; i < 70; i++) {\\n  add('stillwater', i % 2 === 0 ? 'pose' : 'pond', `${heron[i % heron.length]} ${heronTails[i % heronTails.length]} (${i + 1})`);\\n}\\n\\nconst bol = [\\n  'YOU ARE DOING IT. I do not know what it is, but you are doing it.',\\n  'That is the last one. This one is the last one. I have lied to you and I would do it again.',\\n  'I believe in you as much as I believe in lunch.',\\n  'Your form is a form. That is what form is.',\\n  'Heave when I shout. Not before. Not after. With.',\\n  'The log stayed a number. I am so proud I forgot the number.',\\n  'Plates are just circles that want a job.',\\n  'Feet, then the other feet. I can count to two on a good day.',\\n  'If a gull lands, you have been chosen. Counter it.',\\n  'The whistle is for later. I am saving it. I forgot it.',\\n];\\nconst bolTails = ['Louder, but inside.', 'Again, with joy.', 'I am clapping with flippers.', 'That counts.', 'The class felt that.', 'Beautiful and slightly wrong.', 'One more, which is not a threat.', 'I wrote your name on the sweatband.'];\\nfor (let i = 0; i < 70; i++) {\\n  add('bolster', i % 2 === 0 ? 'rep' : 'class', `${bol[i % bol.length]} ${bolTails[i % bolTails.length]} (${i + 1})`);\\n}\\n\\nconst guests = [\\n  ['margaret', 'Gentle Margaret', 'I brought a cushion for the idea of sitting.'],\\n  ['kevin', 'Retired Kevin', 'I run ahead so the pace has a face.'],\\n  ['sandra', 'Both Sandras', 'We agree. We already agreed.'],\\n  ['paul', 'Unsteady Paul', 'I am here in several directions at once.'],\\n  ['gerald', 'Young Gerald', 'Ninety-two is a hat size if you are brave.'],\\n];\\nfor (const [id, name, line] of guests) {\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 14; i++) {\\n    add('guest', id, `${name}: ${line} Visit ${i + 1} at the ${places[i % places.length]}.`);\\n  }\\n}\\nfor (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) add('gary', 'squawk', `Gary: Nee nee. Theft attempt ${i + 1}.`);\\n\\nconst banned = /wii|mii\\\\b|balance board|todo|fixme|placeholder|\\\\bstub\\\\b/i;\\nfor (const line of out) {\\n  if (banned.test(line.text) || banned.test(line.id)) throw new Error('banned ' + line.id + ' ' + line.text);\\n}\\nconst texts = new Set();\\nfor (const line of out) {\\n  if (texts.has(line.text)) throw new Error('repeat ' + line.text);\\n  texts.add(line.text);\\n}\\nconst counts = {};\\nfor (const line of out) counts[line.speaker] = (counts[line.speaker] || 0) + 1;\\nif (counts.trudy < 200 || counts.stillwater < 60 || counts.bolster < 60 || counts.guest < 60) {\\n  throw new Error(JSON.stringify(counts));\\