{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_146","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Beginning implementation now. Director fixes will be batched and many files written.\n\nDirector fixes include removing sayId, correcting attract order and sessionFixed polling, setting devModel cap to 6, using ABOUT for aboutPages, and wiring state winner/ghosts with finishEvent forms. Also fixing the fruit hat onFall callback.\n\nChecking whether clearHat removes the fruit body along with its colliders, since that could break support structures in the same step.\n\nConfirmed that `removeCollider` with `true` only wakes bodies. It does not remove the rigid body itself, so the fruit hat can safely clear its colliders without breaking the doll's support structure.\n\nConfirmed the onFall callback resolves correctly through the fruitHat method. The checkin countdown screen avoids clearing pads. The full question flow is now mapped: morning auto or confirm, then question, answer, reply, confirm, and checkin.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ccb4b1d9-d5bb-4f1a-a932-8b45e40f4115-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/programme.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ccb4b1d9-d5bb-4f1a-a932-8b45e40f4115-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/grandHold.js","offset":60,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ccb4b1d9-d5bb-4f1a-a932-8b45e40f4115-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\.notch","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1840,"output_tokens":931,"cache_read_input_tokens":95616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"92313332-7439-4da2-95b6-cecf602c11d1"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ccb4b1d9-d5bb-4f1a-a932-8b45e40f4115-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Days are built from the event registry, so a missing event is skipped. */\\n\\nexport const DAY_TABLE = [\\n  { name: 'Arrival', tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'step'], classes: ['poses', 'fruitHat'] },\\n  { name: 'The Second Day, Which Is Harder', tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'quick'], classes: ['logReps', 'stepClass', 'cairn'] },\\n  { name: 'Service With a Wobble', tests: ['onefoot', 'lean', 'step'], classes: ['roomService', 'plates', 'plank'] },\\n  { name: 'A Little Damp', tests: ['quick', 'onefoot', 'stand'], classes: ['springboard', 'stillWater', 'islandLoop'] },\\n  { name: 'Level Day', tests: ['best'], classes: ['raft', 'tug', 'grandHold'] },\\n];\\n10→\\nexport function programmeSteps(ids) {\\n  const known = new Set(ids);\\n  const steps = [];\\n  for (const day of DAY_TABLE) {\\n    for (const id of day.classes) if (known.has(id)) steps.push(id);\\n  }\\n  return steps;\\n}\\n\\n20→export function dayPlan(dayIndex, ids) {\\n  const known = new Set(ids);\\n  if (dayIndex < DAY_TABLE.length) {\\n    const day = DAY_TABLE[dayIndex];\\n    return {\\n      name: day.name,\\n      tests: day.tests.slice(),\\n      classes: day.classes.filter((id) => known.has(id)),\\n      maintenance: false,\\n    };\\n30→  }\\n  return {\\n    name: 'Maintenance',\\n    tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'step'],\\n    classes: [],\\n    maintenance: true,\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Days are built from the event registry, so a missing event is skipped. */\\n\\nexport const DAY_TABLE = [\\n  { name: 'Arrival', tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'step'], classes: ['poses', 'fruitHat'] },\\n  { name: 'The Second Day, Which Is Harder', tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'quick'], classes: ['logReps', 'stepClass', 'cairn'] },\\n  { name: 'Service With a Wobble', tests: ['onefoot', 'lean', 'step'], classes: ['roomService', 'plates', 'plank'] },\\n  { name: 'A Little Damp', tests: ['quick', 'onefoot', 'stand'], classes: ['springboard', 'stillWater', 'islandLoop'] },\\n  { name: 'Level Day', tests: ['best'], classes: ['raft', 'tug', 'grandHold'] },\\n];\\n10→\\nexport function programmeSteps(ids) {\\n  const known = new Set(ids);\\n  const steps = [];\\n  for (const day of DAY_TABLE) {\\n    for (const id of day.classes) if (known.has(id)) steps.push(id);\\n  }\\n  return steps;\\n}\\n\\n20→export function dayPlan(dayIndex, ids) {\\n  const known = new Set(ids);\\n  if (dayIndex < DAY_TABLE.length) {\\n    const day = DAY_TABLE[dayIndex];\\n    return {\\n      name: day.name,\\n      tests: day.tests.slice(),\\n      classes: day.classes.filter((id) => known.has(id)),\\n      maintenance: false,\\n    };\\n30→  }\\n  return {\\n    name: 'Maintenance',\\n    tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'step'],\\n    classes: [],\\n    maintenance: true,\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/programme.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/** Days are built from the event registry, so a missing event is skipped. */\\n\\nexport const DAY_TABLE = [\\n  { name: 'Arrival', tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'step'], classes: ['poses', 'fruitHat'] },\\n  { name: 'The Second Day, Which Is Harder', tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'quick'], classes: ['logReps', 'stepClass', 'cairn'] },\\n  { name: 'Service With a Wobble', tests: ['onefoot', 'lean', 'step'], classes: ['roomService', 'plates', 'plank'] },\\n  { name: 'A Little Damp', tests: ['quick', 'onefoot', 'stand'], classes: ['springboard', 'stillWater', 'islandLoop'] },\\n  { name: 'Level Day', tests: ['best'], classes: ['raft', 'tug', 'grandHold'] },\\n];\\n\\nexport function programmeSteps(ids) {\\n  const known = new Set(ids);\\n  const steps = [];\\n  for (const day of DAY_TABLE) {\\n    for (const id of day.classes) if (known.has(id)) steps.push(id);\\n  }\\n  return steps;\\n}\\n\\nexport function dayPlan(dayIndex, ids) {\\n  const known = new Set(ids);\\n  if (dayIndex < DAY_TABLE.length) {\\n    const day = DAY_TABLE[dayIndex];\\n    return {\\n      name: day.name,\\n      tests: day.tests.slice(),\\n      classes: day.classes.filter((id) => known.has(id)),\\n      maintenance: false,\\n    };\\n  }\\n  return {\\n    name: 'Maintenance',\\n    tests: ['stand', 'lean', 'step'],\\n    classes: [],\\n    maintenance: true,\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":37}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ccb4b1d9-d5bb-4f1a-a932-8b45e40f4115-40","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"60→\\n  phase() { return PHASES[this.phaseIndex]; }\\n\\n  spawnStone() {\\n    const body = this.world.createRigidBody(\\n      RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(this.lanes[0].x, 2.2 + this.stones.length * 0.16, this.lanes[0].z)\\n        .setCanSleep(false).setLinearDamping(0.2).setAngularDamping(0.6),\\n    );\\n    this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.12, 0.06, 0.12).setMass(0.02).setFriction(0.95).setCollisionGroups(propGroups(0)),\\n70→      body,\\n    );\\n    this.stones.push(body);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const input = inputs[0] || {};\\n    const state = this.states[0];\\n    if (!state.fallen) {\\n      state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n80→      state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n    }\\n    const phase = this.phase();\\n    if (!phase) {\\n      this.done = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.phaseT += dt;\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && !this.clearing && this.stones.length < 4 && this.phaseT > 1 + this.stones.length * 3) this.spawnStone();\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && this.phaseT >= phase.len && !this.clearing) this.clearing = true;\\n90→    if (this.clearing && !this.plateGone) {\\n      if (this.stones.length) {\\n        const body = this.stones.pop();\\n        this.world.removeRigidBody(body);\\n      } else if (!this.steppedClear) {\\n        this.steppedClear = true;\\n      } else if (this.plate) {\\n        this.plate.setEnabled(false);\\n        this.plate = null;\\n        this.plateGone = true;\\n100→        this.clearing = false;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (phase.id === 'gust') {\\n      if (this.phaseT >= this.nextGust && this.warn <= 0 && this.gust <= 0) this.warn = 1;\\n      if (this.warn > 0) {\\n        this.warn = Math.max(0, this.warn - dt);\\n        if (this.warn === 0) {\\n          this.gust = 0.5;\\n          this.nextGust = this.phaseT + 4;\\n110→        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (phase.id === 'hold') {\\n      this.holdTime += dt;\\n      if (this.holdTime > 2) this.notch = true;\\n    }\\n    const pose = phase.id === 'pose' ? { x: 0.3, y: 0.1 } : { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n    let sway = phase.id === 'hold' ? lerp(0.2, 0.02, this.phaseT / phase.len) : phase.id === 'stones' ? 0.12 : 0.1;\\n    if (phase.id === 'gust') sway = 0.08;\\n120→    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: phase.id === 'stones' ? 0.8 : 0.55, ankleMax: 6, maxLean: 16 }, (i) => {\\n      const s = this.sway(i, sway, 0.04);\\n      if (this.gust > 0) {\\n        s.nx += 3;\\n        this.gust = Math.max(0, this.gust - dt);\\n      }\\n      return s;\\n    });\\n    if (state.falls > this.restarts) {\\n      this.restarts = state.falls;\\n130→      this.phaseT = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (phase.id === 'hold' && !state.fallen) {\\n      const cob = screenOf(state, 16);\\n      const u = clamp(this.phaseT / phase.len, 0, 1);\\n      const radius = lerp(0.3, 0.08, u);\\n      if (Math.hypot(cob.x - 0, cob.y - 0) <= radius) this.inRing += dt;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phaseT >= phase.len && !(phase.id === 'stones' && !this.plateGone)) {\\n      this.phaseIndex += 1;\\n140→      this.phaseT = 0;\\n      if (!this.phase()) this.done = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const share = this.holdTime > 0 ? this.inRing / 15 : 1;\\n    const form = clamp(Math.max(85, share * 100), 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw: share, medal: medalOf(form),\\n150→      stats: 'The island is level',\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n      notch: this.notch,\\n      failed: false,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill) {\\n    const phase = this.phase();\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 16);\",\"content_concise\":\"60→\\n  phase() { return PHASES[this.phaseIndex]; }\\n\\n  spawnStone() {\\n    const body = this.world.createRigidBody(\\n      RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(this.lanes[0].x, 2.2 + this.stones.length * 0.16, this.lanes[0].z)\\n        .setCanSleep(false).setLinearDamping(0.2).setAngularDamping(0.6),\\n    );\\n    this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.12, 0.06, 0.12).setMass(0.02).setFriction(0.95).setCollisionGroups(propGroups(0)),\\n70→      body,\\n    );\\n    this.stones.push(body);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const input = inputs[0] || {};\\n    const state = this.states[0];\\n    if (!state.fallen) {\\n      state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n80→      state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n    }\\n    const phase = this.phase();\\n    if (!phase) {\\n      this.done = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.phaseT += dt;\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && !this.clearing && this.stones.length < 4 && this.phaseT > 1 + this.stones.length * 3) this.spawnStone();\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && this.phaseT >= phase.len && !this.clearing) this.clearing = true;\\n90→    if (this.clearing && !this.plateGone) {\\n      if (this.stones.length) {\\n        const body = this.stones.pop();\\n        this.world.removeRigidBody(body);\\n      } else if (!this.steppedClear) {\\n        this.steppedClear = true;\\n      } else if (this.plate) {\\n        this.plate.setEnabled(false);\\n        this.plate = null;\\n        this.plateGone = true;\\n100→        this.clearing = false;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (phase.id === 'gust') {\\n      if (this.phaseT >=