 Progress\\n\\n## Title\\n\\nBrainstormed 50 riffs on the source name, then `crypto.randomInt(0, 50)` returned **2**: **Level Best**.\\n\\nThe list, in order: Wobble Fit, Weeble Wellness, Level Best, The Daily Wobble, Fit-ish, Nearly Upright, Crooked Class, Lean Into It, Posture Party, Hold Still Darling, Island of Lean, Wobble Club, Straighten Up, The Leaning Hour, Class of Lean, Fit Enough, The Soft Landing, Keep It Wobbly, Level-ish, Weebly Fit, Fit Wit, The Morning Lean, Bubble and Beam, Knee News, The Alignment, Wobble Workshop, Almost Level, Tippy Wellness, Balance Resort, The Unsteady, Peg Doll Hour, Wooden Wellness, The Crooked Hour, Slightly Fit, Wobba Club, Fit for a Wobble, The Steady-ish, Wobbleton, Lean Mean Retreat, Toybox Tilt, Marble and Mat, Spirit Level, The Jar of Tries, Dawn on the Deck, Trudys Tilt, One Rock Resort, The Peg Doll Plan, Floor Exercise, Best of Wobble, Knee Deep.\\n\\nThe title on the title screen is Level Best. The retreat in the fiction keeps the plan's name, Level Best Retreat. Dev folder and HTML use `Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317`.\\n10→\\n## Now\\n\\nBalance core, events, island ritual, menus, hub session, and the single-file build are in progress. The simulation step is shared by the page and the tests.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\n## Title\\n\\nBrainstormed 50 riffs on the source name, then `crypto.randomInt(0, 50)` returned **2**: **Level Best**.\\n\\nThe list, in order: Wobble Fit, Weeble Wellness, Level Best, The Daily Wobble, Fit-ish, Nearly Upright, Crooked Class, Lean Into It, Posture Party, Hold Still Darling, Island of Lean, Wobble Club, Straighten Up, The Leaning Hour, Class of Lean, Fit Enough, The Soft Landing, Keep It Wobbly, Level-ish, Weebly Fit, Fit Wit, The Morning Lean, Bubble and Beam, Knee News, The Alignment, Wobble Workshop, Almost Level, Tippy Wellness, Balance Resort, The Unsteady, Peg Doll Hour, Wooden Wellness, The Crooked Hour, Slightly Fit, Wobba Club, Fit for a Wobble, The Steady-ish, Wobbleton, Lean Mean Retreat, Toybox Tilt, Marble and Mat, Spirit Level, The Jar of Tries, Dawn on the Deck, Trudys Tilt, One Rock Resort, The Peg Doll Plan, Floor Exercise, Best of Wobble, Knee Deep.\\n\\nThe title on the title screen is Level Best. The retreat in the fiction keeps the plan's name, Level Best Retreat. Dev folder and HTML use `Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317`.\\n10→\\n## Now\\n\\nBalance core, events, island ritual, menus, hub session, and the single-file build are in progress. The simulation step is shared by the page and the tests.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"# Progress\\n\\n## Title\\n\\nBrainstormed 50 riffs on the source name, then `crypto.randomInt(0, 50)` returned **2**: **Level Best**.\\n\\nThe list, in order: Wobble Fit, Weeble Wellness, Level Best, The Daily Wobble, Fit-ish, Nearly Upright, Crooked Class, Lean Into It, Posture Party, Hold Still Darling, Island of Lean, Wobble Club, Straighten Up, The Leaning Hour, Class of Lean, Fit Enough, The Soft Landing, Keep It Wobbly, Level-ish, Weebly Fit, Fit Wit, The Morning Lean, Bubble and Beam, Knee News, The Alignment, Wobble Workshop, Almost Level, Tippy Wellness, Balance Resort, The Unsteady, Peg Doll Hour, Wooden Wellness, The Crooked Hour, Slightly Fit, Wobba Club, Fit for a Wobble, The Steady-ish, Wobbleton, Lean Mean Retreat, Toybox Tilt, Marble and Mat, Spirit Level, The Jar of Tries, Dawn on the Deck, Trudys Tilt, One Rock Resort, The Peg Doll Plan, Floor Exercise, Best of Wobble, Knee Deep.\\n\\nThe title on the title screen is Level Best. The retreat in the fiction keeps the plan's name, Level Best Retreat. Dev folder and HTML use `Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317`.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\nBalance core, events, island ritual, menus, hub session, and the single-file build are in progress. The simulation step is shared by the page and the tests.\\n\",\"total_lines\":13}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"08c2f391-e1b1-492e-a30f-18758379d156"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_149","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The balance group contains 11 sliders. Only the first 3 of each group are displayed on the page.\n\nThe page layout will have 4 tool pages followed by slider pages. Balance needs 4 pages, World 2, Events 5, Rewards 1, and Ink 2. This totals 18 pages. The first slider is maxLean.\n\nThe slider page logic will slice the flat tuning definitions by offset and wrap to page 0 when reaching the end. The devAction next button currently increments without wrapping and needs updating. Tool pages will display twelve slots.\n\nSix additional tool pages will be added before the slider pages. These cover wipe, palette, gust, fruit, stone, line, event jumps, free camera, physics debug, and input monitor. Sliders and reset remain the critical test targets.\n\nFlags for free camera, physics debug, stats, ink, and palette will be added to the game object state. The renderer will display these as non-focusable text lines rather than buttons, keeping the dev menu at six choices. The next step is to write the code and thoroughly fix sessionFixed.\n\nAttract mode displays the title screen while state and model report attract. The renderer still shows the active event. stopAttract returns before menuMove so input is swallowed. A held key may register as a rising edge on the next frame.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1fb7d50b-9957-454a-b518-a7b962f991f9-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/input/input.js","offset":160,"limit":160}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3468,"output_tokens":939,"cache_read_input_tokens":102272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"c3f05bc8-fd75-4b9e-9b24-2c1fe6637664"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1fb7d50b-9957-454a-b518-a7b962f991f9-47","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"160→        if (stickMenu !== dir) {\\n          edges[dir] = true;\\n          stickMenu = dir;\\n        }\\n      } else if (mag < 0.3) stickMenu = 0;\\n      if (rumble && pad.vibrationActuator && edges.flail) {\\n        try { pad.vibrationActuator.playEffect('dual-rumble', { duration: 80, strongMagnitude: 0.4, weakMagnitude: 0.6 }); } catch { /* ignore */ }\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      rawL = keys.has('KeyQ') || (pointer.buttons & 1) ? 1 : 0;\\n170→      rawR = keys.has('KeyE') || (pointer.buttons & 2) ? 1 : 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    const pressed = (c) => latched.has(c) || keys.has(c);\\n    if (pressed('Enter') || pressed('Space')) edges.confirm = true;\\n    if (pressed('Escape') || pressed('Backspace')) {\\n      edges.back = true;\\n      if (pressed('Escape')) edges.pause = true;\\n    }\\n    if (pressed('KeyF') || latched.has('MouseMiddle')) edges.flail = true;\\n180→    const both = (pointer.buttons & 1) && (pointer.buttons & 2);\\n    if (pressed('Space') || (both && !bothMouse)) edges.hop = true;\\n    bothMouse = both;\\n    if (pressed('KeyT')) edges.ask = true;\\n    if (pressed('KeyC')) edges.recenter = true;\\n    if (latched.has('KeyA')) edges.plateA = true;\\n    if (latched.has('KeyD')) edges.plateD = true;\\n    if (pressed('ArrowUp') || pressed('KeyW')) edges.up = true;\\n    if (pressed('ArrowDown') || pressed('KeyS')) edges.down = true;\\n    if (pressed('ArrowLeft') || pressed('KeyA')) edges.left = true;\\n190→    if (pressed('ArrowRight') || pressed('KeyD')) edges.right = true;\\n    if (latched.has('MouseLeft')) edges.confirm = true;\\n    if (latched.has('MouseRight') && mode === 'menu') edges.back = true;\\n\\n    if (mode === 'menu') {\\n      const stickUp = stickMenu === 'up';\\n      const stickDown = stickMenu === 'down';\\n      const stickLeft = stickMenu === 'left';\\n      const stickRight = stickMenu === 'right';\\n      edges.up = latched.has('ArrowUp') || latched.has('KeyW') || stickUp;\\n200→      edges.down = latched.has('ArrowDown') || latched.has('KeyS') || stickDown;\\n      edges.left = latched.has('ArrowLeft') || latched.has('KeyA') || stickLeft;\\n      edges.right = latched.has('ArrowRight') || latched.has('KeyD') || stickRight;\\n      edges.confirm = latched.has('Enter') || latched.has('Space') || latched.has('MouseLeft');\\n      edges.back = latched.has('Escape') || latched.has('Backspace') || latched.has('MouseRight');\\n    }\\n\\n    // Pad confirm is level-triggered above. Latch it so a held Cross confirms once.\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padCross')) {\\n210→        edges.confirm = true;\\n        latched.add('__padCross');\\n      } else if (mode === 'menu') edges.confirm = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padCross');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[1]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padCircle')) { edges.back = true; latched.add('__padCircle'); }\\n      else if (mode === 'menu') edges.back = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padCircle');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[2]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padSquare')) { edges.flail = true; latched.add('__padSquare'); }\\n220→      else edges.flail = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padSquare');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[9]?.pressed && !createHeld) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padOpt')) { edges.pause = true; latched.add('__padOpt'); }\\n      else edges.pause = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padOpt');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[3]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padTri')) { edges.ask = true; latched.add('__padTri'); }\\n      else edges.ask = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padTri');\\n230→    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padHop')) { edges.hop = true; latched.add('__padHop'); }\\n      else if (mode !== 'move') edges.hop = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padHop');\\n    const dpad = [[12, 'up'], [13, 'down'], [14, 'left'], [15, 'right']];\\n    for (const [idx, name] of dpad) {\\n      const mark = `__dpad${idx}`;\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons?.[idx]?.pressed) {\\n        if (!latched.has(mark)) {\\n          edges[name] = true;\\n240→          latched.add(mark);\\n        } else if (mode === 'menu') edges[name] = false;\\n      } else latched.delete(mark);\\n    }\\n\\n    const source = weightSource(stickActive);\\n    if (mode === 'balance' || mode === 'move' || mode === 'air') {\\n      if (source === 'key' && mode === 'balance') {\\n        const v = keyVector();\\n        wish.x += v.x * 1.6 * dt;\\n250→        wish.y += v.y * 1.6 * dt;\\n      } else if (source === 'key') {\\n        const v = keyVector();\\n        wish.x = v.x;\\n        wish.y = v.y;\\n      } else if (source === 'mouse') {\\n        wish.x = pointer.x;\\n        wish.y = pointer.y;\\n      } else if (source === 'pad') {\\n        wish.x = stickX;\\n260→        wish.y = -stickY;\\n      }\\n      if (edges.recenter || latched.has('KeyC')) { wish.x = 0; wish.y = 0; }\\n      const h = Math.hypot(wish.x, wish.y);\\n      if (h > 1) { wish.x /= h; wish.y /= h; }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!pad || pad.mapping !== 'standard') {\\n      const ramp = dt / 0.12;\\n      feetL += Math.max(-ramp, Math.min(ramp, rawL - feetL));\\n270→      feetR += Math.max(-ramp, Math.min(ramp, rawR - feetR));\\n    }\\n\\n    breatheHeld = keys.has('ShiftLeft') || keys.has('ShiftRight') || !!(pad && pad.buttons?.[5]?.pressed);\\n    latched.clear();\\n    // Keep pad latches that are not real keys. They live in `keys`? I cleared all latches including pad ones.\\n    // Pad latches were stored in `latched` and just got cleared. Re-add the held pad markers.\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) latched.add('__padCross');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) latched.add('__padHop');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[1]?.pressed) latched.add('__padCircle');\\n280→    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[2]?.pressed) latched.add('__padSquare');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[3]?.pressed) latched.add('__padTri');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[9]?.pressed) latched.add('__padOpt');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[12]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad12');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[13]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad13');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[14]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad14');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[15]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad15');\\n\\n    return {\\n      edges,\\n290→      wish: { x: wish.x, y: wish.y },\\n      feetL, feetR, breathe: breatheHeld,\\n      lookX, lookY, zoom,\\n      device: lastDevice,\\n      pointer: lastPointer,\\n      createHeld,\\n      padConnected: !!(pad && pad.connected !== false && pad.mapping === 'standard'),\\n      source,\\n    };\\n  }\\n300→\\n  function weightSource(stickActive) {\\n    if (lastDevice === 'pad') return 'pad';\\n    if (weightKeyDown()) return 'key';\\n    if (pointer.moved && lastPointer) return 'mouse';\\n    if (stickActive) return 'pad';\\n    return lastDevice === 'mouse' ? 'mouse' : 'key';\\n  }\\n\\n  function worldWish(yaw = 0) {\\n310→    const c = Math.cos(yaw);\\n    const s = Math.sin(yaw);\\n    return {\\n      x: wish.x * c + wish.y * s,\\n      z: wish.x * s - wish.y * c,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  function snapshot(yaw = 0) {\\n    const w = worldWish(yaw);\",\"content_concise\":\"160→        if (stickMenu !== dir) {\\n          edges[dir] = true;\\n          stickMenu = dir;\\n        }\\n      } else if (mag < 0.3) stickMenu = 0;\\n      if (rumble && pad.vibrationActuator && edges.flail) {\\n        try { pad.vibrationActuator.playEffect('dual-rumble', { duration: 80, strongMagnitude: 0.4, weakMagnitude: 0.6 }); } catch { /* ignore */ }\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      rawL = keys.has('KeyQ') || (pointer.buttons & 1) ? 1 : 0;\\n170→      rawR = keys.has('KeyE') || (pointer.buttons & 2) ? 1 : 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    const pressed = (c) => latched.has(c) || keys.has(c);\\n    if (pressed('Enter') || pressed('Space')) edges.confirm = true;\\n    if (pressed('Escape') || pressed('Backspace')) {\\n      edges.back = true;\\n      if (pressed('Escape')) edges.pause = true;\\n    }\\n    if (pressed('KeyF') || latched.has('MouseMiddle')) edges.flail = true;\\n180→    const both = (pointer.buttons & 1) && (pointer.buttons & 2);\\n    if (pressed('Space') || (both && !bothMouse)) edges.hop = true;\\n    bothMouse = both;\\n    if (pressed('KeyT')) edges.ask = true;\\n    if (pressed('KeyC')) edges.recenter = true;\\n    if (latched.has('KeyA')) edges.plateA = true;\\n    if (latched.has('KeyD')) edges.plateD = true;\\n    if (pressed('ArrowUp') || pressed('KeyW')) edges.up = true;\\n    if (pressed('ArrowDown') || pressed('KeyS')) edges.down = true;\\n    if (pressed('ArrowLeft') || pressed('KeyA')) edges.left = true;\\n190→    if (pressed('ArrowRight') || pressed('KeyD')) edges.right = true;\\n    if (latched.has('MouseLeft')) edges.confirm = true;\\n    if (latched.has('MouseRight') && mode === 'menu') edges.back = true;\\n\\n    if (mode === 'menu') {\\n      const stickUp = stickMenu === 'up';\\n      const stickDown = stickMenu === 'down';\\n      const stickLeft = stickMenu === 'left';\\n      const stickRight = stickMenu === 'right';\\n      edges.up = latched.has('ArrowUp') || latched.has('KeyW') || stickUp;\\n200→      edges.down = latched.has('ArrowDown') || latched.has('KeyS') || stickDown;\\n      edges.left = latched.has('ArrowLeft') || latched.has('KeyA') || stickLeft;\\n      edges.right = latched.has('ArrowRight') || latched.has('KeyD') || stickRight;\\n      edges.confirm = latched.has('Enter') || latched.has('Space') || latched.has('MouseLeft');\\n      edges.back = latched.has('Escape') || latched.has('Backspace') || latched.has('MouseRight');\\n    }\\n\\n    // Pad confirm is level-triggered above. Latch it so a held Cross confirms once.\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padCross')) {\\n210→        edges.confirm = true;\\n        latched.add('__padCross');\\n      } else if (mode === 'menu') edges.confirm = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padCross');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[1]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padCircle')) { edges.back = true; latched.add('__padCircle'); }\\n      else if (mode === 'menu') edges.back = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padCircle');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[2]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padSquare')) { edges.flail = true; latched.add('__padSquare'); }\\n220→      else edges.flail = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padSquare');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[9]?.pressed && !createHeld) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padOpt')) { edges.pause = true; latched.add('__padOpt'); }\\n      else edges.pause = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padOpt');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[3]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padTri')) { edges.ask = true; latched.add('__padTri'); }\\n      else edges.ask = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padTri');\\n230→    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) {\\n      if (!latched.has('__padHop')) { edges.hop = true; latched.add('__padHop'); }\\n      else if (mode !== 'move') edges.hop = false;\\n    } else latched.delete('__padHop');\\n    const dpad = [[12, 'up'], [13, 'down'], [14, 'left'], [15, 'right']];\\n    for (const [idx, name] of dpad) {\\n      const mark = `__dpad${idx}`;\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons?.[idx]?.pressed) {\\n        if (!latched.has(mark)) {\\n          edges[name] = true;\\n240→          latched.add(mark);\\n        } else if (mode === 'menu') edges[name] = false;\\n      } else latched.delete(mark);\\n    }\\n\\n    const source = weightSource(stickActive);\\n    if (mode === 'balance' || mode === 'move' || mode === 'air') {\\n      if (source === 'key' && mode === 'balance') {\\n        const v = keyVector();\\n        wish.x += v.x * 1.6 * dt;\\n250→        wish.y += v.y * 1.6 * dt;\\n      } else if (source === 'key') {\\n        const v = keyVector();\\n        wish.x = v.x;\\n        wish.y = v.y;\\n      } else if (source === 'mouse') {\\n        wish.x = pointer.x;\\n        wish.y = pointer.y;\\n      } else if (source === 'pad') {\\n        wish.x = stickX;\\n260→        wish.y = -stickY;\\n      }\\n      if (edges.recenter || latched.has('KeyC')) { wish.x = 0; wish.y = 0; }\\n      const h = Math.hypot(wish.x, wish.y);\\n      if (h > 1) { wish.x /= h; wish.y /= h; }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!pad || pad.mapping !== 'standard') {\\n      const ramp = dt / 0.12;\\n      feetL += Math.max(-ramp, Math.min(ramp, rawL - feetL));\\n270→      feetR += Math.max(-ramp, Math.min(ramp, rawR - feetR));\\n    }\\n\\n    breatheHeld = keys.has('ShiftLeft') || keys.has('ShiftRight') || !!(pad && pad.buttons?.[5]?.pressed);\\n    latched.clear();\\n    // Keep pad latches that are not real keys. They live in `keys`? I cleared all latches including pad ones.\\n    // Pad latches were stored in `latched` and just got cleared. Re-add the held pad markers.\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) latched.add('__padCross');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[0]?.pressed) latched.add('__padHop');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[1]?.pressed) latched.add('__padCircle');\\n280→    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[2]?.pressed) latched.add('__padSquare');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[3]?.pressed) latched.add('__padTri');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[9]?.pressed) latched.add('__padOpt');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[12]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad12');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[13]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad13');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[14]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad14');\\n    if (pad && pad.buttons?.[15]?.pressed) latched.add('__dpad15');\\n\\n    return {\\n      edges,\\n290→      wish: { x: wish.x, y: wish.y },\\n      feetL, feetR, breathe: breatheHeld,\\n    