{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_156","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The detune value is always zero at time zero because sin(0) equals zero.\n\nThe detune function satisfies the requirement that it be exactly zero at tilt zero. I will now write the code.\n\nI will avoid banned words like TODO, FIXME, and stub. I will not use confirm, alert, prompt, window.open, WebSocket, or RTCPeerConnection. Math.random is only allowed in rng.js; my new code must call rng() instead.\n\nRenderer animation time will use a clock from Three.js or performance.now. Cloud drift will use sine of time. I am checking that the required dialogue lines exist for unit tests. The test file will be comprehensive but not excessive. I am preparing imports for event and input helpers.\n\nI am writing a `driveEvent` test helper that resets the RNG and tuning, instantiates an event by ID, builds it with a specified tier and lane configuration, and initializes inputs and pads for each lane.\n\nThe helper connects each input to its pad source and index. It then runs the event loop for the requested duration, generating bot commands per lane and writing them to the pads as axis and button states.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-09c29cb2-cfae-40ac-89a7-92e9322899e1-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/base.js","offset":115,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-09c29cb2-cfae-40ac-89a7-92e9322899e1-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"dispose\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events","glob":"*.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1921,"output_tokens":1330,"cache_read_input_tokens":115456,"cache_creation_input_to