{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_178","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Color definitions from WebGPU and TSL are incompatible.\n\nThe recipe imports THREE from webgpu and TSL functions from three/tsl. These are likely separate copies, so PostProcessing may reject TSL nodes. I will try source imports instead of prebuilt bundles.\n\nThe `three/webgpu` export points to the prebuilt bundle, not source. Color objects from the two copies may be incompatible. PostProcessing output nodes also mix webgpu and TSL bundles.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5f44505f-8774-48df-af95-397232e06907-84","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport * as W from 'three/webgpu';\nconst names = ['hash','uniform','Fn','uv','vec2','vec4','mix','color','float','mrt','output','normalView','time','floor','screenSize','smoothstep','abs','max','length','oneMinus','perspectiveDepthToViewZ','MeshBasicNodeMaterial','NoToneMapping','PCFShadowMap','DataTexture','NearestFilter','NoColorSpace','CapsuleGeometry','TubeGeometry','CatmullRomCurve3','AnimationMixer','QuaternionKeyframeTrack','AnimationClip','LoopRepeat'];\nfor (const n of names) console.log(n, typeof W[n]);\n\"","description":"See which TSL names three/webgpu exports"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1081,"output_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":136192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"1e7787f3-558f-400c-8f55-85950cc97ef0"}
