{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_195","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed that rawL starts at 0 and toFixed works.\n\nFound a bug: state() mutates screen to 'touch' when coarse and title. This side effect is dangerous if state() runs repeatedly.\n\nThe coarse-screen mutation in state() was already present. The dev page count is 23: 6 tools plus 12 tuning pages plus 5 event pages. Slider pages also contain 6 items.\n\nJump pages hold 6 items when full, or 5 on the last page. Slider changes bypass devAction entirely; they route through setTune via the UI slide handler, while tests use game.tuning.set.\n\nTests can verify live slider changes during running events and button reset-tune activation. Next steps are writing about.js, renderer, main, build, and tests. Confirmed that devModel snapshot is skipped during title screen state calls, and model() during dev state correctly invokes inputs[0].snapshot and paletteNow.\n\nConfirmed aboutPages is only called when the screen is 'about', so pageLabel does not waste cycles elsewhere. Will verify fixed() brace matching and run a syntax check by importing. Also checking whether balanceStep uses nxHold.\n\nbalanceStep uses the nx argument instead of nxHold, so setting nxHold will not force a gust unless events read it. Events compute their own disturbances, and stepCores passes its own callback, so a global force would need patching. I will skip this unless it is trivial.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-46d8970f-df86-4bad-b8e8-02cd5163d68b-122","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/base.js","old_string":"      const d = disturb ? disturb(i, this.t, state) : { nx: 0, nz: 0 };\n      balanceStep(this.dolls[i].body, state, dt, tune, d.nx || 0, d.nz || 0);","new_string":"      const d = disturb ? disturb(i, this.t, state) : { nx: 0, nz: 0 };\n      const shove = state.nxHold || 0;\n      state.nxHold = 0;\n      balanceStep(this.dolls[i].body, state, dt, tune, (d.nx || 0) + shove, d.nz || 0);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":391,"output_tokens":1214,"cache_read_input_tokens":164480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"82d4bc8c-a63f-4f6c-8f50-a1538d407eb5"}
