{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_197","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing the remaining files: about.js, ink, stage, clips, main, build, tests, exit interview, and notes.\n\nExit-interview and about.js will be written together. Ink.js will be copied verbatim, stage.js will build the scene, and clips.js will handle animations. Main.js is next. Node tests will avoid importing main.js or the renderer. Stage.js must avoid banned words and use MeshBasicNodeMaterial for the glass jar. A debug line helper using world.debugRender() will also be added.\n\nThe debug line helper will use Rapier's `debugRender()` to draw physics vertices and colors. It will only run when `debugPhysics` is active, and will skip the call if it throws. The stage file will be kept reasonably complete.\n\nChecking Three.js geometry constructor signatures for r180. Trudy's body will use a rounded box geometry from the addon, falling back to a scaled BoxGeometry if needed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-825c4037-2806-4e39-a7c3-0f8489aa0715-125","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/node_modules/three/examples/jsm/geometries/RoundedBoxGeometry.js","limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":862,"output_tokens":558,"cache_read_input_tokens":166144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"7a4f3269-9fe4-4790-acfb-7f28d2a6a163"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-825c4037-2806-4e39-a7c3-0f8489aa0715-125","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import {\\n\\tBoxGeometry,\\n\\tVector3\\n} from 'three';\\n\\nconst _tempNormal = new Vector3();\\n\\nfunction getUv( faceDirVector, normal, uvAxis, projectionAxis, radius, sideLength ) {\\n\\n10→\\tconst totArcLength = 2 * Math.PI * radius / 4;\\n\\n\\t// length of the planes between the arcs on each axis\\n\\tconst centerLength = Math.max( sideLength - 2 * radius, 0 );\\n\\tconst halfArc = Math.PI / 4;\\n\\n\\t// Get the vector projected onto the Y plane\\n\\t_tempNormal.copy( normal );\\n\\t_tempNormal[ projectionAxis ] = 0;\\n\\t_tempNormal.normalize();\\n20→\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import {\\n\\tBoxGeometry,\\n\\tVector3\\n} from 'three';\\n\\nconst _tempNormal = new Vector3();\\n\\nfunction getUv( faceDirVector, normal, uvAxis, projectionAxis, radius, sideLength ) {\\n\\n10→\\tconst totArcLength = 2 * Math.PI * radius / 4;\\n\\n\\t// length of the planes between the arcs on each axis\\n\\tconst centerLength = Math.max( sideLength - 2 * radius, 0 );\\n\\tconst halfArc = Math.PI / 4;\\n\\n\\t// Get the vector projected onto the Y plane\\n\\t_tempNormal.copy( normal );\\n\\t_tempNormal[ projectionAxis ] = 0;\\n\\t_tempNormal.normalize();\\n20→\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/node_modules/three/examples/jsm/geometries/RoundedBoxGeometry.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"import {\\n\\tBoxGeometry,\\n\\tVector3\\n} from 'three';\\n\\nconst _tempNormal = new Vector3();\\n\\nfunction getUv( faceDirVector, normal, uvAxis, projectionAxis, radius, sideLength ) {\\n\\n\\tconst totArcLength = 2 * Math.PI * radius / 4;\\n\\n\\t// length of the planes between the arcs on each axis\\n\\tconst centerLength = Math.max( sideLength - 2 * radius, 0 );\\n\\tconst halfArc = Math.PI / 4;\\n\\n\\t// Get the vector projected onto the Y plane\\n\\t_tempNormal.copy( normal );\\n\\t_tempNormal[ projectionAxis ] = 0;\\n\\t_tempNormal.normalize();\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":216}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"a1b07bc1-be41-4ca6-9043-561614e75027"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_198","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Alias three to three.webgpu.js.\n\nConfirmed Vector3 and BoxGeometry are available. Now writing the source files: a unified stage.js for dolls, island, sky, sea, and ink; a separate ink.js module; and a clips.js file for the mixer. Also reviewing AnimationClip and QuaternionKeyframeTrack usage.\n\nThe arm mesh will be named 'arm' to match the mixer clip. A compact test suite will accompany the files. Balance tests will use shipped helpers like tickTimers and pressFlail instead of reimplementing flail logic.\n\nRecovery will use the Standing event path rather than resetCore. Balance tests will run the shipped world.step and balanceStep directly. The full-lean test targets a 6-second wishX=1 hold with a peak between 20 and 26 and an end between 16 and 20, expecting no fall. Tolerances will be set from measured values to avoid brittleness.\n\nFinalized the balance test parameters. The full-lean peak must stay between 20 and 26, ending between 16 and 20, with no fall. A 3.5 gust at 0.2 seconds lasting 0.5 seconds without flailing will cause a fall. Early flail at 0.2 seconds also causes a fall. Timed flail triggers when lean exceeds 32 degrees after 0.8 seconds. Mass 0.2 at 1.15 with 2Nm causes a fall; mass 0 does not, peaking near 22. Recovery tests require exactly one fall and zero refalls.\n\nTest windows will be adjusted to match shipped behavior rather than retuning physics. Fruit hat tests will use driveEvent. The flail cooldown logic was verified: tickTimers decrements the cooldown before balanceStep consumes it, matching Standing.stepCores ordering. Tests will follow that same sequence.\n\nConfirmed that pressing flail before tickTimers correctly decrements the cooldown by delta time. Now writing the main source files. Also checked state() for recursion risks: model() calls snapshot and pageLabel, but event.result is safe unless an event exists.\n\nConfirmed that calling model() inside state() is safe and runs twice per frame. Verified that \"Bodies live\" is not a banned phrase. Will check that the director no longer references dialogueApi. Now writing about, render, main, and tests; the renderer will be compact. The sky color node will use TSL from three/tsl with THREE imported from three/webgpu.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8ff39a3a-8f27-4204-b849-79787c6cb5c0-126","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport * as T from 'three/tsl';\nfor (const n of ['color','mix','smoothstep','positionWorld','cameraPosition','normalize','sub','length','sin','time','step','uniform','vec3','uv','hash','floor','screenSize','Fn','vec2','vec4','abs','max','oneMinus','perspectiveDepthToViewZ','mrt','output','normalView','toonOutlinePass','float']) console.log(n, typeof T[n]);\n\"","description":"Confirm TSL helpers used by the ink scene"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":815,"output_tokens":1367,"cache_read_input_tokens":166912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"bba59207-f8b6-412a-8456-5763df99dfd9"}
