{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_201","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in sampleToSnap: it ignores the sample and calls snapshot after poll.\n\nThe snapshot timing is correct. The remaining files still need to be written.\n\nNo infinite loop risk from state() calling model(). The next files to write are exit interview, about, renderer, main, and tests. A guard may be added to state() to prevent model() from interfering with focus. Slice choices in model() match the UI.\n\nI'll write ink.js, renderer.js, and clips.js in parallel. The renderer will export createStage and include a glass material.\n\nDebug lines will use THREE.LineSegments with BufferGeometry. The free camera will orbit via the look stick, or simply offset when the test flag is set. Ink toggle logic will render the scene directly when ink is off. Sky colors will be stored as uniforms on a single sky material.\n\nSky colors will be stored as THREE.Color objects and updated via setHex when the palette changes. The uniform references the same object, so I need to verify whether TSL reads it each frame or copies it at creation.\n\nThe renderer will use low-poly geometry for the cast. Trudy, Gary, and the island will be simple meshes. The sea and sky will not cast shadows. Only the doll and island will receive shadows.\n\nShadow settings are finalized: the sun camera size is 30 and the renderer uses PCFShadowMap. The HTML will inject the base64 Wasm payload into a global variable before the game bundle loads so initRapier can access it. Tests will run without a browser first, then the file is written.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-10d2f874-239a-49a3-a522-af1f767e09e9-129","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport { readFileSync } from 'fs';\nimport RAPIER from '@dimforge/rapier3d-compat';\nconst bytes = new Uint8Array(readFileSync('node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/rapier_wasm3d_bg.wasm'));\nconst t = Date.now();\nawait RAPIER.init({ module_or_path: bytes });\nconst world = new RAPIER.World({ x: 0, y: -9.81, z: 0 });\nconsole.log('ok', world.bodies.len(), 'ms', Date.now()-t);\nworld.free();\n\"","description":"Confirm Rapier accepts inlined wasm bytes"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1200,"output_tokens":1322,"cache_read_input_tokens":172800,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"3fed4670-4d48-42ad-aac1-8c257289407a"}
