{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A deprecation warning appeared despite passing an object.\n\nThe code checks if the input is a plain object by comparing its prototype to Object.prototype. Uint8Array fails this check, so the warning fires even though the passed object looks correct.\n\nThe init call succeeded despite the warning, so it is harmless. The exact prototype check in the minified code is being re-examined to find why a plain object triggers it.\n\nThe warning is not from the prototype check. The code extracts the Uint8Array into I, so the check passes. wasm-bindgen treats the Uint8Array as a deprecated module path. The call still succeeds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ff00df0-689e-40fd-808a-94620347e51b-130","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"console|warn|violation","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/hub/harness.html","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1451,"output_tokens":579,"cache_read_input_tokens":173952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"53406424-a1bf-4bf9-8c0b-3674722301c6"}
