{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6523e403-2921-42cd-959f-8e11681c2a02-132","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n10→  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n20→\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n30→  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n40→    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n10→  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n20→\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n30→  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n40→    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/charts.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n\",\"total_lines\":78}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6523e403-2921-42cd-959f-8e11681c2a02-133","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** The only randomness in the game. Gameplay draws go through rng(label). */\\n\\nconst streams = new Map();\\nlet baseSeed = 0x1a2b3c4d;\\nlet session = false;\\n\\nexport function setSessionMode(on) {\\n  session = !!on;\\n  streams.clear();\\n10→}\\n\\nexport function resetRng(seed = 0x1a2b3c4d) {\\n  baseSeed = seed >>> 0;\\n  streams.clear();\\n}\\n\\nfunction mulberry32(seed) {\\n  let a = seed >>> 0;\\n  return function next() {\\n20→    a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) >>> 0;\\n    let t = a;\\n    t = Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 15), t | 1);\\n    t ^= t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61);\\n    return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nfunction hashLabel(label) {\\n  let h = 2166136261;\\n30→  const s = String(label);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\\n    h ^= s.charCodeAt(i);\\n    h = Math.imul(h, 16777619);\\n  }\\n  return (h ^ baseSeed) >>> 0;\\n}\\n\\nfunction generatorFor(label) {\\n  let g = streams.get(label);\\n40→  if (g) return g;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** The only randomness in the game. Gameplay draws go through rng(label). */\\n\\nconst streams = new Map();\\nlet baseSeed = 0x1a2b3c4d;\\nlet session = false;\\n\\nexport function setSessionMode(on) {\\n  session = !!on;\\n  streams.clear();\\n10→}\\n\\nexport function resetRng(seed = 0x1a2b3c4d) {\\n  baseSeed = seed >>> 0;\\n  streams.clear();\\n}\\n\\nfunction mulberry32(seed) {\\n  let a = seed >>> 0;\\n  return function next() {\\n20→    a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) >>> 0;\\n    let t = a;\\n    t = Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 15), t | 1);\\n    t ^= t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61);\\n    return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nfunction hashLabel(label) {\\n  let h = 2166136261;\\n30→  const s = String(label);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\\n    h ^= s.charCodeAt(i);\\n    h = Math.imul(h, 16777619);\\n  }\\n  return (h ^ baseSeed) >>> 0;\\n}\\n\\nfunction generatorFor(label) {\\n  let g = streams.get(label);\\n40→  if (g) return g;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/core/rng.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"/** The only randomness in the game. Gameplay draws go through rng(label). */\\n\\nconst streams = new Map();\\nlet baseSeed = 0x1a2b3c4d;\\nlet session = false;\\n\\nexport function setSessionMode(on) {\\n  session = !!on;\\n  streams.clear();\\n}\\n\\nexport function resetRng(seed = 0x1a2b3c4d) {\\n  baseSeed = seed >>> 0;\\n  streams.clear();\\n}\\n\\nfunction mulberry32(seed) {\\n  let a = seed >>> 0;\\n  return function next() {\\n    a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) >>> 0;\\n    let t = a;\\n    t = Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 15), t | 1);\\n    t ^= t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61);\\n    return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nfunction hashLabel(label) {\\n  let h = 2166136261;\\n  const s = String(label);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\\n    h ^= s.charCodeAt(i);\\n    h = Math.imul(h, 16777619);\\n  }\\n  return (h ^ baseSeed) >>> 0;\\n}\\n\\nfunction generatorFor(label) {\\n  let g = streams.get(label);\\n  if (g) return g;\\n\",\"total_lines\":70}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6523e403-2921-42cd-959f-8e11681c2a02-134","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { SAVE_VERSION } from '../data/config.js';\\n\\nexport function memoryStorage() {\\n  const map = new Map();\\n  return {\\n    getItem(key) { return map.has(key) ? map.get(key) : null; },\\n    setItem(key, value) { map.set(key, String(value)); },\\n    removeItem(key) { map.delete(key); },\\n  };\\n10→}\\n\\nexport function readSave(storage, key) {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = storage.getItem(key);\\n    if (!raw) return null;\\n    const data = JSON.parse(raw);\\n    if (!data || data.version !== SAVE_VERSION || !data.profile) return null;\\n    return data;\\n  } catch {\\n20→    return null;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function writeSave(storage, key, data) {\\n  const payload = JSON.stringify({ ...data, version: SAVE_VERSION });\\n  try {\\n    storage.setItem(key, payload);\\n    return true;\\n  } catch {\\n30→    return false;\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { SAVE_VERSION } from '../data/config.js';\\n\\nexport function memoryStorage() {\\n  const map = new Map();\\n  return {\\n    getItem(key) { return map.has(key) ? map.get(key) : null; },\\n    setItem(key, value) { map.set(key, String(value)); },\\n    removeItem(key) { map.delete(key); },\\n  };\\n10→}\\n\\nexport function readSave(storage, key) {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = storage.getItem(key);\\n    if (!raw) return null;\\n    const data = JSON.parse(raw);\\n    if (!data || data.version !== SAVE_VERSION || !data.profile) return null;\\n    return data;\\n  } catch {\\n20→    return null;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function writeSave(storage, key, data) {\\n  const payload = JSON.stringify({ ...data, version: SAVE_VERSION });\\n  try {\\n    storage.setItem(key, payload);\\n    return true;\\n  } catch {\\n30→    return false;\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/core/save.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"import { SAVE_VERSION } from '../data/config.js';\\n\\nexport function memoryStorage() {\\n  const map = new Map();\\n  return {\\n    getItem(key) { return map.has(key) ? map.get(key) : null; },\\n    setItem(key, value) { map.set(key, String(value)); },\\n    removeItem(key) { map.delete(key); },\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function readSave(storage, key) {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = storage.getItem(key);\\n    if (!raw) return null;\\n    const data = JSON.parse(raw);\\n    if (!data || data.version !== SAVE_VERSION || !data.profile) return null;\\n    return data;\\n  } catch {\\n    return null;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function writeSave(storage, key, data) {\\n  const payload = JSON.stringify({ ...data, version: SAVE_VERSION });\\n  try {\\n    storage.setItem(key, payload);\\n    return true;\\n  } catch {\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":32}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"f75141e5-7bc5-48f0-a13a-562adf2c8dae"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_205","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will now write the remaining files.\n\nThe renderer will be solid and tests comprehensive. I verified that `state()` and `model()` calls won't throw errors. Files will be written in two or three large batches. The HTML output path is set to the work root.\n\nThe build script will be placed in tools/ and write its output to the work root. The HTML meta tags will include hub:session, hub:session-players, and hub:session-mode.\n\nAdditional hub meta tags will cover session duration, goal, controls, type, and source. The player count uses a hyphen rather than an en-dash to match the aiHub format.\n\nThe controls meta tag will exactly match the howto string. The description will be one or two sentences. The tagline is \"Hold still. The island is taking notes.\" The name is Level Best. Genre is Sports. Type is Game. Source is Wii Fit. Series is empty. Tags include 3d, comedy, third-person, versus, arcade, and co-op. Source information fields are filled. The date is 2026-11-04 23:13:17.\n\nThe date will be 2026-11-04 23:13:17 as specified in TASK.md. The JSON genre field will hold the genre text and the perspective field will hold the perspective text. The description will read \"physics-balance party sports with a daily ritual\" and the perspective will be \"third person\". Tech details will include versions.\n\nResearch is complete. The engine APIs and PLAN.md were reviewed, but no other research was needed.\n\nTesting will use headless Playwright with a single Node command that prints only failures, plus simulated pads and no physical controller.\n\nThe environment is Grok CLI on Linux. The AI model is xAI grok-4.7 with reasoning effort set to xhigh. Usage will be added on import.\n\nA small comment-free renderer will also be included.\n\nAnimation mixer updates will use clock.getDelta() in the render loop. The first frame will paint the island and doll at rest even when the game state is title with no event. A grass ground disc will sit at y = 0.02 above the sand at y = 0.01, with sea at y = -0.4 to avoid z-fighting. The camera will be positioned at (10, 7, 16) looking at (0, 1.2, 0) with far 2000 and near 0.1. Ink fadeFar is set to 90.\n\nThe clear color will be sky blue so the canvas is never black. A single post-render pass will run immediately after initialization to paint the first frame before the main loop starts. If that render fails, the code will fall back to the standard renderer and record a backend note. Window-level error collection will be added in main. The renderer file is expected to be about four hundred lines.\n\nOnly main.js imports three/webgpu, so tests remain clean. The bundle should land around eight megabytes once minified. I need to guard against placeholder strings surviving in the minified output, since the plan requires none to remain.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3d5c7898-0126-434a-af92-89d1f6d1fc08-135","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport { readFileSync } from 'fs';\nfor (const f of ['node_modules/three/build/three.webgpu.js','node_modules/three/build/three.tsl.js','node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/rapier.mjs']) {\n  const t = readFileSync(f,'utf8');\n  for (const w of ['TODO','FIXME','placeholder','stub']) {\n    const n = t.split(w).length - 1;\n    if (n) console.log(f, w, n);\n  }\n}\n\"","description":"Search vendor bundles for banned words"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1549,"output_tokens":1685,"cache_read_input_tokens":176896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"32bb87cd-fe55-4799-8033-e4293c16dd7f"}
