{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_209","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the `camera.lookAt` signature.\n\nFixed `camera.lookAt` to target the doll's y-coordinate instead of y=0. Confirmed esbuild aliases the 'three' import and supports top-level await in IIFE output. Noted that `createGame` starts its loop before `onFrame` is registered, but this is harmless.\n\ncreateStage renders before window resize, then fit() adjusts the camera. The 20-second ready timeout starts when the iframe loads, but renderer initialization and SwiftShader compilation could be slow. Starting connect in parallel would help.\n\nThe connection will be started before stage initialization so the hello message fires immediately. The ready signal will be sent right after the stage is created, not after it finishes. This lets the round begin while shaders compile in the background.\n\nThe connection will be awaited immediately after stage creation begins. Once the hub resolves, `runSession` fires right away so the ready signal is sent without waiting for the stage to finish.\n\nAwaiting `connect()` before stage creation is the right order. The welcome message arrives quickly after hello, so ready() fires before the heavy render. This keeps the 20-second budget safe.\n\nThe stage promise will be awaited only after the ready signal fires. This lets the card render and the game stay interactive while shaders compile in the background.\n\nA bug in `createStage` was spotted: its final `render()` call might throw before returning, which would lose the stage if the caller does not catch it.\n\nThe `render()` try/catch already handles `makeInk` compilation errors, so `createStage` returns safely even if the final render throws. The WebGPURenderer constructor is also caught and falls back to WebGL. The `camera.lookAt` signature is corrected. `RoundedBoxGeometry` may be heavy but acceptable. `devModel` snapshot timing during `onFrame` before polling is fine.\n\nDuring stage initialization, the renderer is not yet attached, so idle frames are incorrectly counted toward the attract timer. This could trigger the attract screen before the title appears. The fix is to defer idle counting until the renderer is actually attached.\n\nThe `!rendererAttached` guard was flawed because it remained true in the browser before `setRender` ran. A new `holdAttract` flag initialized to `!!doc` will block idle counting until the renderer attaches. `setRender` resets this flag and `woke` when the first frame arrives.\n\nNode tests will count idle frames normally because `holdAttract` is false. Browser tests will defer attract until the renderer attaches, so the wall-clock attract test runs in node and screenshots before the browser attract timer starts. A browser test with `render=0` will never trigger attract because `setRender` is never called.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be5a549c-cc9e-4acc-81e9-a7f15d4619f1-143","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"  let rendererAttached = false;","new_string":"  let rendererAttached = false;\n  let holdAttract = !!doc;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be5a549c-cc9e-4acc-81e9-a7f15d4619f1-144","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"      else if (!rendererAttached || frames > 0) idle += dt;","new_string":"      else if (!holdAttract) idle += dt;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be5a549c-cc9e-4acc-81e9-a7f15d4619f1-145","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"    setRender(info) {\n      rendererAttached = true;\n      backend = info.backend;\n      lost = info.lost;\n      frames = info.frames;\n    },","new_string":"    setRender(info) {\n      rendererAttached = true;\n      holdAttract = false;\n      backend = info.backend;\n      lost = info.lost;\n      frames = info.frames;\n    },"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be5a549c-cc9e-4acc-81e9-a7f15d4619f1-146","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/render/renderer.js","old_string":"    camera.lookAt(playing && state.screen !== 'attract' ? 1.1 : 1.2, 0, 0);","new_string":"    camera.lookAt(0, playing && state.screen !== 'attract' ? 1.1 : 1.2, 0);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be5a549c-cc9e-4acc-81e9-a7f15d4619f1-147","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/main.js","old_string":"let stage = null;\nif (params.get('render') !== '0') {\n  try {\n    stage = await createStage(canvas, { session: !!(globalThis.AIHub && AIHub.active) });\n    publish(stage.info());\n  } catch (err) {\n    errors.push(String(err && err.message || err));\n    if (globalThis.AIHub && AIHub.active && AIHub.fail) AIHub.fail(String(err && err.message || err));\n    publish(null);\n  }\n} else publish(null);\n\nfunction fit() {\n  if (!stage) return;\n  stage.resize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight, window.devicePixelRatio || 1);\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', fit);\nfit();\n\ngame.onFrame(() => {\n  const view = game.state();\n  if (stage) {\n    stage.sync(view);\n    stage.setInk(view.inkOn !== false && view.settings.ink !== 0);\n    stage.render(view.inkOn !== false);\n    publish(stage.info());\n  }\n  if (boot.parentNode && view.screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\n});\n\nconst hub = globalThis.AIHub;\nif (hub && hub.active) {\n  const info = await hub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true });\n  if (info) game.runSession(info);\n  else game.runStandalone();\n} else {\n  game.runStandalone();\n}","new_string":"const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\nconst connecting = hub && hub.active ? hub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }) : null;\n\nlet stage = null;\nconst stagePromise = params.get('render') === '0'\n  ? null\n  : createStage(canvas, { session: !!(hub && hub.active) }).then((made) => {\n    stage = made;\n    publish(stage.info());\n    return made;\n  }).catch((err) => {\n    errors.push(String((err && err.message) || err));\n    if (hub && hub.active && hub.fail) hub.fail(String((err && err.message) || err));\n    publish({ backend: 'none', lost: String((err && err.message) || err), frames: 0, width: 0, height: 0 });\n    return null;\n  });\n\nfunction fit() {\n  if (!stage) return;\n  stage.resize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight, window.devicePixelRatio || 1);\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', fit);\n\ngame.onFrame(() => {\n  const view = game.state();\n  if (stage) {\n    stage.sync(view);\n    stage.setInk(view.inkOn !== false && view.settings.ink !== 0);\n    stage.render(view.inkOn !== false);\n    publish(stage.info());\n  }\n  if (boot.parentNode && view.screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\n});\n\nif (connecting) {\n  const info = await connecting;\n  if (info) game.runSession(info);\n  else game.runStandalone();\n} else {\n  game.runStandalone();\n}\nawait stagePromise;\nfit();"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":179113,"output_tokens":2764,"cache_read_input_tokens":13696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"990a94b7-c266-43a8-af22-62513fc74da5"}
