{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_215","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The dev screen's state() function calls model(), which triggers a snapshot and may be heavy.\n\nstate() calling model() is safe. The coarse-screen side effect is harmless because setScreen already handles it. No recursion occurs. Snapshot calls during model are fine.\n\nNo infinite loop exists between state and model. I will write the build, logic tests, and notes now. A quick import test follows. Missing event titles and null group seats are handled safely. Logic tests go in one file. Browser tests use dynamic imports for ui, audio, and hub groups.\n\nLaunch and hub scripts run separately after tests. A quick import test will verify createGame. Infinity bankAt values are handled correctly. Parked poses remain below 85.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d4ea1d87-7622-44ab-a7bc-bf3f354063d2-153","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/roomService.js","offset":165,"limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":397,"output_tokens":515,"cache_read_input_tokens":201216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"a38d8e20-373a-4f28-b9d1-c23cefb4e008"}
