{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_218","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The measured value is 101.9. The cap of 180 is sufficient for most cases, while the grand hold is 220.\n\nSimulation runtime estimates to about one to two minutes. I will write the files now, adding a fast NaN check. I will run both plate keys and stick inputs. For Cairn tier 2, I will compare breath-on versus breath-off to see which stones survive.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2dcf7749-3cd3-4601-912d-c66633e0dc68-156","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/build.mjs","content":"import { build } from 'esbuild';\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nimport { createHash } from 'node:crypto';\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\nimport path from 'node:path';\n\nconst root = path.resolve(path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), '..');\nconst OUT = path.resolve(root, '..', 'Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317.html');\nconst EXPECTED = '529eac78c54cfff0e60d375a9c63f66d1a594327ddcc262a2bdf9b1f2fb6582a';\n\nconst METAS = [\n  ['hub:session', '1'],\n  ['hub:session-players', '1-4'],\n  ['hub:session-mode', 'ghost'],\n  ['hub:session-minutes', '3'],\n  ['hub:session-goal', 'Stay balanced through the class: highest score wins'],\n  ['hub:session-howto', 'Lean: stick, WASD or mouse. Feet: L2 R2, Q E or clicks. Flail: Square or F'],\n  ['hub:session-type', 'Game'],\n  ['hub:session-source', 'Wii Fit'],\n].map(([name, content]) => `<meta name=\"${name}\" content=\"${content}\">`).join('');\n\nfunction sessionSource() {\n  const session = readFileSync(path.join(root, 'vendor/session.js'), 'utf8').replace(/\\r\\n/g, '\\n');\n  const END = \"})(typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis);\";\n  const start = session.indexOf('/*! aihub-session ');\n  const hash = createHash('sha256').update(session.slice(start, session.indexOf(END) + END.length)).digest('hex');\n  if (hash !== EXPECTED) throw new Error(`not the released hub client (${hash})`);\n  return session;\n}\n\nfunction writeAbout() {\n  const json = readFileSync(path.resolve(root, '..', 'exit-interview.json'), 'utf8');\n  const about = `/** Filled from exit-interview.json by the build. Keep the two copies the same. */\\nexport const ABOUT = ${JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(json), null, 2)};\\n`;\n  writeFileSync(path.join(root, 'src/data/about.js'), about);\n}\n\nexport async function buildGame() {\n  writeAbout();\n  const session = sessionSource();\n  const result = await build({\n    absWorkingDir: root,\n    entryPoints: ['src/main.js'],\n    bundle: true,\n    format: 'iife',\n    target: 'es2022',\n    minify: true,\n    legalComments: 'none',\n    write: false,\n    alias: { three: path.join(root, 'node_modules/three/build/three.webgpu.js') },\n    plugins: [{\n      name: 'rapier-wasm',\n      setup(b) {\n        b.onLoad({ filter: /rapier\\.mjs$/ }, async (args) => {\n          let text = readFileSync(args.path, 'utf8');\n          text = text.replace(\n            /new URL\\(\\s*[\"']rapier_wasm3d_bg\\.wasm[\"']\\s*,\\s*import\\.meta\\.url\\s*\\)/g,\n            'globalThis.__LEVEL_BEST_WASM__',\n          );\n          return { contents: text, loader: 'js' };\n        });\n      },\n    }],\n  });\n  const js = result.outputFiles[0].text.replace(/<\\/script/gi, '<\\\\/script');\n  const font = (weight) => readFileSync(path.join(root, `node_modules/@fontsource/fredoka/files/fredoka-latin-${weight}-normal.woff2`)).toString('base64');\n  const faces = [400, 500, 700].map((weight) => (\n    `@font-face{font-family:Fredoka;font-style:normal;font-weight:${weight};font-display:swap;src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,${font(weight)}) format(\"woff2\");}`\n  )).join('');\n  const wasm = readFileSync(path.join(root, 'node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/rapier_wasm3d_bg.wasm')).toString('base64');\n  const html = [\n    '<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><script>',\n    session,\n    '</script>',\n    METAS,\n    '<title>Level Best</title><style>',\n    faces,\n    'html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#8FB4E0;overflow:hidden}canvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}',\n    '</style></head><body><script>window.__LEVEL_BEST_WASM__=Uint8Array.from(atob(\"',\n    wasm,\n    '\"),c=>c.charCodeAt(0));</script><script>',\n    js,\n    '</script></body></html>',\n  ].join('');\n  writeFileSync(OUT, html);\n  return OUT;\n}\n\nif (process.argv[1] && process.argv[1].endsWith('build.mjs')) {\n  const out = await buildGame();\n  console.log(out);\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2dcf7749-3cd3-4601-912d-c66633e0dc68-157","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md","content":"# Issues caught while building Level Best\n\n1. Log Reps counted a phantom first rep because `lastRep` was undefined. Critical: no. The score started a rep early.\n2. Plank & Perch could spawn a second ragdoll for one fall. Critical: yes. A second removal in the same step panics Rapier for the whole page.\n3. Island Loop scored cadence from `t % period` and wrote tilted gravity into the world. Critical: yes. A sharp jog scored 26, and the gravity write produced NaN.\n4. Plate Spinners' bot left the band it was supposed to hold. Critical: yes. A sharp bot scored about 47 instead of a full spin.\n5. Room Service built the tray with full extents and lost glasses that were still on it. Critical: yes. The order could not be delivered.\n6. Tippy Raft ignored the lane's skill and the grip that keeps a sharp player near the middle. Critical: no. Rounds still ended, but skill did not matter.\n7. Check-in leaned the doll toward the wrong side of the target. Critical: yes. The Wobble Age came out of the wrong mean.\n8. Check-in applied the calm margin twice. Critical: no. The stand test was stricter than the written one, but the day still finished.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":357,"output_tokens":1953,"cache_read_input_tokens":203264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"709f941a-5bef-4829-9c75-346bc8a44213"}
