{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_228","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Noticed that writeSave wraps data with a version, but director persist calls it with profile and settings directly.\n\nConfirmed the save and load flow is correct. Next I will smoke import and then write tests.\n\nPlanning a test runner at tools/test.mjs that imports groups, runs selected tests, prints only failures, and exits with code 1 if anything fails. The suite will be split into four files: unit tests for pure functions and source greps, balance checks for fresh worlds and events, event tests for sharp bots across tiers, and flow tests for the full game.\n\nAdded input, audio, hub, and UI test files to the suite. Input covers verbs, menus, group, and raft winner. Audio requires Playwright because Node lacks OfflineAudioContext; it will use the test hook's probe. Hub and UI need a built HTML file and a server, so they are heavy and belong in the full run. Events, flow, and balance can run in Node.\n\nAudio tests will open the built HTML with `?test=1&render=0&manual=1` and call `__TEST__.probe`. They can also be folded into the UI Playwright suite. The work order is: smoke `createGame`, write and run Node tests, build HTML, then write audio, UI, and hub tests. A bug was found: `main.js` exports `activate` on `__TEST__`, but `createGame` does not return it.\n\nUI tests will click real DOM buttons via Playwright if mountUi works. Node tests can use game.key and advance.\n\nI confirmed the createGame return ends around runSession, so adding activate there is straightforward.\n\nI also spotted a state bug: goto('play') calls setScreen('play') after beginCountdown already set the screen to 'countdown'. The play screen logic may not clear paused correctly.\n\nConfirmed the paused state bug is harmless because beginCountdown already clears it before goto('play') runs.\n\nDiscovered that goto() does not pass a seed to startEvent, so every event uses seed 1. This breaks balance assertions that need three distinct seeds. The plan requires tests to drive shipped code, so I will either extend goto with a seed argument or construct events directly for variation.\n\nI will extend `goto` to accept an `args` object and thread extra fields through `openIntro` into `beginCountdown`. This lets tests pass a seed or tier when starting the play screen, fixing the balance assertion bug without breaking existing code.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/fruitHat.js","offset":200,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/logReps.js","offset":1,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/raft.js","offset":1,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/grandHold.js","offset":1,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-43","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"activate\\(","glob":"**/src/game/director.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5545,"output_tokens":1897,"cache_read_input_tokens":93696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"ad4ca54f-3ec2-49d0-80e0-61c755f8b7fd"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→\\n  clearHat(i) {\\n    for (const fruit of this.hats[i]) this.world.removeCollider(fruit.col, true);\\n    this.hats[i] = [];\\n  }\\n\\n  onFall(i) {\\n    this.clearHat(i);\\n  }\\n\\n210→  result(i = 0) {\\n    const raw = this.score[i];\\n    const form = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, (100 * raw) / this.params.par));\\n    return {\\n      form, raw,\\n      medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${this.banked[i]} banked · ${this.states[i].falls} spills`,\\n      banked: this.banked[i],\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n    };\\n220→  }\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Sharp banks at 7. The stick aims at a fruit only in its last 0.95 s.\\n   * bankAt Infinity never hops.\\n   */\\n  botInput(i, skill, opt = 7) {\\n    const bankAt = typeof opt === 'number' ? opt : (opt?.bankAt ?? 7);\\n    const home = this.lanes[i];\\n    let target = null;\\n230→    let best = 1e9;\\n    for (const fruit of this.flight) {\\n      if (fruit.lane !== i || fruit.done) continue;\\n      const left = fruit.fly - fruit.age;\\n      if (left > 0.95) continue;\\n      if (left < best) { best = left; target = fruit; }\\n    }\\n    const reach = Math.max(0.2, Math.sin(getTune('maxLean') * DEG) * 1.5);\\n    let x = 0;\\n    let y = 0;\\n240→    if (target) {\\n      const dx = target.x - home.x;\\n      const dz = target.z - home.z;\\n      x = dx / reach;\\n      y = -dz / reach;\\n      const n = skill.noise || 0;\\n      x += n * Math.sin(this.t * 4 + i);\\n      y += n * Math.cos(this.t * 3 + i);\\n    }\\n    const hop = this.hats[i].length >= bankAt && this.bankCool[i] <= 0 && !this.states[i].fallen;\",\"content_concise\":\"200→\\n  clearHat(i) {\\n    for (const fruit of this.hats[i]) this.world.removeCollider(fruit.col, true);\\n    this.hats[i] = [];\\n  }\\n\\n  onFall(i) {\\n    this.clearHat(i);\\n  }\\n\\n210→  result(i = 0) {\\n    const raw = this.score[i];\\n    const form = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, (100 * raw) / this.params.par));\\n    return {\\n      form, raw,\\n      medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${this.banked[i]} banked · ${this.states[i].falls} spills`,\\n      banked: this.banked[i],\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n    };\\n220→  }\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Sharp banks at 7. The stick aims at a fruit only in its last 0.95 s.\\n   * bankAt Infinity never hops.\\n   */\\n  botInput(i, skill, opt = 7) {\\n    const bankAt = typeof opt === 'number' ? opt : (opt?.bankAt ?? 7);\\n    const home = this.lanes[i];\\n    let target = null;\\n230→    let best = 1e9;\\n    for (const fruit of this.flight) {\\n      if (fruit.lane !== i || fruit.done) continue;\\n      const left = fruit.fly - fruit.age;\\n      if (left > 0.95) continue;\\n      if (left < best) { best = left; target = fruit; }\\n    }\\n    const reach = Math.max(0.2, Math.sin(getTune('maxLean') * DEG) * 1.5);\\n    let x = 0;\\n    let y = 0;\\n240→    if (target) {\\n      const dx = target.x - home.x;\\n      const dz = target.z - home.z;\\n      x = dx / reach;\\n      y = -dz / reach;\\n      const n = skill.noise || 0;\\n      x += n * Math.sin(this.t * 4 + i);\\n      y += n * Math.cos(this.t * 3 + i);\\n    }\\n    const hop = this.hats[i].length >= bankAt && this.bankCool[i] <= 0 && !this.states[i].fallen;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/fruitHat.js\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"\\n  clearHat(i) {\\n    for (const fruit of this.hats[i]) this.world.removeCollider(fruit.col, true);\\n    this.hats[i] = [];\\n  }\\n\\n  onFall(i) {\\n    this.clearHat(i);\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const raw = this.score[i];\\n    const form = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, (100 * raw) / this.params.par));\\n    return {\\n      form, raw,\\n      medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${this.banked[i]} banked · ${this.states[i].falls} spills`,\\n      banked: this.banked[i],\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Sharp banks at 7. The stick aims at a fruit only in its last 0.95 s.\\n   * bankAt Infinity never hops.\\n   */\\n  botInput(i, skill, opt = 7) {\\n    const bankAt = typeof opt === 'number' ? opt : (opt?.bankAt ?? 7);\\n    const home = this.lanes[i];\\n    let target = null;\\n    let best = 1e9;\\n    for (const fruit of this.flight) {\\n      if (fruit.lane !== i || fruit.done) continue;\\n      const left = fruit.fly - fruit.age;\\n      if (left > 0.95) continue;\\n      if (left < best) { best = left; target = fruit; }\\n    }\\n    const reach = Math.max(0.2, Math.sin(getTune('maxLean') * DEG) * 1.5);\\n    let x = 0;\\n    let y = 0;\\n    if (target) {\\n      const dx = target.x - home.x;\\n      const dz = target.z - home.z;\\n      x = dx / reach;\\n      y = -dz / reach;\\n      const n = skill.noise || 0;\\n      x += n * Math.sin(this.t * 4 + i);\\n      y += n * Math.cos(this.t * 3 + i);\\n    }\\n    const hop = this.hats[i].length >= bankAt && this.bankCool[i] <= 0 && !this.states[i].fallen;\\n\",\"total_lines\":254}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-40","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { difficultyOf, DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { reps: 6, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.04, tremor1: 0.12 },\\n  2: { reps: 9, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.06, tremor1: 0.16 },\\n10→  3: { reps: 12, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class LogReps extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'logReps';\\n  static title = 'Log Reps';\\n  static discipline = 'Strength';\\n  static instructor = 'bolster';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n20→  static can = 'Follow the ribbon with both feet and keep the dot near the middle.';\\n  static cant = 'The log is a number on your shoulders. Lean it past the notch and Coach has to catch it.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Six reps, then Coach lies about the last one.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Nine reps. The band is stricter.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Twelve reps. The band is strict.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n30→    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.offset = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repScore = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.bandTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.zoneTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repClock = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repIndex = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.lost = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n40→    this.dropped = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.lastRep = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\\n\\n  tempo() {\\n    const diff = difficultyOf(this.difficulty).rhythm;\\n    return getTune('repTempo') * diff;\\n  }\\n50→\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { difficultyOf, DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { reps: 6, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.04, tremor1: 0.12 },\\n  2: { reps: 9, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.06, tremor1: 0.16 },\\n10→  3: { reps: 12, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class LogReps extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'logReps';\\n  static title = 'Log Reps';\\n  static discipline = 'Strength';\\n  static instructor = 'bolster';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n20→  static can = 'Follow the ribbon with both feet and keep the dot near the middle.';\\n  static cant = 'The log is a number on your shoulders. Lean it past the notch and Coach has to catch it.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Six reps, then Coach lies about the last one.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Nine reps. The band is stricter.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Twelve reps. The band is strict.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n30→    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.offset = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repScore = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.bandTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.zoneTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repClock = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repIndex = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.lost = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n40→    this.dropped = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.lastRep = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\\n\\n  tempo() {\\n    const diff = difficultyOf(this.difficulty).rhythm;\\n    return getTune('repTempo') * diff;\\n  }\\n50→\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/logReps.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { difficultyOf, DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { reps: 6, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.04, tremor1: 0.12 },\\n  2: { reps: 9, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.06, tremor1: 0.16 },\\n  3: { reps: 12, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class LogReps extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'logReps';\\n  static title = 'Log Reps';\\n  static discipline = 'Strength';\\n  static instructor = 'bolster';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n  static can = 'Follow the ribbon with both feet and keep the dot near the middle.';\\n  static cant = 'The log is a number on your shoulders. Lean it past the notch and Coach has to catch it.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Six reps, then Coach lies about the last one.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Nine reps. The band is stricter.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Twelve reps. The band is strict.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.offset = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repScore = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.bandTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.zoneTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repClock = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repIndex = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.lost = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n    this.dropped = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.lastRep = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\\n\\n  tempo() {\\n    const diff = difficultyOf(this.difficulty).rhythm;\\n    return getTune('repTempo') * diff;\\n  }\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":159}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-41","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { rng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { clamp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nexport class Raft extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'raft';\\n  static title = 'Tippy Raft';\\n10→  static discipline = 'Balance Play';\\n  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = false;\\n  static can = 'Walk, hop, and flail to shove. Last one on the raft takes the round.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot win by standing in the middle forever. The raft shrinks, and the sea takes a side.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'hop', 'flail'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Best of three. The sea is already choosing.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The swells come a little meaner.' },\\n20→    3: { blurb: 'The raft forgets its edges quickly.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    const lanes = opts.lanes && opts.lanes.length >= 2 ? opts.lanes : [\\n      { id: 0, kind: 'local', x: 0, z: 0, name: 'You' },\\n      { id: 1, kind: 'bot', x: 3.2, z: 0, skill: 'average', name: 'Kevin' },\\n      { id: 2, kind: 'bot', x: 6.4, z: 0, skill: 'clumsy', name: 'Paul' },\\n      { id: 3, kind: 'bot', x: 9.6, z: 0, skill: 'sharp', name: 'Sandra' },\\n    ];\\n30→    super({ ...opts, lanes });\\n    this.players = this.lanes.map((lane, i) => ({\\n      x: Math.cos((i / this.lanes.length) * Math.PI * 2) * 1.2,\\n      z: Math.sin((i / this.lanes.length) * Math.PI * 2) * 1.2,\\n      vx: 0, vz: 0, out: false, shove: 0, cool: 0,\\n      skill: lane.kind === 'local' ? (opts.skill || 'sharp') : (['average', 'clumsy', 'average'][i - 1] || 'average'),\\n    }));\\n    this.round = 0;\\n    this.wins = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.radius = 6;\\n40→    this.tx = 0;\\n    this.tz = 0;\\n    this.vxT = 0;\\n    this.vzT = 0;\\n    this.nextSwell = 4;\\n    this.roundT = 0;\\n    this.roundTimes = [];\\n    this.over = false;\\n    this.label = opts.label ?? 'raft';\\n    this.god = true;\\n50→    this.targetRounds = 3;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { rng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { clamp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nexport class Raft extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'raft';\\n  static title = 'Tippy Raft';\\n10→  static discipline = 'Balance Play';\\n  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = false;\\n  static can = 'Walk, hop, and flail to shove. Last one on the raft takes the round.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot win by standing in the middle forever. The raft shrinks, and the sea takes a side.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'hop', 'flail'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Best of three. The sea is already choosing.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The swells come a little meaner.' },\\n20→    3: { blurb: 'The raft forgets its edges quickly.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    const lanes = opts.lanes && opts.lanes.length >= 2 ? opts.lanes : [\\n      { id: 0, kind: 'local', x: 0, z: 0, name: 'You' },\\n      { id: 1, kind: 'bot', x: 3.2, z: 0, skill: 'average', name: 'Kevin' },\\n      { id: 2, kind: 'bot', x: 6.4, z: 0, skill: 'clumsy', name: 'Paul' },\\n      { id: 3, kind: 'bot', x: 9.6, z: 0, skill: 'sharp', name: 'Sandra' },\\n    ];\\n30→    super({ ...opts, lanes });\\n    this.players = this.lanes.map((lane, i) => ({\\n      x: Math.cos((i / this.lanes.length) * Math.PI * 2) * 1.2,\\n      z: Math.sin((i / this.lanes.length) * Math.PI * 2) * 1.2,\\n      vx: 0, vz: 0, out: false, shove: 0, cool: 0,\\n      skill: lane.kind === 'local' ? (opts.skill || 'sharp') : (['average', 'clumsy', 'average'][i - 1] || 'average'),\\n    }));\\n    this.round = 0;\\n    this.wins = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.radius = 6;\\n40→    this.tx = 0;\\n    this.tz = 0;\\n    this.vxT = 0;\\n    this.vzT = 0;\\n    this.nextSwell = 4;\\n    this.roundT = 0;\\n    this.roundTimes = [];\\n    this.over = false;\\n    this.label = opts.label ?? 'raft';\\n    this.god = true;\\n50→    this.targetRounds = 3;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/raft.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { rng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { clamp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nexport class Raft extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'raft';\\n  static title = 'Tippy Raft';\\n  static discipline = 'Balance Play';\\n  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = false;\\n  static can = 'Walk, hop, and flail to shove. Last one on the raft takes the round.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot win by standing in the middle forever. The raft shrinks, and the sea takes a side.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'hop', 'flail'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Best of three. The sea is already choosing.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The swells come a little meaner.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'The raft forgets its edges quickly.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    const lanes = opts.lanes && opts.lanes.length >= 2 ? opts.lanes : [\\n      { id: 0, kind: 'local', x: 0, z: 0, name: 'You' },\\n      { id: 1, kind: 'bot', x: 3.2, z: 0, skill: 'average', name: 'Kevin' },\\n      { id: 2, kind: 'bot', x: 6.4, z: 0, skill: 'clumsy', name: 'Paul' },\\n      { id: 3, kind: 'bot', x: 9.6, z: 0, skill: 'sharp', name: 'Sandra' },\\n    ];\\n    super({ ...opts, lanes });\\n    this.players = this.lanes.map((lane, i) => ({\\n      x: Math.cos((i / this.lanes.length) * Math.PI * 2) * 1.2,\\n      z: Math.sin((i / this.lanes.length) * Math.PI * 2) * 1.2,\\n      vx: 0, vz: 0, out: false, shove: 0, cool: 0,\\n      skill: lane.kind === 'local' ? (opts.skill || 'sharp') : (['average', 'clumsy', 'average'][i - 1] || 'average'),\\n    }));\\n    this.round = 0;\\n    this.wins = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.radius = 6;\\n    this.tx = 0;\\n    this.tz = 0;\\n    this.vxT = 0;\\n    this.vzT = 0;\\n    this.nextSwell = 4;\\n    this.roundT = 0;\\n    this.roundTimes = [];\\n    this.over = false;\\n    this.label = opts.label ?? 'raft';\\n    this.god = true;\\n    this.targetRounds = 3;\\n\",\"total_lines\":200}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d5c428a5-9bcf-4b90-85e8-fc2329c81951-42","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { RAPIER, propGroups, dollGroups } from '../physics/world.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\n\\nconst PHASES = [\\n  { id: 'pose', len: 20 },\\n10→  { id: 'stones', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'gust', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'steps', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'hold', len: 15 },\\n];\\n\\nexport class GrandHold extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'grandHold';\\n  static title = 'The Grand Hold';\\n  static discipline = 'Finale';\\n20→  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = false;\\n  static session = false;\\n  static can = 'Follow the remix. If you fall, the class catches you and the phase starts again.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot fail this. You can only take longer.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Four short memories, then the middle.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The same hold, asked a little more clearly.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'The same hold. The island already trusts you.' },\\n30→  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.phaseIndex = 0;\\n    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.restarts = 0;\\n    this.inRing = 0;\\n    this.holdTime = 0;\\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n40→    this.stones = [];\\n    this.clearing = false;\\n    this.plate = null;\\n    this.plateGone = false;\\n    this.notch = false;\\n    this.gust = 0;\\n    this.warn = 0;\\n    this.nextGust = 3;\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n  }\\n50→\\n  build() {\\n    this.buildWorld(10, 16);\\n    this.plate = this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.22, 0.02, 0.22)\\n        .setMass(0.04).setFriction(1).setTranslation(0, 1.05, 0)\\n        .setCollisionGroups(dollGroups(0)),\\n      this.dolls[0].body,\\n    );\\n  }\\n60→\\n  phase() { return PHASES[this.phaseIndex]; }\\n\\n  spawnStone() {\\n    const body = this.world.createRigidBody(\\n      RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(this.lanes[0].x, 2.2 + this.stones.length * 0.16, this.lanes[0].z)\\n        .setCanSleep(false).setLinearDamping(0.2).setAngularDamping(0.6),\\n    );\\n    this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.12, 0.06, 0.12).setMass(0.02).setFriction(0.95).setCollisionGroups(propGroups(0)),\\n70→      body,\\n    );\\n    this.stones.push(body);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const input = inputs[0] || {};\\n    const state = this.states[0];\\n    if (!state.fallen) {\\n      state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n80→      state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n    }\\n    const phase = this.phase();\\n    if (!phase) {\\n      this.done = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.phaseT += dt;\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && !this.clearing && this.stones.length < 4 && this.phaseT > 1 + this.stones.length * 3) this.spawnStone();\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && this.phaseT >= phase.len && !this.clearing) this.clearing = true;\\n90→    if (this.clearing && !this.plateGone) {\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { RAPIER, propGroups, dollGroups } from '../physics/world.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\n\\nconst PHASES = [\\n  { id: 'pose', len: 20 },\\n10→  { id: 'stones', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'gust', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'steps', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'hold', len: 15 },\\n];\\n\\nexport class GrandHold extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'grandHold';\\n  static title = 'The Grand Hold';\\n  static discipline = 'Finale';\\n20→  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = false;\\n  static session = false;\\n  static can = 'Follow the remix. If you fall, the class catches you and the phase starts again.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot fail this. You can only take longer.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Four short memories, then the middle.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The same hold, asked a little more clearly.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'The same hold. The island already trusts you.' },\\n30→  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.phaseIndex = 0;\\n    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.restarts = 0;\\n    this.inRing = 0;\\n    this.holdTime = 0;\\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n40→    this.stones = [];\\n    this.clearing = false;\\n    this.plate = null;\\n    this.plateGone = false;\\n    this.notch = false;\\n    this.gust = 0;\\n    this.warn = 0;\\n    this.nextGust = 3;\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n  }\\n50→\\n  build() {\\n    this.buildWorld(10, 16);\\n    this.plate = this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.22, 0.02, 0.22)\\n        .setMass(0.04).setFriction(1).setTranslation(0, 1.05, 0)\\n        .setCollisionGroups(dollGroups(0)),\\n      this.dolls[0].body,\\n    );\\n  }\\n60→\\n  phase() { return PHASES[this.phaseIndex]; }\\n\\n  spawnStone() {\\n    const body = this.world.createRigidBody(\\n      RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(this.lanes[0].x, 2.2 + this.stones.length * 0.16, this.lanes[0].z)\\n        .setCanSleep(false).setLinearDamping(0.2).setAngularDamping(0.6),\\n    );\\n    this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.12, 0.06, 0.12).setMass(0.02).setFriction(0.95).setCollisionGroups(propGroups(0)),\\n70→      body,\\n    );\\n    this.stones.push(body);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const input = inputs[0] || {};\\n    const state = this.states[0];\\n    if (!state.fallen) {\\n      state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n80→      state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n    }\\n    const phase = this.phase();\\n    if (!phase) {\\n      this.done = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.phaseT += dt;\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && !this.clearing && this.stones.length < 4 && this.phaseT > 1 + this.stones.length * 3) this.spawnStone();\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && this.phaseT >= phase.len && !this.clearing) this.clearing = true;\\n90→    if (this.clearing && !this.plateGone) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/grandHold.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { RAPIER, propGroups, dollGroups } from '../physics/world.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\n\\nconst PHASES = [\\n  { id: 'pose', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'stones', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'gust', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'steps', len: 20 },\\n  { id: 'hold', len: 15 },\\n];\\n\\nexport class GrandHold extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'grandHold';\\n  static title = 'The Grand Hold';\\n  static discipline = 'Finale';\\n  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = false;\\n  static session = false;\\n  static can = 'Follow the remix. If you fall, the class catches you and the phase starts again.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot fail this. You can only take longer.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Four short memories, then the middle.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The same hold, asked a little more clearly.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'The same hold. The island already trusts you.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.phaseIndex = 0;\\n    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.restarts = 0;\\n    this.inRing = 0;\\n    this.holdTime = 0;\\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.stones = [];\\n    this.clearing = false;\\n    this.plate = null;\\n    this.plateGone = false;\\n    this.notch = false;\\n    this.gust = 0;\\n    this.warn = 0;\\n    this.nextGust = 3;\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() {\\n    this.buildWorld(10, 16);\\n    this.plate = this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.22, 0.02, 0.22)\\n        .setMass(0.04).setFriction(1).setTranslation(0, 1.05, 0)\\n        .setCollisionGroups(dollGroups(0)),\\n      this.dolls[0].body,\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  phase() { return PHASES[this.phaseIndex]; }\\n\\n  spawnStone() {\\n    const body = this.world.createRigidBody(\\n      RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(this.lanes[0].x, 2.2 + this.stones.length * 0.16, this.lanes[0].z)\\n        .setCanSleep(false).setLinearDamping(0.2).setAngularDamping(0.6),\\n    );\\n    this.world.createCollider(\\n      RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.12, 0.06, 0.12).setMass(0.02).setFriction(0.95).setCollisionGroups(propGroups(0)),\\n      body,\\n    );\\n    this.stones.push(body);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const input = inputs[0] || {};\\n    const state = this.states[0];\\n    if (!state.fallen) {\\n      state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n      state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n    }\\n    const phase = this.phase();\\n    if (!phase) {\\n      this.done = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.phaseT += dt;\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && !this.clearing && this.stones.length < 4 && this.phaseT > 1 + this.stones.length * 3) this.spawnStone();\\n    if (phase.id === 'stones' && this.phaseT >= phase.len && !this.clearing) this.clearing = true;\\n    if (this.clearing && !this.plateGone) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":176}}","is