{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_249","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Poses require list length and hold.\n\nConstructor parameters look fine. Writing code now with robust tests. Step class caps at 120 chunks. Grand hold caps at 220 chunks.\n\nIsland loop caps at 100 chunks. Springboard caps at 70. A `play` helper will advance until the game exits play, checkin, countdown, or intro screens. NaN checks and direct disposal will be added. Tier 2 and 3 goto calls will include tier parameters. The skill matrix balance is slow and may be sampled.\n\nThe skill matrix balance is required by the plan. If wall time is too high, only one seed will be used for sharp in the events group. A quick benchmark of fruit hat will estimate timing. The director will be patched first. Then a test library and bench script will be written. The full events runner will be built next. Browser tests will follow. Parallel work includes patching and node tests. The balance core and one event will run immediately.\n\nFruit hat clearHat handles multiple colliders correctly. The plank double ragdoll fix is already verified. Code comments will be minimal; tests may use short assertion messages. Director setScreen resets page and focus before switching to the plan screen.\n\nThe plan screen focus now selects the first unfinished class. Countdown god mode is safe because goto play sets the intro screen first. Attract mode calls startEvent directly instead of beginCountdown. pendingStart clears even if start throws. activate already returned is handled. state() and model() side effects on coarse titles are acceptable.\n\nNode tests are not coarse, so model() side effects on titles are harmless. Calling state() twice is safe because model() may have side effects. I am now tracing writeSave version handling to fix the resume test.\n\nwriteSave nests profile and settings under a version field. Object.assign overwrites the fresh profile correctly. I will review the long-running skill before launching those tests.\n\nThe long-running skill is well known. The full test suite may take several minutes. I will start with block_until_ms set to 0 and monitor the job.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9cd4276f-635b-4bb6-b7e1-655f6cb05d8d-82","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/poses.js","offset":30,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9cd4276f-635b-4bb6-b7e1-655f6cb05d8d-83","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/plank.js","offset":20,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9cd4276f-635b-4bb6-b7e1-655f6cb05d8d-84","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/logReps.js","offset":50,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2280,"output_tokens":1468,"cache_read_input_tokens":151040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"498829ae-1a01-4e12-b992-718cfd99f83e"}
