{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_298","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in driveBots: botInput is called before fixed(), but botInput uses this.\n\nThe step order is now clear. botInput reads this.t before stepCores increments it. fixed() then checks the input and sets lastPress to that stale value.\n\nstepCores increments this.t at its very first line. Both botInput and fixed() read this.t before that increment, so they see the same value for a given step. The gap between taps equals N times dt, where N is the number of steps between spin crossings.\n\nThe timing logic is confirmed correct. The first tap at event.t=0 is handled properly. botInput and fixed both use the same pre-increment t value, so sin wander and band switching remain consistent. A slight offset in the first smoothed interval is acceptable.\n\nA potential bug was found in the key input path. When a key tap occurs during driveBots, lastDevice is set to 'key'. After that first tap, lastDevice remains 'key' indefinitely until a stick move happens. On subsequent frames, keys are not down and weightKeyDown() returns false, so the pointer does not move and the stick stays inactive.\n\nThe key input path is harmless. Wish integration holds when keys are not down, keeping magnitude tiny. Between taps, hold is detected if the gap stays under 1.05 seconds. Key oscillation produces a negligible 0.013 magnitude. The duration check in fixed uses the incremented time correctly.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35fdb0a5-76e8-4f14-989a-442a727528e1-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/plates.js","offset":60,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5253,"output_tokens":950,"cache_read_input_tokens":109952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"a5c3d339-f994-4c32-a52a-5fba08bfe806"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-35fdb0a5-76e8-4f14-989a-442a727528e1-53","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"60→\\n  gain() { return getTune('plateGain'); }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n      state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      const sx = input.screenX != null ? input.screenX : (input.wishX || 0);\\n70→      const sy = input.screenY != null ? input.screenY : -(input.wishZ || 0);\\n      const mag = Math.hypot(sx, sy);\\n      let omega = 0;\\n      const tapped = !!(input.plateA || input.plateD);\\n      if (mag > 0.5) {\\n        const ang = Math.atan2(sy, sx);\\n        if (this.hasAng[i]) {\\n          let d = ang - this.prevAng[i];\\n          while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n          while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n80→          omega = d / dt;\\n        }\\n        this.prevAng[i] = ang;\\n        this.hasAng[i] = true;\\n        const a = 1 - Math.exp(-dt / 0.12);\\n        this.sensed[i] += (omega - this.sensed[i]) * a;\\n      } else if (tapped) {\\n        const prev = this.lastPress[i];\\n        if (prev >= 0) {\\n          const gap = this.t - prev;\\n90→          // Each press is half a turn, so the gap is the hoop speed. The slow band is one tap every ~0.7 s.\\n          if (gap >= dt && gap <= 1.2) {\\n            const instant = Math.PI / gap;\\n            const a = 1 - Math.exp(-gap / 0.12);\\n            this.sensed[i] += (instant - this.sensed[i]) * a;\\n          }\\n        }\\n        this.lastPress[i] = this.t;\\n        this.hasAng[i] = false;\\n      } else if (this.lastPress[i] < 0 || this.t - this.lastPress[i] > 1.05) {\\n100→        this.sensed[i] *= Math.exp(-3 * dt);\\n        this.hasAng[i] = false;\\n      }\\n      const b = 1 - Math.exp(-dt / 0.5);\\n      this.hoop[i] += (this.sensed[i] - this.hoop[i]) * b;\\n      const speed = Math.abs(this.hoop[i]);\\n      for (const plate of this.plates[i]) {\\n        if (plate.back > 0) {\\n          plate.back = Math.max(0, plate.back - dt);\\n          if (plate.back === 0) {\\n110→            plate.alive = true;\\n            plate.energy = 0.7;\\n          }\\n          continue;\\n        }\\n        const band = BANDS[plate.band];\\n        const inside = speed >= band.lo && speed <= band.hi;\\n        plate.energy += dt * (inside ? this.gain() : -this.decay());\\n        plate.energy = clamp(plate.energy, 0, 1);\\n        if (plate.energy <= 0) {\\n120→          plate.alive = false;\\n          plate.back = 6;\\n          this.crashes[i] += 1;\\n        } else {\\n          plate.aliveTime += dt;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.8 });\\n    if (this.t >= this.duration) this.done = true;\\n130→  }\\n\\n  share(i = 0) {\\n    const possible = this.plates[i].length * this.duration;\\n    const alive = this.plates[i].reduce((sum, plate) => sum + plate.aliveTime, 0);\\n    return possible > 0 ? alive / possible : 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const share = this.share(i);\\n140→    const form = clamp(200 * share - 100, 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw: share, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% spinning · ${this.crashes[i]} crashes`,\\n      falls: 0,\\n      share,\\n      crashes: this.crashes[i],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n150→  botInput(i, skill, opt = {}) {\\n    const alive = this.plates[i].filter((plate) => plate.alive);\\n    const lowest = alive.slice().sort((a, b) => a.energy - b.energy)[0] || this.plates[i][0];\\n    const here = alive.filter((plate) => plate.band === this.bandWish[i]);\\n    const hereMin = here.length ? Math.min(...here.map((plate) => plate.energy)) : 0;\\n    const reaction = Math.max(0.9, skill?.reaction ?? 0.12);\\n    const urgent = lowest && lowest.energy < 0.35 && lowest.band !== this.bandWish[i];\\n    if ((urgent || hereMin > 0.9) && lowest && this.t - this.bandAt[i] > reaction) {\\n      this.bandWish[i] = lowest.band;\\n      this.bandAt[i] = this.t;\\n160→    }\\n    const band = BANDS[this.bandWish[i]];\\n    const clumsy = (skill?.speedErr ?? 0) > 1;\\n    // A clumsy hand wanders several rad/s, so the hoop leaves the band. A sharp hand stays inside it.\\n    const wander = (skill?.speedErr ?? 0.3) * (clumsy ? 3.5 : 0.12) * Math.sin(this.t * 1.7 + this.ph);\\n    const omega = band.mid + wander;\\n    if (opt.keys) {\\n      const prev = this.spin[i];\\n      this.spin[i] += omega * (1 / 120);\\n      const turn = Math.floor(this.spin[i] / Math.PI);\\n170→      const tap = turn !== Math.floor(prev / Math.PI);\\n      const which = Math.abs(turn);\\n      return { x: 0, y: 0, plateA: tap && which % 2 === 1, plateD: tap && which % 2 === 0, flail: false, hop: false };\\n    }\\n    this.angle[i] += omega * (1 / 120);\\n    return {\\n      x: Math.cos(this.angle[i]),\\n      y: Math.sin(this.angle[i]),\\n      flail: false,\\n      hop: false,\",\"content_concise\":\"60→\\n  gain() { return getTune('plateGain'); }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n      state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      const sx = input.screenX != null ? input.screenX : (input.wishX || 0);\\n70→      const sy = input.screenY != null ? input.screenY : -(input.wishZ || 0);\\n      const mag = Math.hypot(sx, sy);\\n      let omega = 0;\\n      const tapped = !!(input.plateA || input.plateD);\\n      if (mag > 0.5) {\\n        const ang = Math.atan2(sy, sx);\\n        if (this.hasAng[i]) {\\n          let d = ang - this.prevAng[i];\\n          while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n          while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n80→          omega = d / dt;\\n        }\\n        this.prevAng