{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_300","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both tests passed. The sharp stick and keys are shared.\n\nCairn passed. The full balance suite is next. It covers the 3x3x14 matrix and events, flow, input, and unit tests. Earlier timings suggest this will take a while.\n\nThe full balance suite should take roughly one to two minutes. The matrix runs about 25 seconds. Events and flow tests add another 30 to 45 seconds.\n\nUnit tests will be skipped until the HTML build is ready. The balance suite comes first because it covers the recently changed plates and cairn events. Events, flow, and input will follow. I'll check for other issues before starting the long run.\n\nNo state() mutation issues were found. Only cairn latches are affected. The balance suite is starting from the dev folder. I will read flow.mjs, events.mjs, unit.mjs, and the build docs while it runs.\n\nI will run the balance suite with a 180-second timeout. The matrix could take up to two minutes. I am also scanning for events that might hang or produce NaN.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dc802037-9787-42e3-9544-6be7bc9bfc5e-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/balance.mjs","offset":230,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dc802037-9787-42e3-9544-6be7bc9bfc5e-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dc802037-9787-42e3-9544-6be7bc9bfc5e-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"## Verification","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"inpu