{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dc802037-9787-42e3-9544-6be7bc9bfc5e-55","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"230→  });\\n\\n  add('sharp, average and clumsy Tier 1 across three seeds', async () => {\\n    const skills = ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'];\\n    const totals = {};\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) totals[id] = { sharp: [], average: [], clumsy: [] };\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      for (const skill of skills) {\\n        for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n          const { state } = await playBot(id, { skill, seed });\\n240→          const form = state.profile.best[id][1];\\n          assert(Number.isFinite(form), `${id} ${skill} seed ${seed} form`);\\n          totals[id][skill].push(form);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const mean = (list) => list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length;\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n      const sharp = mean(totals[id].sharp);\\n      const average = mean(totals[id].average);\\n250→      const clumsy = mean(totals[id].clumsy);\\n      assert(sharp >= 85, `${id} sharp average ${sharp.toFixed(1)}`);\\n      assert(average >= 40, `${id} average ${average.toFixed(1)}`);\\n      assert(clumsy >= 40, `${id} clumsy ${clumsy.toFixed(1)}`);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  return tests;\\n}\\n\\n260→void initRapier;\\nvoid fresh;\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"230→  });\\n\\n  add('sharp, average and clumsy Tier 1 across three seeds', async () => {\\n    const skills = ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'];\\n    const totals = {};\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) totals[id] = { sharp: [], average: [], clumsy: [] };\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      for (const skill of skills) {\\n        for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n          const { state } = await playBot(id, { skill, seed });\\n240→          const form = state.profile.best[id][1];\\n          assert(Number.isFinite(form), `${id} ${skill} seed ${seed} form`);\\n          totals[id][skill].push(form);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const mean = (list) => list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length;\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n      const sharp = mean(totals[id].sharp);\\n      const average = mean(totals[id].average);\\n250→      const clumsy = mean(totals[id].clumsy);\\n      assert(sharp >= 85, `${id} sharp average ${sharp.toFixed(1)}`);\\n      assert(average >= 40, `${id} average ${average.toFixed(1)}`);\\n      assert(clumsy >= 40, `${id} clumsy ${clumsy.toFixed(1)}`);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  return tests;\\n}\\n\\n260→void initRapier;\\nvoid fresh;\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/balance.mjs\",\"offset\":230,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"  });\\n\\n  add('sharp, average and clumsy Tier 1 across three seeds', async () => {\\n    const skills = ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'];\\n    const totals = {};\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) totals[id] = { sharp: [], average: [], clumsy: [] };\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      for (const skill of skills) {\\n        for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n          const { state } = await playBot(id, { skill, seed });\\n          const form = state.profile.best[id][1];\\n          assert(Number.isFinite(form), `${id} ${skill} seed ${seed} form`);\\n          totals[id][skill].push(form);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const mean = (list) => list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length;\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n      const sharp = mean(totals[id].sharp);\\n      const average = mean(totals[id].average);\\n      const clumsy = mean(totals[id].clumsy);\\n      assert(sharp >= 85, `${id} sharp average ${sharp.toFixed(1)}`);\\n      assert(average >= 40, `${id} average ${average.toFixed(1)}`);\\n      assert(clumsy >= 40, `${id} clumsy ${clumsy.toFixed(1)}`);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  return tests;\\n}\\n\\nvoid initRapier;\\nvoid fresh;\\n\",\"total_lines\":261}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dc802037-9787-42e3-9544-6be7bc9bfc5e-56","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Issues caught while building Level Best\\n\\n1. Log Reps counted a phantom first rep because `lastRep` was undefined. Critical: no. The score started a rep early.\\n2. Plank & Perch could spawn a second ragdoll for one fall. Critical: yes. A second removal in the same step panics Rapier for the whole page.\\n3. Island Loop scored cadence from `t % period` and wrote tilted gravity into the world. Critical: yes. A sharp jog scored 26, and the gravity write produced NaN.\\n4. Plate Spinners' bot left the band it was supposed to hold. Critical: yes. A sharp bot scored about 47 instead of a full spin.\\n5. Room Service built the tray with full extents and lost glasses that were still on it. Critical: yes. The order could not be delivered.\\n6. Tippy Raft ignored the lane's skill and the grip that keeps a sharp player near the middle. Critical: no. Rounds still ended, but skill did not matter.\\n7. Check-in leaned the doll toward the wrong side of the target. Critical: yes. The Wobble Age came out of the wrong mean.\\n10→8. Check-in applied the calm margin twice. Critical: no. The stand test was stricter than the written one, but the day still finished.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Issues caught while building Level Best\\n\\n1. Log Reps counted a phantom first rep because `lastRep` was undefined. Critical: no. The score started a rep early.\\n2. Plank & Perch could spawn a second ragdoll for one fall. Critical: yes. A second removal in the same step panics Rapier for the whole page.\\n3. Island Loop scored cadence from `t % period` and wrote tilted gravity into the world. Critical: yes. A sharp jog scored 26, and the gravity write produced NaN.\\n4. Plate Spinners' bot left the band it was supposed to hold. Critical: yes. A sharp bot scored about 47 instead of a full spin.\\n5. Room Service built the tray with full extents and lost glasses that were still on it. Critical: yes. The order could not be delivered.\\n6. Tippy Raft ignored the lane's skill and the grip that keeps a sharp player near the middle. Critical: no. Rounds still ended, but skill did not matter.\\n7. Check-in leaned the doll toward the wrong side of the target. Critical: yes. The Wobble Age came out of the wrong mean.\\n10→8. Check-in applied the calm margin twice. Critical: no. The stand test was stricter than the written one, but the day still finished.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"# Issues caught while building Level Best\\n\\n1. Log Reps counted a phantom first rep because `lastRep` was undefined. Critical: no. The score started a rep early.\\n2. Plank & Perch could spawn a second ragdoll for one fall. Critical: yes. A second removal in the same step panics Rapier for the whole page.\\n3. Island Loop scored cadence from `t % period` and wrote tilted gravity into the world. Critical: yes. A sharp jog scored 26, and the gravity write produced NaN.\\n4. Plate Spinners' bot left the band it was supposed to hold. Critical: yes. A sharp bot scored about 47 instead of a full spin.\\n5. Room Service built the tray with full extents and lost glasses that were still on it. Critical: yes. The order could not be delivered.\\n6. Tippy Raft ignored the lane's skill and the grip that keeps a sharp player near the middle. Critical: no. Rounds still ended, but skill did not matter.\\n7. Check-in leaned the doll toward the wrong side of the target. Critical: yes. The Wobble Age came out of the wrong mean.\\n8. Check-in applied the calm margin twice. Critical: no. The stand test was stricter than the written one, but the day still finished.\\n\",\"total_lines\":10}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dc802037-9787-42e3-9544-6be7bc9bfc5e-57","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,95,95,120,50,57,98,52,100,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"dcb7032a-e39a-46eb-86c8-651b61ddef7c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_301","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The matrix requires all events to have a sharp mean of at least 85, an average of at least 40, and a clumsy score of at least 40.\n\nI'll run the test and fix failures as they appear. PLAN.md has no verification section.\n\nThe verification plan might be in the goal plan or under a different heading. The old sharp-score bug is already documented as fixed, so I won't double-count it.\n\nTwo new bugs were caught and fixed: an early finishCount latch and a keys window making L unreachable. These will be added to issues.md as bug 9.\n\nCairn latched its stone count on the first read while the pile was empty, so it always scored zero. Plate Spinners read key taps as a count inside 0.5s, making the slow band unreachable. The clumsy plate bot's wander was too small to leave the band, so every skill kept plates alive. These are bugs 10 and 11.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37f2f72d-477c-4148-acee-47ba86d7523b-58","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Verification","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PLAN.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37f2f72d-477c-4148-acee-47ba86d7523b-59","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Verification|test-full|launch","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37f2f72d-477c-4148-acee-47ba86d7523b-60","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node tools/test.mjs balance","description":"Run the full balance test group","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1911,"output_tokens":951,"cache_read_input_tokens":119040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"35218de3-fb9b-47b3-a7e1-48b4c1322da5"}
