{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_304","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The matrix failed on stillWater clumsy 14.\n\nThe test currently fails on the first assertion. I will modify it to collect all failures so every missed event is visible at once. Then I will run a diagnostic and fix the events.\n\nThe matrix is fast. All 126 events finished in 18 seconds. The first failure was stillWater clumsy. Poses and Cairn passed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-384a8e44-216d-4797-a159-426a79f5f70f-68","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/stillWater.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-384a8e44-216d-4797-a159-426a79f5f70f-69","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/matrix.mjs","content":"import { playBot, eventIds } from '../../../work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/lib.mjs';\n\nconst skills = ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'];\nconst totals = {};\nfor (const id of eventIds()) totals[id] = { sharp: [], average: [], clumsy: [] };\nfor (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\n  for (const skill of skills) {\n    for (const id of eventIds()) {\n      const t0 = Date.now();\n      const { state } = await playBot(id, { skill, seed });\n      const form = state.profile.best[id][1];\n      totals[id][skill].push(form);\n      const ms = Date.now() - t0;\n      if (!Number.isFinite(form)) console.log('NAN', id, skill, seed, ms);\n    }\n  }\n}\nconst mean = (list) => list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length;\nlet bad = 0;\nfor (const id of eventIds()) {\n  const s = mean(totals[id].sharp);\n  const a = mean(totals[id].average);\n  const c = mean(totals[id].clumsy);\n  const flags = [];\n  if (s < 85) flags.push('sharp');\n  if (a < 40) flags.push('avg');\n  if (c < 40) flags.push('clumsy');\n  if (flags.length) bad += 1;\n  console.log(\n    `${flags.length ? 'FAIL' : 'ok  '} ${id.padEnd(14)} sharp ${s.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  avg ${a.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  clumsy ${c.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  [${totals[id].sharp.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] [${totals[id].average.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] [${totals[id].clumsy.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] ${flags.join(',')}`,\n  );\n}\nconsole.log(bad ? `${bad} events missed` : 'all events in band');\nprocess.exit(bad ? 1 : 0);\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5453,"output_tokens":996,"cache_read_input_tokens":126464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"849bf8f7-d52c-41f5-98c3-4f4057b60e97"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-384a8e44-216d-4797-a159-426a79f5f70f-68","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\nimport { mean } from '../game/score.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { zone: 0.15, sway0: 0.07, sway1: 0.18, sneezes: 2, par: 100 },\\n  2: { zone: 0.12, sway0: 0.1, sway1: 0.22, sneezes: 3, par: 100 },\\n10→  3: { zone: 0.1, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.26, sneezes: 4, par: 100 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class StillWater extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'stillWater';\\n  static title = 'Still Water';\\n  static discipline = 'Stillness';\\n  static instructor = 'stillwater';\\n  static couch = false;\\n  static session = false;\\n20→  static can = 'Sit in the calm. When a sneeze is coming, flail to stifle it.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot chase the creatures. Leaving the calm sends them off.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'A wide calm, and two sneezes.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The calm shrinks. Three sneezes.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'A small calm, and four sneezes.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n30→    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.duration = opts.session ? 50 : 60;\\n    this.calm = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.inTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.warn = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.shove = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.stifled = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.arrivals = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n40→    const span = this.duration - 8;\\n    this.times = Array.from({ length: this.params.sneezes }, (_, n) => 8 + (span * (n + 0.5)) / this.params.sneezes);\\n    this.fired = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 18); }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    if (this.fired < this.times.length && this.t >= this.times[this.fired]) {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n50→        this.warn[i] = 1.2;\\n        this.stifled[i] = false;\\n      }\\n      this.fired += 1;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n60→        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      }\\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0 && input.flail && this.tryFlail(i)) this.stifled[i] = true;\\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0) {\\n        this.warn[i] = Math.max(0, this.warn[i] - dt);\\n        if (this.warn[i] === 0 && !this.stifled[i]) this.shove[i] = 0.3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const u = clamp(this.t / this.duration, 0, 1);\\n    const sway = lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u);\\n70→    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.45 }, (i) => {\\n      const s = this.sway(i, sway, 0.05);\\n      if (this.shove[i] > 0) {\\n        this.shove[i] = Math.max(0, this.shove[i] - dt);\\n        s.nx += 2.2;\\n      }\\n      return s;\\n    });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.states[i].fallen) {\\n80→        this.calm[i] = Math.max(0, this.calm[i] - dt / 8);\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n      const inside = Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= this.params.zone;\\n      if (inside) this.inTime[i] += dt;\\n      this.calm[i] = clamp(this.calm[i] + dt * (inside ? 1 / 30 : -1 / 8), 0, 1);\\n      const gates = [0.2, 0.4, 0.6, 0.8, 1];\\n      this.arrivals[i] = gates.filter((g) => this.calm[i] >= g - 1e-6).length;\\n    }\\n90→    if (this.t >= this.duration) this.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const share = this.inTime[i] / this.duration;\\n    const form = clamp(mean([share, this.calm[i]]) * 100, 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw: form, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% calm time · ${this.arrivals[i]} visitors`,\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n100→      calm: this.calm[i],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill) {\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\\n    const wish = correctWish(skill, { x: 0, y: 0 }, past, this.t, false, this.ph);\\n    const flail = this.warn[i] > 0.2 && this.warn[i] < 1.05 && !this.stifled[i];\\n110→    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, flail, breathe: false, hop: false };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\nimport { mean } from '../game/score.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { zone: 0.15, sway0: 0.07, sway1: 0.18, sneezes: 2, par: 100 },\\n  2: { zone: 0.12, sway0: 0.1, sway1: 0.22, sneezes: 3, par: 100 },\\n10→  3: { zone: 0.1, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.26, sneezes: 4, par: 100 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class StillWater extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'stillWater';\\n  static title = 'Still Water';\\n  static discipline = 'Stillness';\\n  static instructor = 'stillwater';\\n  static couch = false;\\n  static session = false;\\n20→  static can = 'Sit in the calm. When a sneeze is coming, flail to stifle it.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot chase the creatures. Leaving the calm sends them off.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'A wide calm, and two sneezes.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The calm shrinks. Three sneezes.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'A small calm, and four sneezes.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n30→    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.duration = opts.session ? 50 : 60;\\n    this.calm = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.inTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.warn = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.shove = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.stifled = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.arrivals = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n40→    const span = this.duration - 8;\\n    this.times = Array.from({ length: this.params.sneezes }, (_, n) => 8 + (span * (n + 0.5)) / this.params.sneezes);\\n    this.fired = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 18); }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    if (this.fired < this.times.length && this.t >= this.times[this.fired]) {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n50→        this.warn[i] = 1.2;\\n        this.stifled[i] = false;\\n      }\\n      this.fired += 1;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n60→        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      }\\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0 && input.flail && this.tryFlail(i)) this.stifled[i] = true;\\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0) {\\n        this.warn[i] = Math.max(0, this.warn[i] - dt);\\n        if (this.warn[i] === 0 && !this.stifled[i]) this.shove[i] = 0.3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const u = clamp(this.t / this.duration, 0, 1);\\n    const sway = lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u);\\n70→    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.45 }, (i) => {\\n      const s = this.sway(i, sway, 0.05);\\n      if (this.shove[i] > 0) {\\n        this.shove[i] = Math.max(0, this.shove[i] - dt);\\n        s.nx += 2.2;\\n      }\\n      return s;\\n    });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.states[i].fallen) {\\n80→        this.calm[i] = Math.max(0, this.calm[i] - dt / 8);\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n      const inside = Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= this.params.zone;\\n      if (inside) this.inTime[i] += dt;\\n      this.calm[i] = clamp(this.calm[i] + dt * (inside ? 1 / 30 : -1 / 8), 0, 1);\\n      const gates = [0.2, 0.4, 0.6, 0.8, 1];\\n      this.arrivals[i] = gates.filter((g) => this.calm[i] >= g - 1e-6).length;\\n    }\\n90→    if (this.t >= this.duration) this.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const share = this.inTime[i] / this.duration;\\n    const form = clamp(mean([share, this.calm[i]]) * 100, 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw: form, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% calm time · ${this.arrivals[i]} visitors`,\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n100→      calm: this.calm[i],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill) {\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\\n    const wish = correctWish(skill, { x: 0, y: 0 }, past, this.t, false, this.ph);\\n    const flail = this.warn[i] > 0.2 && this.warn[i] < 1.05 && !this.stifled[i];\\n110→    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, flail, breathe: false, hop: false };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/stillWater.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { correctWish, remember, recall } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\nimport { mean } from '../game/score.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { zone: 0.15, sway0: 0.07, sway1: 0.18, sneezes: 2, par: 100 },\\n  2: { zone: 0.12, sway0: 0.1, sway1: 0.22, sneezes: 3, par: 100 },\\n  3: { zone: 0.1, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.26, sneezes: 4, par: 100 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class StillWater extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'stillWater';\\n  static title = 'Still Water';\\n  static discipline = 'Stillness';\\n  static instructor = 'stillwater';\\n  static couch = false;\\n  static session = false;\\n  static can = 'Sit in the calm. When a sneeze is coming, flail to stifle it.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot chase the creatures. Leaving the calm sends them off.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'flail', 'breathe'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'A wide calm, and two sneezes.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'The calm shrinks. Three sneezes.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'A small calm, and four sneezes.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.duration = opts.session ? 50 : 60;\\n    this.calm = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.inTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.warn = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.shove = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.stifled = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.hist = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.arrivals = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    const span = this.duration - 8;\\n    this.times = Array.from({ length: this.params.sneezes }, (_, n) => 8 + (span * (n + 0.5)) / this.params.sneezes);\\n    this.fired = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 18); }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    if (this.fired < this.times.length && this.t >= this.times[this.fired]) {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n        this.warn[i] = 1.2;\\n        this.stifled[i] = false;\\n      }\\n      this.fired += 1;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      }\\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0 && input.flail && this.tryFlail(i)) this.stifled[i] = true;\\n      if (this.warn[i] > 0) {\\n        this.warn[i] = Math.max(0, this.warn[i] - dt);\\n        if (this.warn[i] === 0 && !this.stifled[i]) this.shove[i] = 0.3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const u = clamp(this.t / this.duration, 0, 1);\\n    const sway = lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u);\\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.45 }, (i) => {\\n      const s = this.sway(i, sway, 0.05);\\n      if (this.shove[i] > 0) {\\n        this.shove[i] = Math.max(0, this.shove[i] - dt);\\n        s.nx += 2.2;\\n      }\\n      return s;\\n    });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.states[i].fallen) {\\n        this.calm[i] = Math.max(0, this.calm[i] - dt / 8);\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n      const inside = Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= this.params.zone;\\n      if (inside) this.inTime[i] += dt;\\n      this.calm[i] = clamp(this.calm[i] + dt * (inside ? 1 / 30 : -1 / 8), 0, 1);\\n      const gates = [0.2, 0.4, 0.6, 0.8, 1];\\n      this.arrivals[i] = gates.filter((g) => this.calm[i] >= g - 1e-6).length;\\n    }\\n    if (this.t >= this.duration) this.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const share = this.inTime[i] / this.duration;\\n    const form = clamp(mean([share, this.calm[i]]) * 100, 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw: form, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% calm time · ${this.arrivals[i]} visitors`,\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n      calm: this.calm[i],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill) {\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\\n    const wish = correctWish(skill, { x: 0, y: 0 }, past, this.t, false, this.ph);\\n    const flail = this.warn[i] > 0.2 && this.warn[i] < 1.05 && !this.stifled[i];\\n    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, flail, breathe: false, hop: false };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":112}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-384a8e44-216d-4797-a159-426a79f5f70f-69","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"import { playBot, eventIds } from '../../../work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/lib.mjs';\\n\\nconst skills = ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'];\\nconst totals = {};\\nfor (const id of eventIds()) totals[id] = { sharp: [], average: [], clumsy: [] };\\nfor (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n  for (const skill of skills) {\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n      const t0 = Date.now();\\n      const { state } = await playBot(id, { skill, seed });\\n      const form = state.profile.best[id][1];\\n      totals[id][skill].push(form);\\n      const ms = Date.now() - t0;\\n      if (!Number.isFinite(form)) console.log('NAN', id, skill, seed, ms);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\nconst mean = (list) => list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length;\\nlet bad = 0;\\nfor (const id of eventIds()) {\\n  const s = mean(totals[id].sharp);\\n  const a = mean(totals[id].average);\\n  const c = mean(totals[id].clumsy);\\n  const flags = [];\\n  if (s < 85) flags.push('sharp');\\n  if (a < 40) flags.push('avg');\\n  if (c < 40) flags.push('clumsy');\\n  if (flags.length) bad += 1;\\n  console.log(\\n    `${flags.length ? 'FAIL' : 'ok  '} ${id.padEnd(14)} sharp ${s.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  avg ${a.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  clumsy ${c.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  [${totals[id].sharp.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] [${totals[id].average.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] [${totals[id].clumsy.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] ${flags.join(',')}`,\\n  );\\n}\\nconsole.log(bad ? `${bad} events missed` : 'all events in band');\\nprocess.exit(bad ? 1 : 0);\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/matrix.mjs has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/matrix.mjs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/matrix.mjs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"import { playBot, eventIds } from '../../../work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/lib.mjs';\\n\\nconst skills = ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'];\\nconst totals = {};\\nfor (const id of eventIds()) totals[id] = { sharp: [], average: [], clumsy: [] };\\nfor (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n  for (const skill of skills) {\\n    for (const id of eventIds()) {\\n      const t0 = Date.now();\\n      const { state } = await playBot(id, { skill, seed });\\n      const form = state.profile.best[id][1];\\n      totals[id][skill].push(form);\\n      const ms = Date.now() - t0;\\n      if (!Number.isFinite(form)) console.log('NAN', id, skill, seed, ms);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\nconst mean = (list) => list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length;\\nlet bad = 0;\\nfor (const id of eventIds()) {\\n  const s = mean(totals[id].sharp);\\n  const a = mean(totals[id].average);\\n  const c = mean(totals[id].clumsy);\\n  const flags = [];\\n  if (s < 85) flags.push('sharp');\\n  if (a < 40) flags.push('avg');\\n  if (c < 40) flags.push('clumsy');\\n  if (flags.length) bad += 1;\\n  console.log(\\n    `${flags.length ? 'FAIL' : 'ok  '} ${id.padEnd(14)} sharp ${s.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  avg ${a.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  clumsy ${c.toFixed(1).padStart(6)}  [${totals[id].sharp.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] [${totals[id].average.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] [${totals[id].clumsy.map((n) => n.toFixed(0)).join(',')}] ${flags.join(',')}`,\\n  );\\n}\\nconsole.log(bad ? `${bad} events missed` : 'all events in band');\\nprocess.exit(bad ? 1 : 0);\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"d5a4a58d-52c5-4470-b0d7-74179c1ccbc8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_305","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still water scoring is calculated as the mean of the zone share and calm meter, multiplied by 100.\n\nClumsy scored 14.6. The tight zone and high noise/delay likely kept it outside the target range. A missed flail triggers a 2.2 N·m shove for 0.3 s.\n\nThe bot flails on a fixed window rather than using reaction time. Both skills can flail during their sneezes because the cooldown is only 2 s and the gaps are 26 s. The skill difference is therefore balance correction quality.\n\nThe 0.15 zone equals roughly 2.7° of lean. Sharp’s delay and gain let it stay inside that narrow band, but clumsy’s slower correction and noise push it outside most of the time. The plan requires clumsy to score at least 40, so the matrix needs adjustment.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-893efe4a-8b94-42a2-b135-55243b6ac987-70","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Still Water|still water|calm","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-893efe4a-8b94-42a2-b135-55243b6ac987-71","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/lean.js","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-893efe4a-8b94-42a2-b135-55243b6ac987-72","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer && node matrix.mjs","description":"Print skill means for every Tier 1 event","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2711,"output_tokens":982,"cache_read_input_tokens":131840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c