\":1,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T08:18:24Z\",\"ended\":\"2026-11-05T08:18:45Z\",\"duration_secs\":20.242701471,\"output\":\"using deprecated parameters for the initialization function; pass a single object instead\\n(node:137783) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\nok   poses          sharp  100.0  avg   82.7  clumsy   52.0  [100,100,100] [83,83,83] [52,52,52] \\nok   cairn          sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy   66.6  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [67,67,67] \\nFAIL stillWater     sharp  100.0  avg   98.1  clumsy   14.6  [100,100,100] [98,98,98] [15,15,15] clumsy\\nFAIL logReps        sharp  100.0  avg   63.6  clumsy   30.3  [100,100,100] [64,64,64] [30,30,30] clumsy\\nok   plank          sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy  100.0  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [100,100,100] \\nok   tug            sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy  100.0  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [100,100,100] \\nok   stepClass      sharp  100.0  avg   94.3  clumsy   66.3  [100,100,100] [94,94,94] [66,66,66] \\nok   plates         sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy   53.3  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [53,53,53] \\nok   islandLoop     sharp   94.2  avg   77.5  clumsy   55.1  [94,94,94] [77,77,77] [55,55,55] \\nok   fruitHat       sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy   99.8  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [100,99,100] \\nok   roomService    sharp   92.2  avg   92.2  clumsy   92.2  [92,92,92] [92,92,92] [92,92,92] \\nok   springboard    sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy  100.0  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [100,100,100] \\nok   raft           sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy  100.0  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [100,100,100] \\nok   grandHold      sharp  100.0  avg  100.0  clumsy   85.0  [100,100,100] [100,100,100] [85,85,85] \\n2 events missed\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af