{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_307","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Two failures remain. The stillWater clumsy 14 test is one.\n\nThe second failure is logReps clumsy at 30.3, which must stay below 70 while the mean rises to at least 40. The matrix averages three seeds.\n\nI will read logReps.js to understand why clumsy logReps is stuck at 30. I also need to trace the stillWater oscillation: the plan expected 48, but clumsy is only 15. Form equals mean(share, calm)*100, which is 15.\n\nClumsy's longer delay and lower gain let sway build up to 0.18 N·m. Sharp's shorter delay and higher gain keep oscillation inside the zone. The ankle limit is 4.6 N·m.\n\nThe delayed wish is wrong. The ankle drives toward the wrong lean and adds to the sway. I will not change SKILLS. I may try low-passing the still water bot's wish or using gainLoad 0.45. The gain of 0.8 with delay may push the wish too hard when the cob was large 0.38 s ago but the doll has already returned.\n\nThe delayed proportional control is the root cause. Sharp's higher gain and shorter delay keep the system stable, while clumsy's lower gain and longer delay let sway grow unchecked.\n\nReducing sway would make the skill easier for sharp, but it would also erase the skill gap. The plan wants sharp at 100 and clumsy near 48, so the disturbance must stay strong enough to separate them.\n\nThe plan's 80% stillWater was measured against the bot's own delay and noise. Our physics may be more oscillatory than planned, so ignoring noise would not match the intended skill profile. Widening the calm zone to 0.15 would let a wobbling clumsy bot count as inside more often, but that would violate the plan's specified tier.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d7445dd2-dcd4-48f4-8575-1107695e642e-75","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/logReps.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d7445dd2-dcd4-48f4-8575-1107695e642e-76","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function formOf","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/score.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4917,"output_tokens":1255,"cache_read_input_tokens":137344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"71eaa246-540e-460c-9c3f-0360d56ef0b8"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d7445dd2-dcd4-48f4-8575-1107695e642e-75","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { difficultyOf, DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { reps: 6, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.04, tremor1: 0.12 },\\n  2: { reps: 9, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.06, tremor1: 0.16 },\\n10→  3: { reps: 12, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class LogReps extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'logReps';\\n  static title = 'Log Reps';\\n  static discipline = 'Strength';\\n  static instructor = 'bolster';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n20→  static can = 'Follow the ribbon with both feet and keep the dot near the middle.';\\n  static cant = 'The log is a number on your shoulders. Lean it past the notch and Coach has to catch it.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Six reps, then Coach lies about the last one.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Nine reps. The band is stricter.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Twelve reps. The band is strict.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n30→    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.offset = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repScore = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.bandTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.zoneTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repClock = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repIndex = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.lost = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n40→    this.dropped = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.lastRep = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\\n\\n  tempo() {\\n    const diff = difficultyOf(this.difficulty).rhythm;\\n    return getTune('repTempo') * diff;\\n  }\\n50→\\n  cycle() { return 5 / this.tempo(); }\\n\\n  ribbon(t) {\\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\\n    const u = (t % cycle) / cycle;\\n    const down = 2 / 5;\\n    const pause = 0.5 / 5;\\n    if (u < down) return u / down;\\n    if (u < down + pause) return 1;\\n60→    if (u < down + pause + down) return 1 - (u - down - pause) / down;\\n    return 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  totalReps() { return this.params.reps + 2; }\\n\\n  halfWidth(rep) {\\n    const base = lerp(0.16, 0.1, rep / this.params.reps);\\n    return Math.max(0.06, base - 0.02 * (this.tier - 1));\\n  }\\n70→\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      }\\n80→      const depth = ((input.feetL || 0) + (input.feetR || 0)) / 2;\\n      const target = this.ribbon(this.t);\\n      const rep = Math.min(this.totalReps() - 1, Math.floor(this.t / cycle));\\n      const band = this.halfWidth(rep);\\n      const cob = screenOf(state, 18);\\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        if (Math.abs(depth - target) <= band) this.bandTime[i] += dt;\\n        if (Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= 0.3) this.zoneTime[i] += dt;\\n        this.repClock[i] += dt;\\n      }\\n90→      const deg = Math.abs(state.leanX) / DEG;\\n      if (deg > 6) this.offset[i] += Math.sign(state.leanX || 1) * 0.05 * (deg - 6) * dt;\\n      else this.offset[i] *= Math.exp(-dt * 0.8);\\n      if (Math.abs(this.offset[i]) >= 0.5 && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        this.dropped[i] = true;\\n        this.lost[i] += 1;\\n        this.offset[i] = 0;\\n        this.dropBack = (this.dropBack || 0) + 1;\\n      }\\n      if (this.dropped[i]) {\\n100→        this.dropT = (this.dropT || 0) + dt;\\n        if (this.dropT > 0.6) {\\n          this.dropped[i] = false;\\n          this.dropT = 0;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const u = clamp(this.t / (this.totalReps() * cycle), 0, 1);\\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6 }, (i) => {\\n      const s = this.sway(i, lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u), lerp(this.params.tremor0, this.params.tremor1, u));\\n110→      s.nx += 0.06 * 9.81 * this.offset[i];\\n      return s;\\n    });\\n    const repNow = Math.floor(this.t / cycle);\\n    if (repNow > this.lastRep) {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n        const clock = Math.max(1e-4, this.repClock[i]);\\n        const bandShare = clamp(this.bandTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\\n        const zoneShare = clamp(this.zoneTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\\n        let score = bandShare * (0.5 + 0.5 * zoneShare);\\n120→        if (this.lastRep >= this.params.reps) score *= 2;\\n        if (this.lost[i]) score = 0;\\n        this.repScore[i].push(score);\\n        this.bandTime[i] = 0;\\n        this.zoneTime[i] = 0;\\n        this.repClock[i] = 0;\\n        this.lost[i] = 0;\\n      }\\n      this.lastRep = repNow;\\n    }\\n130→    if (this.t >= this.totalReps() * cycle) this.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const list = this.repScore[i];\\n    const raw = list.length ? list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length : 0;\\n    const form = clamp(raw * 100, 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${list.length} reps · the log stayed a number`,\\n140→      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill) {\\n    const late = skill?.delay ?? 0.16;\\n    const depth = this.ribbon(Math.max(0, this.t - late));\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n    const fix = (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7) * (0 - cob.x);\\n    return {\\n150→      x: clamp(fix, -0.4, 0.4),\\n      y: clamp(-cob.y * (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7), -0.4, 0.4),\\n      feetL: depth,\\n      feetR: depth,\\n      flail: false,\\n      hop: false,\\n      breathe: false,\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { difficultyOf, DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { reps: 6, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.04, tremor1: 0.12 },\\n  2: { reps: 9, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.06, tremor1: 0.16 },\\n10→  3: { reps: 12, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class LogReps extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'logReps';\\n  static title = 'Log Reps';\\n  static discipline = 'Strength';\\n  static instructor = 'bolster';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n20→  static can = 'Follow the ribbon with both feet and keep the dot near the middle.';\\n  static cant = 'The log is a number on your shoulders. Lean it past the notch and Coach has to catch it.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Six reps, then Coach lies about the last one.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Nine reps. The band is stricter.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Twelve reps. The band is strict.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n30→    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.offset = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repScore = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.bandTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.zoneTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repClock = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repIndex = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.lost = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n40→    this.dropped = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.lastRep = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\\n\\n  tempo() {\\n    const diff = difficultyOf(this.difficulty).rhythm;\\n    return getTune('repTempo') * diff;\\n  }\\n50→\\n  cycle() { return 5 / this.tempo(); }\\n\\n  ribbon(t) {\\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\\n    const u = (t % cycle) / cycle;\\n    const down = 2 / 5;\\n    const pause = 0.5 / 5;\\n    if (u < down) return u / down;\\n    if (u < down + pause) return 1;\\n60→    if (u < down + pause + down) return 1 - (u - down - pause) / down;\\n    return 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  totalReps() { return this.params.reps + 2; }\\n\\n  halfWidth(rep) {\\n    const base = lerp(0.16, 0.1, rep / this.params.reps);\\n    return Math.max(0.06, base - 0.02 * (this.tier - 1));\\n  }\\n70→\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      }\\n80→      const depth = ((input.feetL || 0) + (input.feetR || 0)) / 2;\\n      const target = this.ribbon(this.t);\\n      const rep = Math.min(this.totalReps() - 1, Math.floor(this.t / cycle));\\n      const band = this.halfWidth(rep);\\n      const cob = screenOf(state, 18);\\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        if (Math.abs(depth - target) <= band) this.bandTime[i] += dt;\\n        if (Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= 0.3) this.zoneTime[i] += dt;\\n        this.repClock[i] += dt;\\n      }\\n90→      const deg = Math.abs(state.leanX) / DEG;\\n      if (deg > 6) this.offset[i] += Math.sign(state.leanX || 1) * 0.05 * (deg - 6) * dt;\\n      else this.offset[i] *= Math.exp(-dt * 0.8);\\n      if (Math.abs(this.offset[i]) >= 0.5 && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        this.dropped[i] = true;\\n        this.lost[i] += 1;\\n        this.offset[i] = 0;\\n        this.dropBack = (this.dropBack || 0) + 1;\\n      }\\n      if (this.dropped[i]) {\\n100→        this.dropT = (this.dropT || 0) + dt;\\n        if (this.dropT > 0.6) {\\n          this.dropped[i] = false;\\n          this.dropT = 0;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const u = clamp(this.t / (this.totalReps() * cycle), 0, 1);\\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6 }, (i) => {\\n      const s = this.sway(i, lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u), lerp(this.params.tremor0, this.params.tremor1, u));\\n110→      s.nx += 0.06 * 9.81 * this.offset[i];\\n      return s;\\n    });\\n    const repNow = Math.floor(this.t / cycle);\\n    if (repNow > this.lastRep) {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n        const clock = Math.max(1e-4, this.repClock[i]);\\n        const bandShare = clamp(this.bandTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\\n        const zoneShare = clamp(this.zoneTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\\n        let score = bandShare * (0.5 + 0.5 * zoneShare);\\n120→        if (this.lastRep >= this.params.reps) score *= 2;\\n        if (this.lost[i]) score = 0;\\n        this.repScore[i].push(score);\\n        this.bandTime[i] = 0;\\n        this.zoneTime[i] = 0;\\n        this.repClock[i] = 0;\\n        this.lost[i] = 0;\\n      }\\n      this.lastRep = repNow;\\n    }\\n130→    if (this.t >= this.totalReps() * cycle) this.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const list = this.repScore[i];\\n    const raw = list.length ? list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length : 0;\\n    const form = clamp(raw * 100, 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${list.length} reps · the log stayed a number`,\\n140→      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill) {\\n    const late = skill?.delay ?? 0.16;\\n    const depth = this.ribbon(Math.max(0, this.t - late));\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n    const fix = (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7) * (0 - cob.x);\\n    return {\\n150→      x: clamp(fix, -0.4, 0.4),\\n      y: clamp(-cob.y * (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7), -0.4, 0.4),\\n      feetL: depth,\\n      feetR: depth,\\n      flail: false,\\n      hop: false,\\n      breathe: false,\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/logReps.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { difficultyOf, DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { screenOf, clamp, lerp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = {\\n  1: { reps: 6, sway0: 0.08, sway1: 0.22, tremor0: 0.04, tremor1: 0.12 },\\n  2: { reps: 9, sway0: 0.12, sway1: 0.3, tremor0: 0.06, tremor1: 0.16 },\\n  3: { reps: 12, sway0: 0.15, sway1: 0.38, tremor0: 0.08, tremor1: 0.2 },\\n};\\n\\nexport class LogReps extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'logReps';\\n  static title = 'Log Reps';\\n  static discipline = 'Strength';\\n  static instructor = 'bolster';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n  static can = 'Follow the ribbon with both feet and keep the dot near the middle.';\\n  static cant = 'The log is a number on your shoulders. Lean it past the notch and Coach has to catch it.';\\n  static verbs = ['weight', 'leftFoot', 'rightFoot'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'Six reps, then Coach lies about the last one.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Nine reps. The band is stricter.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Twelve reps. The band is strict.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.offset = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repScore = this.lanes.map(() => []);\\n    this.bandTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.zoneTime = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repClock = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.repIndex = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.lost = this.lanes.map(() => 0);\\n    this.ankleOverride = 6;\\n    this.dropped = this.lanes.map(() => false);\\n    this.lastRep = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  build() { this.buildWorld(8, 16); }\\n\\n  tempo() {\\n    const diff = difficultyOf(this.difficulty).rhythm;\\n    return getTune('repTempo') * diff;\\n  }\\n\\n  cycle() { return 5 / this.tempo(); }\\n\\n  ribbon(t) {\\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\\n    const u = (t % cycle) / cycle;\\n    const down = 2 / 5;\\n    const pause = 0.5 / 5;\\n    if (u < down) return u / down;\\n    if (u < down + pause) return 1;\\n    if (u < down + pause + down) return 1 - (u - down - pause) / down;\\n    return 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  totalReps() { return this.params.reps + 2; }\\n\\n  halfWidth(rep) {\\n    const base = lerp(0.16, 0.1, rep / this.params.reps);\\n    return Math.max(0.06, base - 0.02 * (this.tier - 1));\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt, inputs) {\\n    const cycle = this.cycle();\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n      const input = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const state = this.states[i];\\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        state.wishX = input.wishX || 0;\\n        state.wishZ = input.wishZ || 0;\\n      }\\n      const depth = ((input.feetL || 0) + (input.feetR || 0)) / 2;\\n      const target = this.ribbon(this.t);\\n      const rep = Math.min(this.totalReps() - 1, Math.floor(this.t / cycle));\\n      const band = this.halfWidth(rep);\\n      const cob = screenOf(state, 18);\\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        if (Math.abs(depth - target) <= band) this.bandTime[i] += dt;\\n        if (Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= 0.3) this.zoneTime[i] += dt;\\n        this.repClock[i] += dt;\\n      }\\n      const deg = Math.abs(state.leanX) / DEG;\\n      if (deg > 6) this.offset[i] += Math.sign(state.leanX || 1) * 0.05 * (deg - 6) * dt;\\n      else this.offset[i] *= Math.exp(-dt * 0.8);\\n      if (Math.abs(this.offset[i]) >= 0.5 && !this.dropped[i]) {\\n        this.dropped[i] = true;\\n        this.lost[i] += 1;\\n        this.offset[i] = 0;\\n        this.dropBack = (this.dropBack || 0) + 1;\\n      }\\n      if (this.dropped[i]) {\\n        this.dropT = (this.dropT || 0) + dt;\\n        if (this.dropT > 0.6) {\\n          this.dropped[i] = false;\\n          this.dropT = 0;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const u = clamp(this.t / (this.totalReps() * cycle), 0, 1);\\n    this.stepCores(dt, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6 }, (i) => {\\n      const s = this.sway(i, lerp(this.params.sway0, this.params.sway1, u), lerp(this.params.tremor0, this.params.tremor1, u));\\n      s.nx += 0.06 * 9.81 * this.offset[i];\\n      return s;\\n    });\\n    const repNow = Math.floor(this.t / cycle);\\n    if (repNow > this.lastRep) {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < this.lanes.length; i++) {\\n        const clock = Math.max(1e-4, this.repClock[i]);\\n        const bandShare = clamp(this.bandTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\\n        const zoneShare = clamp(this.zoneTime[i] / clock, 0, 1);\\n        let score = bandShare * (0.5 + 0.5 * zoneShare);\\n        if (this.lastRep >= this.params.reps) score *= 2;\\n        if (this.lost[i]) score = 0;\\n        this.repScore[i].push(score);\\n        this.bandTime[i] = 0;\\n        this.zoneTime[i] = 0;\\n        this.repClock[i] = 0;\\n        this.lost[i] = 0;\\n      }\\n      this.lastRep = repNow;\\n    }\\n    if (this.t >= this.totalReps() * cycle) this.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  result(i = 0) {\\n    const list = this.repScore[i];\\n    const raw = list.length ? list.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / list.length : 0;\\n    const form = clamp(raw * 100, 0, 100);\\n    return {\\n      form, raw, medal: medalOf(form),\\n      stats: `${list.length} reps · the log stayed a number`,\\n      falls: this.states[i].falls,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  botInput(i, skill) {\\n    const late = skill?.delay ?? 0.16;\\n    const depth = this.ribbon(Math.max(0, this.t - late));\\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\\n    const fix = (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7) * (0 - cob.x);\\n    return {\\n      x: clamp(fix, -0.4, 0.4),\\n      y: clamp(-cob.y * (skill?.gainLoad ?? 0.7), -0.4, 0.4),\\n      feetL: depth,\\n      feetR: depth,\\n      flail: false,\\n      hop: false,\\n      breathe: false,\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":159}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d7445dd2-dcd4-48f4-8575-1107695e642e-76","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,95,95,120,50,57,98,52,100,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,95,95,120,50,57,98,52,100,57,47,119,111,114,107,47,76,101,118,101,108,32,66,101,115,116,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,47,115,114,99,47,103,97,109,101,47,115,99,111,114,101,46,106,115,10,50,57,58,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,102,111,114,109,79,102,40,114,97,119,44,32,112,97,114,41,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":1,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/score.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":29,\"content\":\"export function formOf(raw, par) {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"ba189689-4285-438a-a97c-8b2a20bebef5"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_308","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ribbon scoring is a squat depth from 0 to 1 and back.\n\nThe bot follows the ribbon delayed by skill.delay. The band half-width shrinks from 0.16 to 0.1. Score per rep is bandShare times (0.5 + 0.5 * zoneShare). The zone is cob within 0.3. Bonus reps score double. A lost log scores zero for that rep. Form equals average rep scores times 100. The clumsy delay is 0.38 seconds. That is 0.19 of the down stroke on a 5-second cycle.\n\nThe 0.38-second delay sits outside the 0.16 band for most of the stroke. That explains the low form score. The plan requires clumsy log form to stay between 40 and 70. The bot only uses delay and gainLoad, not timingOffset or speedErr.\n\nThe delay alone causes the miss, with no timing noise. To lift clumsy form from 30 to about 50 without passing 70, the band could be widened slightly so the 0.38-second delay stays inside more often. Slowing the ribbon would also reduce depth error for the same delay. Anticipating the ribbon by less than the full delay is cheating. Weighting the pause more heavily in scoring is another option.\n\nWidening the band would raise both sharp and clumsy scores. Sharp is already 100, so it cannot go higher. The average could reach 80 or 100, and clumsy could rise to about 45. The test only requires average >= 40 and clumsy >= 40 and < 70, so widening the band until clumsy reaches roughly 50 is acceptable. I still need to determine the default repTempo.\n\nThe down stroke lasts 2/tempo seconds. Depth speed is tempo/2 units per second. Error equals delay times tempo over two. With default tempo one, the errors are 0.04 for sharp, 0.065 for average, and 0.19 for clumsy. The moving portion of the cycle is four-fifths. The clumsy delay always exceeds the shrinking band during that motion.\n\nThe band is only inside during the pauses and the very start of each stroke. With tempo one, the 0.16 band covers about 0.32 seconds per stroke, or 0.64 seconds across both strokes. That is a tiny fraction of the moving portion, so the clumsy delay spends almost all its time outside the band.\n\nThe math checks out. The 0.38-second delay sits inside the band for only about 33 percent of the cycle, so the clumsy score is roughly 0.30. The sharp delay stays inside the whole time, giving a score of 1.0. The average delay is inside early reps but outside later ones, yielding a score near 0.64.\n\nA band half-width of 0.22 would place the clumsy delay inside the entire stroke, pushing form to 100 and exceeding the 70 cap. The target range is roughly 50 to 60, which requires a bandShare near 0.5 to 0.6. Currently the bandShare is only about 0.30.\n\nThe delayed signal lags by a constant depth error once the stroke begins. The bot stays inside the band only during the initial portion of each stroke, before that fixed lag exceeds the shrinking half-width.\n\nThe pause mechanics are too messy to calculate precisely. I will widen the band slightly and remeasure. The current lerp runs from 0.16 to 0.1. A new lerp starting at 0.22 might push clumsy form above 80.\n\nThe band is a hard threshold. If the minimum half-width stays below the 0.19 steady error, the bot only scores the ramp-in. Widening the band modestly increases that window slightly, but it cannot push the cruise portion inside without pushing the score above 70.\n\nA linear band scale from 0.13 to 0.22 would push the score above 70, so that shortcut is impossible. The bot must instead widen the band just enough to lengthen the ramp-in window without crossing the cruise threshold. The clumsy zoneShare is only 0.3 because their gainLoad of 0.45 produces weak lean correction.\n\nThe zone share is actually about 1.0, not 0.3. The lean correction is working perfectly. The only remaining problem is the foot band, which misses the delayed ribbon during the cruise portion of each stroke.\n\nA hard inside-or-outside band would push the score to 100 once the delay exceeds the minimum half-width. The plan is to replace that binary threshold with a continuous graded error. Depth would be scored as one minus the absolute error divided by twice the band, clamped between zero and one. This gives partial credit when the delayed ribbon sits near the target but outside the strict margin.\n\nA fully graded depth score would drop sharp form from 100 to about 70, violating the 85 minimum. The revised plan keeps a hard inside-or-outside band: full credit when the delayed ribbon sits within the margin, partial credit only when it sits outside.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ae30517-ec92-477a-b741-0086f3ebbfab-77","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Log Reps|log rep|ribbon|halfWidth|band","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3458,"output_tokens":2909,"cache_read_input_tokens":142208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"1cb075df-14b8-4aeb-ba24-360744f4c09c"}
