{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_318","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Form 60 is produced with x at 0.08, gain at 0.55, and noise at zero.\n\nSharp and average forms score 100 and 92. Clumsy form scores 61. All are above 40. These values need verification through the actual bot path after implementation.\n\nDirect probe results match the director path for still water, confirming direct testing is reliable. Now writing the `stillWater.botInput` method.\n\nThe `stillWater.botInput` method is now complete. It scales noise to amplitude, generates a goal position from sine waves, and caps gain at 0.55. A sharp skill with gain 1.4 was tested and scored 100.\n\nThe gain cap of 0.55 might break sharp's zone hold because the probe used full gain. Sharp with zero noise and goal should still score 100. Average gain drops to 0.55, yielding amplitude 0.034. A quick test of sharp at gain 0.55 will confirm.\n\nThe gain cap is being replaced with a conditional rule. Gain stays at 0.55 only when noise exceeds 0.05; otherwise it uses the original gain. Sharp keeps its full gain of 1.4, average keeps 1.0, and clumsy drops to 0.55. This preserves the original high score for average while still limiting noisy skills.\n\nThe fast noise term is the only one that resonates. Average should score near 98 still, but a small wander with full gain might lower it, so playBot will verify. Reps will be logged for shoulder events. Both changes will be tested across three skills using one seed since prior scores were identical across seeds. The reps logic is being added to fixed() scoring.\n\nThe scoring formula now weights bandTime by depthHit instead of a flat dt. Near misses add partial time. A rough estimate puts clumsy cruise form at about 63, below the 70 threshold.\n\nDouble-counting the last two shoulder reps would push the mean form to 79, above the 70 threshold. The base score per rep must be lowered so the doubled reps still land around 50–60. A target of roughly 0.44 per rep before doubling achieves that.\n\nThe shoulder band is fixed at 0.09 instead of the zone width. Cruise hit becomes 0.33, and the depthHit formula uses a clamp of 1 - (err - band) / 0.09.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Clumsy guests ring the pond because fast hand-noise feeds the delayed correction, and a late log rep is scored as a total miss. I'll calm the pond wander and give a near-miss partial credit."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fda90452-0614-48f7-a389-95557cd9edeb-88","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/stillWater.js","old_string":"  botInput(i, skill) {\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\n    const wish = correctWish(skill, { x: 0, y: 0 }, past, this.t, false, this.ph);\n    const flail = this.warn[i] > 0.2 && this.warn[i] < 1.05 && !this.stifled[i];\n    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, flail, breathe: false, hop: false };\n  }","new_string":"  botInput(i, skill) {\n    const cob = screenOf(this.states[i], 18);\n    remember(this.hist[i], this.t, cob);\n    const past = recall(this.hist[i], this.t - (skill?.delay ?? 0.16));\n    // The fast noise term rings against a delayed correction and throws the pose out of the pond.\n    // Wander the aim slowly, in proportion to that noise, and correct without the buzz.\n    const amp = (skill?.noise ?? 0) * (0.08 / 0.07);\n    const goal = {\n      x: amp * Math.sin(this.t * 0.5 + this.ph),\n      y: amp * 0.6 * Math.sin(this.t * 0.37 + this.ph + 1.2),\n    };\n    const steady = { ...skill, noise: 0, gain: (skill?.noise ?? 0) > 0.05 ? 0.55 : skill?.gain };\n    const wish = correctWish(steady, goal, past, this.t, false, this.ph);\n    const flail = this.warn[i] > 0.2 && this.warn[i] < 1.05 && !this.stifled[i];\n    return { x: wish.x, y: wish.y, flail, breathe: false, hop: false };\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fda90452-0614-48f7-a389-95557cd9edeb-89","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/logReps.js","old_string":"      const depth = ((input.feetL || 0) + (input.feetR || 0)) / 2;\n      const target = this.ribbon(this.t);\n      const rep = Math.min(this.totalReps() - 1, Math.floor(this.t / cycle));\n      const band = this.halfWidth(rep);\n      const cob = screenOf(state, 18);\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\n        if (Math.abs(depth - target) <= band) this.bandTime[i] += dt;\n        if (Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= 0.3) this.zoneTime[i] += dt;","new_string":"      const depth = ((input.feetL || 0) + (input.feetR || 0)) / 2;\n      const target = this.ribbon(this.t);\n      const rep = Math.min(this.totalReps() - 1, Math.floor(this.t / cycle));\n      const band = this.halfWidth(rep);\n      const cob = screenOf(state, 18);\n      if (!state.fallen && !this.dropped[i]) {\n        const err = Math.abs(depth - target);\n        const depthHit = err <= band ? 1 : clamp(1 - (err - band) / 0.08, 0, 1);\n        this.bandTime[i] += dt * depthHit;\n        if (Math.hypot(cob.x, cob.y) <= 0.3) this.zoneTime[i] += dt;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":590,"output_tokens":3049,"cache_read_input_tokens":166144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"2b2e803d-a469-4990-8c2e-20d8f2464397"}
