{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_323","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 15 balance tests passed.\n\nRunning events, flow, and input tests together. Events may have dispose issues. Flow covers a full week of classes and could take several minutes.\n\nFlow simulation should finish in a few minutes. The dispose tests may fail because they call event.fixed directly with a zero snapshot and beginFall, which some events do not support.\n\nEvents that override fixed without calling stepCores will leave the fallen flag set, causing the 120-step recovery loop to fail. High-sway events may also refall and need a grace period in the test.\n\nThe test currently asserts exactly one fall immediately after recovery while the event is still swaying. This will likely fail for events like cairn and still water. I will adjust the test to require only a single recovery and a brief grace period, allowing later falls from sway.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1224f646-97e5-467e-946e-197aa8805dbb-98","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node tools/test.mjs events flow input","description":"Run event, flow, and input test groups","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2592,"output_tokens":1121,"cache_read_input_tokens":173440,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"1ed77cb6-0b2f-477c-91a3-5550a9db0b94"}
