{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_344","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cairn does not drop stones while fallen.\n\nThe stone check runs before stepCores during recovery. The loop exits immediately after recovery, so no extra stones spawn.\n\nThe old test compared against bodiesAtBuild before build props were added. The new test also passes. I will apply all edits and run tests. The flow attract wall clock test passed despite the bug because advance(10) processes many fixed steps in one call.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-79736b88-bb30-42a3-96b8-968469f96e99-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","offset":40,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1049,"output_tokens":1111,"cache_read_input_tokens":75648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"ad96cbd1-a173-4809-b2df-10e7e1faf51a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-79736b88-bb30-42a3-96b8-968469f96e99-40","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"40→}\\n\\nfunction defaultSettings() {\\n  return {\\n    music: 10, sfx: 80, voice: 80, glyphs: 'playstation', rumble: true,\\n    autoBreathe: false, rhythmOffset: 0, uiScale: 1, ink: 1, reduceShake: false,\\n    difficulty: 'standard',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n50→export async function createGame(opts = {}) {\\n  await initRapier();\\n  const storage = opts.storage || (opts.window && opts.window.localStorage) || memoryStorage();\\n  const doc = opts.document || null;\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  const pads = [0, 1, 2, 3].map(() => makePad());\\n  let padSource = () => pads;\\n  const inputs = [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => {\\n    const input = createInput();\\n    input.setPadSource(() => padSource());\\n60→    input.setPadIndex(i);\\n    input.setDevice('pad');\\n    return input;\\n  });\\n  const profile = freshProfile();\\n  const settings = defaultSettings();\\n  const saved = readSave(storage, SAVE_KEY);\\n  if (saved) {\\n    Object.assign(profile, saved.profile);\\n    Object.assign(settings, saved.settings);\\n70→  }\\n  let screen = 'title';\\n  let focus = 0;\\n  let page = 0;\\n  let idle = 0;\\n  let attract = null;\\n  let event = null;\\n  let eventId = null;\\n  let tier = 1;\\n  let paused = false;\",\"content_concise\":\"40→}\\n\\nfunction defaultSettings() {\\n  return {\\n    music: 10, sfx: 80, voice: 80, glyphs: 'playstation', rumble: true,\\n    autoBreathe: false, rhythmOffset: 0, uiScale: 1, ink: 1, reduceShake: false,\\n    difficulty: 'standard',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n50→export async function createGame(opts = {}) {\\n  await initRapier();\\n  const storage = opts.storage || (opts.window && opts.window.localStorage) || memoryStorage();\\n  const doc = opts.document || null;\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  const pads = [0, 1, 2, 3].map(() => makePad());\\n  let padSource = () => pads;\\n  const inputs = [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => {\\n    const input = createInput();\\n    input.setPadSource(() => padSource());\\n60→    input.setPadIndex(i);\\n    input.setDevice('pad');\\n    return input;\\n  });\\n  const profile = freshProfile();\\n  const settings = defaultSettings();\\n  const saved = readSave(storage, SAVE_KEY);\\n  if (saved) {\\n    Object.assign(profile, saved.profile);\\n    Object.assign(settings, saved.settings);\\n70→  }\\n  let screen = 'title';\\n  let focus = 0;\\n  let page = 0;\\n  let idle = 0;\\n  let attract = null;\\n  let event = null;\\n  let eventId = null;\\n  let tier = 1;\\n  let paused = false;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\",\"offset\":40,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"}\\n\\nfunction defaultSettings() {\\n  return {\\n    music: 10, sfx: 80, voice: 80, glyphs: 'playstation', rumble: true,\\n    autoBreathe: false, rhythmOffset: 0, uiScale: 1, ink: 1, reduceShake: false,\\n    difficulty: 'standard',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport async function createGame(opts = {}) {\\n  await initRapier();\\n  const storage = opts.storage || (opts.window && opts.window.localStorage) || memoryStorage();\\n  const doc = opts.document || null;\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  const pads = [0, 1, 2, 3].map(() => makePad());\\n  let padSource = () => pads;\\n  const inputs = [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => {\\n    const input = createInput();\\n    input.setPadSource(() => padSource());\\n    input.setPadIndex(i);\\n    input.setDevice('pad');\\n    return input;\\n  });\\n  const profile = freshProfile();\\n  const settings = defaultSettings();\\n  const saved = readSave(storage, SAVE_KEY);\\n  if (saved) {\\n    Object.assign(profile, saved.profile);\\n    Object.assign(settings, saved.settings);\\n  }\\n  let screen = 'title';\\n  let focus = 0;\\n  let page = 0;\\n  let idle = 0;\\n  let attract = null;\\n  let event = null;\\n  let eventId = null;\\n  let tier = 1;\\n  let paused = false;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1318}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"a1c42dd1-300f-401c-933e-27d40863e574"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_345","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The seven failures come from four code bugs and one test that counted props as leaked bodies. I am patching those now."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-313a1c1e-173c-4c0a-a54d-8c733b9c0e2a-41","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"    if (attract) {\n      const sample = input.poll(dt, 'menu');\n      const travel = input.takeTravel();\n      if (woke(sample, travel)) { stopAttract(true); return; }\n      stepAttract(dt);\n      return;\n    }","new_string":"    if (attract) {\n      const sample = input.poll(dt, 'menu');\n      const travel = input.takeTravel();\n      if (woke(sample, travel)) { stopAttract(true); return; }\n      stepAttract(dt);\n      // The demo writes the same pads a person would. Clear them after the\n      // snapshot so the next wake poll does not treat the bot stick as a person.\n      for (const pad of pads) clearPad(pad);\n      return;\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-313a1c1e-173c-4c0a-a54d-8c733b9c0e2a-42","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"    pointer(x, y, buttons = 0) { inputs[0].pointerMove(x, y, buttons); if (buttons) inputs[0].pointerButtons(buttons, x, y); },","new_string":"    pointer(x, y, buttons = 0) { inputs[0].pointerButtons(buttons, x, y); },"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-313a1c1e-173c-4c0a-a54d-8c733b9c0e2a-43","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/input/input.js","old_string":"  let stickMenu = 0;\n  let createHeld = false;","new_string":"  let stickMenu = 0;\n  let prevStickX = 0;\n  let prevStickY = 0;\n  let createHeld = false;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-313a1c1e-173c-4c0a-a54d-8c733b9c0e2a-44","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/input/input.js","old_string":"    if (pad && pad.mapping === 'standard') {\n      stickX = pad.axes?.[0] || 0;\n      stickY = pad.axes?.[1] || 0;\n      const mag = Math.hypot(stickX, stickY);\n      if (mag > 0.25) {\n        stickActive = true;\n        markDevice('pad');\n      }","new_string":"    if (pad && pad.mapping === 'standard') {\n      stickX = pad.axes?.[0] || 0;\n      stickY = pad.axes?.[1] || 0;\n      const mag = Math.hypot(stickX, stickY);\n      const delta = Math.hypot(stickX - prevStickX, stickY - prevStickY);\n      prevStickX = stickX;\n      prevStickY = stickY;\n      if (mag > 0.25) {\n        stickActive = true;\n        // A parked stick must not steal the last device from a newer key.\n        if (delta > 0.05) markDevice('pad');\n      }\n      if (mode === 'menu') {\n        wish.x = stickX;\n        wish.y = -stickY;\n      }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-313a1c1e-173c-4c0a-a54d-8c733b9c0e2a-45","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/input/input.js","old_string":"    } else {\n      rawL = keys.has('KeyQ') || (pointer.buttons & 1) ? 1 : 0;\n      rawR = keys.has('KeyE') || (pointer.buttons & 2) ? 1 : 0;\n    }","new_string":"    } else {\n      prevStickX = 0;\n      prevStickY = 0;\n      rawL = keys.has('KeyQ') || (pointer.buttons & 1) ? 1 : 0;\n      rawR = keys.has('KeyE') || (pointer.buttons & 2) ? 1 : 0;\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-313a1c1e-173c-4c0a-a54d-8c733b9c0e2a-46","nam