{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_363","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"RoundedBoxGeometry imports from the 'three' library.\n\nBundling both core and webgpu versions of three.js creates duplicate copies, which breaks instanceof checks. The standard fix is to alias the exact `three` package to `three.webgpu.js`, but esbuild aliases match by prefix rather than exact name.\n\nA custom esbuild plugin using `onResolve` with regex filters can bypass the prefix alias issue. It maps `three`, `three/webgpu`, `three/tsl`, and `three/addons/` to their respective build paths.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a753f38f-ea5d-45e6-a9c7-42cbf70b54be-95","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/node_modules/three/build/three.webgpu.js","limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a753f38f-ea5d-45e6-a9c7-42cbf70b54be-96","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/node_modules/three/build/three.tsl.js","limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a753f38f-ea5d-45e6-a9c7-42cbf70b54be-97","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^import |from ['\\\"]","glob":"**/three/build/three.webgpu.js","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2193,"output_tokens":912,"cache_read_input_tokens":136576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"f567780c-4b06-47a7-b0ed-1523983dede9"}
