{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5147da42-17f0-4500-aa01-30592d28a35a-108","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1275→    },\\n    onFrame(fn) { listeners.add(fn); return () => listeners.delete(fn); },\\n    audio,\\n    profile,\\n    tilt: tiltRad,\\n1280→    persist,\\n    loop,\\n    input: inputs[0],\\n    inputs,\\n    runStandalone() { audio.play('title'); paint(); },\\n    runSession(info) {\\n      session = { info, slots: [], slot: -1, parts: [], total: 0, best: 'Attended', lastProgress: -1, lastGhost: -1, sent: false, playT: 0, ghosts: [] };\\n      setSessionMode(true);\\n      const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n      const deal = hub.rng('deal');\\n1290→      const pool = SESSION_SET.slice();\\n      while (session.slots.length < 3 && pool.length) {\\n        session.slots.push(pool.splice(Math.floor(deal() * pool.length), 1)[0]);\\n      }\\n      hub.on('card', () => { screen = 'card'; paint(); });\\n      hub.on('start', () => { session.started = true; });\\n      hub.on('time-up', () => sendResult());\\n      hub.on('end', () => { locked = true; audio.stop(); });\\n      hub.on('leave', (msg) => { session.ghosts = session.ghosts.filter((g) => g.id !== msg.id); });\\n      hub.on('message', (data, from) => {\\n1300→        if (!data || data.t !== 'g') return;\\n        const id = from == null ? 0 : from;\\n        session.ghosts = session.ghosts.filter((g) => g.id !== id);\\n        session.ghosts.push({ ...data, id });\\n      });\\n      const onKey = (e) => {\\n        if (locked || session.started) return;\\n        if (e.key === 'Enter') hub.answer('ready');\\n        if (e.key === 'm' || e.key === 'M') hub.answer('more');\\n      };\\n1310→      if (opts.window) opts.window.addEventListener('keydown', onKey);\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      hub.ready();\\n      paint();\\n    },\\n    activate,\\n    errors,\\n    TITLE,\\n  };\\n}\\n1320→\\nfunction clampNum(n, a, b) { return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, n)); }\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1275→    },\\n    onFrame(fn) { listeners.add(fn); return () => listeners.delete(fn); },\\n    audio,\\n    profile,\\n    tilt: tiltRad,\\n1280→    persist,\\n    loop,\\n    input: inputs[0],\\n    inputs,\\n    runStandalone() { audio.play('title'); paint(); },\\n    runSession(info) {\\n      session = { info, slots: [], slot: -1, parts: [], total: 0, best: 'Attended', lastProgress: -1, lastGhost: -1, sent: false, playT: 0, ghosts: [] };\\n      setSessionMode(true);\\n      const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n      const deal = hub.rng('deal');\\n1290→      const pool = SESSION_SET.slice();\\n      while (session.slots.length < 3 && pool.length) {\\n        session.slots.push(pool.splice(Math.floor(deal() * pool.length), 1)[0]);\\n      }\\n      hub.on('card', () => { screen = 'card'; paint(); });\\n      hub.on('start', () => { session.started = true; });\\n      hub.on('time-up', () => sendResult());\\n      hub.on('end', () => { locked = true; audio.stop(); });\\n      hub.on('leave', (msg) => { session.ghosts = session.ghosts.filter((g) => g.id !== msg.id); });\\n      hub.on('message', (data, from) => {\\n1300→        if (!data || data.t !== 'g') return;\\n        const id = from == null ? 0 : from;\\n        session.ghosts = session.ghosts.filter((g) => g.id !== id);\\n        session.ghosts.push({ ...data, id });\\n      });\\n      const onKey = (e) => {\\n        if (locked || session.started) return;\\n        if (e.key === 'Enter') hub.answer('ready');\\n        if (e.key === 'm' || e.key === 'M') hub.answer('more');\\n      };\\n1310→      if (opts.window) opts.window.addEventListener('keydown', onKey);\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      hub.ready();\\n      paint();\\n    },\\n    activate,\\n    errors,\\n    TITLE,\\n  };\\n}\\n1320→\\nfunction clampNum(n, a, b) { return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, n)); }\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\",\"offset\":1275,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"    },\\n    onFrame(fn) { listeners.add(fn); return () => listeners.delete(fn); },\\n    audio,\\n    profile,\\n    tilt: tiltRad,\\n    persist,\\n    loop,\\n    input: inputs[0],\\n    inputs,\\n    runStandalone() { audio.play('title'); paint(); },\\n    runSession(info) {\\n      session = { info, slots: [], slot: -1, parts: [], total: 0, best: 'Attended', lastProgress: -1, lastGhost: -1, sent: false, playT: 0, ghosts: [] };\\n      setSessionMode(true);\\n      const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n      const deal = hub.rng('deal');\\n      const pool = SESSION_SET.slice();\\n      while (session.slots.length < 3 && pool.length) {\\n        session.slots.push(pool.splice(Math.floor(deal() * pool.length), 1)[0]);\\n      }\\n      hub.on('card', () => { screen = 'card'; paint(); });\\n      hub.on('start', () => { session.started = true; });\\n      hub.on('time-up', () => sendResult());\\n      hub.on('end', () => { locked = true; audio.stop(); });\\n      hub.on('leave', (msg) => { session.ghosts = session.ghosts.filter((g) => g.id !== msg.id); });\\n      hub.on('message', (data, from) => {\\n        if (!data || data.t !== 'g') return;\\n        const id = from == null ? 0 : from;\\n        session.ghosts = session.ghosts.filter((g) => g.id !== id);\\n        session.ghosts.push({ ...data, id });\\n      });\\n      const onKey = (e) => {\\n        if (locked || session.started) return;\\n        if (e.key === 'Enter') hub.answer('ready');\\n        if (e.key === 'm' || e.key === 'M') hub.answer('more');\\n      };\\n      if (opts.window) opts.window.addEventListener('keydown', onKey);\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      hub.ready();\\n      paint();\\n    },\\n    activate,\\n    errors,\\n    TITLE,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nfunction clampNum(n, a, b) { return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, n)); }\\n\",\"total_lines\":1321}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"1244af77-5b2c-4346-86fc-11ed6abfebba"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_372","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The keyboard listener is only added in runSession for hub card answers.\n\nThe standalone game lacks DOM-level keyboard, mouse, and gamepad listeners. This blocks real interaction and will break browser tests that rely on keydown events. I need to wire DOM events into main.js or the director to handle key presses, pointer movement, and button presses.\n\nThe director's padSource only returns virtual gamepad stubs. Real navigator.getGamepads() data is never read. Keyboard and mouse events must be wired to call inputs[0].keyDown, keyUp, and pointerButtons directly.\n\nThe game currently never calls navigator.getGamepads(). The plan is to replace that API with an init script returning window.__pads, which the game will read and merge with its virtual stubs. I am now drafting DOM listeners in main.js for keyboard input.\n\nThe DOM listener draft now covers keydown, keyup, pointermove, pointerdown, and pointerup. Pointer events will call game.pointer with clientX, clientY, and e.buttons. The pad source is being wired to read navigator.getGamepads() directly.\n\nThe pad source fallback to virtual pads is problematic. Those stubs are always connected, so the game assumes four pads are present even without hardware. This could interfere with wake detection.\n\nZero-stick pads are harmless for menus and markDevice. The pad source should prefer window.__pads over navigator.getGamepads() and the virtual stubs. Bots write to game.pads, so a null navigator result does not break them.\n\nThe browser hub harness only pokes keys, not gamepads. Both the node test path and the browser test path must therefore work. The pad source needs to read navigator.getGamepads() directly so that init-script stubs are respected.\n\nThe pad source will prefer navigator.getGamepads() over virtual stubs. Node tests lack that API, so they fall back to game.pads. In the browser, null entries from getGamepads() also fall through to game.pads, preserving bot behavior. A real connected pad will replace its virtual counterpart.\n\nThe pad source will be implemented as a `livePads()` function that checks `window.__pads` first, then `navigator.getGamepads()`, and falls back to virtual stubs. The hub harness dispatches keydown events directly into the iframe, so wiring keyboard listeners to call `game.key` will let those pokes drive the game during sessions.\n\nA global keydown listener would collide with the card-phase onKey in runSession. Enter currently answers ready during the card phase, but a global handler would also fire game.key('Enter') and confirm menus. The harness pokes Arrow keys, WASD, and Enter during play, so both listeners must be reconciled.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3ab0d55d-3e09-4746-a559-4289e808026d-109","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function sessionFixed|screen === 'card'|answer\\(","glob":"**/director.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":681,"output_tokens":1587,"cache_read_input_tokens":150144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"a53f4376-3edb-445a-ab1c-6ae19cde3b16"}
