{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3099cf68-ec51-4a81-bb96-2e2958c1b452-110","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"760→      if (pad && pad.buttons[1] && pad.buttons[1].pressed) group.seats[i] = null;\\n    }\\n    if (sample.edges.confirm && !group.seats.some((s) => s && s.device === 'key')) {\\n      const slot = group.seats.findIndex((s) => !s);\\n      if (slot >= 0) {\\n        group.seats[slot] = { name: profile.name, device: 'key' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return used;\\n770→  }\\n\\n  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n780→      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000;\\n    if (t < 0) {\\n      screen = 'countdown';\\n      countLeft = Math.max(0, -t);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const slot = Math.min(session.slots.length, Math.floor(t / 62));\\n790→    const local = t - slot * 62;\\n    if (slot >= session.slots.length) {\\n      screen = 'waiting';\\n      sendResult();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.slot !== slot) {\\n      session.slot = slot;\\n      session.playT = 0;\\n      if (event) event.dispose();\\n800→      event = null;\\n      eventId = session.slots[slot];\\n    }\\n    if (local < 6) {\\n      screen = 'intro';\\n      session.scoreShown = session.total;\\n    } else if (local < 56) {\\n      if (!event) {\\n        startEvent(eventId, { session: true, lanes: [{ id: 0, kind: 'local', name: profile.name, colour: SEAT_COLOURS[hub.me || 0] }] });\\n        screen = 'play';\\n810→      }\\n      const input = inputs[0];\\n      let snaps;\\n      if (botSkill) snaps = driveBots(dt);\\n      else {\\n        input.poll(dt, 'balance');\\n        snaps = [input.snapshot(0)];\\n      }\\n      stepEvent(dt, snaps);\\n      session.playT += dt;\\n820→      if (event && (event.done || local >= 55.9)) {\\n        const result = event.result(0);\\n        session.parts.push(Math.round((result.form || 0) * 10));\\n        session.total = session.parts.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n        session.best = medalLabel(result.medal || 'attended');\\n        event.dispose();\\n        event = null;\\n        screen = 'results';\\n      } else screen = 'play';\\n    } else screen = 'results';\\n830→    if (t - session.lastProgress >= 1 || session.lastProgress < 0) {\\n      const label = `${eventTitle(session.slots[slot])} ${session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total}`.slice(0, 24);\\n      const score = session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total;\\n      hub.progress({ score, label });\\n      session.lastProgress = t;\\n    }\\n    if (t - session.lastGhost >= 0.1) {\\n      const lean = event && event.states ? event.states[0] : { leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, fallen: false };\\n      hub.send({\\n        t: 'g', a: slot, x: 0, z: 0,\\n840→        lx: Number((lean.leanX || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        lz: Number((lean.leanZ || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        c: 0, f: lean.fallen ? 1 : 0, s: session.total,\\n      }, { reliable: false });\\n      session.lastGhost = t;\\n    }\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sendResult() {\",\"content_concise\":\"760→      if (pad && pad.buttons[1] && pad.buttons[1].pressed) group.seats[i] = null;\\n    }\\n    if (sample.edges.confirm && !group.seats.some((s) => s && s.device === 'key')) {\\n      const slot = group.seats.findIndex((s) => !s);\\n      if (slot >= 0) {\\n        group.seats[slot] = { name: profile.name, device: 'key' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return used;\\n770→  }\\n\\n  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n780→      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000;\\n    if (t < 0) {\\n      screen = 'countdown';\\n      countLeft = Math.max(0, -t);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const slot = Math.min(session.slots.length, Math.floor(t / 62));\\n790→    const local = t - slot * 62;\\n    if (slot >= session.slots.length) {\\n      screen = 'waiting';\\n      sendResult();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.slot !== slot) {\\n      session.slot = slot;\\n      session.playT = 0;\\n      if (event) event.dispose();\\n800→      event = null;\\n      eventId = session.slots[slot];\\n    }\\n    if (local < 6) {\\n      screen = 'intro';\\n      session.scoreShown = session.total;\\n    } else if (local < 56) {\\n      if (!event) {\\n        startEvent(eventId, { session: true, lanes: [{ id: 0, kind: 'local', name: profile.name, colour: SEAT_COLOURS[hub.me || 0] }] });\\n        screen = 'play';\\n810→      }\\n      const input = inputs[0];\\n      let snaps;\\n      if (botSkill) snaps = driveBots(dt);\\n      else {\\n        input.poll(dt, 'balance');\\n        snaps = [input.snapshot(0)];\\n      }\\n      stepEvent(dt, snaps);\\n      session.playT += dt;\\n820→      if (event && (event.done || local >= 55.9)) {\\n        const result = event.result(0);\\n        session.parts.push(Math.round((result.form || 0) * 10));\\n        session.total = session.parts.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n        session.best = medalLabel(result.medal || 'attended');\\n        event.dispose();\\n        event = null;\\n        screen = 'results';\\n      } else screen = 'play';\\n    } else screen = 'results';\\n830→    if (t - session.lastProgress >= 1 || session.lastProgress < 0) {\\n      const label = `${eventTitle(session.slots[slot])} ${session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total}`.slice(0, 24);\\n      const score = session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total;\\n      hub.progress({ score, label });\\n      session.lastProgress = t;\\n    }\\n    if (t - session.lastGhost >= 0.1) {\\n      const lean = event && event.states ? event.states[0] : { leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, fallen: false };\\n      hub.send({\\n        t: 'g', a: slot, x: 0, z: 0,\\n840→        lx: Number((lean.leanX || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        lz: Number((lean.leanZ || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        c: 0, f: lean.fallen ? 1 : 0, s: session.total,\\n      }, { reliable: false });\\n      session.lastGhost = t;\\n    }\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sendResult() {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\",\"offset\":760,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"      if (pad && pad.buttons[1] && pad.buttons[1].pressed) group.seats[i] = null;\\n    }\\n    if (sample.edges.confirm && !group.seats.some((s) => s && s.device === 'key')) {\\n      const slot = group.seats.findIndex((s) => !s);\\n      if (slot >= 0) {\\n        group.seats[slot] = { name: profile.name, device: 'key' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return used;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000;\\n    if (t < 0) {\\n      screen = 'countdown';\\n      countLeft = Math.max(0, -t);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const slot = Math.min(session.slots.length, Math.floor(t / 62));\\n    const local = t - slot * 62;\\n    if (slot >= session.slots.length) {\\n      screen = 'waiting';\\n      sendResult();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.slot !== slot) {\\n      session.slot = slot;\\n      session.playT = 0;\\n      if (event) event.dispose();\\n      event = null;\\n      eventId = session.slots[slot];\\n    }\\n    if (local < 6) {\\n      screen = 'intro';\\n      session.scoreShown = session.total;\\n    } else if (local < 56) {\\n      if (!event) {\\n        startEvent(eventId, { session: true, lanes: [{ id: 0, kind: 'local', name: profile.name, colour: SEAT_COLOURS[hub.me || 0] }] });\\n        screen = 'play';\\n      }\\n      const input = inputs[0];\\n      let snaps;\\n      if (botSkill) snaps = driveBots(dt);\\n      else {\\n        input.poll(dt, 'balance');\\n        snaps = [input.snapshot(0)];\\n      }\\n      stepEvent(dt, snaps);\\n      session.playT += dt;\\n      if (event && (event.done || local >= 55.9)) {\\n        const result = event.result(0);\\n        session.parts.push(Math.round((result.form || 0) * 10));\\n        session.total = session.parts.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n        session.best = medalLabel(result.medal || 'attended');\\n        event.dispose();\\n        event = null;\\n        screen = 'results';\\n      } else screen = 'play';\\n    } else screen = 'results';\\n    if (t - session.lastProgress >= 1 || session.lastProgress < 0) {\\n      const label = `${eventTitle(session.slots[slot])} ${session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total}`.slice(0, 24);\\n      const score = session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total;\\n      hub.progress({ score, label });\\n      session.lastProgress = t;\\n    }\\n    if (t - session.lastGhost >= 0.1) {\\n      const lean = event && event.states ? event.states[0] : { leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, fallen: false };\\n      hub.send({\\n        t: 'g', a: slot, x: 0, z: 0,\\n        lx: Number((lean.leanX || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        lz: Number((lean.leanZ || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        c: 0, f: lean.fallen ? 1 : 0, s: session.total,\\n      }, { reliable: false });\\n      session.lastGhost = t;\\n    }\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sendResult() {\\n\",\"total_lines\":1321}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"e4a7c26e-27fd-4f25-83b5-0430f3312f8d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_374","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Considering wiring keydown events to game.key.\n\nBoth the poll and key handlers will answer on Enter. The harness expects this within three seconds. During play, key presses become weight.\n\nGhost mode sends progress automatically from the game loop. The harness failures likely come from ready timeout blocking connect, not missing keyboard wiring. Connect happens in parallel before stage and waits for welcome.\n\nFour WebGPU iframes may OOM or delay readiness past the 20-second limit.\n\nKeyboard wiring is still required for launch tests, hub controls, real play, and UI touch tests. Mouse clicks already activate buttons, but keyboard menu navigation does not work without keydown wiring.\n\nGamepad stubs are unnecessary; key presses are simpler. Pointermove events must update the input wish for gameplay lean. Button hover handlers and window weight handlers both fire on pointermove and bubble correctly.\n\nPreventing default on Space and arrow keys would block page scrolling, but it risks double-activating focused buttons. The browser fires a click when Enter is pressed, and the keydown handler simultaneously triggers game.key Enter, which can confirm the same action twice. This creates a conflict between native button activation and custom game input.\n\nThe UI sets autofocus on the focused button. This causes Space to trigger a native click immediately, then the next frame poll latches Enter and triggers again. To prevent double activation, either remove autofocus or use preventDefault to block the native click.\n\nThe fix is to call preventDefault on keydown for Space, Enter, and arrow keys. This blocks the browser from firing a native click on the focused button, so game.key handles activation alone without double-activation.\n\nMouse clicks on buttons trigger double activation too. The click handler activates the choice immediately, while pointerdown latches MouseLeft and the next poll confirms it again. This would advance the menu twice in two frames. Options to prevent this are being considered.\n\nTwo designs are being compared to prevent double activation. One removes button click handlers entirely and routes all input through the poll, using pointerdown on the window so clicks on buttons still register. The other keeps the click handler but suppresses the mouse confirm latch when the event target is a button.\n\nThe simplest robust fix is to keep button click handlers and suppress the MouseLeft menu confirm latch when a click already activated a choice. This prevents double activation without removing the click handlers.\n\nThe pointerdown sequence latches MouseLeft before the click handler fires, so suppressing the poll confirm would break non-DOM tests that rely on game.pointer to advance menus. The fix must therefore target the click handler directly.\n\nThe button click handler will be stripped of its activate call. Menu activation will rely solely on the poll, which latches pointerdown and confirms the choice once per frame. This prevents double activation without suppressing the mouse confirm latch needed by non-DOM tests.\n\nThe button click handler will keep its immediate activate call for test responsiveness. The window pointerdown listener will instead suppress the confirm latch when the click target is a button or input, passing only position and non-confirm buttons to game.pointer. This prevents double activation without removing the click handler.\n\nThe pointerdown listener will mask the left button when the click target is a control, so the poll cannot double-latch confirm while the click handler still fires once. Middle-button clicks on controls will still latch flail. Pointer movement without buttons updates position and triggers mouse detection after a four-pixel threshold. The input view size will be set to the real window dimensions for correct pointer normalization.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a055cd72-8621-478b-b805-07a9f3788658-111","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/audio/engine.js","offset":80,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a055cd72-8621-478b-b805-07a9f3788658-112","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"resume|suspended|audio\\.play","glob":"**/*.{js,mjs}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1149,"output_tokens":2142,"cache_read_input_tokens":152576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"833c6f13-eff7-4551-867c-620a85e6e4a4"}
