eave Class',\"},{\"line_number\":1284,\"content\":\"    runStandalone() { audio.play('title'); paint(); },\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"7d843c15-3867-49f7-855f-9427deda0142"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_375","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `audio.unlock` function exists but is never called.\n\nI'll call `game.audio.unlock()` on the first key, pointer, or pad input. If the context stays suspended after a few seconds of pad input, I'll show a small tag asking for a key or click. The launch uses autoplay, but file:// Chromium may still suspend the live context until a gesture occurs.\n\nThe live mix analyser test requires a running context. I'll pass `--autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required` so the context starts immediately. I'm checking whether the model's paint output already has a tag slot for the suspended state.\n\nThe unlock call will go directly in the DOM listener. The suspended tag will be added to the model's prompt lines whenever the snapshot state is 'suspended'. This line may appear on every screen, but it is harmless. Node tests are unaffected because they have no AudioContext and their state is 'silent'.\n\nThe suspended tag will be inserted in model() before the return, only when audio.snapshot().state is 'suspended'. This extra paragraph is harmless and won't break flow tests. I'll also trigger unlock from the poll loop whenever a pad button or edge input occurs, not just from DOM handlers.\n\nThe unlock calls will be added inside `start()` after the game object is created. The resize handler will also call `setView`.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-983377eb-3778-40d1-9e89-7ff6e73a70da-113","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"answer:function|function answer|\\.answer=","glob":"**/session.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3480,"output_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":153600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"45ee69bc-886d-4a90-8bc7-c10437c2f0eb"}
