{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f7d96a1f-bd28-4b07-8d29-5fefe83d0f52-165","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"110→  let pendingStart = null;\\n  const listeners = new Set();\\n  const programme = programmeSteps(eventIds());\\n  let ui = null;\\n  if (doc) {\\n    ui = mountUi(doc, {\\n      activate: (index) => activate(index),\\n      hover: (index) => { focus = index; paint(); },\\n      slide: (id, value) => { setTune(id, value); applySettings(); paint(); },\\n    });\\n120→  }\\n\\n  function applySettings() {\\n    audio.setGains(settings.music / 100, settings.sfx / 100, settings.voice / 100);\\n    inputs.forEach((input) => input.setRumble(settings.rumble));\\n  }\\n  applySettings();\\n\\n  function persist() {\\n    writeSave(storage, SAVE_KEY, { profile, settings });\",\"content_concise\":\"110→  let pendingStart = null;\\n  const listeners = new Set();\\n  const programme = programmeSteps(eventIds());\\n  let ui = null;\\n  if (doc) {\\n    ui = mountUi(doc, {\\n      activate: (index) => activate(index),\\n      hover: (index) => { focus = index; paint(); },\\n      slide: (id, value) => { setTune(id, value); applySettings(); paint(); },\\n    });\\n120→  }\\n\\n  function applySettings() {\\n    audio.setGains(settings.music / 100, settings.sfx / 100, settings.voice / 100);\\n    inputs.forEach((input) => input.setRumble(settings.rumble));\\n  }\\n  applySettings();\\n\\n  function persist() {\\n    writeSave(storage, SAVE_KEY, { profile, settings });\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\",\"offset\":110,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"  let pendingStart = null;\\n  const listeners = new Set();\\n  const programme = programmeSteps(eventIds());\\n  let ui = null;\\n  if (doc) {\\n    ui = mountUi(doc, {\\n      activate: (index) => activate(index),\\n      hover: (index) => { focus = index; paint(); },\\n      slide: (id, value) => { setTune(id, value); applySettings(); paint(); },\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function applySettings() {\\n    audio.setGains(settings.music / 100, settings.sfx / 100, settings.voice / 100);\\n    inputs.forEach((input) => input.setRumble(settings.rumble));\\n  }\\n  applySettings();\\n\\n  function persist() {\\n    writeSave(storage, SAVE_KEY, { profile, settings });\\n\",\"total_lines\":1322}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"9c2bf758-43de-4078-8bd7-3ee266e9bd09"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_417","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pointermove hover event triggers paint(), which calls replaceChildren() and replaces the entire UI.\n\nA tap triggers pointerdown on the button, but hover immediately repaints and destroys it before click can fire. This is why tapping a button never opens settings.\n\nButtons listen for pointermove to trigger hover, while sliders use pointerdown. Touch devices may fire pointermove before click, so hover repaints the button and destroys it before the click event can reach it.\n\nThe fix is to skip paint() when hover is called with the same index as the current focus. Since focus starts at 0, hover(0) returns immediately and the button survives. The click event then reaches the settings button.\n\nThe hover handler will be updated to skip paint when focus is unchanged. About paging will use nudge and activate handling, with the UI audit's about collection using activate on the next button or ArrowRight after the nudge fix.\n\nThe nudge function now wraps around pages for the about and journal screens. The activate handler updates the page index when next or previous buttons are pressed, then paints the updated view.\n\nArrowRight on the about screen only advances pages, not focus. The UI test will use ArrowRight to page through about content. I should verify that advancing a page triggers a paint.\n\nThe test advances pages by calling frame(), which triggers paint. The about screen contains roughly 38 pages, so the 80-step loop wraps around twice and will reach the date field. That date text is a single line.\n\nThe test will switch to locator.tap() for more reliable touch simulation. HTML must be rebuilt because browser tests validate the bundle. Node flow tests import the director directly and should remain unaffected by the hover change.\n\nThe about screen has no sliders, so nudge will not accidentally trigger applySettings. The 1080 audit likely passed its layout check; the missing date error only appears after the problems assertion.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-583bd7b6-8368-473e-8755-952f7b6ae282-166","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"      hover: (index) => { focus = index; paint(); },","new_string":"      hover: (index) => { if (focus === index) return; focus = index; paint(); },"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-583bd7b6-8368-473e-8755-952f7b6ae282-167","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"  function nudge(choice, dir) {\n    if (!choice) return;","new_string":"  function nudge(choice, dir) {\n    if (screen === 'about' || screen === 'journal') {\n      const count = screen === 'about' ? aboutPages().length : 3;\n      page = (page + (dir > 0 ? 1 : count - 1)) % count;\n      return;\n    }\n    if (!choice) return;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-583bd7b6-8368-473e-8755-952f7b6ae282-168","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"    if (screen === 'island') {\n      if (id === 'plan') return setScreen('plan');\n      if (id === 'bed') return setScreen('bed');\n      if (id === 'menu') return setScreen('menu');\n    }\n    paint();\n  }","new_string":"    if (screen === 'island') {\n      if (id === 'plan') return setScreen('plan');\n      if (id === 'bed') return setScreen('bed');\n      if (id === 'menu') return setScreen('menu');\n    }\n    if ((screen === 'about' || screen === 'journal') && (id === 'next' || id === 'prev')) {\n      const count = screen === 'about' ? aboutPages().length : 3;\n      page = (page + (id === 'next' ? 1 : count - 1)) % count;\n    }\n    paint();\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-583bd7b6-8368-473e-8755-952f7b6ae282-169","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/browser.mjs","old_string":"        const box = await page.locator('button', { hasText: 'Settings' }).boundingBox();\n        await page.touchscreen.tap(box.x + box.width / 2, box.y + box.height / 2);\n        await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.dataset.screen === 'settings', null, { timeout: 3000 });","new_string":"        await page.locator('button', { hasText: 'Settings' }).tap();\n        await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.dataset.screen === 'settings', null, { timeout: 3000 });"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":416,"output_tokens":2205,"cache_read_input_tokens":203392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"ce09fe00-c26a-49de-bf55-71a2eaa26db9"}
