{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_428","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boot removal occurs after the `await connecting` step.\n\nStandalone mode correctly removes boot before any await. The test waitForFunction could still interleave after __TEST__ assignment but before runStandalone.\n\nThe `await createGame` call precedes the `__TEST__` assignment, so the test waitForFunction can interleave before that point.\n\nThe __TEST__ assignment and boot removal occur synchronously before the next await, so waitForFunction will not see the test flag until after those steps finish. createGame's paint is synchronous. The hub path also correctly removes boot after connecting. One remaining concern: overflow:hidden on #ui might clip focus outlines.\n\nFocus outlines extend 9 pixels outside the button. The #ui padding and border box contain them, so overflow:hidden will not clip them.\n\nThe 4px box-shadow also stays inside the padding. A 0.4-degree rotation on a wide button protrudes roughly 5.8 pixels vertically above and below its edges.\n\nThe rotated button's visual bottom extends to 1003.8 pixels, which sits inside the #ui content box and padding.\n\nThe rotated button's bottom edge at 1003 pixels stays below the 1034 pixel limit. The focused button is not at the screen edge because the title sits above it and the buttons are centered in a flex column with space-between.\n\nIf content overflows #ui, overflow:hidden clips it. getBoundingClientRect still returns the full layout box, so clipped elements can register as outside the margin and fail the test while remaining invisible to the user. Content must fit within the container. The later h1 font-size rule overrides the earlier body selector because of higher specificity.\n\nThe 0.4-degree rotation applies to all buttons, not just the focused one. The previous failure came from the scale(1.02) effect on the focused button, which added roughly 17 pixels horizontally; removing that should let the focused button pass like the unfocused ones. I will rebuild and rerun the tests now.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41df14d6-7db2-4c13-87f1-c57743480a7a-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/main.js","offset":130,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41df14d6-7db2-4c13-87f1-c57743480a7a-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/ui/styles.js","limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5343,"output_tokens":1525,"cache_read_input_tokens":63104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"09581c38-a537-4920-bf7b-85018d527bdf"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-41df14d6-7db2-4c13-87f1-c57743480a7a-23","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"130→  if (stage) {\\n    stage.sync(view);\\n    stage.setInk(view.inkOn !== false && view.settings.ink !== 0);\\n    stage.render(view.inkOn !== false);\\n    publish(stage.info());\\n  }\\n  if (boot.parentNode && view.screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\\n});\\n\\nif (connecting) {\\n140→  const info = await connecting;\\n  if (info) game.runSession(info);\\n  else game.runStandalone();\\n} else {\\n  game.runStandalone();\\n}\\nif (boot.parentNode && game.state().screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\\nif (params.get('render') === '0') {\\n  game.setRender({ backend: 'none', lost: null, frames: 0, width: 0, height: 0 });\\n}\\n150→await stagePromise;\\nfit();\\n}\\n\\nstart().catch((err) => {\\n  errors.push(String((err && err.message) || err));\\n});\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"130→  if (stage) {\\n    stage.sync(view);\\n    stage.setInk(view.inkOn !== false && view.settings.ink !== 0);\\n    stage.render(view.inkOn !== false);\\n    publish(stage.info());\\n  }\\n  if (boot.parentNode && view.screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\\n});\\n\\nif (connecting) {\\n140→  const info = await connecting;\\n  if (info) game.runSession(info);\\n  else game.runStandalone();\\n} else {\\n  game.runStandalone();\\n}\\nif (boot.parentNode && game.state().screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\\nif (params.get('render') === '0') {\\n  game.setRender({ backend: 'none', lost: null, frames: 0, width: 0, height: 0 });\\n}\\n150→await stagePromise;\\nfit();\\n}\\n\\nstart().catch((err) => {\\n  errors.push(String((err && err.message) || err));\\n});\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/main.js\",\"offset\":130,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"  if (stage) {\\n    stage.sync(view);\\n    stage.setInk(view.inkOn !== false && view.settings.ink !== 0);\\n    stage.render(view.inkOn !== false);\\n    publish(stage.info());\\n  }\\n  if (boot.parentNode && view.screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\\n});\\n\\nif (connecting) {\\n  const info = await connecting;\\n  if (info) game.runSession(info);\\n  else game.runStandalone();\\n} else {\\n  game.runStandalone();\\n}\\nif (boot.parentNode && game.state().screen !== 'boot') boot.remove();\\nif (params.get('render') === '0') {\\n  game.setRender({ backend: 'none', lost: null, frames: 0, width: 0, height: 0 });\\n}\\nawait stagePromise;\\nfit();\\n}\\n\\nstart().catch((err) => {\\n  errors.push(String((err && err.message) || err));\\n});\\n\",\"total_lines\":156}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-41df14d6-7db2-4c13-87f1-c57743480a7a-24","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→export const CSS = `\\n:root { color: #1A1420; font-family: Fredoka, \\\"Trebuchet MS\\\", sans-serif; }\\nhtml, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #8FB4E0; overflow: hidden; }\\nbody * { font-size: 36px; }\\ncanvas, .bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; z-index: 0; }\\n#boot-line { position: fixed; inset: 5%; z-index: 3; font-size: 48px; pointer-events: none; }\\n#ui { position: fixed; inset: 5%; z-index: 2; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; pointer-events: none; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.25; overflow: hidden; }\\n#ui button, #ui input, #ui .hit { pointer-events: auto; font: inherit; font-size: 36px; color: #1A1420; }\\nh1, h2, p, li, button, label, span, input { font-size: 36px; }\\n10→h1 { font-size: 84px; margin: 0; line-height: 1; }\\nh2 { font-size: 54px; margin: 0 0 8px; }\\nbutton, .choice {\\n  display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px 18px;\\n  background: #fff6e4; border: 4px solid #1A1420; border-radius: 14px;\\n  transform: rotate(-0.4deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1A1420;\\n}\\nbutton.is-focus, input.is-focus, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {\\n  outline: 6px solid #F5B700; outline-offset: 3px; transform: rotate(0.4deg);\\n}\\n20→.row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }\",\"content_concise\":\"1→export const CSS = `\\n:root { color: #1A1420; font-family: Fredoka, \\\"Trebuchet MS\\\", sans-serif; }\\nhtml, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #8FB4E0; overflow: hidden; }\\nbody * { font-size: 36px; }\\ncanvas, .bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; z-index: 0; }\\n#boot-line { position: fixed; inset: 5%; z-index: 3; font-size: 48px; pointer-events: none; }\\n#ui { position: fixed; inset: 5%; z-index: 2; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; pointer-events: none; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.25; overflow: hidden; }\\n#ui button, #ui input, #ui .hit { pointer-events: auto; font: inherit; font-size: 36px; color: #1A1420; }\\nh1, h2, p, li, button, label, span, input { font-size: 36px; }\\n10→h1 { font-size: 84px; margin: 0; line-height: 1; }\\nh2 { font-size: 54px; margin: 0 0 8px; }\\nbutton, .choice {\\n  display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px 18px;\\n  background: #fff6e4; border: 4px solid #1A1420; border-radius: 14px;\\n  transform: rotate(-0.4deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1A1420;\\n}\\nbutton.is-focus, input.is-focus, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {\\n  outline: 6px solid #F5B700; outline-offset: 3px; transform: rotate(0.4deg);\\n}\\n20→.row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/ui/styles.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"export const CSS = `\\n:root { color: #1A1420; font-family: Fredoka, \\\"Trebuchet MS\\\", sans-serif; }\\nhtml, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #8FB4E0; overflow: hidden; }\\nbody * { font-size: 36px; }\\ncanvas, .bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; z-index: 0; }\\n#boot-line { position: fixed; inset: 5%; z-index: 3; font-size: 48px; pointer-events: none; }\\n#ui { position: fixed; inset: 5%; z-index: 2; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; pointer-events: none; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.25; overflow: hidden; }\\n#ui button, #ui input, #ui .hit { pointer-events: auto; font: inherit; font-size: 36px; color: #1A1420; }\\nh1, h2, p, li, button, label, span, input { font-size: 36px; }\\nh1 { font-size: 84px; margin: 0; line-height: 1; }\\nh2 { font-size: 54px; margin: 0 0 8px; }\\nbutton, .choice {\\n  display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px 18px;\\n  background: #fff6e4; border: 4px solid #1A1420; border-radius: 14px;\\n  transform: rotate(-0.4deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1A1420;\\n}\\nbutton.is-focus, input.is-focus, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {\\n  outline: 6px solid #F5B700; outline-offset: 3px; transform: rotate(0.4deg);\\n}\\n.row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }\\n\",\"total_lines\":34}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"82c0356e-37be-4913-af1c-a09c6466c0bb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_429","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The button transform rotate still expands the AABB.\n\nPadding should fix the button expansion. Button margins will be reduced so stacks fit. The global font-size rule affects SVG elements but not canvas. Script tags in the body might create overflow issues.\n\nScript tags are skipped by the overflow test because their boxes have zero width. The 36px font-size override is therefore safe. Button focus outlines will not be clipped by the container padding. Vertical margins are set to 8px.\n\nThe first button's focus outline extends into its top margin. Buttons default to content-box sizing, so their declared width of 100% plus padding and borders makes them wider than the parent container.\n\nThe button overhangs the parent by 44 pixels. The #ui padding absorbs 22 pixels on each side, leaving 18 pixels inside the margin. That is safely within the test tolerance of 8 pixels outside the margin. The only remaining risk is if the button's actual parent is not the #ui content box.\n\nThe button sits inside a `mid` div with auto width. Its 44-pixel overhang is absorbed by the 40-pixel padding, so it remains 18 pixels inside the margin line. The previous failure occurred because that padding was missing. The rotate transform adds only about five pixels vertically.\n\nThe test only flagged the focused button, not all buttons. This is puzzling because every button uses width 100% with content-box sizing. The containing block might not be the parent content box after all.\n\nThe 22-pixel overhang should have caused every button to fail, yet only the focused one was reported. This suggests the width declaration may not be applying as expected, or the test message was truncated.\n\nThe scale(1.02) transform is the only difference between the passing and failing states. If the buttons truly overflowed by 22 pixels, every button would fail, not just the focused one. This suggests the width declaration may not be applying as expected, or the parent container is shrink-constraining the button's used width.\n\nThe `mid` container is a flex item with `min-width: auto`. Its content can force the entire flex item to expand past the parent. The button sits inside this flex item, so its left edge may still align with the container margin. This explains why only the focused button was flagged.\n\nThe scale(1.02) transform adds 17 pixels to each side of the button. That exceeds the 8-pixel margin tolerance. The test still only flagged the focused button. This suggests the overflow may not be affecting every button equally.\n\nThe browser may resolve the percentage width against available space, so the button could fit without overflowing. I will trust the next test run. I also set overflow:hidden on #ui.\n\nOverflow:hidden on #ui will not help the test because getBoundingClientRect still reports the full box. It is only a visual safety clip for focus rings that barely stick out, so I will leave it in place for now and remove it if it clips important UI.\n\nThe proper fix is to set box-sizing: border-box on buttons and choice elements. This makes width: 100% include padding and borders, preventing horizontal overflow.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5a71cb6c-e9c8-44e5-8986-7acdbcc7c192-25","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/ui/styles.js","old_string":"button, .choice {\n  display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px 18px;\n  background: #fff6e4; border: 4px solid #1A1420; border-radius: 14px;\n  transform: rotate(-0.4deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1A1420;\n}","new_string":"button, .choice {\n  box-sizing: border-box; display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px 18px;\n  background: #fff6e4; border: 4px solid #1A1420; border-radius: 14px;\n  transform: rotate(-0.4deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1A1420;\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5a71cb6c-e9c8-44e5-8986-7acdbcc7c192-26","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/ui/styles.js","old_string":"input[type=\"range\"] { width: 100%; height: 36px; accent-color: #E8443A; }","new_string":"input[type=\"range\"] { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 36px; accent-color: #E8443A; }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2368,"output_tokens":2109,"cache_read_input_tokens":68352,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"eff0d3ab-f0d7-4f99-bef7-6ac5889446f2"}
