{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_431","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Touch test passed. The dev screen bottom prompt row overflows the viewport.\n\nThe dev screen's dense content pushes the prompt row below the viewport. `overflow: hidden` clips visually but `getBoundingClientRect` still reports the overflow. Two fixes are under consideration: reducing the prompt row or making the dev UI more compact.\n\nThe dev screen content must fit within the viewport without scrolling. I am calculating exact pixel heights to determine how much space is available for the dense dev lines and prompt bar.\n\nDefault paragraph margins are 1em, or 36px at this font size. These unreset margins collapse between the four dev lines and add significant vertical space.\n\nParagraphs total 360px. Six buttons add roughly 534px. The dev screen is too tall for the viewport.\n\nThe dev screen content totals roughly 1077 pixels, exceeding the 916-pixel viewport by about 160 pixels. The overflow matches the bottom prompt row leaving the screen. The first fix being considered is resetting paragraph and heading margins globally to small values so all screens are tighter and predictable.\n\nThe global margin reset is the chosen fix. Paragraphs will use 4px vertical margins, headings will have zero margins, and buttons will use 6px margins. This shrinks the dev screen content to roughly 899 pixels, fitting inside the viewport.\n\nThe dev status lines are long and may wrap to two lines each. That would increase the content height and could still push the prompt row below the viewport.\n\nThe longest dev line is about 50 characters, which fits on one line at this font size. The total content height is estimated between 850 and 950 pixels. The play screen should remain within the viewport. The overflow is isolated to the bottom prompt row.\n\nAnother option is to remove the generic confirm and back prompts from the dev screen entirely. The dev tools already provide those controls, so the bottom row would be empty and could collapse to zero height. This would eliminate the overflow without changing margins.\n\nThe dev screen's four extra status lines and page label are the only things pushing it past the viewport. I will combine those dev lines into two short lines and rely on the global margin reset to keep all screens compact.\n\nThe SVG className warning is harmless. Only the dev screen overflowed. Paragraph margins will be 2px and button margins 4px. The dev status lines will be shortened to two compact lines.\n\nThe dev screen now fits with roughly 60 pixels to spare. I will also set the h2 line-height to 1.1 for extra safety.\n\nAbsolute positioning for the prompt row was rejected because the plan forbids scrolling. If the dev screen still overflows after the margin fixes, I will remove its prompts entirely by modifying model() to skip them when screen is dev.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Touch settings works. The dev screen is the one that still spills: its status lines plus six tools push the prompt row past the safe area. I'll tighten the type spacing and shorten those lines."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2b203f8e-451e-412e-bec4-ae70abeabb92-28","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/ui/styles.js","old_string":"h1 { font-size: 84px; margin: 0; line-height: 1; }\nh2 { font-size: 54px; margin: 0 0 8px; }\nbutton, .choice {\n  box-sizing: border-box; display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px 18px;","new_string":"h1 { font-size: 84px; margin: 0; line-height: 1; }\nh2 { font-size: 54px; margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.1; }\np { margin: 2px 0; }\nbutton, .choice {\n  box-sizing: border-box; display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; margin: 4px 0; padding: 8px 18px;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2b203f8e-451e-412e-bec4-ae70abeabb92-29","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","old_string":"    lines.push(`Time scale ${timeScale.toFixed(2)}. God ${god ? 'on' : 'off'}. Ink ${inkOn ? 'on' : 'off'}.`);\n    lines.push(`Camera ${freeCam ? 'free' : 'follow'}. Physics lines ${debugPhysics ? 'on' : 'off'}.`);\n    lines.push(`Input ${inputs[0].lastDevice}  stick ${wish.wishX.toFixed(2)}, ${wish.wishZ.toFixed(2)}  feet ${wish.feetL.toFixed(2)} ${wish.feetR.toFixed(2)}`);\n    lines.push(`Frames ${frames}. Backend ${backend}. Bodies ${event && event.world ? 'live' : 'none'}.`);","new_string":"    lines.push(`Scale ${timeScale.toFixed(2)} · God ${god ? 'on' : 'off'} · Ink ${inkOn ? 'on' : 'off'} · Camera ${freeCam ? 'free' : 'follow'} · Lines ${debugPhysics ? 'on' : 'off'}`);\n    lines.push(`${inputs[0].lastDevice} ${wish.wishX.toFixed(2)}, ${wish.wishZ.toFixed(2)} · feet ${wish.feetL.toFixed(2)} ${wish.feetR.toFixed(2)} · ${frames} frames · ${backend}`);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":742,"output_tokens":3114,"cache_read_input_tokens":72960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"9cb75e02-29b4-413b-a3c9-d2093dcf3e8b"}
