15,32,100,111,101,115,32,110,111,116,32,102,97,105,108,32,116,104,101,32,103,111,97,108,32,111,110,99,101,32,115,116,101,112,115,32,49,226,128,147,51,32,112,97,115,115,46,10,52,50,58,45,32,91,32,93,32,83,104,105,112,32,116,104,101,32,101,110,100,105,110,103,44,32,65,98,111,117,116,47,67,114,101,100,105,116,115,44,32,101,120,105,116,45,105,110,116,101,114,118,105,101,119,46,106,115,111,110,44,32,96,123,83,67,82,65,84,67,72,125,47,116,101,115,116,45,102,117,108,108,46,108,111,103,96,32,119,105,116,104,32,122,101,114,111,32,102,97,105,108,117,114,101,115,44,32,116,104,101,32,116,119,111,32,108,97,117,110,99,104,32,99,97,112,116,117,114,101,115,44,32,97,110,100,32,116,104,101,32,104,117,98,32,108,111,103,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":6,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"1. gating: Add in-repo tests that drive the shipped simulation (the same fixed step the page runs), not a copy of the formulas and not a mock of the unit under test. One command prints only failures and a one-line count, and its full run covers criteria 2–4 from their own start states: balance (parked stick, fall/recover, load, Fruit Hat bank versus never-bank), each §6 event, check-in/age/marbles/tilt, a sim-time playthrough from a fresh profile through the ending and a later day, input verbs and glyphs, attract at 10 seconds with the press swallowed, dev sliders and reset, touch-only copy and Settings, offline audio renders that are finite, non-silent, and not clipped with music gain 0.10, the 1080p UI limits, the exit-interview shape, and the built HTML (no external requests, no audio files, no TODO/placeholder/stub, client immediately after charset). Capture stdout to `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log`. Pass only if the count shows zero failures.\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"2. gating: Launch the real root HTML from `file://` twice, in Playwright Chromium, with `--enable-unsafe-webgpu --enable-features=Vulkan --use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader --use-vulkan=swiftshader --use-angle=swiftshader`. Each run must show no page errors, a live WebGPU device (a lost device fails), a canvas whose drawing size matches the requested view, and a pixel readback that is substantially painted (a large painted fraction or a bbox covering most of the surface, with dark ink-like pixels and a spread of other colours — not merely non-zero). The title string on screen equals GameTitle. A stubbed standard pad or a key then changes screen or balance state in a second capture. Both runs must succeed the same way. Save `{SCRATCH}/launch-1.png`, `{SCRATCH}/launch-2.png`, and `{SCRATCH}/launch.log`. If the browser cannot start, save that launcher error to `{SCRATCH}/launch-env.txt` and criterion 1's file checks plus the non-render tests in step 1 are the bar. A readback that succeeds an [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"3. gating: Serve the built HTML and the hub harness on `127.0.0.1` with an OS-picked port, confirm the response is this game, then run the harness to `body[data-complete=\\\"true\\\"]` and `window.__hubCheck.pass === true` for `players=1`, `players=2`, `players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5`, and `scenario=host-leave`. Stop only that server, by its PID. Also open the file outside a session and press Enter, Space, Enter, Space: no errors and a drawn frame. Capture `{SCRATCH}/hub.log`.\"},{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\"4. evidence: At 1920×1080, with the same rendering flags, capture title, island on day 1 and level, each event mid-play, results, jar, age reveal, four-player Group Class, dev mode, and About into `{SCRATCH}/shots/`. A WebKit load that reports the WebGL2 fallback and no page errors goes to `{SCRATCH}/webkit.log`. Absence of these shots does not fail the goal once steps 1–3 pass.\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"- [ ] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"d79cec9b-3951-4205-8311-85aa1ecf20e4"}
