{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_437","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The launch succeeded. WebGPU rendered the canvas. The title is Level Best. Press Enter to proceed.\n\nBoth runs completed without errors. I will inspect the generated PNGs to verify they look like a proper game. The hub tests will run for up to 810 seconds.\n\nI will set a 15-minute block to keep the hub test in the foreground. I can draft notes and interview material while it runs, but the final report must wait for the full suite to complete.\n\nNode-side tests can run in parallel with the hub test. They do not need a browser. The full suite must still execute because it repeats the hub and UI audio. I will check if memory allows parallel runs.\n\nI will run the hub test in the background with block_until_ms set to zero. Node tests will run in the foreground with a long block. This avoids mixing stdout and prevents memory pressure from extra browsers.\n\nI need to capture the hub test stdout so I can see pass or fail lines. The node tests are unit, balance, events, flow, and input. They were green before recent CSS and director edits. About paging and hover changes could theoretically affect flow tests if they drive navigation. The prior summary showed 71 passes for those five suites.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Both launches drew a WebGPU title and left it on Enter. I'll look at the captures, then start the hub harness and the simulation tests."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89fb7f1a-f6ac-44c8-8320-b2a8a5f1717b-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/launch-1.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89fb7f1a-f6ac-44c8-8320-b2a8a5f1717b-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implement