Exit interview: before you finish, also save these answers as exit-interview.json in this folder's root, beside the game's .html: one JSON object in exactly the shape below, every value filled in (\\\"unknown\\\" for anything you can't confirm). Tools read it (the game's run record and the AI Hub catalogue), so write plain text, and check that the file parses as JSON.\"},{\"line_number\":111,\"content\":\"  \\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\\"date\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"source\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"plan\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"genre\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"tech\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"animation\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"audio\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"online\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"testing\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"research\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"environment\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"model\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"},\"},{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\\"your answer to each Testing Feedback question, in order\\\"],\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"c8b8ce64-0b3a-4501-bde4-3bc611e5b1cd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_440","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hub passed in 45 seconds.\n\nRunning the full test suite. It may take 5 to 15 minutes. I will redirect stdout to test-full.log.\n\nI'll use tee to stream stdout to the log file while keeping it visible in the terminal. Stderr will be excluded to avoid the NO_COLOR warning.\n\nI'll enable pipefail so test failures aren't hidden by tee. The full suite could take over ten minutes, with events tests being the longest part. I'll start it in the background and poll for completion while drafting the issues update.\n\nI will check hub.log first to confirm it is complete. The official test-full.log must come from the game as shipped. I will update the exit interview and rebuild before rerunning unit and UI tests.\n\nThe full suite must pass before updating the exit interview. If it fails, I will fix bugs and rerun full first. The current interview text is already baked into about.js from the last build.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d1c464a9-33ee-49b5-8e6d-c8660951baa5-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/hub.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d1c464a9-33ee-49b5-8e6d-c8660951baa5-48","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"set -o pipefail; cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && node tools/test.mjs full | tee \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/test-full.log\"","description":"Run full suite into test-full.log","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2056,"output_tokens":1271,"cache_read_input_tokens":90240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent