{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_442","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 102 tests passed. No failures.\n\nChecking whether warnings leaked into test-full.log. Tee only captures stdout, but the tool may have merged stderr into the output display.\n\nReading test-full.log to verify it contains only the failure count and zero failures.\n\nThe 102 test count is correct. Next steps are updating notes and exit-interview feedback, rebuilding, rerunning unit and UI tests, updating PROGRESS.md, flipping the goal plan checklist, and adding deviations. About.js must be checked for forbidden words before any feedback text is added.\n\nAbout.js is generated from exit-interview data, so its comments must avoid forbidden words like \"Math.random\". I will review the goal plan checklist, deviations instructions, and PROGRESS.md before writing. The feedback rewrite will keep the 4/6/4 structure with honest counts. Issues 9-21 will be precise and not inflated.\n\nBugs 9 through 14 are now classified. Cairn latched stone count, plate key taps, and clumsy plate wander were critical. Still Water resonance and Log Reps binary depth were not critical. PointerMove consuming mouse edges before pointerButtons was also critical.\n\nBug 15 was not critical. A held stick re-marked the pad on every poll, so a later key never became the last device. The test required a stick then key to switch lastDevice to key. A parked stick kept stealing input because it met the mag>0.25 threshold while delta stayed zero.\n\nBugs 16 through 19 are now classified. Attract self-woke and about pages not turning were critical. Raft failing to copy the wish into balance was also critical. Lowpass thuds silent was not critical.\n\nBug 20 is critical. Hover repaint blocked the Settings tap, so the only touch control did nothing.\n\nBug 21 is not critical. The page ran; the unit test rejected shader URLs in the bundle.\n\nThe final tally is 21 issues total: 13 critical and 8 non-critical.\n\nThe testing feedback must match the notes exactly, so the one-line descriptions will be honest and consistent. Feedback strings must not contain TODO, FIXME, placeholder, or stub. The word \"Wii Fit\" is allowed in about.js because that file is excluded from the source-name grep.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d3d243-af39-4ca7-8197-255e8d29f8b0-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/test-full.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d3d243-af39-4ca7-8197-255e8d29f8b0-52","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|placeholder|Math\\.random|wii|about\\.js","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/unit.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d3d243-af39-4ca7-8197-255e8d29f8b0-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d3d243-af39-4ca7-8197-255e8d29f8b0-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2832,"output_tokens":1723,"cache_read_input_tokens":93824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"b15c75f4-c215-45a7-8584-20bd9443cfac"}
