file://` draws.\\n- [x] Add the balance core, three-device input, Balance Disc, jointed doll, ragdoll recovery, and Fruit Hat. Lock them with tests from a fresh world.\\n- [x] Add the island ritual (check-in, Wobble Age, jar, tilt) and every other §6 event, each tested from its own start.\\n- [x] Add menus, attract, dev sliders, synthesized audio, glyphs, touch-only, Group Class, and the hub ghost session.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- [ ] Boot a single-file build: Three r180 ink scene, Rapier 0.19.3, unmodified hub client, WebGL2 fallback, and a test advance hook. Confirm `file://` draws.\\n- [ ] Add the balance core, three-device input, Balance Disc, jointed doll, ragdoll recovery, and Fruit Hat. Lock them with tests from a fresh world.\\n- [ ] Add the island ritual (check-in, Wobble Age, jar, tilt) and every other §6 event, each tested from its own start.\\n- [ ] Add menus, attract, dev sliders, synthesized audio, glyphs, touch-only, Group Class, and the hub ghost session.\",\"old_line\":38,\"new_string\":\"- [x] Boot a single-file build: Three r180 ink scene, Rapier 0.19.3, unmodified hub client, WebGL2 fallback, and a test advance hook. Confirm `file://` draws.\\n- [x] Add the balance core, three-device input, Balance Disc, jointed doll, ragdoll recovery, and Fruit Hat. Lock them with tests from a fresh world.\\n- [x] Add the island ritual (check-in, Wobble Age, jar, tilt) and every other §6 event, each tested from its own start.\\n- [x] Add menus, attract, dev sliders, synthesized audio, glyphs, touch-only, Group Class, and the hub ghost session.\",\"new_line\":38,\"context_before\":\"\\n## Task checklist\\n- [x] Pick GameTitle with a real RNG after brainstorming riffs, record it in PROGRESS.md, and create the matching dev subfolder.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- [ ] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log.\\n\\n## Risks / Contradictions\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fdfc683e-6dc5-4b95-a0ab-871f6633ce03-68","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- A real pad unlocking audio, and whether the music sounds good, cannot be confirmed here. Signal tests, plus the on-screen prompt if audio stays suspended after pad input, are the bar.\",\"new_string\":\"- A real pad unlocking audio, and whether the music sounds good, cannot be confirmed here. Signal tests, plus the on-screen prompt if audio stays suspended after pad input, are the bar.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n- Island Loop calls gravityFromTilt and ignores the return. Assigning that vector to world.gravity produced NaN. Uphill stride still uses the sine of the tilt.\\n- Room Service tray collider is cuboid(0.3, 0.01, 0.3). PLAN.md wrote a vertical half-extent of 0.02. The thinner tray keeps five glasses seated on the 0.6 m top.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- A real pad unlocking audio, and whether the music sounds good, cannot be confirmed here. Signal tests, plus the on-screen prompt if audio stays suspended after pad input, are the bar.\",\"old_line\":49,\"new_string\":\"- A real pad unlocking audio, and whether the music sounds good, cannot be confirmed here. Signal tests, plus the on-screen prompt if audio stays suspended after pad input, are the bar.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n- Island Loop calls gravityFromTilt and ignores the return. Assigning that vector to world.gravity produced NaN. Uphill stride still uses the sine of the tilt.\\n- Room Service tray collider is cuboid(0.3, 0.01, 0.3). PLAN.md wrote a vertical half-extent of 0.02. The thinner tray keeps five glasses seated on the 0.6 m top.\",\"new_line\":49,\"context_before\":\"- Software WebGPU is only a few frames per second here, and extra browsers are killed when memory runs out. Logic tests must not need a renderer; keep at most two browsers open.\\n- PLAN.md §18 lets a short build cut whole events in a fixed order. That does not relax this plan: this computer can run the full demo, so every §6 event is required. A stub, a placeholder, or a cut of a do-not-cut system fails.\\n- The hub rejects an edited `session.js` and checks its hash. If the published client hash differs from the hash written in PLAN.md, use the hash shipped with that client release and fail the build on a mismatch.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"3af2f011-1051-4a93-94da-e9b401036817"}
