{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_456","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Running a quick webkit check and writing the results to webkit.log.\n\nUpdating PROGRESS and marking the final checklist item complete. The webkit check will run in parallel with writing files. If it fails, the error will be recorded without blocking ship. The final reply must include Source Information and the three feedback lists.\n\nVerified that about.js matches the JSON and that the UI test passed. The build generated about.js from the new JSON, and the full run confirmed they match.\n\nThe webkit script will navigate to the HTML, wait for rendering to finish, and capture frame info plus console errors. It exits with an error if WebGL2 is missing or frames are lost. Playwright must run from the dev folder.\n\nNode ESM resolution ties module imports to the script file path, not the current working directory. A webkit check script placed in scratch would fail to find playwright. The script will instead be written directly into the dev folder and deleted immediately after execution.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c2a0b4f-9196-4b26-9af5-86d79108b9aa-82","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"## Now\n\nBalance core, events, island ritual, menus, hub session, and the single-file build are in progress. The simulation step is shared by the page and the tests.","new_string":"## Now\n\nThe game is built. The work-folder root holds the single HTML file, this note, and exit-interview.json. The dev folder holds the modules and the test command.\n\n`node tools/test.mjs full` printed `102 passed, 0 failed`. Two file:// launches drew the WebGPU title and left it on Enter. The hub harness passed for 1 player, 2 players, 4 players with latency, jitter and loss, and a host leaving. Outside a session, Enter and Space leave a drawn frame.\n\nIssues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-one in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c2a0b4f-9196-4b26-9af5-86d79108b9aa-83","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md","old_string":"- [ ] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log.","new_string":"- [x] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c2a0b4f-9196-4b26-9af5-86d79108b9aa-84","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317\" && echo \"override=${PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE:-unset}\" && node --input-type=module <<'EOF'\nimport { webkit } from 'playwright';\nimport { writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nconst html = 'file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317.html';\nconst out = '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/webkit.log';\nconst browser = await webkit.launch({ headless: true });\nconst page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 1280, height: 720 }, deviceScaleFactor: 1 });\nconst errors = [];\npage.on('pageerror', (err) => errors.push(String(err.message || err)));\npage.on('console', (msg) => { if (msg.type() === 'error') errors.push(msg.text()); });\ntry {\n  await page.goto(html);\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__RENDER__ && window.__RENDER__.frames > 0 && !window.__RENDER__.lost, null, { timeout: 90000 });\n  const info = await page.evaluate(() => ({\n    ...window.__RENDER__,\n    title: document.querySelector('h1') && document.querySelector('h1').textContent,\n    screen: document.body.dataset.screen,\n  }));\n  const text = `backend=${info.backend} lost=${info.lost} frames=${info.frames} size=${info.width}x${info.height} title=${info.title} screen=${info.screen} errors=${errors.length}\\n${errors.join('\\n')}\\n`;\n  writeFileSync(out, text);\n  console.log(text);\n  if (info.backend !== 'webgl2' || info.lost || errors.length || info.title !== 'Level Best') process.exitCode = 1;\n} catch (err) {\n  const text = `FAILED ${err && err.stack || err}\\n`;\n  writeFileSync(out, text);\n  console.error(text);\n  process.exitCode = 1;\n} finally {\n  await browser.close();\n}\nEOF","description":"Load the page in WebKit and record the fallback","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":954,"output_tokens":2106,"cache_read_input_tokens":123776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"9cc8c4c1-2b8f-41f5-9913-c65ef4e1477d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8c2a0b4f-9196-4b26-9af5-86d79108b9aa-82","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"## Now\\n\\nBalance core, events, island ritual, menus, hub session, and the single-file build are in progress. The simulation step is shared by the page and the tests.\",\"new_string\":\"## Now\\n\\nThe game is built. The work-folder root holds the single HTML file, this note, and exit-interview.json. The dev folder holds the modules and the test command.\\n\\n`node tools/test.mjs full` printed `102 passed, 0 failed`. Two file:// launches drew the WebGPU title and left it on Enter. The hub harness passed for 1 player, 2 players, 4 players with latency, jitter and loss, and a host leaving. Outside a session, Enter and Space leave a drawn frame.\\n\\nIssues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-one in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"## Now\\n\\nBalance core, events, island ritual, menus, hub session, and the single-file build are in progress. The simulation step is shared by the page and the tests.\",\"old_line\":11,\"new_string\":\"## Now\\n\\nThe game is built. The work-folder root holds the single HTML file, this note, and exit-interview.json. The dev folder holds the modules and the test command.\\n\\n`node tools/test.mjs full` printed `102 passed, 0 failed`. Two file:// launches drew the WebGPU title and left it on Enter. The hub harness passed for 1 player, 2 players, 4 players with latency, jitter and loss, and a host leaving. Outside a session, Enter and Space leave a drawn frame.\\n\\nIssues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-one in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\",\"new_line\":11,\"context_before\":\"\\nThe title on the title screen is Level Best. The retreat in the fiction keeps the plan's name, Level Best Retreat. Dev folder and HTML use `Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317`.\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8c2a0b4f-9196-4b26-9af5-86d79108b9aa-83","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- [ ] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log.\",\"new_string\":\"- [x] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9%2Fwork/01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66/goal/plan.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- [ ] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log.\",\"old_line\":42,\"new_string\":\"- [x] Ship the ending, About/Credits, exit-interview.json, `{SCRATCH}/test-full.log` with zero failures, the two launch captures, and the hub log.\",\"new_line\":42,\"context_before\":\"- [x] Add the balance core, three-device input, Balance Disc, jointed doll, ragdoll recovery, and Fruit Hat. Lock them with tests from a fresh world.\\n- [x] Add the island ritual (check-in, Wobble Age, jar, tilt) and every other §6 event, each tested from its own start.\\n- [x] Add menus, attract, dev sliders, synthesized audio, glyphs, touch-only, Group Class, and the hub ghost session.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n## Risks / Contradictions\\n- TASK.md's three WebGPU flags alone lose the device while the frame counter still climbs. Rendering checks must also pass `--use-vulkan=swiftshader` and `--use-angle=swiftshader`. A lost device, or a readback that succeeds and is blank, is a failure.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8c2a0b4f-9196-4b26-9af5-86d79108b9aa-84","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[111,118,101,114,114,105,100,101,61,117,98,117,110,116,117,50,52,46,48,52,45,120,54,52,10,40,110,111,100,101,58,50,55,52,51,56,53,41,32,87,97,114,110,105,110,103,58,32,84,104,101,32,39,78,79,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,105,115,32,105,103,110,111,114,101,100,32,100,117,101,32,116,111,32,116,104,101,32,39,70,79,82,67,69,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,98,101,105,110,103,32,115,101,116,46,10,40,85,115,101,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,45,45,116,114,97,99,101,45,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,115,32,46,46,46,96,32,116,111,32,115,104,111,119,32,119,104,101,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,32,119,97,115,32,99,114,101,97,116,101,100,41,10,98,97,99,107,101,110,100,61,119,101,98,103,108,50,32,108,111,115,116,61,110,117,108,108,32,102,114,97,109,101,115,61,50,32,115,105,122,101,61,49,50,56,48,120,55,50,48,32,116,105,116,108,101,61,76,101,118,101,108,32,66,101,115,116,32,115,99,114,101,