{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_457","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"WebKit fell back to WebGL2. The title is Level Best. Two frames rendered. A null was lost. A WebGL error occurred: texSubImage2D ArrayBufferView too small.\n\nThe console error is not a pageerror. It might be a one-frame startup glitch or a persistent texture bug. I will check if the WebGL2 fallback still renders correctly.\n\nThe WebGL2 fallback is working. The texSubImage error is a quality issue, not a gating failure. I will inspect the renderer's texture uploads and DataTexture handling to see if it is easy to fix.\n\nI will take a WebKit screenshot to verify the scene is painted. A blank canvas would require a fix. The console WebGL error might be treated as a page error under strict reading, though the launch test only fails on device lost.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-032707c5-8383-458c-9957-9a0036f08177-85","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"DataTexture|CanvasTexture|needsUpdate|texSubImage|DataArray","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-032707c5-8383-458c-9957-9a0036f08177-86","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/render/renderer.js","offset":160,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2442,"output_tokens":688,"cache_read_input_tokens":124672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"606b2504-c47d-4794-b6a8-8a832d32dd05"}
