{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_461","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"WebKit is clean. WebGL2 works. No errors remain.\n\nRerunning WebGPU launch and full tests to match the updated HTML. Launch will run first as a visual gate, then full. The ramp change must not flatten the shading.\n\nThe launch script checks color spread. The PNG will be inspected too.\n\nAdding issue 22 for the ramp bug would require rebuilding the interview and retesting. The interview undercounts without it. Honesty demands inclusion.\n\nThe WebGL fallback rendered the title, so the ramp bug is not critical. It will be logged as non-critical in issue 22. The critical count stays at thirteen.\n\nIssue 22 is added before launch and full so the final HTML is used. The testing feedback sentence will list twenty-two issues and mention the ramp. The second sentence keeps thirteen critical.\n\nThe second feedback sentence will not mention the ramp. WebKit does not need rerunning after the interview rebuild; the WebGL fallback behavior is unchanged.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e4f12a4-a049-45a4-9dbc-bb4ef72ae500-90","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md","old_string":"21. The bundled shader comments still contained web URLs. Critical: no. The page ran, and the unit check rejected the strings.","new_string":"21. The bundled shader comments still contained web URLs. Critical: no. The page ran, and the unit check rejected the strings.\n22. The toon ramp was three bytes in an RGBA texture, so WebGL rejected the upload. Critical: no. The title still drew. The stops are now four-byte pixels."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e4f12a4-a049-45a4-9dbc-bb4ef72ae500-91","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"Twenty-one issues. Testing caught a phantom first log rep, a second ragdoll on the plank, an Island Loop cadence that scored 26, plate bots that left the band, a key window that made the slow plate band unreachable, a clumsy plate wander that could not drop a plate, a Room Service tray at the wrong size, a raft that ignored skill, a raft whose balance wish never reached the joint, two check-in lean bugs, The Cairn latching zero stones, a Still Water guest stuck outside the calm, a log depth score that ignored near misses, mouse edges dropped before they were read, a parked stick that kept the last device, an attract demo that woke itself, fruit and stamp effects with no low end, About pages that did not turn, a hover that rebuilt the button under the pointer, and shader comment URLs left in the bundle.\",","new_string":"    \"Twenty-two issues. Testing caught a phantom first log rep, a second ragdoll on the plank, an Island Loop cadence that scored 26, plate bots that left the band, a key window that made the slow plate band unreachable, a clumsy plate wander that could not drop a plate, a Room Service tray at the wrong size, a raft that ignored skill, a raft whose balance wish never reached the joint, two check-in lean bugs, The Cairn latching zero stones, a Still Water guest stuck outside the calm, a log depth score that ignored near misses, mouse edges dropped before they were read, a parked stick that kept the last device, an attract demo that woke itself, fruit and stamp effects with no low end, About pages that did not turn, a hover that rebuilt the button under the pointer, shader comment URLs left in the bundle, and a toon ramp whose three stops were too short for an RGBA upload.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e4f12a4-a049-45a4-9dbc-bb4ef72ae500-92","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"Issues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-one in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.","new_string":"Issues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-two in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":968,"output_tokens":1628,"cache_read_input_tokens":131200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"c556ae3c-e438-4447-a38c-0800ce872bfb"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e4f12a4-a049-45a4-9dbc-bb4ef72ae500-90","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"21. The bundled shader comments still contained web URLs. Critical: no. The page ran, and the unit check rejected the strings.\",\"new_string\":\"21. The bundled shader comments still contained web URLs. Critical: no. The page ran, and the unit check rejected the strings.\\n22. The toon ramp was three bytes in an RGBA texture, so WebGL rejected the upload. Critical: no. The title still drew. The stops are now four-byte pixels.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"21. The bundled shader comments still contained web URLs. Critical: no. The page ran, and the unit check rejected the strings.\",\"old_line\":23,\"new_string\":\"21. The bundled shader comments still contained web URLs. Critical: no. The page ran, and the unit check rejected the strings.\\n22. The toon ramp was three bytes in an RGBA texture, so WebGL rejected the upload. Critical: no. The title still drew. The stops are now four-byte pixels.\",\"new_line\":23,\"context_before\":\"18. Fruit and stamp effects were silent because the noise had no low frequency for the lowpass. Critical: no. The rest of the mix was audible.\\n19. About and the journal ignored next, previous, and left and right, so the page stayed on the title. Critical: yes. The credits could not be read.\\n20. Hovering a choice rebuilt the button, so the click never landed. Critical: yes. Touch Settings did not open.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e4f12a4-a049-45a4-9dbc-bb4ef72ae500-91","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Twenty-one issues. Testing caught a phantom first log rep, a second ragdoll on the plank, an Island Loop cadence that scored 26, plate bots that left the band, a key window that made the slow plate band unreachable, a clumsy plate wander that could not drop a plate, a Room Service tray at the wrong size, a raft that ignored skill, a raft whose balance wish never reached the joint, two check-in lean bugs, The Cairn latching zero stones, a Still Water guest stuck outside the calm, a log depth score that ignored near misses, mouse edges dropped before they were read, a parked stick that kept the last device, an attract demo that woke itself, fruit and stamp effects with no low end, About pages that did not turn, a hover that rebuilt the button under the pointer, and shader comment URLs left in the bundle.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Twenty-two issues. Testing caught a phantom first log rep, a second ragdoll on the plank, an Island Loop cadence that scored 26, plate bots that left the band, a key window that made the slow plate band unreachable, a clumsy plate wander that could not drop a plate, a Room Service tray at the wrong size, a raft that ignored skill, a raft whose balance wish never reached the joint, two check-in lean bugs, The Cairn latching zero stones, a Still Water guest stuck outside the calm, a log depth score that ignored near misses, mouse edges dropped before they were read, a parked stick that kept the last device, an attract demo that woke itself, fruit and stamp effects with no low end, About pages that did not turn, a hover that rebuilt the button under the pointer, shader comment URLs left in the bundle, and a toon ramp whose three stops were too short for an RGBA upload.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Twenty-one issues. Testing caught a phantom first log rep, a second ragdoll on the plank, an Island Loop cadence that scored 26, plate bots that left the band, a key window that made the slow plate band unreachable, a clumsy plate wander that could not drop a plate, a Room Service tray at the wrong size, a raft that ignored skill, a raft whose balance wish never reached the joint, two check-in lean bugs, The Cairn latching zero stones, a Still Water guest stuck outside the calm, a log depth score that ignored near misses, mouse edges dropped before they were read, a parked stick that kept the last device, an attract demo that woke itself, fruit and stamp effects with no low end, About pages that did not turn, a hover that rebuilt the button under the pointer, and shader comment URLs left in the bundle.\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Twenty-two issues. Testing caught a phantom first log rep, a second ragdoll on the plank, an Island Loop cadence that scored 26, plate bots that left the band, a key window that made the slow plate band unreachable, a clumsy plate wander that could not drop a plate, a Room Service tray at the wrong size, a raft that ignored skill, a raft whose balance wish never reached the joint, two check-in lean bugs, The Cairn latching zero stones, a Still Water guest stuck outside the calm, a log depth score that ignored near misses, mouse edges dropped before they were read, a parked stick that kept the last device, an attract demo that woke itself, fruit and stamp effects with no low end, About pages that did not turn, a hover that rebuilt the button under the pointer, shader comment URLs left in the bundle, and a toon ramp whose three stops were too short for an RGBA upload.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"Thirteen were critical. The plank could panic physics, Island Loop and the sharp plate bot scored as a failure, keys could not reach the slow band, plates could not be lost, Room Service could not deliver, the raft joint stayed at rest, The Cairn always reported zero stones, the check-in lean sign would publish the wrong Wobble Age, mouse confirm never fired, attract mode would not stay up, About could not leave its first page, and the only touch control did not open.\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful test was a sharp bot driving each event through the real pad path and reading that event's own result.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful test was counting renderer frames without reading pixels. A lost device still increments the frame counter.\\\"\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e4f12a4-a049-45a4-9dbc-bb4ef72ae500-92","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"Issues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-one in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\",\"new_string\":\"Issues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-two in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"Issues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-one in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\",\"old_line\":17,\"new_string\":\"Issues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-two in all, thirteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\",\"new_line\":17,\"context_before\":\"\\n`node tools/test.mjs full` printed `102 passed, 0 failed`. Two file:// launches drew the WebGPU title and left it on Enter. The hub harness passed for 1 player, 2 players, 4 players with latency, jitter and loss, and a host leaving. Outside a session, Enter and Space leave a drawn frame.\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"efcefbfb-e5ef-47dc-96f5-7c9cb81cb089"}
