{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_469","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The test log shows only 102 passed tests and no failures. That seems suspiciously short.\n\nThe verification plan expects only a count line when no failures exist. The launch log shows painted cover, title text, and viewport changes. The hub log passed all four scenarios plus solo enter and space. Criterion 4 requires 30px gameplay text at 1920x1080.\n\nI will inspect the tests to confirm they drive real code and hunt for genuine bugs in core systems. I also need to verify the HTML file is self-contained.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The captured logs claim a clean suite and two painted launches. I'll check whether the tests actually drive the shipped game and whether the launch images match those numbers."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c6d941a-81d7-4fe4-b9c4-26b6157a57c8-9","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/launch-1.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c6d941a-81d7-4fe4-b9c4-26b6157a57c8-10","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/launch-2.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c6d941a-81d7-4fe4-b9c4-26b6157a57c8-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/test.mjs","limit":150}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c6d941a-81d7-4fe4-b9c4-26b6157a57c8-12","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^(export )?(async )?function |^test\\(|^await |it\\(|describe\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test","glob":"*.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"ca