{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_476","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The raft implementation looks complete with the planned parameters: radius shrink and tilt K 6 C 3.\n\nGravity is omitted because raft positions are kinematic numbers rather than Rapier bodies. Island Loop gravity is a documented deviation. The stride uses slope. Visual tilt might not update depending on whether the renderer reads event tilt. I am weighing whether this qualifies as a refute-worthy bug, guided by instructions to avoid extending scope and to pass criteria whose evidence holds.\n\nCriterion 3 is met because the event still plays its rules. The uphill effect is approximated. Tests pass with sharp bot form above 85. The key question is whether unused gravity counts as a core no-op.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-564ba08a-ba6e-4c7f-ab4b-88d501e4233a-35","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"restTilt|tiltQuaternion|islandGroup|detune|levelled|completed","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-564ba08a-ba6e-4c7f-ab4b-88d501e4233a-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PLAN.md","offset":584,"limit":180}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5873,"output_tokens":517,"cache_read_input_tokens":85888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"8258bf23-85a1-4c26-bc97-5ac5130fa2db"}
