{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_481","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking how hub.time() advances during the harness.\n\nThe harness passed because it simulated time in large jumps, skipping the 0.1s window entirely. A real session uses a continuous shared clock advancing at up to 30 steps per second.\n\nThe game loop likely advances a fixed accumulator and calls `sessionFixed` repeatedly per frame. Each call reads the same absolute hub clock value, so the 0.1s window is evaluated against identical timestamps.\n\nIf hub.time() lands inside the 0.1s window, every substep in that frame and all subsequent frames until the clock crosses 56 will each trigger a score. At 6 fps this may be one frame. At 60 fps it could mean roughly twelve scorings.\n\nAt 6 fps, a single frame may step 0.16s while hub.time() remains frozen at the same timestamp. If that timestamp falls inside the 0.1s window, every one of the up to 30 substeps in that frame restarts and scores the event. This produces at least one frame of duplicate scores.\n\nThe harness may have mocked hub.time() to skip the 0.1s window entirely, which would explain why it passed despite the bug. Early-finishing events like poses and springboard also restart mid-slot, not just within the 0.1s window. For example, a pose at local time 39 finishes before 56, so it scores and immediately starts a new one that runs until 55.9, then repeats.\n\nSpringboard can finish two full rounds plus a partial round in about fifty seconds, scoring multiple times within the same slot. This violates criterion 5 and the plan's rule that each slot gives exactly one round(form × 10).","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9521b805-2da2-4c73-90f8-9519c2d06b64-50","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/charts.js","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9521b805-2da2-4c73-90f8-9519c2d06b64-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","offset":330,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9521b805-2da2-4c73-90f8-9519c2d06b64-52","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"parts\\.push|slot !==","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3418,"output_tokens":1313,"cache_read_input_tokens":117888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"7bbec3f2-24a5-4271-96c2-b415650f5485"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9521b805-2da2-4c73-90f8-9519c2d06b64-50","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n10→  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n20→\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n30→  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n40→    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n10→  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n20→\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n30→  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n40→    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/charts.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n\",\"total_lines\":78}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9521b805-2da2-4c73-90f8-9519c2d06b64-51","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"330→    if (screen === 'island') {\\n      if (id === 'plan') return setScreen('plan');\\n      if (id === 'bed') return setScreen('bed');\\n      if (id === 'menu') return setScreen('menu');\\n    }\\n    if ((screen === 'about' || screen === 'journal') && (id === 'next' || id === 'prev')) {\\n      const count = screen === 'about' ? aboutPages().length : 3;\\n      page = (page + (id === 'next' ? 1 : count - 1)) % count;\\n    }\\n    paint();\\n340→  }\\n\\n  function pageOfEnding() {\\n    if (screen === 'ending') return 'credits';\\n    return 'credits';\\n  }\\n\\n  function beginDay() {\\n    freePick = false;\\n    profile.classDone = [];\\n350→    talk('trudy', 'morning');\\n    setScreen('morning');\\n  }\\n\\n  function answerQuestion(id) {\\n    const q = QUESTIONS[profile.dayIndex % QUESTIONS.length];\\n    const key = id === 'yes' ? q.yes : id === 'no' ? q.no : id === 'left' ? q.left : q.right;\\n    const line = lookup(key);\\n    speech = { who: 'Trudy', text: line ? line.text : 'Noted.', id: key };\\n    speechLeft = 1.2;\\n360→    if (line) audio.say(line.text, 'trudy');\\n    setScreen('reply');\\n  }\\n\\n  function openIntro(id) {\\n    eventId = id;\\n    tier = (pendingStart && pendingStart.tier) || tierFor(id);\\n    setScreen('intro');\\n  }\\n\\n370→  function beginCountdown() {\\n    const plan = today();\\n    const extra = pendingStart || {};\\n    pendingStart = null;\\n    startEvent(eventId, {\\n      seed: extra.seed,\\n      tier: extra.tier,\\n      lanes: extra.lanes,\\n      skill: extra.skill,\\n      tests: eventId === 'checkin' ? plan.tests : extra.tests,\\n380→      god: extra.god || screen === 'attract',\\n    });\\n    if (eventId === 'checkin') {\\n      screen = 'checkinPlay';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    countLeft = 3;\\n    setScreen('countdown');\\n  }\\n\\n390→  function afterResult() {\\n    if (eventId === 'checkin') return;\\n    profile.marbles += jarPay;\\n    jarLeft = 2;\\n    audio.sfx('marble');\\n    setScreen('jar');\\n  }\\n\\n  function afterJar() {\\n    if (profile.levelled && eventId === 'grandHold') {\\n400→      sayExact(\\\"Oh. So that's what the middle looks like.\\\");\\n      return setScreen('ending');\\n    }\\n    const plan = today();\\n    const pendingClass = plan.classes.filter((id) => !profile.classDone.includes(id));\\n    if (group && group.playlist) retu