{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_482","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Step class session contains 192 cells.\n\nCell duration is roughly 0.2586 seconds, yielding a total session of about 50 seconds. The restart bug triggers when an event marks done before local time reaches 55.9, plus a 0.1-second window for all events. Simulating the game loop to verify this timing gap.\n\nThe game loop accumulates real time into a fixed-step accumulator. AIHub.time() advances independently via wall-clock, so it can drift by a few milliseconds during a single frame. If hub.time() reads 55920ms at the start of a frame while local time is still 55.92, the event remains active and the restart condition does not trigger.\n\nThe catch-up loop can score up to 30 bogus events in a single frame. Each substep advances local time into the 55.9-second window and triggers a one-tick event. Even if the loop runs only one fixed step per hub sample, subsequent animation frames still add scores. startEvent is synchronous.\n\nA cheap Node reproduction would demonstrate the bug by comparing expected versus actual behavior. The instructions permit running code only where it is cheap. Workspace modifications are forbidden; only verdict files may be written.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-75dab556-7ffb-4684-b520-f66d592d5ad8-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","offset":1160,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-75dab556-7ffb-4684-b520-f66d592d5ad8-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/tuning.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-75dab556-7ffb-4684-b520-f66d592d5ad8-55","name":"grep","inp