{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_483","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"session.parts is missing from state().\n\nI'll reproduce the bug by mocking AIHub and reading progress calls. A progress score jump exceeding one event's form*10 within the end window indicates the bug. I'm writing a cheap script in skeptic scratch to set up the mock, create a game manually, run a session, and force the RNG to pick poses first. I also noticed that deal() is called once and returns a function.\n\nI need to check the session client API or hub README to see if `hub.rng('deal')` returns a function or a number. If it returns a number, the code would crash when trying to call it as a function.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-496c1007-4507-476f-8bcd-e94ab37f69e5-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"rng\\s*[:(]|this\\.rng|AIHub\\.rng","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/vendor/session.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-496c1007-4507-476f-8bcd-e94ab37f69e5-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"rng","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/tools/hub"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4696,"output_tokens":488,"cache_read_input_tokens":123904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"3e95f218-09af-4ba8-8768-5027d9163e20"}
