{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_489","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll write a spot-check script in the skeptic scratch directory and run it.\n\nThe script will mock AIHub and step the clock in fixed increments to record progress scores. It will simulate a realistic frame with frozen hub time during 30 steps at 55.95s. Audio creation is confirmed safe in Node. The game directory will be used for imports and Rapier initialization.\n\nThe script now defines a deterministic RNG and a `time()` function that returns the global clock. It creates a manual game session with empty event listeners and sets the fixed step size to 1000/120 seconds.\n\nThe script advances the clock from 0 to 70 seconds in 120-step increments. It records every score change with timestamps, screen state, and event time.\n\nThe script will log the first 40 score jumps and the final result. Each 1/120-second tick triggers exactly one physics step, so the full 70-second run covers 8,400 steps. The poses phase ends early around 39 seconds.\n\nThe RNG will be forced to return 0 so the first event is always poses. Scores at 50, 56, and 62 seconds will be recorded. A high timeout will prevent audio warnings from interrupting the run.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4c1cbf9a-7df6-462c-8777-e1c769581079-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"FIXED_DT","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/config.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":507,"output_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":136320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"1cb9ab03-a819-469c-8101-30969df4cda9"}
