 = 42s`, Log Reps is `8 * 5 = 40s` at the default tempo, and Springboard sets `done` after three dives. Those completions fall while `local < 56`.\\\\n\\\\nSpot-check: manual `createGame`, `runSession`, `AIHub.rng` returning 0 so slot 0 is Poses, clock advanced `1/120` s per fixed step. Progress score was 0 at t=0, 257 at t=39 (first Poses ended), then 11576 at t=56. One slot cannot exceed 1000. The same `55.9` latch is in the bundled HTML. The harness still passes because it does not check the score magnitude.\\\\n\\\\nFix: record a slot's part once, and do not call `startEvent` again until `session.slot` changes. Keep the results screen until `local >= 56`. Add a sim-time test that slot 0 contributes one part and the reported score stays ≤ 1000 until the next slot.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/goal-verdict-cfc5772a1498-1-0.json has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/goal-verdict-cfc5772a1498-1-0.json has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/goal-verdict-cfc5772a1498-1-0.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": true,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js:812\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"A hub slot scores and disposes the event while local time is still under 56s, then the next fixed step sees event===null and starts a new one. Poses (33s), Cairn (~42s), Log Reps (40s) and Springboard (3 dives) finish inside the 50s play window and are scored again; once local is in [55.9, 56) every 1/120 step starts a fresh world an