{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_504","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The sessionFixed path is the only option. time() runs once per step.\n\nLocked remains false so the end handler never fires. Progress reports immediately on the first step and then every second of hub time. The test will record progress scores to confirm the final reported score stays at or below 1000 and remains stable. Disposed events are safely skipped once the results screen is reached.\n\nThe original code scored events inside the `local < 56` branch, so an unfinished event could still score if it crossed the threshold while running. Restricting scoring to that same window would miss a late score if the clock jumped past 56 seconds.\n\nReal-time steps are 1/120 seconds, so the [55.9, 56) scoring window is reliably hit. The test will verify the event ID was springboard by storing session.slots on state and reading hubRound.\n\nThe test will also record `session.latchedAt` to confirm the event finished before the 56-second cutoff.\n\nThe test will split the advance into two phases. First it advances until local time nears 40 seconds, confirming the event finished early and produced exactly one part before reaching 55.9 seconds. Then it continues through the remainder of the run.\n\nA capped `time()` function would freeze on the limit and retrigger the bug. The test will instead advance exactly the required number of steps using a `runUntil` helper.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b69e793-92b7-4b9e-99d3-bc8daed635e3-123","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/springboard.js","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1134,"output_tokens":1222,"cache_read_input_tokens":163840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"c8c1c347-7429-4d9c-b70c-8caeccd168f5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6b69e793-92b7-4b9e-99d3-bc8daed635e3-123","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { timingOffset } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { clamp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = { 1: { tower: 5 }, 2: { tower: 7 }, 3: { tower: 9 } };\\n\\n10→export class Springboard extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'springboard';\\n  static title = 'Springboard';\\n  static discipline = 'Balance Play';\\n  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n  static can = 'Pump both feet as the board goes down. Hop near the top. In the air, aim for a clean line or a proud flop.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot steer the board with your weight. Late pumping barely lifts you.';\\n  static verbs = ['leftFoot', 'rightFoot', 'hop', 'weight'];\\n20→  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'The five metre tower. Three dives, best two.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Seven metres. The air is longer.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Nine metres. There is time to change your mind.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.dives = [];\\n30→    this.dive = 0;\\n    this.phase = 'pump';\\n    this.y = 0.05;\\n    this.v = 0;\\n    this.spin = 0;\\n    this.angle = 0;\\n    this.airT = 0;\\n    this.pumpT = 0;\\n    this.height = this.params.tower;\\n    this.scores = [];\\n40→    this.omega = (Math.PI * 2) / 0.9;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { timingOffset } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { clamp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = { 1: { tower: 5 }, 2: { tower: 7 }, 3: { tower: 9 } };\\n\\n10→export class Springboard extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'springboard';\\n  static title = 'Springboard';\\n  static discipline = 'Balance Play';\\n  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n  static can = 'Pump both feet as the board goes down. Hop near the top. In the air, aim for a clean line or a proud flop.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot steer the board with your weight. Late pumping barely lifts you.';\\n  static verbs = ['leftFoot', 'rightFoot', 'hop', 'weight'];\\n20→  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'The five metre tower. Three dives, best two.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Seven metres. The air is longer.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Nine metres. There is time to change your mind.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.dives = [];\\n30→    this.dive = 0;\\n    this.phase = 'pump';\\n    this.y = 0.05;\\n    this.v = 0;\\n    this.spin = 0;\\n    this.angle = 0;\\n    this.airT = 0;\\n    this.pumpT = 0;\\n    this.height = this.params.tower;\\n    this.scores = [];\\n40→    this.omega = (Math.PI * 2) / 0.9;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/springboard.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"import { Standing } from './base.js';\\nimport { getTune } from '../core/tuning.js';\\nimport { medalOf } from '../game/score.js';\\nimport { DEG } from '../physics/balancer.js';\\nimport { timingOffset } from '../input/bot.js';\\nimport { clamp } from './lean.js';\\n\\nconst TIERS = { 1: { tower: 5 }, 2: { tower: 7 }, 3: { tower: 9 } };\\n\\nexport class Springboard extends Standing {\\n  static id = 'springboard';\\n  static title = 'Springboard';\\n  static discipline = 'Balance Play';\\n  static instructor = 'trudy';\\n  static couch = true;\\n  static session = true;\\n  static can = 'Pump both feet as the board goes down. Hop near the top. In the air, aim for a clean line or a proud flop.';\\n  static cant = 'You cannot steer the board with your weight. Late pumping barely lifts you.';\\n  static verbs = ['leftFoot', 'rightFoot', 'hop', 'weight'];\\n  static tiers = {\\n    1: { blurb: 'The five metre tower. Three dives, best two.' },\\n    2: { blurb: 'Seven metres. The air is longer.' },\\n    3: { blurb: 'Nine metres. There is time to change your mind.' },\\n  };\\n\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    super(opts);\\n    this.params = { ...(TIERS[this.tier] || TIERS[1]) };\\n    this.dives = [];\\n    this.dive = 0;\\n    this.phase = 'pump';\\n    this.y = 0.05;\\n    this.v = 0;\\n    this.spin = 0;\\n    this.angle = 0;\\n    this.airT = 0;\\n    this.pumpT = 0;\\n    this.height = this.params.tower;\\n    this.scores = [];\\n    this.omega = (Math.PI * 2) / 0.9;\\n\",\"total_lines\":150}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"24635720-6f02-4ddc-b1eb-46a0810a26ed"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_505","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The air time function is h(t) = 5 + 3t - 0.5·9.\n\nLanding occurs at roughly 1.36 seconds. Each dive takes about 9.96 seconds total. The game ends when three scores are collected, which happens in the fixed update step after finishDive.\n\nThe game ends at the landing of the third dive, not after its show phase. The total time is roughly three times the pump and air duration.\n\nThe event lasts roughly 29 seconds. It ends by local time 35 and is definitely done by 45. The total must be finite and not NaN. The results screen persists through the second advance. Even zero-score dives keep the parts array under 1000 entries. Extra springboard restarts would inflate the length.\n\nA second springboard would finish near 64 seconds, past the 56-second cutoff, scoring as a partial at 55.9 and producing many extra world parts. The test should pass in about ten to twenty seconds. Dispose must tolerate double calls. Interview counts need updating; the about page test walks eighty pages, so adding a few words remains safe. Issue 23 is noted.\n\nThe slot score is no longer a single class. The page builds a new physics world every frame for a tenth of a second. This is a bugfix, not a plan deviation. I will mark the ship in progress while fixing it. I will run the targeted flow test first. Then I will rebuild and run the full suite. The full suite includes the eleven-second attract wall clock and the full week script. That may take thirty to sixty seconds.\n\nThe test runner cannot execute a single test by name, so the flow suite will run as a whole. Interview text changes do not affect the session bug and can be applied before the flow check. After the flow test passes, one rebuild is needed to update the HTML before running the full suite and launching.\n\nThe new test will be appended to flow.mjs. The hubRound state field will be named sessionRound so the test can read the shipped state.\n\nThe sessionRound state field will expose the slot ID, a copy of the parts array, and the total score. The slot defaults to -1 before play and resets to 0 on the first step. A latched flag will be cleared whenever the slot changes from -1 to 0.\n\nEvent result access and ghost sends after disposal are safe. The step-then-check-done order correctly simulates the finishing tick. A single leftover part from a storm event at the cutoff is harmless; springboard events finish earlier and produce valid results.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d4477213-dc79-4a5d-961b-4b2a4a360be7-124","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/flow.mjs","offset":200,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d4477213-dc79-4a5d-961b-4b2a4a360be7-125","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"ship","content":"Latch one hub score per slot and retest","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1799,"output_tokens":1592,"cache_read_input_tokens":164864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"88c73891-d139-4a79-b49d-3a7896c8cf22"}
