{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-35a659a2-cec1-46f0-b418-e2c0becb4207-143","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"11→## Now\\n\\nThe game is built. The work-folder root holds the single HTML file, this note, and exit-interview.json. The dev folder holds the modules and the test command.\\n\\n`node tools/test.mjs full` printed `102 passed, 0 failed`. Two file:// launches drew the WebGPU title and left it on Enter. The hub harness passed for 1 player, 2 players, 4 players with latency, jitter and loss, and a host leaving. Outside a session, Enter and Space leave a drawn frame.\\n\\nIssues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-three in all, fourteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"11→## Now\\n\\nThe game is built. The work-folder root holds the single HTML file, this note, and exit-interview.json. The dev folder holds the modules and the test command.\\n\\n`node tools/test.mjs full` printed `102 passed, 0 failed`. Two file:// launches drew the WebGPU title and left it on Enter. The hub harness passed for 1 player, 2 players, 4 players with latency, jitter and loss, and a host leaving. Outside a session, Enter and Space leave a drawn frame.\\n\\nIssues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-three in all, fourteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":11,\"raw_output\":\"## Now\\n\\nThe game is built. The work-folder root holds the single HTML file, this note, and exit-interview.json. The dev folder holds the modules and the test command.\\n\\n`node tools/test.mjs full` printed `102 passed, 0 failed`. Two file:// launches drew the WebGPU title and left it on Enter. The hub harness passed for 1 player, 2 players, 4 players with latency, jitter and loss, and a host leaving. Outside a session, Enter and Space leave a drawn frame.\\n\\nIssues found while building are in `notes/issues.md`. Twenty-three in all, fourteen of them critical. The About screen and exit-interview.json use that count.\\n\",\"total_lines\":17}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"05c6c013-43e1-44da-8873-ea67e171733f"}
