{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_526","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to fix a bug identified by the skeptic panel.\n\nThe bug is in director.js around line 841. Slots only score while local time stays below 56 or the event is already done. At 6fps, events like Plate Spinners and Step Class reach results with empty parts and zero total. The fix requires scoring live events on any exit from the play window, including local>=56 and slot changes.\n\nThe simulation must advance time in roughly 1/6-second frames while keeping hub time constant during each frame's fixed steps. A 50-second class in slot 0 should still contain one part with a total between 0 and 1000.\n\nThe game loop accumulates real time and then runs 20 fixed steps per frame. During those steps, AIHub.time() stays constant because it is wall-clock based on the hub rather than simulation time. A single 1/6-second jump from 55.85 to 56.02 therefore hits every step in that frame at local >= 56. The event never scores.\n\nSlot changes also dispose the event before scoring. When local time crosses 62, the code switches slots and destroys the event without latching its score. A jump from slot 0 to slot 1 at that boundary therefore leaves the event unscored.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The play window can close without a score. At 6 fps the hub clock jumps about a sixth of a second, so a 50-second class skips the narrow scoring moment and finishes at zero. I'll score the live event once whenever that window closes."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-67f91c0f-0615-427c-9ae6-b1e6b49c3778-145","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","offset":781,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-67f91c0f-0615-427c-9ae6-b1e6b49c3778-146","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub slot keeps one score","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/flow.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-67f91c0f-0615-427c-9ae6-b1e6b49c3778-147","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"duration|this\\.t >=","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/plates.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12539,"output_tokens":1135,"cache_read_input_tokens":166656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"5d8084ae-db40-41b3-a38a-92a185cf262f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-67f91c0f-0615-427c-9ae6-b1e6b49c3778-145","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"781→  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n790→      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000;\\n    if (t < 0) {\\n      screen = 'countdown';\\n      countLeft = Math.max(0, -t);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const slot = Math.min(session.slots.length, Math.floor(t / 62));\\n    const local = t - slot * 62;\\n800→    if (slot >= session.slots.length) {\\n      screen = 'waiting';\\n      sendResult();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.slot !== slot) {\\n      session.slot = slot;\\n      session.playT = 0;\\n      session.latched = false;\\n      if (event) event.dispose();\\n810→      event = null;\\n      eventId = session.slots[slot];\\n    }\\n    if (local < 6) {\\n      screen = 'intro';\\n      session.scoreShown = session.total;\\n    } else if (local < 56) {\\n      if (!event && !session.latched) {\\n        startEvent(eventId, { session: true, lanes: [{ id: 0, kind: 'local', name: profile.name, colour: SEAT_COLOURS[hub.me || 0] }] });\\n      }\\n820→      if (event && !session.latched) {\\n        const input = inputs[0];\\n        let snaps;\\n        if (botSkill) snaps = driveBots(dt);\\n        else {\\n          input.poll(dt, 'balance');\\n          snaps = [input.snapshot(0)];\\n        }\\n        stepEvent(dt, snaps);\\n        session.playT += dt;\\n830→        if (event.done || local >= 55.9) {\\n          const result = event.result(0);\\n          session.parts.push(Math.round((result.form || 0) * 10));\\n          session.total = session.parts.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n          session.best = medalLabel(result.medal || 'attended');\\n          session.latched = true;\\n          event.dispose();\\n          event = null;\\n          screen = 'results';\\n        } else screen = 'play';\\n840→      } else screen = 'results';\\n    } else screen = 'results';\\n    if (t - session.lastProgress >= 1 || session.lastProgress < 0) {\\n      const label = `${eventTitle(session.slots[slot])} ${session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total}`.slice(0, 24);\\n      const score = session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total;\\n      hub.progress({ score, label });\\n      session.lastProgress = t;\\n    }\\n    if (t - session.lastGhost >= 0.1) {\\n      const lean = event && event.states ? event.states[0] : { leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, fallen: false };\\n850→      hub.send({\\n        t: 'g', a: slot, x: 0, z: 0,\\n        lx: Number((lean.leanX || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        lz: Number((lean.leanZ || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        c: 0, f: lean.fallen ? 1 : 0, s: session.total,\\n      }, { reliable: false });\\n      session.lastGhost = t;\\n    }\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n860→\\n  function sendResult() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!session || session.sent || !hub) return;\\n    session.sent = true;\\n    const score = session.total || 0;\\n    hub.result({\\n      score,\\n      stats: { 'Floor Exercises': profile.floor, 'Best medal': session.best || 'Attended', 'Wobble Age': profile.ages[0] || 41 },\\n      awards: score >= 2500 ? ['Suspiciously Still'] : ['Showed Up'],\\n870→    });\",\"content_concise\":\"781→  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n790→      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000