{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_546","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I am acting as an adversarial verifier.I am acting as an adversarial verifier for the Grok Build harness.\n\nThe verifier targets a specific prior gap in director.js: the local>=56 branch only switches to results, so events like Plate Spinners, Fruit Hat, and Step Class reach results with empty ","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"parts and zero total","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":" audit the prior scoring-"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" at 6fps.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"window gap against the current director, the sim-time test, and the captured run — not a new checklist."},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe verifier will require live scoring on every exit from the play window, including slot changes. The simulation clock must advance in roughly 1/6-second frames with constant time during each frame's steps. A 50-second class must still produce one part with a total between zero and 1000.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'll verify the prior scoring-window bug is actually fixed, starting with the director, the new sim-time test, and the captured run."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-55a8e305-2e90-4d45-a801-df558f52c87f-0","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"local >= 56|local>=56|55\\.9|scoreLive|exitPlay|parts","glob":"**/director.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-55a8e305-2e90-4d45-a801-df558f52c87f-1","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"1/6|sixth|6fps|55\\.9|slot 0|AIHub\\.time","glob":"**/*.{mjs,js,md}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-55a8e305-2e90-4d45-a801-df558f52c87f-2","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":22891,"output_tokens":472,"cache_re