xhigh-20261104-231317/test/flow.mjs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":237,\"content\":\"      assert(end.sessionRound.slot === 0, `left slot 0 at ${end.sessionRound.slot}`);\"},{\"line_number\":250,\"content\":\"  tests.push(['a 6fps hub clock scores one 50s class', async () => {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/about.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"    \\\"Fifteen were critical. The plank could panic physics, Island Loop and the sharp plate bot scored as a failure, keys could not reach the slow band, plates could not be lost, Room Service could not deliver, the raft joint stayed at rest, The Cairn always reported zero stones, the check-in lean sign would publish the wrong Wobble Age, mouse confirm never fired, attract mode would not stay up, About could not leave its first page, the only touch control did not open, a hub slot scored the same class more than once, and a 6fps clock left a finished class with no score.\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":632,\"content\":\"3. **The round runs on `AIHub.time()` alone,** so everyone is in the same class at the same moment. Count down from 3 while the time is negative. Three slots picked with `AIHub.rng('deal')` from the session set (Poses, Cairn, Log Reps, Step Class, Plate Spinners, Fruit Hat, Springboard), no repeats: each is 6 s intro, 50 s play (`sessionConfig` makes each event fit exactly), 6 s score. Total 186 s, within the 270 s limit that 3 minutes gives ✔. If time jumps (hidden tab), go to the slot the clock says.\"},{\"line_number\":633,\"content\":\"4. **Ghosts.** From the moment `AIHub.time()` reaches 0, including during intros, about 10 times a second, `AIHub.send({ t:'g', a:slotIndex, x, z, lx, lz, c:clipIndex, f:fallen?1:0, s:score }, { reliable:false })`. Keep it well under 1,200 bytes. Show a ghost only when its `a` equals your slot. Interpolate over about 150 ms. Ghosts are visual only: name tag (set with `textContent`, never HTML), seat colour on the shirt, a flop clip for `f`. They never touch your physics. Remove on `leave`.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":844,\"content\":\"        if (event.done || local >= 55.9) latchSlot();\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"24. A hub slot scored only inside a tenth of a second at the end of play. Critical: yes. At 6fps the clock steps over that window, so Plate Spinners, Fruit Hat, and Step Class finished with no score.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-55a8e305-2e90-4d45-a801-df558f52c87f-2","content":"{\"type\":\"ListDir\",\"Content\":{\"content\":\"- /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/\\n  - hub.log\\n  - launch-1.png\\n  - launch-2.png\\n  - launch.log\\n  - test-full.log\\n  - webkit.log\",\"absolute_root_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"b816f84c-c3ad-4c14-9755-299b6b9f8bb1"}
