ne_number\":632,\"content\":\"3. **The round runs on `AIHub.time()` alone,** so everyone is in the same class at the same moment. Count down from 3 while the time is negative. Three slots picked with `AIHub.rng('deal')` from the session set (Poses, Cairn, Log Reps, Step Class, Plate Spinners, Fruit Hat, Springboard), no repeats: each is 6 s intro, 50 s play (`sessionConfig` makes each event fit exactly), 6 s score. Total 186 s, within the 270 s limit that 3 minutes gives ✔. If time jumps (hidden tab), go to the slot the clock says.\"},{\"line_number\":633,\"content\":\"4. **Ghosts.** From the moment `AIHub.time()` reaches 0, including during intros, about 10 times a second, `AIHub.send({ t:'g', a:slotIndex, x, z, lx, lz, c:clipIndex, f:fallen?1:0, s:score }, { reliable:false })`. Keep it well under 1,200 bytes. Show a ghost only when its `a` equals your slot. Interpolate over about 150 ms. Ghosts are visual only: name tag (set with `textContent`, never HTML), seat colour on the shirt, a flop clip for `f`. They never touch your physics. Remove on `leave`.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/flow.mjs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":237,\"content\":\"      assert(end.sessionRound.slot === 0, `left slot 0 at ${end.sessionRound.slot}`);\"},{\"line_number\":250,\"content\":\"  tests.push(['a 6fps hub clock scores one 50s class', async () => {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/notes/issues.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"24. A hub slot scored only inside a tenth of a second at the end of play. Critical: yes. At 6fps the clock steps over that window, so Plate Spinners, Fruit Hat, and Step Class finished with no score.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/about.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"    \\\"Fifteen were critical. The plank could panic physics, Island Loop and the sharp plate bot scored as a failure, keys could not reach the slow band, plates could not be lost, Room Service could not deliver, the raft joint stayed at rest, The Cairn always reported zero stones, the check-in lean sign would publish the wrong Wobble Age, mouse confirm never fired, attract mode would not stay up, About could not leave its first page, the only touch control did not open, a hub slot scored the same class more than once, and a 6fps clock left a finished class with no score.\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":844,\"content\":\"        if (event.done || local >= 55.9) latchSlot();\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-70c38f9a-701e-44b9-a7d1-3b848d589de8-2","content":"{\"type\":\"ListDir\",\"Content\":{\"content\":\"- /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/\\n  - hub.log\\n  - launch-1.png\\n  - launch-2.png\\n  - launch.log\\n  - test-full.log\\n  - webkit.log\",\"absolute_root_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"755f60f1-2d59-4fee-8222-4e37d5d1bade"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_548","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to read the director.js scoring logic for hub session slots and the flow test.","signature":"AUhnQL58RI/j3T2Pr3INnHAm+3WIgt7qmMe7IeUEtVmV56IFT4sdrUezdr/antG2B6ZznierOSmvKcmqP3NHR2yifR5yyD1kQ0reE88nBcIrW6ecYW+xMPUfD0uITbVjhNLY8GGSgX/nD3vlX+LrCM0MjzIOFXy2vcGqSm481pHbLM3WFBa1qo/ujQG3GQ08BvybDuvQxBYHhYPiXIAKAX0E2r+D8uAAYE51OCnZBlSUM2LGfY+hl9CXEbj5O3BIyuSx8mk06M4tR7UQKQlmwt9j"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92da2047-2152-4771-ab96-1c0afa94b472-3","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","offset":740,"limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92da2047-2152-4771-ab96-1c0afa94b472-4","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/test/flow.mjs","offset":150,"limit":250}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92da2047-2152-4771-ab96-1c0afa94b472-5","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"6fps|104 passed|passed, 0 failed|a 6fps","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1889,"output_tokens":303,"cache_read_input_tokens":24576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"69d86732-3247-43f1-bce7-5ffee987941f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-92da2047-2152-4771-ab96-1c0afa94b472-3","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"740→      attract.left = 18;\\n      if (attract.index % ATTRACT.length === 0) {\\n        attract.between = 5;\\n        screen = 'title';\\n        botSkill = null;\\n      } else launchAttract();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stopAttract(swallow) {\\n750→    if (event) { event.dispose(); event = null; }\\n    attract = null;\\n    botSkill = null;\\n    botOpt = {};\\n    idle = 0;\\n    for (const pad of pads) clearPad(pad);\\n    screen = coarse ? 'touch' : 'title';\\n    if (swallow) paint();\\n  }\\n\\n760→  function joinPads(sample) {\\n    if (screen !== 'group' || !group) return false;\\n    let used = false;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      const pad = padAt(i);\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons[0] && pad.buttons[0].pressed && !group.seats[i]) {\\n        group.seats[i] = { name: `Player ${i + 1}`, device: 'pad' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons[1] && pad.buttons[1].pressed) group.seats[i] = null;\\n770→    }\\n    if (sample.edges.confirm && !group.seats.some((s) => s && s.device === 'key')) {\\n      const slot = group.seats.findIndex((s) => !s);\\n      if (slot >= 0) {\\n        group.seats[slot] = { name: profile.name, device: 'key' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return used;\\n  }\\n780→\\n  function latchSlot() {\\n    if (!session || session.latched || !event) return;\\n    const result = event.result(0);\\n    session.parts.push(Math.round((result.form || 0) * 10));\\n    session.total = session.parts.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n    session.best = medalLabel(result.medal || 'attended');\\n    session.latched = true;\\n    event.dispose();\\n    event = null;\\n790→    screen = 'results';\\n  }\\n\\n  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n800→      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000;\\n    if (t < 0) {\\n      screen = 'countdown';\\n      countLeft = Math.max(0, -t);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n810→    const slot = Math.min(session.slots.length, Math.floor(t / 62));\\n    const local = t - slot * 62;\\n    if (slot >= session.slots.length) {\\n      latchSlot();\\n      screen = 'waiting';\\n      sendResult();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.slot !== slot) {\\n      latchSlot();\\n820→      session.slot = slot;\\n      session.playT = 0;\\n      session.latched = false;\\n      if (event) event.dispose();\\n      event = null;\\n      eventId = session.slots[slot];\\n    }\\n    if (local < 6) {\\n      screen = 'intro';\\n      session.scoreShown = session.total;\\n830→    } else if (local < 56) {\\n      if (!event && !session.latched) {\\n        startEvent(eventId, { session: true, lanes: [{ id: 0, kind: 'local', name: profile.name, colour: SEAT_COLOURS[hub.me || 0] }] });\\n      }\\n      if (event && !session.latched) {\\n        const input = inputs[0];\\n        let snaps;\\n        if (botSkill) snaps = driveBots(dt);\\n        else {\\n          input.poll(dt, 'balance');\\n840→          snaps = [input.snapshot(0)];\\n        }\\n        stepEvent(dt, snaps);\\n        session.playT += dt;\\n        if (event.done || local >= 55.9) latchSlot();\\n        else screen = 'play';\\n      } else screen = 'results';\\n    } else if (!session.latched) latchSlot();\\n    else screen = 'results';\\n    if (t - session.lastProgress >= 1 || session.lastProgress < 0) {\\n850→      const label = `${eventTitle(session.slots[slot])} ${session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total}`.slice(0, 24);\\n      const score = session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total;\\n      hub.progress({ score, label });\\n      session.lastProgress = t;\\n    }\\n    if (t - session.lastGhost >= 0.1) {\\n      const lean = event && event.states ? event.states[0] : { leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, fallen: false };\\n      hub.send({\\n        t: 'g', a: slot, x: 0, z: 0,\\n        lx: Number((lean.leanX || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n860→        lz: Number((lean.leanZ || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        c: 0, f: lean.fallen ? 1 : 0, s: session.total,\\n      }, { reliable: false });\\n      session.lastGhost = t;\\n    }\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sendResult() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n870→    if (!session || session.sent || !hub) return;\\n    session.sent = true;\\n    const score = session.total || 0;\\n    hub.result({\\n      score,\\n      stats: { 'Floor Exercises': profile.floor, 'Best medal': session.best || 'Attended', 'Wobble Age': profile.ages[0] || 41 },\\n      awards: score >= 2500 ? ['Suspiciously Still'] : ['Showed Up'],\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n880→  function eventTitle(id) {\\n    const Ctor = eventById(id);\\n    return Ctor ? Ctor.title : 'Class';\\n  }\\n\\n  function frame() {\\n    frames += 1;\\n    if (!locked) audio.tick();\\n    for (const fn of listeners) fn();\\n    paint();\\n890→  }\\n\\n  function model() {\\n    const device = inputs[0].lastDevice;\\n    const prompts = promptFor(currentVerbs(), device, settings.glyphs);\\n    const lines = [];\\n    const choices = [];\\n    let heading = '';\\n    const add = (id, label, extra = {}) => choices.push({ id, label, index: choices.length, focus: choices.length === focus, ...extra });\\n    if (coarse && screen === 'title') screen = 'touch';\\n900→    if (screen === 'touch') {\\n      lines.push('Controller or keyboard required');\\n      lines.push(TAGLINE);\\n      add('settings', 'Settings');\\n    } else if (screen === 'title' || (attract && attract.between > 0)) {\\n      lines.push(TAGLINE);\\n      lines.push('Press to begin');\\n      add('begin', 'Begin');\\n    } else if (screen === 'who') {\\n      heading = \\\"Who's here?\\\";\\n910→      add('begin', 'Begin');\\n      add('name', `Name: ${NAMES[profile.nameIndex]}`);\\n      add('paint', `Paint: ${PAINTS[profile.paintIndex].id}`);\\n      add('hat', `Hat: ${HATS[profile.hatIndex].label}`);\\n    } else if (screen === 'tutorial') {\\n      heading = 'How a day works';\\n      lines.push('You can lean, step, hop, and flail. You cannot type a name.');\\n      lines.push('Flail is a short save with a cooldown. It is not a free win.');\\n      add('on', 'Step on');\\n    } else if (screen === 'menu') {\\n920→      heading = 'Level Best Retreat';\\n      const cont = profile.dayIndex > 0 || profile.classDone.length ? 'Continue' : 'Programme';\\n      add('programme', cont);\\n      add('group', 'Group Class');\\n      add('free', 'Free Play');\\n      add('journal', 'Journal');\\n      add('settings', 'Settings');\\n      add('about', 'About / Credits');\\n    } else if (screen === 'morning') {\\n      heading = today().name;\\n930→      lines.push(speech ? speech.text : 'Good morning.');\\n      add('on', 'Continue');\\n    } else if (screen === 'question') {\\n      const q = QUESTIONS[profile.dayIndex % QUESTIONS.length];\\n      const line = lookup(q.ask);\\n      heading = 'A small question';\\n      lines.push(line ? line.text : 'Do you trust your knees?');\\n      if (q.kind === 'side') { add('left', 'Left'); add('right', 'Right'); }\\n      else { add('yes', 'Yes'); add('no', 'No'); }\\n    } else if (screen === 'reply') {\",\"content_concise\":\"740→      attract.left = 18;\\n      if (attract.index % ATTRACT.length === 0) {\\n        attract.between = 5;\\n        screen = 'title';\\n        botSkill = null;\\n      } else launchAttract();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stopAttract(swallow) {\\n750→    if (event) { event.dispose(); event = null; }\\n    attract = null;\\n    botSkill = null;\\n    botOpt = {};\\n    idle = 0;\\n    for (const pad of pads) clearPad(pad);\\n    screen = coarse ? 'touch' : 'title';\\n    if (swallow) paint();\\n  }\\n\\n760→  function joinPads(sample) {\\n    if (screen !== 'group' || !group) return false;\\n    let used = false;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      const pad = padAt(i);\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons[0] && pad.buttons[0].pressed && !group.seats[i]) {\\n        group.seats[i] = { name: `Player ${i + 1}`, device: 'pad' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons[1] && pad.buttons[1].pressed) group.seats[i] = null;\\n770→    }\\n    if (sample.edges.confirm && !group.seats.some((s) => s && s.device === 'key')) {\\n      const slot = group.seats.findIndex((s) => !s);\\n      if (slot >= 0) {\\n        group.seats[slot] = { name: profile.name, device: 'key' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return used;\\n  }\\n780→\\n  function latchSlot() {\\n    if (!session || session.latched || !event) return;\\n    const result = event.result(0);\\n    session.parts.push(Math.round((result.form || 0) * 10));\\n    session.total = session.parts.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n    session.best = medalLabel(result.medal || 'attended');\\n    session.latched = true;\\n    event.dispose();\\n    event = null;\\n790→    screen = 'results';\\n  }\\n\\n  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n800→      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000;\\n    if (t < 0) {\\n      screen = 'countdown';\\n      countLeft = Math.max(0, -t);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n810→    const slot = Math.min(session.slots.length, Math.floor(t / 62));\\n    const local = t - slot * 62;\\n    if (slot >= session.slots.length) {\\n      latchSlot();\\n      screen = 'waiting';\\n      sendResult();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.slot !== slot) {\\n      latchSlot();\\n820→      session.slot = slot;\\n      session.playT = 0;\\n      session.latched = false;\\n      if (event) event.dispose();\\n      event = null;\\n      eventId = session.slots[slot];\\n    }\\n    if (local < 6) {\\n      screen = 'intro';\\n      session.scoreShown = session.total;\\n830→    } else if (local < 56) {\\n      if (!event && !session.latched) {\\n        startEvent(eventId, { session: true, lanes: [{ id: 0, kind: 'local', name: profile.name, colour: SEAT_COLOURS[hub.me || 0] }] });\\n      }\\n      if (event && !session.latched) {\\n        const input = inputs[0];\\n        let snaps;\\n        if (botSkill) snaps = driveBots(dt);\\n        else {\\n          input.poll(dt, 'balance');\\n840→          snaps = [input.snapshot(0)];\\n        }\\n        stepEvent(dt, snaps);\\n        session.playT += dt;\\n        if (event.done || local >= 55.9) latchSlot();\\n        else screen = 'play';\\n      } else screen = 'results';\\n    } else if (!session.latched) latchSlot();\\n    else screen = 'results';\\n    if (t - session.lastProgress >= 1 || session.lastProgress < 0) {\\n850→      const label = `${eventTitle(session.slots[slot])} ${session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total}`.slice(0, 24);\\n      const score = session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total;\\n      hub.progress({ score, label });\\n      session.lastProgress = t;\\n    }\\n    if (t - session.lastGhost >= 0.1) {\\n      const lean = event && event.states ? event.states[0] : { leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, fallen: false };\\n      hub.send({\\n        t: 'g', a: slot, x: 0, z: 0,\\n        lx: Number((lean.leanX || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n860→        lz: Number((lean.leanZ || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        c: 0, f: lean.fallen ? 1 : 0, s: session.total,\\n      }, { reliable: false });\\n      session.lastGhost = t;\\n    }\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sendResult() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n870→    if (!session || session.sent || !hub) return;\\n    session.sent = true;\\n    const score = session.total || 0;\\n    hub.result({\\n      score,\\n      stats: { 'Floor Exercises': profile.floor, 'Best medal': session.best || 'Attended', 'Wobble Age': profile.ages[0] || 41 },\\n      awards: score >= 2500 ? ['Suspiciously Still'] : ['Showed Up'],\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n880→  function eventTitle(id) {\\n    const Ctor = eventById(id);\\n    return Ctor ? Ctor.title : 'Class';\\n  }\\n\\n  function frame() {\\n    frames += 1;\\n    if (!locked) audio.tick();\\n    for (const fn of listeners) fn();\\n    paint();\\n890→  }\\n\\n  function model() {\\n    const device = inputs[0].lastDevice;\\n    const prompts = promptFor(currentVerbs(), device, settings.glyphs);\\n    const lines = [];\\n    const choices = [];\\n    let heading = '';\\n    const add = (id, label, extra = {}) => choices.push({ id, label, index: choices.length, focus: choices.length === focus, ...extra });\\n    if (coarse && screen === 'title') screen = 'touch';\\n900→    if (screen === 'touch') {\\n      lines.push('Controller or keyboard required');\\n      lines.push(TAGLINE);\\n      add('settings', 'Settings');\\n    } else if (screen === 'title' || (attract && attract.between > 0)) {\\n      lines.push(TAGLINE);\\n      lines.push('Press to begin');\\n      add('begin', 'Begin');\\n    } else if (screen === 'who') {\\n      heading = \\\"Who's here?\\\";\\n910→      add('begin', 'Begin');\\n      add('name', `Name: ${NAMES[profile.nameIndex]}`);\\n      add('paint', `Paint: ${PAINTS[profile.paintIndex].id}`);\\n      add('hat', `Hat: ${HATS[profile.hatIndex].label}`);\\n    } else if (screen === 'tutorial') {\\n      heading = 'How a day works';\\n      lines.push('You can lean, step, hop, and flail. You cannot type a name.');\\n      lines.push('Flail is a short save with a cooldown. It is not a free win.');\\n      add('on', 'Step on');\\n    } else if (screen === 'menu') {\\n920→      heading = 'Level Best Retreat';\\n      const cont = profile.dayIndex > 0 || profile.classDone.length ? 'Continue' : 'Programme';\\n      add('programme', cont);\\n      add('group', 'Group Class');\\n      add('free', 'Free Play');\\n      add('journal', 'Journal');\\n      add('settings', 'Settings');\\n      add('about', 'About / Credits');\\n    } else if (screen === 'morning') {\\n      heading = today().name;\\n930→      lines.push(speech ? speech.text : 'Good morning.');\\n      add('on', 'Continue');\\n    } else if (screen === 'question') {\\n      const q = QUESTIONS[profile.dayIndex % QUESTIONS.length];\\n      const line = lookup(q.ask);\\n      heading = 'A small question';\\n      lines.push(line ? line.text : 'Do you trust your knees?');\\n      if (q.kind === 'side') { add('left', 'Left'); add('right', 'Right'); }\\n      else { add('yes', 'Yes'); add('no', 'No'); }\\n    } else if (screen === 'reply') {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\",\"offset\":740,\"limit\":200,\"raw_output\":\"      attract.left = 18;\\n      if (attract.index % ATTRACT.length === 0) {\\n        attract.between = 5;\\n        screen = 'title';\\n        botSkill = null;\\n      } else launchAttract();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stopAttract(swallow) {\\n    if (event) { event.dispose(); event = null; }\\n    attract = null;\\n    botSkill = null;\\n    botOpt = {};\\n    idle = 0;\\n    for (const pad of pads) clearPad(pad);\\n    screen = coarse ? 'touch' : 'title';\\n    if (swallow) paint();\\n  }\\n\\n  function joinPads(sample) {\\n    if (screen !== 'group' || !group) return false;\\n    let used = false;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      const pad = padAt(i);\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons[0] && pad.buttons[0].pressed && !group.seats[i]) {\\n        group.seats[i] = { name: `Player ${i + 1}`, device: 'pad' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n      if (pad && pad.buttons[1] && pad.buttons[1].pressed) group.seats[i] = null;\\n    }\\n    if (sample.edges.confirm && !group.seats.some((s) => s && s.device === 'key')) {\\n      const slot = group.seats.findIndex((s) => !s);\\n      if (slot >= 0) {\\n        group.seats[slot] = { name: profile.name, device: 'key' };\\n        used = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return used;\\n  }\\n\\n  function latchSlot() {\\n    if (!session || session.latched || !event) return;\\n    const result = event.result(0);\\n    session.parts.push(Math.round((result.form || 0) * 10));\\n    session.total = session.parts.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n    session.best = medalLabel(result.medal || 'attended');\\n    session.latched = true;\\n    event.dispose();\\n    event = null;\\n    screen = 'results';\\n  }\\n\\n  function sessionFixed(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    const ms = hub.time();\\n    if (!Number.isFinite(ms)) {\\n      screen = 'card';\\n      const sample = inputs[0].poll(dt, 'menu');\\n      if (sample.edges.confirm) hub.answer('ready');\\n      if (sample.edges.ask) hub.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const t = ms / 1000;\\n    if (t < 0) {\\n      screen = 'countdown';\\n      countLeft = Math.max(0, -t);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const slot = Math.min(session.slots.length, Math.floor(t / 62));\\n    const local = t - slot * 62;\\n    if (slot >= session.slots.length) {\\n      latchSlot();\\n      screen = 'waiting';\\n      sendResult();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.slot !== slot) {\\n      latchSlot();\\n      session.slot = slot;\\n      session.playT = 0;\\n      session.latched = false;\\n      if (event) event.dispose();\\n      event = null;\\n      eventId = session.slots[slot];\\n    }\\n    if (local < 6) {\\n      screen = 'intro';\\n      session.scoreShown = session.total;\\n    } else if (local < 56) {\\n      if (!event && !session.latched) {\\n        startEvent(eventId, { session: true, lanes: [{ id: 0, kind: 'local', name: profile.name, colour: SEAT_COLOURS[hub.me || 0] }] });\\n      }\\n      if (event && !session.latched) {\\n        const input = inputs[0];\\n        let snaps;\\n        if (botSkill) snaps = driveBots(dt);\\n        else {\\n          input.poll(dt, 'balance');\\n          snaps = [input.snapshot(0)];\\n        }\\n        stepEvent(dt, snaps);\\n        session.playT += dt;\\n        if (event.done || local >= 55.9) latchSlot();\\n        else screen = 'play';\\n      } else screen = 'results';\\n    } else if (!session.latched) latchSlot();\\n    else screen = 'results';\\n    if (t - session.lastProgress >= 1 || session.lastProgress < 0) {\\n      const label = `${eventTitle(session.slots[slot])} ${session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total}`.slice(0, 24);\\n      const score = session.slot === 0 && local < 6 ? 0 : session.total;\\n      hub.progress({ score, label });\\n      session.lastProgress = t;\\n    }\\n    if (t - session.lastGhost >= 0.1) {\\n      const lean = event && event.states ? event.states[0] : { leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, fallen: false };\\n      hub.send({\\n        t: 'g', a: slot, x: 0, z: 0,\\n        lx: Number((lean.leanX || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        lz: Number((lean.leanZ || 0).toFixed(3)),\\n        c: 0, f: lean.fallen ? 1 : 0, s: session.total,\\n      }, { reliable: false });\\n      session.lastGhost = t;\\n    }\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sendResult() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!session || session.sent || !hub) return;\\n    session.sent = true;\\n    const score = session.total || 0;\\n    hub.result({\\n      score,\\n      stats: { 'Floor Exercises': profile.floor, 'Best medal': session.best || 'Attended', 'Wobble Age': profile.ages[0] || 41 },\\n      awards: score >= 2500 ? ['Suspiciously Still'] : ['Showed Up'],\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function eventTitle(id) {\\n    const Ctor = eventById(id);\\n    return Ctor ? Ctor.title : 'Class';\\n  }\\n\\n  function frame() {\\n    frames += 1;\\n    if (!locked) audio.tick();\\n    for (const fn of listeners) fn();\\n    paint();\\n  }\\n\\n  function model() {\\n    const device = inputs[0].lastDevice;\\n    const prompts = promptFor(currentVerbs(), device, settings.glyphs);\\n    const lines = [];\\n    const choices = [];\\n    let heading = '';\\n    const add = (id, label, extra = {}) => choices.push({ id, label, index: choices.length, focus: choices.length === focus, ...extra });\\n    if (coarse && screen === 'title') screen = 'touch';\\n    if (screen === 'touch') {\\n      lines.push('Controller or keyboard required');\\n      lines.push(TAGLINE);\\n      add('settings', 'Settings');\\n    } else if (screen === 'title' || (attract && attract.between > 0)) {\\n      lines.push(TAGLINE);\\n      lines.push('Press to begin');\\n      add('begin', 'Begin');\\n    } else if (screen === 'who') {\\n      heading = \\\"Who's here?\\\";\\n      add('begin', 'Begin');\\n      add('name', `Name: ${NAMES[profile.nameIndex]}`);\\n      add('paint', `Paint: ${PAINTS[profile.paintIndex].id}`);\\n      add('hat', `Hat: ${HATS[profile.hatIndex].label}`);\\n    } else if (screen === 'tutorial') {\\n      heading = 'How a day works';\\n      lines.push('You can lean, step, hop, and flail. You cannot type a name.');\\n      lines.push('Flail is a short save with a cooldown. It is not a free win.');\\n      add('on', 'Step on');\\n    } else if (screen === 'menu') {\\n      heading = 'Level Best Retreat';\\n      const cont = profile.dayIndex > 0 || profile.classDone.length ? 'Continue' : 'Programme';\\n      add('programme', cont);\\n      add('group', 'Group Class');\\n      add('free', 'Free Play');\\n      add('journal', 'Journal');\\n      add('settings', 'Settings');\\n      add('about', 'About / Credits');\\n    } else if (screen === 'morning') {\\n      heading = today().name;\\n      lines.push(speech ? speech.text : 'Good morning.');\\n      add('on', 'Continue');\\n    } else if (screen === 'question') {\\n      const q = QUESTIONS[profile.dayIndex % QUESTIONS.length];\\n      const line = lookup(q.ask);\\n      heading = 'A small question';\\n      lines.push(line ? line.text : 'Do you trust your knees?');\\n      if (q.kind === 'side') { add('left', 'Left'); add('right', 'Right'); }\\n      else { add('yes', 'Yes'); add('no', 'No'); }\\n    } else if (screen === 'reply') {\\n\",\"total_lines\":1350}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-92da2047-2152-4771-ab96-1c0afa94b472-4","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"150→    resetTuning();\\n    const game = await createGame({ manual: false, storage: memoryStorage() });\\n    await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 11000));\\n    const state = game.state();\\n    game.loop.stop();\\n    assert(state.attract || state.screen === 'attract', `clock screen ${state.screen}`);\\n  }]);\\n\\n  tests.push(['dev mode opens only from pause and sliders reset', async () => {\\n    const game = await fresh();\\n160→    assert(game.goto('dev') === false, 'dev from title');\\n    assert(game.state().screen === 'title', game.state().screen);\\n    game.bot('sharp');\\n    game.goto('play', { id: 'poses' });\\n    assert(game.tuning.get('maxLean') === 18, 'default lean');\\n    game.tuning.set('maxLean', 10);\\n    assert(game.tuning.get('maxLean') === 10, 'live slider');\\n    game.advance(0.5);\\n    assert(game.state().screen === 'play', 'event kept running');\\n    assert(game.tuning.get('maxLean') === 10, 'slider stuck');\\n170→    game.goto('pause');\\n    assert(game.goto('dev') === true, 'dev from pause');\\n    assert(game.state().choices.length === 6, `dev choices ${game.state().choices.length}`);\\n    pressChoice(game, 'reset-tune');\\n    assert(getTune('maxLean') === 18, `reset ${getTune('maxLean')}`);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) pressChoice(game, 'next');\\n    pressChoice(game, 'gust');\\n    game.goto('play');\\n    game.advance(0.5);\\n    assert(game.state().errors.length === 0, 'gust error');\\n180→  }]);\\n\\n  tests.push(['touch-only offers settings and no play', async () => {\\n    const game = await fresh({ coarse: true });\\n    assert(game.state().screen === 'touch', game.state().screen);\\n    assert(game.state().lines.some((line) => line.includes('Controller or keyboard required')), game.state().lines.join('|'));\\n    assert(game.state().choices.length === 1 && game.state().choices[0] === 'settings', game.state().choices.join(','));\\n    tap(game);\\n    await until(game, (s) => s.screen === 'settings', 2, 'touch settings');\\n    assert(!game.state().choices.includes('poses'), 'touch started a class');\\n190→  }]);\\n\\n  tests.push(['pause lists six choices', async () => {\\n    const game = await fresh();\\n    game.goto('play', { id: 'stillWater' });\\n    tap(game, 'Escape');\\n    await until(game, (s) => s.screen === 'pause', 2, 'pause');\\n    assert(game.state().choices.length === 6, game.state().choices.join(','));\\n  }]);\\n\\n200→  tests.push(['a hub slot keeps one score through the end of the minute', async () => {\\n    const previous = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    let ms = 0;\\n    const stepMs = 1000 / 120;\\n    const scores = [];\\n    globalThis.AIHub = {\\n      me: 0,\\n      players: [],\\n      time: () => {\\n        const now = ms;\\n210→        ms += stepMs;\\n        return now;\\n      },\\n      rng: (label) => {\\n        let n = 0;\\n        return () => (label === 'deal' && n++ === 0 ? 0.99 : 0.5);\\n      },\\n      on: () => {},\\n      ready: () => {},\\n      answer: () => {},\\n220→      send: () => {},\\n      progress: (body) => { scores.push(body.score); },\\n      result: () => {},\\n    };\\n    try {\\n      const game = await fresh();\\n      game.runSession({ room: 'test' });\\n      game.advance(45);\\n      const mid = game.state();\\n      assert(mid.sessionRound && mid.sessionRound.id === 'springboard', `slot ${mid.sessionRound && mid.sessionRound.id}`);\\n230→      assert(mid.sessionRound.slot === 0, `slot index ${mid.sessionRound.slot}`);\\n      assert(mid.sessionRound.parts.length === 1, `parts at 45s ${mid.sessionRound.parts.join(',')}`);\\n      assert(mid.screen === 'results', `screen at 45s ${mid.screen}`);\\n      assert(mid.event === null, 'the finished class was started again');\\n      const held = mid.sessionRound.total;\\n      game.advance(16.9);\\n      const end = game.state();\\n      assert(end.sessionRound.slot === 0, `left slot 0 at ${end.sessionRound.slot}`);\\n      assert(end.sessionRound.parts.length === 1, `parts at the end ${end.sessionRound.parts.join(',')}`);\\n      assert(end.sessionRound.total === held, `score changed from ${held} to ${end.sessionRound.total}`);\\n240→      assert(end.sessionRound.total <= 1000, `score ${end.sessionRound.total}`);\\n      assert(end.screen === 'results', `screen at the end ${end.screen}`);\\n      assert(scores.length > 0 && scores[scores.length - 1] <= 1000, `progress ${scores[scores.length - 1]}`);\\n      assert(scores.every((score) => score <= 1000), `progress climbed ${scores.join(',')}`);\\n    } finally {\\n      globalThis.AIHub = previous;\\n      setSessionMode(false);\\n    }\\n  }]);\\n\\n250→  tests.push(['a 6fps hub clock scores one 50s class', async () => {\\n    const previous = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    let ms = 0;\\n    const scores = [];\\n    globalThis.AIHub = {\\n      me: 0,\\n      players: [],\\n      time: () => ms,\\n      rng: (label) => {\\n        let n = 0;\\n260→        return () => (label === 'deal' && n++ === 0 ? 0.6 : 0.5);\\n      },\\n      on: () => {},\\n      ready: () => {},\\n      answer: () => {},\\n      send: () => {},\\n      progress: (body) => { scores.push(body.score); },\\n      result: () => {},\\n    };\\n    try {\\n270→      const game = await fresh();\\n      game.runSession({ room: 'test' });\\n      game.bot('sharp');\\n      const frame = 1 / 6;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < 372; i++) {\\n        ms = i * frame * 1000;\\n        game.advance(frame);\\n      }\\n      const end = game.state();\\n      assert(end.sessionRound && end.sessionRound.id === 'plates', `class ${end.sessionRound && end.sessionRound.id}`);\\n280→      assert(end.sessionRound.slot === 0, `slot ${end.sessionRound.slot}`);\\n      assert(end.sessionRound.parts.length === 1, `parts ${end.sessionRound.parts.join(',')}`);\\n      assert(end.sessionRound.total > 0 && end.sessionRound.total <= 1000, `score ${end.sessionRound.total}`);\\n      assert(end.sessionRound.total === end.sessionRound.parts[0], 'the part is not the total');\\n      assert(end.screen === 'results', `screen ${end.screen}`);\\n      assert(end.event === null, 'the class was still live');\\n      assert(scores.some((score) => score === end.sessionRound.total), 'progress never showed the score');\\n      assert(scores.every((score) => score <= 1000), 'progress climbed past one class');\\n    } finally {\\n      globalThis.AIHub = previous;\\n290→      setSessionMode(false);\\n    }\\n  }]);\\n\\n  return tests;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"150→    resetTuning();\\n    const game = await createGame({ manual: false, storage: memoryStorage() });\\n    await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 11000));\\n    const state = game.state();\\n    game.loop.stop();\\n    assert(state.attract || state.screen === 'attract', `clock screen ${state.screen}`);\\n  }]);\\n\\n  tests.push(['dev mode opens only from pause and sliders reset', async () => {\\n    const game = await fresh();\\n160→    assert(game.goto('dev') === false, 'dev from title');\\n    assert(game.state().screen === 'title', game.state().screen);\\n    game.bot('sharp');\\n    game.goto('play', { id: 'poses' });\\n    assert(game.tuning.get('maxLean') === 18, 'default lean');\\n    game.tuning.set('maxLean', 10);\\n    assert(game.tuning.get('maxLean') === 10, 'live slider');\\n    game.advance(0.5);\\n    assert(game.state().screen === 'play', 'event kept running');\\n    assert(game.tuning.get('maxLean') === 10, 'slider stuck');\\n170→    game.goto('pause');\\n    assert(game.goto('dev') === true, 'dev from pause');\\n    assert(game.state().choices.length === 6, `dev choices ${game.state().choices.length}`);\\n    pressChoice(game, 'reset-tune');\\n    assert(getTune('maxLean') === 18, `reset ${getTune('maxLean')}`);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) pressChoice(game, 'next');\\n    pressChoice(game, 'gust');\\n    game.goto('play');\\n    game.advance(0.5);\\n    assert(game.state().errors.length === 0, 'gust error');\\n180→  }]);\\n\\n  tests.push(['touch-only offers settings and no play', async () => {\\n    const game = await fresh({ coarse: true });\\n    assert(game.state().screen === 'touch', game.state().screen);\\n    assert(game.state().lines.some((line) => line.includes('Controller or keyboard required')), game.state().lines.join('|'));\\n    assert(game.state().choices.length === 1 && game.state().choices[0] === 'settings', game.state().choices.join(','));\\n    tap(game);\\n    await until(game, (s) => s.screen === 'settings', 2, 'touch settings');\\n    assert(!game.state().choices.includes('poses'), 'touch started a class');\\n190→  }]);\\n\\n  tests.push(['pause lists six choices', async () => {\\n    const game = await fresh();\\n    game.goto('play', { id: 'stillWater' });\\n    tap(game, 'Escape');\\n    await until(game, (s) => s.screen === 'pause', 2, 'pause');\\n    assert(game.state().choices.length === 6, game.state().choices.join(','));\\n  }]);\\n\\n200→  tests.push(['a hub slot keeps one score through the end of the minute', async () => {\\n    const previous = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    let ms = 0;\\n    const stepMs = 1000 / 120;\\n    const scores = [];\\n    globalThis.AIHub = {\\n      me: 0,\\n      players: [],\\n      time: () => {\\n        const now = ms;\\n210→        ms 