{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_557","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe test comment explicitly states that hub time stays constant during a frame's fixed steps. If `advance` reads the clock once per call and then steps physics using that same timestamp, every fixed step sees zero delta. This would freeze the simulation entirely. The real page likely reads the clock once per animation frame instead.The fixed timestep is likely 1/120.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-706fdbc8-4b53-4bf9-8d3a-8c66db269072-9","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function advance|sessionFixed|fixed|accumulator|STEP","glob":"**/director.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-706fdbc8-4b53-4bf9-8d3a-8c66db269072-10","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js","offset":1180,"limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-706fdbc8-4b53-4bf9-8d3a-8c66db269072-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/core/loop.js","limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":33588,"output_tokens":3812,"cache_read_input_tokens":1792,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"2703a748-dfd5-4869-8ff4-2dac55ecd3df"}
