{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_564","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe director scores an event when `event.done` is true, even if the hub local time is below 55.9 seconds. The old code would have scored via this flag too. I am tracing how internal `t` advances through fixed steps to see when it reaches 50 seconds relative to hub local","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b8b7fcb-67ce-4ab8-81c6-e30b6afe9208-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317.html","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b8b7fcb-67ce-4ab8-81c6-e30b6afe9208-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function chart\\(","glob":"**/charts.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b8b7fcb-67ce-4ab8-81c6-e30b6afe9208-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/events/base.js","offset":55,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1065,"output_tokens":238,"cache_read_input_tokens":53248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"5238d63c-e244-4c87-8c41-bf01c2bbca1d"}
