{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8bdd016e-2c19-4415-8ad1-45447fe2afad-25","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,95,95,120,50,57,98,52,100,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8bdd016e-2c19-4415-8ad1-45447fe2afad-26","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n10→  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n20→\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n30→  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n40→    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 4],\\n  ]),\\n  2: chart(116, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.doubles, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.leanStep, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.nod, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.busy, 4],\\n50→    [PATTERNS.jog, 4],\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n10→  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n20→\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n30→  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n40→    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 4],\\n  ]),\\n  2: chart(116, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.doubles, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.leanStep, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.nod, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.busy, 4],\\n50→    [PATTERNS.jog, 4],\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/data/charts.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"/** Step charts. A bar is 8 eighth-notes. Cell time is half a beat. */\\n\\nexport const CELL = {\\n  L: 'L', R: 'R', B: 'B',\\n  left: '<', right: '>', up: '^', down: 'v', rest: '.',\\n};\\n\\nconst PATTERNS = {\\n  walk: 'L...R...',\\n  jog: 'L.R.L.R.',\\n  both: 'L.R.B...',\\n  doubles: 'L.L.R.R.',\\n  lean: '<...>...',\\n  leanStep: 'L.R.<...',\\n  nod: '^...v...',\\n  busy: 'LRL.RLR.',\\n  stamp: 'B.B.LRB.',\\n  flourish: 'L.R.LRLR',\\n};\\n\\nfunction bars(pattern, count) {\\n  const cell = pattern.padEnd(8, '.').slice(0, 8);\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) out.push(...cell);\\n  return out;\\n}\\n\\nfunction chart(bpm, parts) {\\n  const cells = parts.flatMap(([pattern, count]) => bars(pattern, count));\\n  return { bpm, cells, cellDt: 30 / bpm };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CHARTS = {\\n  1: chart(104, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.both, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.lean, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 8],\\n    [PATTERNS.walk, 4],\\n  ]),\\n  2: chart(116, [\\n    ['.', 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.doubles, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.leanStep, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.nod, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.busy, 4],\\n    [PATTERNS.jog, 4],\\n\",\"total_lines\":78}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8bdd016e-2c19-4415-8ad1-45447fe2afad-27","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,51,49,55,95,95,120,50,57,98,52,100,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"9432055d-e5d3-4fea-a343-c54ee62a74c1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_567","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" scenario did not.\n\nThe bug scenario is a frame-order race. When internal time reaches 50 seconds and hub local time simultaneously hits the 56-second threshold, the director checks local time first. It jumps to results without stepping, so `event.done` never gets set. The old code would have scored via the done flag instead.A grep of the HTML file returned no results.\n\nThe exact internal time at the end of frame 335 determines whether the test catches the bug. If it reaches 50 seconds, the old code scores via `event.done` and the new branch is irrelevant. If it stays below 50, the event never sets done, so frame 336 must latch the live result through the new branch. I am computing that boundary precisely.\n\nThe exact arithmetic confirms the boundary. With 20 fixed steps per frame and a step size of 1/120, the 300 play frames total exactly 50 seconds of internal time. The event reaches its done threshold at the last step of frame 335. The old code would score via that flag before hub local time ever hits 56 seconds. This means the test passes on the old implementation too.\n\nThe HTML file was readable but grep missed it, likely due to gitignore or size. The plan.md path points to a session directory rather than the workspace PLAN.md. I will search with ripgrep or Python instead. I also considered reading hub scoring acceptance criteria, but anti-ratchet rules advise against re-litigating.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e164cb09-2b47-42c4-a643-3a6c69392e7c-28","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nimport os\np=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317.html\"\nst=os.stat(p)\nprint(\"size\", st.st_size, \"mtime\", st.st_mtime)\ndata=open(p,\"rb\").read()\nfor s in [b\"55.9\", b\"latched\", b\"Plate Spinners\", b\"sessionFixed\", b\"latchSlot\", b\"55.9\"]:\n    print(s, data.find(s))\n# director mtime\nd=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/work/Level Best-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231317/src/game/director.js\"\nprint(\"director mtime\", os.stat(d).st_mtime, \"size\", os.stat(d).st_size)\nlog=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/implementer/test-full.log\"\nprint(\"log mtime\", os.stat(log).st_mtime, \"size\", os.stat(log).st_size)\nprint(open(log).read()[:2000])\nPY","description":"Compare bundle, source, and test log timestamps"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":995,"output_tokens":626,"cache_read_input_tokens":55936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"39306598-c94b-4408-bfa4-ec21a06f79e8"}
