{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_588","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bundled HTML matches the source logic.\n\nThe fix uses a comma operator in the slot-change condition to call `Ms()` before resetting state. It also adds an `Ms()` call for the local>=56 case when not latched.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-83541d4f-3b21-45af-8037-bfafe8c7cc72-39","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/goal-verdict-cfc5772a1498-3-1.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"director.js:847 latches on local>=56; flow.mjs:250 holds AIHub.time() for each 1/6s frame; 6000 steps leave plates t=49.999 so done stays false and the new branch is what scores; test-full.log is 104 passed, 0 failed after the bundle rebuild.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"Prior gap is fixed. `sessionFixed` now calls `latchSlot()` on any exit from the play window: `event.done`, `local >= 55.9`, `local >= 56` while unlatched, and a slot change before the live event is disposed (`director.js:818` and `:847`). The same logic is in the rebuilt HTML (minified `else P.latched?o=\\\"results\\\":Ms()` next to `55.9`).\\n\\nThe new flow test keeps `AIHub.time()` constant during each `advance(1/6)` and steps it between frames. Slot 0 deals to Plate Spinners. Float timing is the bug itself: 300 play frames × 20 steps ends at event `t ≈ 49.9999999999978`, so `t >= 50` never sets `done`, and hub local jumps from 55.833 to 56.0, skipping `[55.9, 56)`. Only the new `local >= 56` latch can produce one part. The test requires that part, `0 < total <= 1000`, results, and a matching progress report.\\n\\n`test-full.log` is `104 passed, 0 failed`, written after `director.js` and the HTML bundle. The current suite is 104 tests (the new case included).\"\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-83541d4f-3b21-45af-8037-bfafe8c7cc72-40","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231317__x29b4d9/tmp/grok-goal-cfc5772a1498/goal-classifier-cfc5772a1498-3-skeptic-1.md","content":"# Skeptic re-check: 6fps hub score window\n\nNot refuted. The prior gap is fixed in the shipped source and in the rebuilt page.\n\n## What was wrong\n\nA class only latched while `local` sat in `[55.9, 56)` or the event had already set `done`. The `local >= 56` branch only switched to results. At 6fps, hub time jumps about 1/6s and stays put for that frame's fixed steps, so Plate Spinners, Fruit Hat, and Step Class left the play window with `parts=[]` and total 0.\n\n## What the code does now\n\n`latchSlot()` in `src/game/director.js` still no-ops once `session.latched` is set or the event is gone, pushes one `round(form * 10)` part, disposes the event, and sets `results`.\n\nIt now runs on every exit from the play window:\n\n- `event.done` or `local >= 55.9` while still inside `local < 56` (`director.js:844`)\n- `local >= 56` and not yet latched (`director.js:847`)\n- a slot change, before the old event is disposed (`director.js:818`)\n- the clock running past the last slot (`director.js:812`)\n\nThe bundled HTML contains the same chain (`55.9` once, then `else P.latched?o=\"results\":Ms()`). The bundle mtime is after `director.js`.\n\n## Why the new test actually hits the bug\n\n`test/flow.mjs` (`a 6fps hub clock scores one 50s class`) sets `AIHub.time()` to `i/6` seconds and holds it for the whole `advance(1/6)`. Deal `0.6` selects Plate Spinners as slot 0. A sharp bot drives the real pad path.\n\nFixed step is `1/120`, and `(1/6)/(1/120)` rounds to 20. Play is frames `i=36..335` (local 6 through 55.833): 6000 steps. `6000/120` in float is `49.9999999999978`, so plates `t >= 50` does not set `done`. The next frame is local `56` exactly, which skips `[55.9, 56)`. The old window cannot score this run. The assertion is one part, `0 < total <= 1000`, `total === parts[0]`, screen `results`, event cleared, and progress showing that total.\n\n## Evidence\n\n`implementer/test-full.log` is `104 passed, 0 failed`, timestamped after the bundle. Current registrations are 104 (56 event, 15 balance, 12 unit, 9 flow including this one, 8 input, 4 browser).\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2152,"output_tokens":1718,"cache_read_input_tokens":67328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa57-1af6-7b91-b0b8-da8c4d991b66","uuid":"18e58048-b58d-4c2b-bb6a-c5046d41a892"}
